{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Includes the UL-DCCH-Message as defined in TS 36.331 [10]. In this version of the specification, the field is only used to transfer the E-UTRA RRC MeasurementReport, E-UTRA RRC SidelinkUEInformation and the E-UTRA RRC UEAssistanceInformation messages.","paragraph_zero_based":12696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":12697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–ULInformationTransferMRDC","paragraph_zero_based":12698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The ULInformationTransferMRDC message is used for the uplink transfer of MR-DC dedicated information (e.g. for transferring the NR or E-UTRA RRC MeasurementReport message, the FailureInformation message, the UEAssistanceInformation message, the RRCReconfigurationComplete message, the IABOtherInformation message or the NR or E-UTRA RRC MCGFailureInformation message).","paragraph_zero_based":12699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Signalling radio bearer: SRB1, SRB3","paragraph_zero_based":12700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RLC-SAP: AM","paragraph_zero_based":12701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Logical channel: DCCH","paragraph_zero_based":12702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Direction: UE to Network","paragraph_zero_based":12703},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ULInformationTransferMRDC message","paragraph_zero_based":12704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":12705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-ULINFORMATIONTRANSFERMRDC-START","paragraph_zero_based":12706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":12707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ULInformationTransferMRDC ::=               SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":12708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    criticalExtensions                          CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_base