{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the EUTRA anchor carrier frequency list, which can provide the NR sidelink communication configurations.","paragraph_zero_based":13632},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-FreqInfoList","paragraph_zero_based":13633},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the NR sidelink communication/discovery configuration on some carrier frequency (ies). In this release, only one entry can be configured in the list.","paragraph_zero_based":13634},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-L2U2N-Relay","paragraph_zero_based":13635},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the support of NR sidelink Layer-2 relay.","paragraph_zero_based":13636},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery","paragraph_zero_based":13637},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the support of L3 U2N relay AS-layer capability, i.e. NR sidelink relay discovery.","paragraph_zero_based":13638},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MaxNumConsecutiveDTX","paragraph_zero_based":13639},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the maximum number of consecutive HARQ DTX before triggering sidelink RLF. Value n1 corresponds to 1, value n2 corresponds to 2, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":13640},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MeasConfigCommon","paragraph_zero_based":13641},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the measurement configurations (e.g. RSRP) for NR sidelink communication.","paragraph_zero_based":13642},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-NonRelayDiscovery","paragraph_zero_based":13643},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the support of NR sidelink non-relay discovery.","paragraph_zero_based":13644},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-NR-AnchorCarrierFreqList","paragraph_zero_based":13645},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the NR anchor carrier frequency list, which can provide the NR sidelink communication/discovery configurations.","paragraph_zero_based":13646},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-OffsetDFN","paragraph_zero_based":13647},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the timing offset for the UE to determine DFN timing when GNSS is used for timing reference. Value 1 corresponds to 0.001 milliseconds, value 2 corresponds to 0.002 milliseconds, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":13648},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-RadioBearerConfigList","paragraph_zero_based":13649},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates one or multiple sidelink radio bearer configurations.","paragraph_zero_based":13650},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-RLC-BearerConfigList","paragraph_zero_based":13651},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates one or multiple sidelink RLC bearer configurations.","paragraph_zero_based":13652},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SSB-PriorityNR","paragraph_zero_based":13653},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the priority of NR sidelink SSB transmission and reception.","paragraph_zero_based":13654},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"t400","paragraph_zero_based":13655}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["62a5bbe00f67f2d84138b94cc1e61e0860ad6965fc630211ad474273ce4f61e3","09e479a007d59ae971e2a49e5606d2dffcfad227efca9c3c9b0308c96090fc2a","c99a962ebd50f3a390b147d8eb93016558ff1e3bd7f923e9704216fe1699e628","988996855771469e4b5bb23a4182ad587abb5a6cb9b0a3e07090ccae73e0d3f3","90d1d0007191319890975e2209a2b9f8ec2b79c0e379e2918686decc7b921c8b","c3c74f8d2f412a699211