n or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p14400"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The RA preamble index to use in the RA occasions associated with this CSI-RS. If the field is absent, the UE uses the preamble index associated with the SSB that is QCLed with this CSI-RS.","paragraph_zero_based":14424},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":14425},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BFR-SSB-Resource field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":14426},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ra-PreambleIndex","paragraph_zero_based":14427},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The preamble index that the UE shall use when performing BFR upon selecting the candidate beams identified by this SSB.","paragraph_zero_based":14428},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssb","paragraph_zero_based":14429},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The ID of an SSB transmitted by this serving cell. It determines a candidate beam for beam failure recovery (BFR).","paragraph_zero_based":14430},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":14431},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–BeamFailureRecoveryRSConfig","paragraph_zero_based":14432},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE BeamFailureRecoveryRSConfig is used to configure the UE with candidate beams for beam failure recovery in case of beam failure detection. See also TS 38.321 [3], clause 5.17.","paragraph_zero_based":14433},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BeamFailureRecoveryRSConfig information element","paragraph_zero_based":14434},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":14435},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-BEAMFAILURERECOVERYRSCONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":14436},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":14437},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BeamFailureRecoveryRSConfig-r16 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":14438},{"literal_text_all_w_t_an