CSI-Part2-Index1","paragraph_zero_based":14488},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Up to 11 bits of CSI part 2 bits (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 9.3). When the field is absent the UE applies the value 13.","paragraph_zero_based":14489},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"betaOffsetCSI-Part2-Index2","paragraph_zero_based":14490},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Above 11 bits of CSI part 2 bits (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 9.3). When the field is absent the UE applies the value 13.","paragraph_zero_based":14491},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":14492},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–BetaOffsetsCrossPri","paragraph_zero_based":14493},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE BetaOffsetsCrossPri is used to configure beta-offset values for cross-priority HARQ-ACK multiplexing on PUSCH.","paragraph_zero_based":14494},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BetaOffsetsCrossPri information element","paragraph_zero_based":14495}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f82b6d7e0d7b88cd7508f14e1d947ba0d52af0cf79a2faab230e1b46fb34e268","54419a2af2ae962aca8b75f1ce80b69eb2896225c5ee7545e4e5c042b99f952b","b3db6c1cb80a7e6db9c188967d8bbf8f7f26422bd53256bd249d39705e2542b7","738b6c9ff51353f2a7dfd9152051d62c200cb30909cf24aad8a5ecbad3f18654","2d73f9b94dc3cef1ef8055e64b87707770f2e71d1182ddfc7119506285fc4485","f93316371d9f1605795f9e65308b4b3aa4bc99390cb361999a8ec6a2ca29e058","3471746a0fcabaa2a3dbf6986cb0ec6bb56ef6010412a5acf72ef77c7124765d","2b68654141bb2af1e5e2def4788003ca8be6798d931209d3502d6fad931871a7","e2b96d8f9577c5097cf61b479bcc861fdbb2cc83dfa4d1a2312123672424383b","dc59faa1e972c1097954737710c323a35a7bea2ab84279d1fd0cff5efe1fd510","b0f837e16e53f54e541b5d2d0a93ca2