ist-r15 (when connected to 5GC) in SystemInformationBlockType1 that contained the reported cellIdentity.","paragraph_zero_based":15685},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"trackingAreaCode-eutra-epc, trackingAreaCode-eutra-5gc","paragraph_zero_based":15686},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates Tracking Area Code to which the cell indicated by cellIdentity-eutra-epc, cellIdentity-eutra-5GC belongs.","paragraph_zero_based":15687},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":15688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–CGI-InfoNR","paragraph_zero_based":15689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE CGI-InfoNR indicates cell access related information, which is reported by the UE as part of report CGI procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":15690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CGI-InfoNR information element","paragraph_zero_based":15691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":15692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CGI-INFO-NR-START","paragraph_zero_based":15693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":15694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CGI-InfoNR ::=                    SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":15695}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1db25959ca3030c1779b42c2dee8a411b82b32f86ddbc0692a363066fbbb1a4b","6ac1f8b88c3a07f0bc24d05408cf70b0836ff80cf4b69282b898f5e13e0d6069","b998538f4cb0e93cfc1d8cff99fb253949192ab0afe684c95e8aeee7ee69324f","ae17d05d2131fd761e8df020bd98d8f273cada1f427e84e3be3656a5d4065402","bb521dcafa0b1754db8cdac3b5500b016454b2341733e50d19a0716478ed519c","cafec32fd4abb27f786e51261457762ee69d7e6b2436def88df031ffffc117c2","d95b4dd45c809d4c75e11f768632169d7375dc1f0ef255f