{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"numberOfBeams","paragraph_zero_based":15960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of beams, L, used for linear combination.","paragraph_zero_based":15961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"numberOfPMI-SubbandsPerCQI-Subband","paragraph_zero_based":15962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Field indicates how PMI subbands are defined per CQI subband according to TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.2.5, and 5.2.2.2.7.","paragraph_zero_based":15963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"paramCombination","paragraph_zero_based":15964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Field describes supported parameter combination (M, α, β) as specified in TS 38.214 [19].","paragraph_zero_based":15965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"phaseAlphabetSize","paragraph_zero_based":15966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The size of the PSK alphabet, QPSK or 8-PSK.","paragraph_zero_based":15967},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"portSelectionSamplingSize","paragraph_zero_based":15968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The size of the port selection codebook (parameter d), see TS 38.214 [19] clause 5.2.2.2.6.","paragraph_zero_based":15969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ri-Restriction","paragraph_zero_based":15970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Restriction for RI for TypeI-MultiPanel-RI-Restriction (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.2.2).","paragraph_zero_based":15971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subbandAmplitude","paragraph_zero_based":15972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If subband amplitude reporting is activated (true).","paragraph_zero_based":15973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"twoTX-CodebookSubsetRestriction","paragraph_zero_based":15974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Codebook subset restriction for 2TX codebook (see TS 38.214 [19] clause 5.2.2.2.1).","paragraph_zero_based":15975},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"typeI-SinglePanel-codebookSubsetRestriction-i2","paragraph_zero_based":15976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"i2 codebook subset restriction for Type I Single-panel codebook used when reportQuantity is CRI/Ri/i1/CQI (see TS 38.214 [19] clause 5.2.2.2.1).","paragraph_zero_based":15977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"typeI-SinglePanel-ri-Restriction","paragraph_zero_based":15978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Restriction for RI for TypeI-SinglePanel-RI-Restriction (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.2.1).","paragraph_zero_based":15979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"typeI-SinglePanel-Group1, typeI-SinglePanel-Group2","paragraph_zero_based":15980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configures codebooks for CSI calculation when UE is configured with two CMR Groups with CMRGroupingAndPairing in the NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet associated with the CSI-ReportConfig. Network configures the same number of ports for both codebooks.","paragraph_zero_based":15981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"typeI-SinglePanel-ri-RestrictionSDM, typeI-SinglePanel-ri-RestrictionSTRP","paragraph_zero_based":15982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Restriction for RI for N Resource Pairs when two CMR Groups are configured with CMRGroupingAndPairing in the NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet associated with the CSI-ReportConfig (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.1.4.2).","paragraph_zero_based":15983}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["deb39500e5fc5bb2d3e6304c574c3ebf6925fb0e6aa579d4a4a3055dc7115cbe","7882c4df33c4918100bfb833f603395270c5f3afbadea75453cf3604896c009b","5745c2e857c03b624a2eca2dafeb038c33e3e4a3a006321b0644bfa1eecf574e","a18c153ad867991a1db28841d18d30560640e