{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                p4                                  BIT STRING (SIZE (4)),","paragraph_zero_based":17184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                p8                                  BIT STRING (SIZE (8)),","paragraph_zero_based":17185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                p12                                 BIT STRING (SIZE (12)),","paragraph_zero_based":17186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                p16                                 BIT STRING (SIZE (16)),","paragraph_zero_based":17187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                p24                                 BIT STRING (SIZE (24)),","paragraph_zero_based":17188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                p32                                 BIT STRING (SIZE (32))","paragraph_zero_based":17189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"            }                                                                                           OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":17190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nzp-CSI-RS-ResourceList-r18            SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofNZP-CSI-RS-ResourcesPerSet)) OF NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceIndex,","paragraph_zero_based":17191},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    powerOffset-r18                        INTEGER(0..23)","paragraph_zero_based":17192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":17193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceIndex ::= INTEGER (0..maxNrofNZP-CSI-RS-ResourcesPerSet-1-r18)","paragraph_zero_based":17195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-REPORTSUBCONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17199},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-ReportSubConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":17200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"port-subsetIndicator","paragraph_zero_based":17201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the number of ports of the NZP CSI-RS resources indicated in nzp-CSI-RS-resourceList (the value is the same like portNumber of these NZP CSI-RS resources) and the (sub)set of CSI-RS antenna ports used for CSI calculation of the sub-configuration. In the bit string, each bit corresponds to an antenna port. When a bit is set to1, the corresponding port is enabled for CSI calculation corresponding to the sub-configuration. When the bit is set to zero, the corresponding port is not enabled for CSI calcualton corresponding to the sub-configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":17202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nzp-CSI-RS-resourceList","paragraph_zero_based":17203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of NZP CSI RS resources for the sub-configuration that is a (sub)set of NZP CSI-RS resource(s) of the CSI-RS resource set for channel measurement associated with the sub-configuration in the CSI report configuration. Value 0 refers to the first NZP CSI RS resource of the CSI-RS resource set, value 1 refers to the second NZP CSI RS resource of the CSI-RS resource set, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":17204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"powerOffset","paragraph_zero_based":17205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When powerControlOffset is configured in a NZP CSI-RS resources indicated by nzp-CSI-RS-Resources, the power offset of PDSCH RE to NZP CSI-RS RE is the largest value between - 8 dB and powerControlOffset - powerOffset.","paragraph_zero_based":17206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17207}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"docu