{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":17496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":17497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    servingAdditionalPCIList-r17        SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofCSI-SSB-ResourcePerSet)) OF ServingAdditionalPCIIndex-r17  OPTIONAL  -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":17498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]]","paragraph_zero_based":17499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":17500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ServingAdditionalPCIIndex-r17  ::=  INTEGER(0..maxNrofAdditionalPCI-r17)","paragraph_zero_based":17502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17503},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-SSB-RESOURCESET-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17504},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17505},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17506},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-SSB-ResourceSet field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":17507},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"servingAdditionalPCIList","paragraph_zero_based":17508},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the physical cell IDs (PCI) of the SSBs in the csi-SSB-ResourceList. If present, the list has the same number of entries as csi-SSB-ResourceList. The first entry of the list indicates the value of the PCI for the first entry of csi-SSB-ResourceList, the second entry of this list indicates the value of the PCI for the second entry of csi-SSB-ResourceList, and so on. For each entry, the following applies:","paragraph_zero_based":17509},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- If the value is zero, the PCI is the PCI of the serving cell in which this CSI-SSB-ResourceSet is defined;","paragraph_zero_based":17510},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- otherwise, the value is additionalPCIIndex-r17 of an SSB-MTC-AdditionalPCI-r17 configured using the additionalPCI-ToAddModList-r17 in ServingCellConfig, and the PCI is the additionalPCI-r17 in this SSB-MTC-AdditionalPCI-r17.","paragraph_zero_based":17511},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17512},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–CSI-SSB-ResourceSetId","paragraph_zero_based":17513},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE CSI-SSB-ResourceSetId is used to identify one SS/PBCH block resource set.","paragraph_zero_based":17514},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-SSB-ResourceId information element","paragraph_zero_based":17515},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":17516},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-SSB-RESOURCESETID-START","paragraph_zero_based":17517},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17518},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-SSB-ResourceSetId ::=           INTEGER (0..maxNrofCSI-SSB-ResourceSets-1)","paragraph_zero_based":17519}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["cdbdb027ba99777918fd8b56fcb44adc1fd2abaf08cb93300ca0477d2bd78b3f","997e9fd633389a985cce9e95f15eb8ec0be4fdd3f0df35c59cf6f150bc26d9a9","572f7b224e61684ed36e0eee4e8df55d2bc91eb54c3212baf0d0fb800cc6466d","f480a0da3e51345c83efdc2ef127f03fcd3e84a94c70daac0c5ca272e6448621","2f354adea2afe7ea781fcc2e921309b993d7b2cc118ffe51f066271f0ab1b7af","8310e00613fe392e4b9a584e6964f3f6b8ee581570e92c1783edbdbfd9c44bdd","b591949e66b8ae65d38cd72c61cea20a18ff63613a74321b6f691c89381b5518","2a2f1793c15b89b8fbe7368d51d2235750134880de14f975139241ec27c0fded","3ec89760ab1d771fda6dc3e71