{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":17832},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    initialDownlinkBWP-RedCap-r17   BWP-DownlinkCommon                              OPTIONAL    -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":17833},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17834},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]]","paragraph_zero_based":17835},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":17836},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17837},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-DOWNLINKCONFIGCOMMON-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17838},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17839},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17840},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DownlinkConfigCommon field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":17841},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"frequencyInfoDL","paragraph_zero_based":17842},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Basic parameters of a downlink carrier and transmission thereon.","paragraph_zero_based":17843},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"initialDownlinkBWP","paragraph_zero_based":17844},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The initial downlink BWP configuration for a serving cell. The network configures the locationAndBandwidth so that the initial downlink BWP contains the entire CORESET#0 of this serving cell in the frequency domain.","paragraph_zero_based":17845},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"initialDownlinkBWP-RedCap","paragraph_zero_based":17846},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If present, RedCap UEs use this DL BWP instead of initialDownlinkBWP.","paragraph_zero_based":17847},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If absent, RedCap UEs use initialDownlinkBWP provided that it does not exceed the RedCap UE maximum bandwidth (see also clause 5.2.2.4.2).","paragraph_zero_based":17848},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17849},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":17850},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":17851},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"InterFreqHOAndServCellAdd","paragraph_zero_based":17852},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is mandatory present for inter-frequency handover, and upon serving cell (PSCell/SCell) addition. Otherwise, the field is optionally present, Need M.","paragraph_zero_based":17853},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ServCellAdd","paragraph_zero_based":17854},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is mandatory present upon serving cell addition (for PSCell and SCell) and upon handover from E-UTRA to NR. It is optionally present, Need M otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":17855}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9fccd998df27d37dbab27925d6493a44ede54f4ed3d809710d232ff5317df268","7163bd66493c52c692fa67064b7dae68f10d68733639d6d805489798d91f0e21","0f9174b71553c0da88abede84e221f8f91f37735d9f6b5fff3c535eb2e4719b8","ece444bd4bf25731aa75b5dd661c78279e5bb1c516c87d7020bb9bcb6d9152f3","ef0bb0e495e012f96988e4ddd828fe524a4609808ee3d879892e20b33c8cdd08","7215284e9f4387dfb361d97f050d802c24ad9dec9190c5107b5166a6d2f8c208","bb9db8488fc46d893b1de25ce0bf5034523649e123656c87f4df5dea51b5a311","8dd26381b2c853d85944878f3ae835f682ce64fb57cfe9dc277d2430eb6a2265","be4f028791621f2cbfd347b99d66aa41c7cba548db1f0ab8663a8e3b576b8fec","562a9ee39961442b1afe4f0c151f34ed090aa9b17b5505caff1c1a9135d22d2e","df2fbc8c414181ef52537765d96635ec2bcbec557afdf61a54e858060f0335a7","e04a75d0ee4ca9e91b5f9540fc104ac8229cfc01cc6a7