{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DRX-ConfigSecondaryGroup-r16 ::=   SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":18144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    drx-onDurationTimer-r16            CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":18145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                           subMilliSeconds INTEGER (1..31),","paragraph_zero_based":18146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                           milliSeconds    ENUMERATED {","paragraph_zero_based":18147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                               ms1, ms2, ms3, ms4, ms5, ms6, ms8, ms10, ms20, ms30, ms40, ms50, ms60,","paragraph_zero_based":18148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                               ms80, ms100, ms200, ms300, ms400, ms500, ms600, ms800, ms1000, ms1200,","paragraph_zero_based":18149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                               ms1600, spare8, spare7, spare6, spare5, spare4, spare3, spare2, spare1 }","paragraph_zero_based":18150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                            },","paragraph_zero_based":18151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    drx-InactivityTimer-r16            ENUMERATED {","paragraph_zero_based":18152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                           ms0, ms1, ms2, ms3, ms4, ms5, ms6, ms8, ms10, ms20, ms30, ms40, ms50, ms60, ms80,","paragraph_zero_based":18153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                           ms100, ms200, ms300, ms500, ms750, ms1280, ms1920, ms2560, spare9, spare8,","paragraph_zero_based":18154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                           spare7, spare6, spare5, spare4, spare3, spare2, spare1}","paragraph_zero_based":18155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":18156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-DRX-CONFIGSECONDARYGROUP-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DRX-ConfigSecondaryGroup field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":18161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-InactivityTimer","paragraph_zero_based":18162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiple integers of 1 ms. ms0 corresponds to 0 ms, ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, and so on, as specified in TS 38.321 [3]. The network configures a drx-InactivityTimer value for the second DRX group that is smaller than the drx-InactivityTimer configured for the default DRX group in IE DRX-Config.","paragraph_zero_based":18163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-onDurationTimer","paragraph_zero_based":18164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiples of 1/32 ms (subMilliSeconds) or in ms (milliSeconds). For the latter, value ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, value ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, and so on, as specified in TS 38.321 [3]. The network configures a drx-onDurationTimer value for the second DRX group that is smaller than the drx-onDurationTimer configured for the default DRX group in IE DRX-Config.","paragraph_zero_based":18165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–DRX-ConfigSL","paragraph_zero_based":18167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["33591e16364597749dbee72e9e24aa34f006ba734f3ee5be1a