* 10-8 rad. Actual value = field value * (2.341* 10-8).","paragraph_zero_based":18234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"meanAnomaly","paragraph_zero_based":18235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Satellite orbital parameter: Mean anomaly M at epoch time, see NIMA TR 8350.2 [71]. Unit is radian.","paragraph_zero_based":18236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Step of 2.341* 10-8 rad. Actual value = field value * (2.341* 10-8).","paragraph_zero_based":18237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"periapsis","paragraph_zero_based":18238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Satellite orbital parameter: argument of periapsis , see NIMA TR 8350.2 [71]. Unit is radian.","paragraph_zero_based":18239}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d5abacdfe009361601fc08f04556c5efc5af43a5d1324b8ac4824374cc00925c","d260142d58ee39b554bb560fd18794f9426b45556ae451559d37d42d4804473b","d42b901af4b2e5a55cd373b8fb68de3ee58aebe6ffbb3f26aeabfa718d4eac4b","427bd589e45f52c3ea686d247e5e36767d833986338f413cd3823edf00c65b13","725cce1bd7b28d4bcd5cf3f8e599fd0199b2655b0aa5e6042958f54f39daf7ff","01ac73754c849437d5bf31f2c011421aa30e75cf8d3375e12a85040acf4c05b4","f058aed409f896ba233b35979cea46707029a4f3e07b5805135ecb0e9686344a","9c975cdd21b7bf33220c2434407999911a0f9553c74bcb0da972e318f7d0ca9f","1527cf0b5de21dcf2898104e5606b5966c559cd8da613bf32cb9d4af42688e5a","3c63f8c224fe282e720377a75d2c666a9a606873dc5166898e8e08f7631ee5fa","a8aa9cd7d89b30b12f0541102b683b634dad67e5b138dd3af3c8f86c51187c17","a5195e57d817273b03f9d6d03e4ffb6b349eefa4908dc8606f79d6663d96f1c3","735277353e9b7f5e8e2eb6b1a1c18468748b900481f63c8c5c902a41e15c380e","3fdd040e1fb009a7685e9bb2c4cab72d80c872741c0f7d02420dd3b9f815c8aa","fff1a06a6b39d270