of msg3 repetition is part of this feature combination. This field is not configured in a set of preambles that is configured with 2-step random-access type.","paragraph_zero_based":18281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–FeatureCombinationPreambles","paragraph_zero_based":18283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE FeatureCombinationPreambles associates a set of preambles with a feature combination. For parameters which can be provided in this IE, the UE applies this field value when performing Random Access using a preamble in this featureCombinationPreambles, otherwise the UE applies the corresponding value as determined by applicable Need Code, e.g. Need S. On a specific BWP, there can be at most one set of preambles associated with a given feature combination per RA Type (i.e. 4-step RACH or 2-step RACH).","paragraph_zero_based":18284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FeatureCombinationPreambles information element","paragraph_zero_based":18285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":18286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FEATURECOMBINATIONPREAMBLES-START","paragraph_zero_based":18287}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a150744063359534b0c227a6000c82f03638d973d524dbb7074bde12e681bfc3","b8c5f1fe603bbc02b2e1990492ffff63da77b2d7b5ee2f2ccd7f208b3310266a","b40278067a8a2e389ceae891895091db75cf3aa0edc6e67ef7645b7608bf927f","024037fae46f0bd576a7360b8dfd84127e26b1149a76ec624b1eca70204de9e7","ad75c567e4c9b8b72d457b77edc2427a083d8f2e5c8470b484447ab06aec9980","9ff546f8beac7790ac1befe57a3f600af7170f657f581032cd871ef97ca3a481","8aee41ba2ec05dcdc588e1df6686