ES merged CR.docx:p18456"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor’s note: One impact identified for inter-band SSB-less is in the absoluteFrequencySSB field (“same frequency band” is currently mentioned). For further 331 spec impacts more work is needed on RRC configuration of the frequency of the SSB to be used for the UE to obtain the timing reference for the inter-band SCell.","paragraph_zero_based":18480},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18481},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–FrequencyInfoDL-SIB","paragraph_zero_based":18482},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE FrequencyInfoDL-SIB provides basic parameters of a downlink carrier and transmission thereon.","paragraph_zero_based":18483},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FrequencyInfoDL-SIB information element","paragraph_zero_based":18484},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":18485},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FREQUENCYINFODL-SIB-START","paragraph_zero_based":18486},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18487},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FrequencyInfoDL-SIB ::=             SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":18488},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    frequencyBandList                   MultiFrequencyBandListNR-SIB,","paragraph_zero_based":18489},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    offsetToPointA                      INTEGER (0..2199),","paragraph_zero_based":18490},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    scs-SpecificCarrierList             SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxSCSs)) OF SCS-SpecificCarrier","paragraph_zero_based":18491},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":18492},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18493},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FrequencyInfoDL-SIB-v1760 ::=       SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":18494},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    frequencyBandList-v1760             MultiFrequencyBandListNR-SIB-v1760","paragraph_zero_based":18495},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":18496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FREQUENCYINFODL-SIB-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FrequencyInfoDL-SIB field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":18501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"offsetToPointA","paragraph_zero_based":18502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Represents the offset to Point A as defined in TS 38.211 [16], clause 4.4.4.2.","paragraph_zero_based":18503}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["83d6d9325cd1f4b72b8c509d8a8cf240b7208c80a5b4b58b48206847d3d6f2c7","dfd104f775397697d532b6ccbf0866a95bc196928f9a819ff0ec8f64d0ab1f72","669d9225349d530313b2b9b86b52fd9062db262a0047f851d2e78812fbf3a293","db84cb3cdf81268786e601f400f32edcd2a3e92fa04c34627abaa556f8021ec4","ff8fc3ec586e237e7ccfe5c66fc35eb3f96a8d4fefe010e9186556911084783f","354d49e82c3a4f7f5f249a61823444b663a8a3d34aec8441b0fec6abf893cf22","d91c220aca71f50a6be0bdb33ae0282efddf00ee0290f39d7c23d6ca1e329fe6","e8e23b8b68c0c87dce3d368ac75cb385d9770292a3e9d35379111e1e991715c0","4f096f1e2f9eeea4c78876b7157b80773f6dc81514c3194de10f1e8e82354834","e82c59fa1f3f2e548d186df0c4468aa8fb57e05a29065b3d113ee819c8e98e7b","91be943b83a885c6c5ccce59fdf8512e1e7dc5ab547ba187baddbb2dc5b56246","972c3dbf0b2d9f3d47fe24c46fc8d16073eab2bd541dbedfe333d600d295aabf","a659393a0a154c0a5fe5655f2584fa833e20ddfa334f4ed4803677a101573802","03b18ffda81e48aa06e571ae61f47f290ad657f26aa95ecd442201d29a6830d7","3f44394c94a1128790b797daf416077f29f4d3a6790757a46b38246e04f4cde0","7e61045a2c878eb68c871f58c941cea69a9c04a9a6c75b11337190194b113656","cd09a484878fb80b1ec51f7ffa24205d44cfe5b56b44626c22df90f3ed045b9a","87ffde60ed31cb51a7b9efd83f8ce43f4e043183bf2ece8638b8c489da532cfe","6e30f1319c80cee97278133075443c2d972f4da63edcff03243e20634dec5a82","3b4828eaab3f3be5b5897cd9a8b34b2794c166c05a1e30361b8dd5e0a56349a3","91ae51f16bd7ca2b8d75f305feadc7dbbe7f0b491306f4558461ab62795150b6","6c7894f177f8e31f7f77d9ca05036d300d9687eb8b90e95aceb1299dd1c15100","1f48b4652890521f3164f146243dc10ff700485f6f3c01b02f849d1552275aa0","dca085033bde179d28b82daa0a3aba128dbaf2fd2547e2c8d3bbf530c7f254d4"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[18480,18503],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p18480"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"frequencyBandList","paragraph_zero_based":18504},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of one or multiple frequency bands to which this carrier(s) belongs. If frequencyBandList-v1760 is present, it shall contain the same number of entries, listed in the same order as in frequencyBandList (without suffix).","paragraph_zero_based":18505},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"scs-SpecificCarrierList","paragraph_zero_based":18506},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A set of carriers for different subcarrier spacings (numerologies). Defined in relation to Point A (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 5.3). The network configures this for all SCSs that are used in DL BWPs in this serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":18507},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18508},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–FrequencyInfoUL","paragraph_zero_based":18509},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE FrequencyInfoUL provides basic parameters of an uplink carrier and transmission thereon.","paragraph_zero_based":18510},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FrequencyInfoUL information element","paragraph_zero_based":18511},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":18512},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FREQUENCYINFOUL-START","paragraph_zero_based":18513},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18514},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FrequencyInfoUL ::=                 SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":18515},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    frequencyBandList                   MultiFrequencyBandListNR                                OPTIONAL,   -- Cond FDD-OrSUL","paragraph_zero_based":18516},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    absoluteFrequencyPointA             ARFCN-ValueNR                                           OPTIONAL,   -- Cond FDD-OrSUL","paragraph_zero_based":18517},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    scs-SpecificCarrierList             SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxSCSs)) OF SCS-SpecificCarrier,","paragraph_zero_based":18518},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    additionalSpectrumEmission          AdditionalSpectrumEmission                              OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":18519},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    p-Max                               P-Max                                                   OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":18520},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    frequencyShift7p5khz                ENUMERATED {true}                                       OPTIONAL,   -- Cond FDD-TDD-OrSUL-Optional","paragraph_zero_based":18521},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":18522},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":18523},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    additionalSpectrumEmission-v1760    AdditionalSpectrumEmission-v1760                        OPTIONAL    -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":18524},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]]","paragraph_zero_based":18525},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":18526},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18527}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4c743e2488ec2ae5919e5abb0a7bd466f81080f73ee081ba875bc7c9d072de8e","d6f22000fbb28171be12323b14a68bf853bcf2fbb6c45f7b1f7b7a7b2a232af0","01aaaa31d1d2ce332910c21cbe4464f307735fed725ef326150a77d322b2ea9a","80ebaf052dd6f1fa50fb01ab1927124741c163561f62b72e95cfb67c008e2311","ba90780bcca9474de16264025df39810fadfc24c2b3ecf6c0c6a4dc845d4277f","66fb2451a8e1ab9078f3d2a31ba0e0dcfa2cde0d39c5bfb7280367b5289c2e8a","70ed8cf6c666abeb33fdc0098236fdcbd5bbab3532cad041a43e2ad3ccefa77c","40054e94df70bef13fb8fd633c7456d0d5308d85b2d3aebec518de5e3d4ab9f8","ac254ee1f4e4b8827a11e407d552b698b491bcd2260943118bd51b66c4a9f648","539e3c095de5553047c11afad8e5dfebac76cd61faa0a13c0ae9d9398b4989b7","2bebec02e668a2de065716d9397bcb4fba079a3a31adb18cdf6b2179fa9e29bb","ac0deec1e83ae53e51ce1f74427e506b121e57fad44872808da279a19ed9319c","264f4f019cc950cda4bccffe848102513ed0ce585b41ec05c1c4305e12830a58","cd8bca513b6b3c63a41afec76021a0f68dc100a0960f0a40b3428d3281e6ba8c","c108ca26ef2ab9c847e7eb20781e3296a306d37a345df7fad7d111d2df32b062","bb3ee27fad9b61ab8aa9ba3105db131fd2c1bf20b0530773e3c842420f90c22a","0cfb880480ee94f99b91096817b0f3d53be40e33524ce05b4273723942f9ac30","51078c5a625ac96dc81d0d3346cb9f31b9e7301deea15a7de1d7ad44937682af","8a818b18ed6c9e307070d340113f242aaccabedaa79f941dab5dd3cca7dd3161","60cbdd1eff95dcb4c98910202cec247b51e61c775752739d147990ca288ce60b","3dd8309e34b415b32ebd04395cc3c594f2a0155be438615553b4e038a2cb233a","ae2c2231e19abaf311c411592537a896c7ac97d7604eb90c905da103d934b8e6","3394fd0fb221c09e51172cbdc3e72c7eb3391319dc56c0606a1f692bfb2d687f","844a7c46fe2e22c038088bfe6d65939678671ccc1fbbbbbce0e13d7f2d6a8a72"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[18504,18527],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p18504"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FREQUENCYINFOUL-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FrequencyInfoUL field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":18531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"absoluteFrequencyPointA","paragraph_zero_based":18532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Absolute frequency of the reference resource block (Common RB 0). Its lowest subcarrier is also known as Point A. Note that the lower edge of the actual carrier is not defined by this field but rather in the scs-SpecificCarrierList (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 4.4.4.2).","paragraph_zero_based":18533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"additionalSpectrumEmission","paragraph_zero_based":18534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The additional spectrum emission requirements to be applied by the UE on this uplink. If both additionalSpectrumEmission (without suffix) and additionalSpectrumEmission-v1760 are absent, the UE uses value 0 for the additionalSpectrumEmission (see TS 38.101-1 [15], tables 6.2.3.1-1A, 6.2A.3.1.1-2 and 6.2A.3.1.2-2, TS 38.101-2 [39], tables 6.2.3.1-2 and 6.2A.3.1-2, and TS 38.101-5 [75], table 6.2.3.1-1A). Network configures the same value in additionalSpectrumEmission for all uplink carrier(s) of the same band with UL configured and if signalled, the same vaue in additionalSpectrumEmission-v1760 for all uplink carrier(s) of the same band with UL configured, except for additionalSpectrumEmission value corresponding to NS_55/NS_57. If NS_55/NS_57 (see TS 38.101-1 [15], table 6.2.3.1-1) is applicable for at least one uplink carrier, the network may configure either NS_55/NS_57 or NS_01 for these uplink carriers, and NS_01 for the remaining uplink carrier(s) of band n77. The additionalSpectrumEmission is applicable for all uplink carriers of the same band with UL configured.","paragraph_zero_based":18535},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"frequencyBandList","paragraph_zero_based":18536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List containing only one frequency band to which this carrier(s) belongs. Multiple values are not supported.","paragraph_zero_based":18537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"frequencyShift7p5khz","paragraph_zero_based":18538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Enable the NR UL transmission with a 7.5 kHz shift to the LTE raster. If the field is absent, the frequency shift is disabled.","paragraph_zero_based":18539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"p-Max","paragraph_zero_based":18540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Maximum transmit power allowed in this serving cell. The maximum transmit power that the UE may use on this serving cell may be additionally limited by p-NR-FR1 (configured for the cell group) and by p-UE-FR1 (configured total for all serving cells operating on FR1). If absent, the UE applies the maximum power according to TS 38.101-1 [15] in case of an FR1 cell, TS 38.101-2 [39] in case of an FR2 cell or TS 38.101-5 [75] in case of an NTN cell. In this release of the specification, if p-Max is present on a carrier frequency in FR2, the UE shall ignore the field and applies the maximum power according to TS 38.101-2 [39]. Value in dBm. This field is ignored by IAB-MT, the IAB-MT applies output power and emissions requirements, as specified in TS 38.174 [63].","paragraph_zero_based":18541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"scs-SpecificCarrierList","paragraph_zero_based":18542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A set of carriers for different subcarrier spacings (numerologies). Defined in relation to Point A. The network configures a scs-SpecificCarrier at least for each numerology (SCS) that is used e.g. in a BWP (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 5.3).","paragraph_zero_based":18543},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":18545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":18546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FDD-OrSUL","paragraph_zero_based":18547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present if this FrequencyInfoUL is for the paired UL for a DL (defined in a FrequencyInfoDL) or if this FrequencyInfoUL is for a supplementary uplink (SUL). It is absent, Need R, otherwise (if this FrequencyInfoUL is for an unpaired UL (TDD).","paragraph_zero_based":18548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FDD-TDD-OrSUL-Optional","paragraph_zero_based":18549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present, Need R, if this FrequencyInfoUL is for the paired UL for a DL (defined in a FrequencyInfoDL), or if this FrequencyInfoUL is for an unpaired UL (TDD) in certain bands (as defined in clause 5.4.2.1 of TS 38.101-1 and in clause 5.4.2.1 of TS 38.104 [12]), or if this FrequencyInfoUL is for a supplementary uplink (SUL). It is absent, Need R, otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":18550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18551}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c0ed87747b9a765363fd39a9165ad0f62bc92f2ce525fe0e6399ddce0f77b278","b66888bcf65c3395b3e30b594f30564a20ce740ba1334942ee9a5935744c085c","be7b5df195b502c8d1ec2a418b83392665109e81cd3f5ea4778ea99655008f3f","cab063251969685c29beaab9518085b8ad78c5a4ab2576f27ce22385b057f485","174213444c81dbedaa82f871d1a511fb215324bbd69966d465663d881a3e25ac","475e3dc3252d5e9cc473cd0a5c4d3e63a1e9f438b44510d2858334f59ee56c1b","c1e2a8ca6b06757afe67f6