{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Absolute frequency of the reference resource block (Common RB 0). Its lowest subcarrier is also known as Point A. Note that the lower edge of the actual carrier is not defined by this field but rather in the scs-SpecificCarrierList (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 4.4.4.2).","paragraph_zero_based":18576},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"frequencyBandList","paragraph_zero_based":18577},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Provides the frequency band indicator and a list of additionalPmax and additionalSpectrumEmission values as defined in TS 38.101-1 [15], table 6.2.3.1-1, TS 38.101-2 [39], table 6.2.3.1-2, and TS 38.101-5 [75], table 6.2.3.1-1. The UE shall apply the first listed band which it supports in the frequencyBandList field. If frequencyBandList-v1760 is present, it shall contain the same number of entries, listed in the same order as in frequencyBandList (without suffix).","paragraph_zero_based":18578},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"frequencyShift7p5khz","paragraph_zero_based":18579},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Enable the NR UL transmission with a 7.5 kHz shift to the LTE raster. If the field is absent, the frequency shift is disabled.","paragraph_zero_based":18580},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"p-Max","paragraph_zero_based":18581},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in dBm applicable for the cell. If absent the UE applies the maximum power according to TS 38.101-1 [15] in case of an FR1 cell, TS 38.101-2 [39] in case of an FR2 cell or TS 38.101-5 [75] in case of an NTN cell. In this release of the specification, if p-Max is present on a carrier frequency in FR2, the UE shall ignore the field and applies the maximum power according to TS 38.101-2 [39]. This field is ignored by IAB-MT, the IAB-MT applies output power and emissions requirements, as specified in TS 38.174 [63].","paragraph_zero_based":18582},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"scs-SpecificCarrierList","paragraph_zero_based":18583},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A set of carriers for different subcarrier spacings (numerologies). Defined in relation to Point A (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 5.3). The network configures this for all SCSs that are used in UL BWPs configured in this serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":18584},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18585},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":18586},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":18587},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FDD-OrSUL","paragraph_zero_based":18588},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present if this FrequencyInfoUL-SIB is for the paired UL for a DL (defined in a FrequencyInfoDL-SIB) or if this FrequencyInfoUL-SIB is for a supplementary uplink (SUL). It is absent otherwise (if this FrequencyInfoUL-SIB is for an unpaired UL (TDD).","paragraph_zero_based":18589},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FDD-TDD-OrSUL-Optional","paragraph_zero_based":18590},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present, Need R, if this FrequencyInfoUL-SIB is for the paired UL for a DL (defined in a FrequencyInfoDL-SIB), or if this FrequencyInfoUL-SIB is for an unpaired UL (TDD) in certain bands (as defined in clause 5.4.2.1 of TS 38.101-1 and in clause 5.4.2.1 of TS 38.104 [12]), or if this FrequencyInfoUL-SIB is for a supplementary uplink (SUL). It is absent otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":18591},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18592},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–GapPriority","paragraph_zero_based":18593},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE GapPriority is used to identify the priority of a gap configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":18594},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"GapPriority information element","paragraph_zero_based":18595},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":18596},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-GAPPRIORITY-START","paragraph_zero_based":18597},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18598},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"GapPriority-r17 ::=                       INTEGER (1..maxNrOfGapPri-r17)","paragraph_zero_based":18599}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["841abb82507605efce41f8222a42201f6b502c972480f702df4285037bf14d90","65db57f92f2b365726c1db1894f68ea358dbf9f0c0b9f7dbb69f04bc540df494","fcf3c8a2cd4f5c7c0f7d600d4bd1c9ec8b87951011f14f44c8a7f2dd1fc80e9d","353099e91c60ce07ced1f1aa2d6602b89ffa1d2c39539d1c2ab50d36a450a7f7","62083ffe365e55c111d22968bbf0d4e346cf108b07917a25007240eda74b7e45","65aacdd081f56a2ee6f3865d22c5d79c07290fcfca4c0b3098f97f27ab6b70a3","10caf18342d69f46aca37cf9d08766407c7751465e36c2f6278e017cb192ec36","12e8bc5922e802393e5eb67745f1d09338409aebbc6468adfa90e22c4b06403a","b4d3f4182c331c2d446e1d2a3c23c3086238814e8a313318f435edb53bc17289","e73e9fd44b1a881d53a4a28238687c286c6b6196f447cf7f6dc2869ad62d264d","cc755bdc03abdefd66520f76b9e4c79d5c55e18b4644007435fcf484ef40f66b","15d452cd74dfdf42a17e6c2c266f31424844228ad0b2ed950c18ab32bc92dddc","0f01761f772ce2252f9ded05380964a75d8d5d525711d3812e400632f17ea0ad","e210369c3b4ca28accb8a5c70857f207156ed71b126529b074e98b79fb5fa8f6","68c17ec53225461e60be6afba24c0ba0c9b6d83e11db2407e43600f4d49f4fd2","da496f5a619118b3823eaa47c5229f93b8fcb9c73a3e272183ce1ca4801fd7df","0e20d1eb8bfac8bbd50d2198cd7b9fed01206aad6a511fb8d2deeea7fe3739f9","78a25bca65811b4ca9f48ae2d3db521c81c2f7af37f26b1d02d283678ec3d2f8","f76d40943fad079c7c3e45dcc24cc11fb763e8b0007d8a5f6423a33638a5dd88","e50f865a52