{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the quality thresholds for reporting the measured cells for idle/inactive E-UTRA measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":19464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportQuantities","paragraph_zero_based":19465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates which measurement quantities UE is requested to report in the idle/inactive measurement report. ","paragraph_zero_based":19466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportQuantitiesEUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":19467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates which E-UTRA measurement quantities the UE is requested to report in the idle/inactive measurement report.","paragraph_zero_based":19468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportQuantityRS-Indexes","paragraph_zero_based":19469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates which measurement information per beam index the UE shall include in the NR idle/inactive measurement results.","paragraph_zero_based":19470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"smtc","paragraph_zero_based":19471},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the measurement timing configuration for inter-frequency measurement. If this field is absent in VarMeasIdleConfig, the UE assumes that SSB periodicity is 5 ms in this frequency.","paragraph_zero_based":19472},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssbSubcarrierSpacing","paragraph_zero_based":19473},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates subcarrier spacing of SSB.","paragraph_zero_based":19474},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Only the following values are applicable depending on the used frequency:","paragraph_zero_based":19475},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FR1:    15 or 30 kHz","paragraph_zero_based":19476},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FR2-1:  120 or 240 kHz","paragraph_zero_based":19477},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FR2-2:  120, 480, or 960 kHz","paragraph_zero_based":19478},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssb-ToMeasure","paragraph_zero_based":19479},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The set of SS blocks to be measured within the SMTC measurement duration (see TS 38.215 [9]). When the field is absent in VarMeasIdleConfig, the UE measures on all SS-blocks.","paragraph_zero_based":19480},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ss-RSSI-Measurement","paragraph_zero_based":19481},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the SSB-based RSSI measurement configuration. If the field is absent in VarMeasIdleConfig, the UE behaviour is defined in TS 38.215 [89], clause 5.1.3.","paragraph_zero_based":19482},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"validityAreaList","paragraph_zero_based":19483},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the list of frequencies and optionally, for each frequency, a list of cells within which the UE is required to perform measurements while in RRC_IDLE and RRC_INACTIVE. ","paragraph_zero_based":19484},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":19485},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MeasIdToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":19486},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE MeasIdToAddModList concerns a list of measurement identities to add or modify, with for each entry the measId, the associated measObjectId and the associated reportConfigId.","paragraph_zero_based":19487}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["bcc6710923f60947d7440e9917e897d666477362171b84d8ceafb00935767140","a97844c5bce027f9cdc72fa79a42f1c1cfcf7762f12ca8427e09214aa270393d","a6af84c50857ff4491626647c657d54683e7301cec78dc5b01608b4236eb1e62","1c036921997449432c37c13de0dda8f52ad5ec5e43cab1d786519fda