{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultServingMOList","paragraph_zero_based":20376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Measured results of measured cells with reference signals indicated in the serving cell measurement objects including measurement results of SpCell, configured SCell(s) and best neighbouring cell within measured cells with reference signals indicated in on each serving cell measurement object. If the sending of the MeasurementReport message is triggered by a measurement configured by the field sl-ConfigDedicatedForNR received within an E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration message (i.e. CBR measurements), this field is not applicable and its contents is ignored by the network.","paragraph_zero_based":20377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultSFTD-EUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":20378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SFTD measurement results between the PCell and the E-UTRA PScell in NE-DC.","paragraph_zero_based":20379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultSFTD-NR","paragraph_zero_based":20380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SFTD measurement results between the PCell and the NR PScell in NR-DC.","paragraph_zero_based":20381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultsSL","paragraph_zero_based":20382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CBR measurements results for NR sidelink communication/discovery.","paragraph_zero_based":20383},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultUTRA-FDD","paragraph_zero_based":20384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Measured result of a UTRA-FDD cell.","paragraph_zero_based":20385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MeasResultsCandRelay","paragraph_zero_based":20386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Measurement result(s) of candiate L2 U2N relay UE(s).","paragraph_zero_based":20387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MeasResultServingRela