{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MUSIM-GapConfig-r17 ::=                  SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":20856},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"musim-GapToReleaseList-r17       SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..3)) OF MUSIM-GapId-r17               OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":20857},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"musim-GapToAddModList-r17        SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..3)) OF MUSIM-Gap-r17             OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":20858},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"musim-AperiodicGap-r17           MUSIM-GapInfo-r17                OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":20859},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"   ...","paragraph_zero_based":20860},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":20861},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MUSIM-Gap-r17 ::=          SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":20862},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    musim-GapId-r17                        MUSIM-GapId-r17,","paragraph_zero_based":20863},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    musim-GapInfo-r17                      MUSIM-GapInfo-r17","paragraph_zero_based":20864},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20865},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":20866},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20867},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MUSIM-GAPCONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":20868},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":20869},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20870},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MUSIM-GapConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":20871},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"musim-AperiodicGap","paragraph_zero_based":20872},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the MUSIM aperiodic gap as specified in TS 38.133 [14] clause 9.1.10. If UE indicates the musim-Starting-SFN-AndSubframe when requesting aperiodic gap the network can only configure the aperiodic gap with the same start point or no aperiodic gap. If the field musim-Starting-SFN-AndSubframe is absent for aperiodic gap, network can configure any timing as the starting point for aperiodic gap or configure no aperiodic gap.","paragraph_zero_based":20873},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"musim-GapInfo","paragraph_zero_based":20874},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the values for musim-GapLength and musim-GapRepetitionAndOffset. When network provides periodic gap, network always signals the musim-GapLength and musim-GapRepetitionAndOffset as indicated by the UE's preferred MUSIM gap configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":20875},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"musim-GapToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":20876},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of MUSIM periodic gap patterns to add or modify.","paragraph_zero_based":20877},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"musim-GapToReleaseList","paragraph_zero_based":20878},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of MUSIM periodic gap patterns to release.","paragraph_zero_based":20879}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b3bf7e5fee1fc81fdf8dcaa3d521278788a00dfd103f292885ee951fe23b077e","0d9b2f8a8a27cb40faedfe3fc151d72d37236a4aa7dca13cc671493bf18ff5c8","bdb4446b4ab342badcd57b5805ccddbcc7bfdeb2b55e476da1a4d1db295092d0","cbb5d3968f82c0fa63cd2613ae92ac2d7bef73be06f19bce6ed7e6366c8f6fd1","bcd17b9a60386d964a46dfbea044a11027f1537d263123e99f52f083be5f1a14","8728acdcb872ce77458f5fa07074765d234547f1c1e7057ffcba6202e34c58a9","362f7dd8fff50346ef0ead5b2ff23dc4a2cfa9ffe88f85db8a45509e233e06bb","d5dda4f96