"    bandNR-r17                        FreqBandIndicatorNR,","paragraph_zero_based":21090},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    gapIndication-r17                 ENUMERATED {gap, ncsg, nogap-noncsg}","paragraph_zero_based":21091},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":21092},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21093},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NEEDFORGAPNCSG-INFONR-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":21094},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":21095}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f360ea13d1fa43151810214bd95407c2106b26f69d80c9b0aa82f7efb7ae0c21","f0849e5df7f94fbd863b7d7a1b3298176dd9ef11691873e673f954e770b221c1","8219daf6f3e7a251bd817f6f9cd9bc33ae51d0e09a0291f6616a07acb493f56c","4552fc56700baf809f6ab9e3cb94b25701f498ff59f54895e755c57fa82586d8","99ed3218e8a8671e10f5b9e1189cbfa90af2155ba67af55126d4f497468dafd0","8004706f86c1b84bdbf313ff7ba25cfe134719c1faf7f295d30510b95b55262c","f491dc293040169fe03e77a47df3ae896e0a715f49d5938f20baced6b2e292b0","ad5b53229181d12ce1c0eea3c708d66af866cd0d187024fa46f83b3a3d066096","eca5968adf87acff60702f49c240bb82fa2f0a6961447a96a5c486074b63561c","98cf8b80e78a180d9d28e2914ea1457c69b649dc4eed7c56e06dbca842f8f0cb","47deaf41a42852464845cbe10b52a93c14c6c6504e83c467b8ac09ad2326395b","3cdd6aa11633f77c05b9a5321e303e089f1b1b64f3f969b21261e36907e0e62a","4f012ed21524ff5630c0c0c0ee877bd1f15e0ef798dfbea689f072c21ea4054a","c90af31b4b5af68193fa5f434f15522d442847166326d5affb8ae2b479b5bddf","6d1bf79a3386957e03ad9807b69f50f60398f036c880612c567cfc1904f6f5d9","953971212253c045d82dd583bb0746c7b4bbe3d3a7670f97e7dcaeb1e7c25128","dee5cd590969242580bcfac495b88f16377c246606c9737d8463fd8bc4ccd6bb","c831d44bb23619a34a245e5017cc888ac454198d671327ed8ba8e39f0e49ca5a","b9b18092bc440006a2c64851a0948fe21111a20ab056163ba67164b34ab4bf91","f0b6f49ce7f14ff15ad407ad8aadfa5c187383394107f1b02329cb60ee953008","1bf67c0fdd615859dfa20423400fca17904b4c1d43a98742354ae49faeb9a18c","f9150052c65bd3dcc2b45bea3d14096422ee96374edc3bf277a4b37b101448d2","ee9cbdfaae08206a6d6350c2b75075dfc7e510b8c568a19806d820b403dda061","372854581a5f119ff49dcea8401251f4e166ac9f3c2baea5aa7f25f57ed54284"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[21072,21095],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p21072"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForGapNCSG-InfoNR field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":21097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"intraFreq-needForNCSG","paragraph_zero_based":21098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information for NR intra-frequency measurement.","paragraph_zero_based":21099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"interFreq-needForNCSG","paragraph_zero_based":21100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information for NR inter-frequency measurement.","paragraph_zero_based":21101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForNCSG-IntraFreq field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":21103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"servCellId","paragraph_zero_based":21104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the serving cell which contains the target SSB (associated with the initial DL BWP) to be measured.","paragraph_zero_based":21105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gapIndicationIntra","paragraph_zero_based":21106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether measurement gap or NCSG is required for the UE to perform intra-frequency SSB based measurements on the concerned serving cell. Value gap indicates that a measurement gap is needed if any of the UE configured BWPs (except the BWP(s) configured with servingCellMO associated with NCD-SSB) do not contain the frequency domain resources of the SSB associated to the initial DL BWP (CD-SSB). Value ncsg indicates that a NCSG is needed if any of the UE configured BWPs do not contain the frequency domain resources of the SSB associated to the initial DL BWP. Value nogap-noncsg indicates that neither a measurement gap nor a NCSG is needed to measure the SSB associated to the initial DL BWP (CD-SSB) for all configured BWPs (except the BWP(s) configured with servingCellMO associated with NCD-SSB), no matter the SSB is within the configured BWP or not.","paragraph_zero_based":21107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForNCSG-NR field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":21109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bandNR","paragraph_zero_based":21110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the NR target band to be measured.","paragraph_zero_based":21111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gapIndication","paragraph_zero_based":21112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether measurement gap or NCSG is required for the UE to perform SSB based measurements on the concerned NR target band while NR-DC or NE-DC is not configured. The UE determines this information based on the resultant configuration of the RRCReconfiguration or RRCResume message that triggers this response. Value gap indicates that a measurement gap is needed, value ncsg indicates that a NCSG is needed, and value nogap-noncsg indicates neither a measurement gap nor a NCSG is needed. ","paragraph_zero_based":21113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NextHopChainingCount","paragraph_zero_based":21115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NextHopChainingCount is used to update the KgNB key and corresponds to parameter NCC: See TS 33.501 [11].","paragraph_zero_based":21116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NextHopChainingCount information element","paragraph_zero_based":21117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":21118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NEXTHOPCHAININGCOUNT-START","paragraph_zero_based":21119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["44948f3f66b0f997e4f8c3ab1210f0d56b6f2928f75712838d19d823ec1f0b1a","31b4479a669cc07db5d9cfa29475c44e4f4d136b2968d0650035082814cf2b09","297f6fe1c1d5d8cd9440a8a85673c8178b259e99c5781c495981833ead72c550","80a1ba4943e3b07f8f1656c9614849bf0e36155ee84bea80cefb5660946339a9","05245b0328dd26abea6e2ea6804b42187277559ee9c7b6633452289a94e3614f","69c79d8879f6411d9dfc64817324c1dc2bae8289f0aa6212604e1c21d08bbffc","275440cc14372bce9d6570ef080c91cad78ee5036c10a940351d366b492eb03a","82825493bc311e4f4ddc1a3dbc63315e78067def7ae470b0280796c31676b914","ad678abf914114badd6f425e53e8f9e224999d70fb9afcf3c132ce7f1df2adcc","44970c977ad11cf9fd2151b17392f201c5dfa013fbcf852358fa867d6bd01b8b","ecd3cd51a999d4d10163471a8a1b8062e31935a9d37eb4ae094ed2574ec16a63","037411e0ac61153b36f294aaca186d4a746f1e71e9f7f357c658e308390e014c","85345e4bf1d074dba7e6ad7c564852d9fdd691e08fb6dd62b784f14cb76678c5","ba4c2e129e3894fb70aa3f65eb757007d41f3ff07f7a345871382e70c2eada7d","24ab7ad003de0e3d35431a6bd48c04e627366254afdc1ab9e95fdad3b55ba4b4","d4daa4f47377db54377526d93642fbc2a9510dff5b38e0320f1e0bd846dbc81a","2e7236338c33278764fe613aebfc8be9f81344763beaed522ed593edb69a66fd","0e09a39d64a6f0b4f0cd6b7895c6201fd6ab6e703575ce108e544d042e1070b1","4472b900273fff13b4e36c4d3db2719beb931f35ea10d2935877e199f7530266","a1f3eeb93e3372cc5adb59d658bff09147d819e891cb2a24affd5d7afdb327e3","18dcd0c0ab2a6543438260e0704df4488d307b21da741f5a91117bbe1d23fb4f","8bd7c378aa38d9ef723d7ff653e03c2f53aa4d22b52fde0456498af737a6e85d","14c75555126524058e29990fe4294f13112fcc84c87af7609ba65ea90a0eafa9","b6eea0a7bd7b3de4a3b0bcfff2a9a80a81df63beddc9803f9bae395c7220284c"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[21096,21119],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p21096"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NextHopChainingCount ::=                    INTEGER (0..7)","paragraph_zero_based":21121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NEXTHOPCHAININGCOUNT-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":21123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":21124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NG-5G-S-TMSI","paragraph_zero_based":21126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NG-5G-S-TMSI contains a 5G S-Temporary Mobile Subscription Identifier (5G-S-TMSI), a temporary UE identity provided by the 5GC which uniquely identifies the UE within the tracking area, see TS 23.003 [21].","paragraph_zero_based":21127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NG-5G-S-TMSI information element","paragraph_zero_based":21128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":21129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NG-5G-S-TMSI-START","paragraph_zero_based":21130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NG-5G-S-TMSI ::=                         BIT STRING (SIZE (48))","paragraph_zero_based":21132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NG-5G-S-TMSI-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":21134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":21135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NonCellDefiningSSB","paragraph_zero_based":21137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NonCellDefiningSSB is used to configure a NCD-SSB to be used while the UE operates in a RedCap-specific initial BWP or dedicated BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":21138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NonCellDefiningSSB information element","paragraph_zero_based":21139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":21140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NONCELLDEFININGSSB-START","paragraph_zero_based":21141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NonCellDefiningSSB-r17 ::=      SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":21143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a63968c4fa005937f3928871d77c2f5cd9317c44344e38b5dc36475c6d89aea7","d206598732c4f9ad8d483de08110d25281d1a9ea27835734df7de0d8a379288b","26ab0295b674886dfaa1a685e2e7a51447e5eb9a7f9892eb508a68b0380dae66","9f80000b63cb964c29e111931b6dd52dbe9130c56df3454be5a1b728b70bbe0a","b5109b0b754ffcf22170fa5843fab9a336d5f25e094cc8ad5e5f015da27c80c5","49be649f5cf00874d4df12e87e2b02db489838a0c0e39f185ecf8f4ebacdbc03","e779e43a4107a887571da35060673b81a417970b97ae369b0af926ff278068a0","f81f15e686c36a46159b922a182af78f8c2ae3afa40849034bf777dc12395f31","1c2f5a635656ccdaad52a9b6836f6061ca75cd5682443790241848ad26bd5e48","db20ad68cc481d2435df84bdb83a9c0508e8d2768cea3508ef203012bc9f9075","8baa869a3f41e3622bc13c43f0c8de66127fa3998deb9f02286231b67af846c6","0d241f35503d928c0a7b270bede46b2b528b9a2ef5262c292b4f45ec55443f4a","e1ae55e95dae845dcd88a59afc7127919710067910a8def5dd1a3f2308587aef","2b71ef8477dd5add2ebe809752444e5d204ab142fd7d77d00e1b4fea3438050e","51959a4cc9e46b44bf6611f1762548ac86ba06f7884211bc33e273421656a2af","c7db4034bfe5dca2a9cf7f2d876ae04e99d9958f1bee4534784445af9cadec69","3ba117c2e1d6d60f2b4c039459cd98d8dcf70b0e0019978cd121ba2cbb4f787b","08712b057c3930a360e2c8b375347ca97eb41048c1d4c68fdc1d3d21d5edaf99","01183126ff9f6051f2ac983bbc0fe37a2281bd377c3ebdc39e5cec9060887123","1ee86aba3a8b706320a409c6db05b418afc7ded1e7e644c593d2d805ec6a6c9f","3d11fd5e91cf461ec0d86ac4bd3901612dc87f5c70f3e6d36a728dcc7a641fe4","aea94591d7531dbf3877ed30cdb5f571971d895c0b8e26b3236f8e8e6bce2f00","57f173d665d5baf9cb0fb78b2cd74e4b7e7ab739fb05a4435083355f59ced0ad","bae8d0eaea9d3f19265e744eedac4b69ca6eedb16af3926798f63e7f96631b14"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[21120,21143],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p21120"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    absoluteFrequencySSB-r17        ARFCN-ValueNR,","paragraph_zero_based":21144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ssb-Periodicity-r17             ENUMERATED { ms5, ms10, ms20, ms40, ms80, ms160, spare2, spare1 }       OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":21145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ssb-TimeOffset-r17              ENUMERATED { ms5, ms10, ms15, ms20, ms40, ms80, spare2, spare1 }      OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":21146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":21147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":21148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NONCELLDEFININGSSB-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":21150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":21151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NonCellDefiningSSB field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":21153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"absoluteFrequencySSB","paragraph_zero_based":21154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Frequency of the NCD-SSB. The network configures this field so that the SSB is within the bandwidth of the BWP configured in BWP-DownlinkCommon.","paragraph_zero_based":21155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssb-Periodicity","paragraph_zero_based":21156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The periodicity of this NCD-SSB. The network configures only periodicities that are larger than the periodicity of serving cell's CD-SSB. If the field is absent, the UE applies the SSB periodicity of the CD-SSB (ssb-periodicityServingCell configured in ServingCellConfigCommon or ServingCellConfigCommonSIB).","paragraph_zero_based":21157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssb-TimeOffset","paragraph_zero_based":21158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The time offset between CD-SSB of the serving cell and this NCD-SSB. Value ms5 means the first burst of NCD-SSB is transmitted 5ms later than the first burst of CD-SSB transmitted after the first symbol of SFN=0 of the serving cell, value ms10 means the first burst of NCD-SSB is transmitted 10ms later than the first burst of CD-SSB transmitted after the first symbol in SFN=0 of the serving cell, and so on. If the field is absent, RedCap UE considers that the time offset between the first burst of CD-SSB transmitted in the serving cell and the first burst of this NCD-SSB transmitted is zero.","paragraph_zero_based":21159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NPN-Identity","paragraph_zero_based":21161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NPN-Identity includes either a list of CAG-IDs or a list of NIDs per PLMN Identity. Further information regarding how to set the IE is specified in TS 23.003 [21].","paragraph_zero_based":21162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NPN-Identity information element","paragraph_zero_based":21163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":21164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NPN-IDENTITY-START","paragraph_zero_based":21165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NPN-Identity-r16 ::=             CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":21167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["782c53595699931192d2872912c1291fc40964560db0445e243161cf5f608660","d12608d0b83195ed4a338a74bf91d9d8fcff3d4ee8edcd36b54bd336a531c6f8"