{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-PUSCH-CONFIGCOMMON-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":24048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":24049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":24050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PUSCH-ConfigCommon field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":24051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"groupHoppingEnabledTransformPrecoding","paragraph_zero_based":24052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For DMRS transmission with transform precoder, the NW may configure group hopping by this cell-specific parameter, see TS 38.211 [16], clause 6.4.1.1.1.2.","paragraph_zero_based":24053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"msg3-DeltaPreamble","paragraph_zero_based":24054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Power offset between msg3 and RACH preamble transmission. Actual value = field value * 2 [dB] (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 7.1)","paragraph_zero_based":24055},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"p0-NominalWithGrant","paragraph_zero_based":24056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"P0 value for PUSCH with grant (except msg3). Value in dBm. Only even values (step size 2) allowed (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 7.1) This field is cell specific","paragraph_zero_based":24057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"pusch-TimeDomainAllocationList","paragraph_zero_based":24058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of time domain allocations for timing of UL assignment to UL data (see TS 38.214 [19], table 6.1.2.1.1-1).","paragraph_zero_based":24059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":24060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–PUSCH-PowerControl","paragraph_zero_based":24061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE PUSCH-PowerControl is used to configure UE specific power control parameter for PUSCH.","paragraph_zero_based":24062},{"literal_t