{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"startingSymbolOffsetK","paragraph_zero_based":25488},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The starting symbol of the second transmission occasion has K symbol offset relative to the last symbol of the first transmission occasion. When UE is configured with tdmSchemeA, the parameter startingSymbolOffsetK is present, otherwise absent.","paragraph_zero_based":25489},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"tciMapping","paragraph_zero_based":25490},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Enables TCI state mapping method to PDSCH transmission occasions.","paragraph_zero_based":25491},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":25492},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–ReportConfigId","paragraph_zero_based":25493},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE ReportConfigId is used to identify a measurement reporting configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":25494},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ReportConfigId information element","paragraph_zero_based":25495},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":25496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-REPORTCONFIGID-START","paragraph_zero_based":25497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":25498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ReportConfigId ::=                          INTEGER (1..maxReportConfigId)","paragraph_zero_based":25499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":25500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-REPORTCONFIGID-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":25501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":25502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":25503},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–ReportConfigInterRAT","paragraph_zero_based":25504},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE ReportConfigInterRAT specifies criteria for triggering of an inter-RAT measurement reporting event, or an L2 U2N relay measurement reporting event. The inter-RAT measurement reporting events for E-UTRA and UTRA-FDD are labelled BN with N equal to 1, 2 and so on. The measurement reporting events for L2 U2N relay UE are labelled YN with N equal to 1, 2 and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":25505},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event B1:Neighbour becomes better than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":25506},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event B2:PCell becomes worse than absolute threshold1 AND Neighbour becomes better than another absolute threshold2;","paragraph_zero_based":25507},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event Y1: PCell becomes worse than absolute threshold1 AND candidate L2 U2N Relay UE becomes better than another absolute threshold2;","paragraph_zero_based":25508},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event Y2: Candidate L2 U2N Relay UE becomes better than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":25509},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ReportConfigInterRAT information element","paragraph_zero_based":25510},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":25511}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["44ec63a745a1028a10e98f677a183b067635eb2d709bd1c05466e24b3ecb8e5f","a8d50f078508c53dd1135d95b5dea38d4214136ade63cf5f0d488ddf865a7df5","425713fc3ac3a4d8b8d0ef4bba56ce9f3b92c25325ae4a06f766a82a0df7f38c","9f6669a3d5d86a0c92d9b2925eed9122de99ecbf81c0c3282a465a94a025b2c6","0183225d77f9ca08f36b43f08c2d070a69297ba03370df60e08fd48e04ace43e","c180ba3494e35a9d67187987669e27cc5f817879d23aa8d199325a175d82637d","5fa217961b2e598465461ea086f4de44ba3d71194d4ccb491f44da9fc44de9c6","02