{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"L2 U2N Relay threshold value associated with the selected trigger quantity (i.e. RSRP) to be used in measurement report triggering condition for event number YN.","paragraph_zero_based":25680},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":25681},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PeriodicalReportConfigInterRAT field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":25682},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxReportCells","paragraph_zero_based":25683},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Max number of non-serving cells/candidate L2 U2N Relay UEs to include in the measurement report.","paragraph_zero_based":25684},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportAmount","paragraph_zero_based":25685},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of measurement reports applicable for eventTriggered as well as for periodical report types","paragraph_zero_based":25686},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportQuantity, reportQuantityUTRA-FDD","paragraph_zero_based":25687},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The cell measurement quantities to be included in the measurement report. If the field reportQuantityUTRA-FDD is present, the UE shall ignore the value(s) provided in reportQuantity.","paragraph_zero_based":25688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":25689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–ReportConfigNR","paragraph_zero_based":25690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE ReportConfigNR specifies criteria for triggering of an NR measurement reporting event or of a CHO, CPA or CPC event or of an L2 U2N relay measurement reporting event. For events labelled AN with N equal to 1, 2 and so on, measurement reporting events and CHO, CPA or CPC events are based on cell measurement results, which can either be derived based on SS/PBCH block or CSI-RS.","paragraph_zero_based":25691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A1:Serving becomes better than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":25692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A2:Serving becomes worse than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":25693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A3:Neighbour becomes amount of offset better than PCell/PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":25694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A4:Neighbour becomes better than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":25695},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A5:PCell/PSCell becomes worse than absolute threshold1 AND Neighbour/SCell becomes better than another absolute threshold2;","paragraph_zero_based":25696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A6:Neighbour becomes amount of offset better than SCell;","paragraph_zero_based":25697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event D1:Distance between UE and a reference location referenceLocation1 becomes larger than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference1 and distance between UE and a reference location referenceLocation2 becomes shorter than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference2;","paragraph_zero_based":25698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent A3: Conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes amount of offset better than PCell/PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":25699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent A4: Conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes better than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":25700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent A5: PCell/PSCell becomes worse than absolute threshold1 AND Conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes better than another absolute threshold2;","paragraph_zero_based":25701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent D1: Distance between UE and a reference location referenceLocation1 becomes larger than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference1 and distance between UE and a reference location referenceLocation2 of conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes shorter than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference2;","paragraph_zero_based":25702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent T1: Time measured at UE becomes more than configured threshold t1-Threshold but is less than t1-Threshold + duration;","paragraph_zero_based":25703}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ce906ce4651df7be6d42f52c8e1ce5896486a20605d8201cef1e8633945ffd83","ebef3953735088adacc75d5fcd0a01fa37bdd244a911ea9dda0619efd22e886f","3d0e85442136ad0858ba0d45a302276ad12ade706bc7fd1c67615ec9b8c81602","80d205f0802b12196364d6142b4c8f3a2be1e24eff0bd4152ba5afeea5112835","fbd8a4215bc6c2b2c87fe5cadd86abba6ef6292e12fcdb9037a2aff730ecda5b","e567b26fe6439f3d5a743121694f6d1128c7befee0f188267ba3ffeb4f136167","7dc0a851550ac1ffd5689faabda6c70797eef4bd9b47c9ff6d0098397223744b","16d64d89e22115c0959fca7d1db361703390a4da0fdc6230d8b1a94f39944cf5","ee883473c19d684e0267449ffad517cd764b0b8e59efcfacbf774e904348bbb4","e287b4df6a4fc7a86a91a45e1df0da088404e2d683a803ca45b72e3f0e4b9d04","54ed0c96e9270b8b156ab5815581eff9ce0972bdd825b6ea35f2c8cb0cfbafb6","3aebc43d58ba2be28db6329379120c5de0b54d3eed2bd169c5823a8d78914bda","20ae4bf7e0ad74fdfc7d2321983649c5c24abf0c7ea07c53adecb7e140fb8db1","fea11e80aa185999d7530af60b59dc0fde2a313abece52b0bf4aa6f0169d8b43","c5242c6df09d6fb4d0075ef3f6f2696478fd1cace51c9f54d178865ed2eb1390","e78367f537bece4199223785aa50d63ab586a25d83ee1c79f6ed4b9e6d9d75cd","d131668299b9fc8187f7572865f1adece5347b12d20704355c53c9bb70437e31","c7bf772098b022dab61489d91150046371dd539392d55c2766edebd69370ee7b","ff0e46024f0f1cae507fa68aad9b8cc58941f737265b247ada221ba35a73ebe5","5c7ed3f5f1e80096c39cb84262c54d2e0f739443c1368c86ff747fbb16e17a8f","c6f040ee4d