{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For IAB-MT, this field is optionally present, Need R, for TDD cells. It is absent otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":27600},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":27601},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–ServingCellConfigCommon","paragraph_zero_based":27602},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE ServingCellConfigCommon is used to configure cell specific parameters of a UE's serving cell. The IE contains parameters which a UE would typically acquire from SSB, MIB or SIBs when accessing the cell from IDLE. With this IE, the network provides this information in dedicated signalling when configuring a UE with a SCells or with an additional cell group (SCG). It also provides it for SpCells (MCG and SCG) upon reconfiguration with sync.","paragraph_zero_based":27603},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ServingCellConfigCommon information element","paragraph_zero_based":27604},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":27605},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SERVINGCELLCONFIGCOMMON-START","paragraph_zero_based":27606},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":27607},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ServingCellConfigCommon ::=         SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":27608},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    physCellId                          PhysCellId                                                          OPTIONAL,   -- Cond HOAndServCellAdd,","paragraph_zero_based":27609},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    downlinkConfigCommon                DownlinkConfigCommon                                                OPTIONAL,   -- Cond HOAndServCellAdd","paragraph_zero_based":27610},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    uplinkConfigCommon                  UplinkConfigCommon                                                  OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":27611},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    supplementaryUplinkConfig           UplinkConfigCommon                                                  OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":27612},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    n-TimingAdvanceOffset               ENUMERATED { n0, n25600, n39936 }                                   OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":27613},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ssb-PositionsInBurst                CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":27614},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        shortBitmap                         BIT STRING (SIZE (4)),","paragraph_zero_based":27615},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        mediumBitmap                        BIT STRING (SIZE (8)),","paragraph_zero_based":27616},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        longBitmap                          BIT STRING (SIZE (64))","paragraph_zero_based":27617},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    }                                                                                                       OPTIONAL, -- Cond AbsFreqSSB","paragraph_zero_based":27618},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ssb-periodicityServingCell          ENUMERATED { ms5, ms10, ms20, ms40, ms80, ms160, spare2, spare1 }   OPTIONAL, -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":27619},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    dmrs-TypeA-Position                 ENUMERATED {pos2, pos3},","paragraph_zero_based":27620},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    lte-CRS-ToMatchAround               SetupRelease { RateMatchPatternLTE-CRS }                            OPTIONAL, -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":27621},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    rateMatchPatternToAddModList        SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofRateMatchPatterns)) OF RateMatchPattern   OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":27622},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    rateMatchPatternToReleaseList       SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofRateMatchPatterns)) OF RateMatchPatternId OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":27623}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e0f32cbb3cb1c31f0ae621ed1d68d0175c92b7ea8c05b543aa358aa1e9423059","3d0bb127d189caf3ef669d9644a9be14dcd9ea56cc6d17b9226ed67b9ea0b406","af92dda3956ad08e26c2694af56791a02a7037ad26c3438b38f4b7a14f3d8471","f8dfdce6d065d65cfaf2410a5729e1e8d68cc699875ab9aa7ff2ff23e82e0d5a","729ae4cd8de2e8d73b1d62e5196a221aee2fbb56aaee952c94af7cec3f5fd437","53274f26ace7dbef1f39db903bf1aa7d9b1fe9228435b74eeb07e0be6ff7220a","22b74219468d7b012205e5d46e4aa77ba35a0f1c103ea94269e4b533557e3b2e","41493bea25381badf84319fbc87d9d1b468a878c66e6e9530b7d252c9512fc9a","057325c2631003821a2f9278260fd7c2589b8c3aa7064714aa179e9a126f049b","712134777f2d0a6cff3c254bb38c72587d892211c19bafe25a8e7ce802066199","7ebb0ad145a7591d3dc3ccb70b0454e1a31b590eb1b7bc9d1bf5442ad40be5a4","6887659ba5a1ea59541e70df9ae36d92be641d63816ecda61cf8305decbd5375","daed7f1b4a820d41b5fbbabf746014c1e3910b541452c33b03ba1d865e60bcbe","1c832a97b9cccb79cd9da51938e40728f04a11c092f601a4b29b169dd67f2d81","260b3183ea17a6870afc3d06f2e6828c55ddc82067c4ab207ca1f83c31b24af7","699416afb1682558e1926ce1cf1101d0cc7960eda08c4ca3938257dd8129a218","125b0390cff6620a1832e09832a9639217c8803235985506821d40a643f31630","a34662e593cdd1409a914264cdc14750eed2f8093ef3da6a95e20d6a5f23de2d","3ce55379c57eec31d0fa5c59192a91ee790a335308e764a57163c6fe324ef817","b1e28125f09c9e5f81c38ea3e89be8ef16fbb27f540d0136e92dc6695d51250b","bee19636c97a067c9df2cb56d29d0fcb98303ae61e7209100518b256b072b1ec","5bfa3099236cc12a8978e8ddc85e88c123ad89736667fa77b273df05c2f7adc6","6578324d499672e376304a2af2c85c827246e3800aee7a037777eb7defb1d048","f228c09252fc9cfa66bd45c11fc3926ce4165aa7d5