{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list with SlotFormatCombinations. Each SlotFormatCombination comprises of one or more SlotFormats (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 4.3.2). The total number of slotFormats in the slotFormatCombinations list does not exceed 512. ","paragraph_zero_based":28056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subcarrierSpacing2","paragraph_zero_based":28057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reference subcarrier spacing for a Slot Format Combination on an FDD or SUL cell (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.1.1). For FDD, subcarrierSpacing (SFI-scs) is the reference SCS for DL BWP and subcarrierSpacing2 (SFI-scs2) is the reference SCS for UL BWP. For SUL, subcarrierSpacing (SFI-scs) is the reference SCS for non-SUL carrier and subcarrierSpacing2 (SFI-scs2) is the reference SCS for SUL carrier. The network configures a value that is smaller than or equal to any SCS of configured BWPs of the serving cell that the command applies to. And the network configures a value that is smaller than or equal to the SCS of the serving cell which the UE monitors for SFI indications.","paragraph_zero_based":28058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subcarrierSpacing","paragraph_zero_based":28059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reference subcarrier spacing for this Slot Format Combination. The network configures a value that is smaller than or equal to any SCS of configured BWPs of the serving cell that the command applies to. And the network configures a value that is smaller than or equal to the SCS of the serving cell which the UE monitors for SFI indications (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.1.1).","paragraph_zero_based":28060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SlotFormatIndicator","paragraph_zero_based":28062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SlotFormatIndicator is used to configure monitoring a Group-Common-PDCCH for Slot-Format-Indicators (SFI).","paragraph_zero_based":28063},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SlotFormatIndicator information element","paragraph_zero_based":28064},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":28065},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SLOTFORMATINDICATOR-START","paragraph_zero_based":28066},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28067},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SlotFormatIndicator ::=     SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":28068},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sfi-RNTI                    RNTI-Value,","paragraph_zero_based":28069},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    dci-PayloadSize             INTEGER (1..maxSFI-DCI-PayloadSize),","paragraph_zero_based":28070},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    slotFormatCombToAddModList  SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofAggregatedCellsPerCellGroup)) OF SlotFormatCombinationsPerCell","paragraph_zero_based":28071},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                                                                                              OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":28072},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    slotFormatCombToReleaseList SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofAggregatedCellsPerCellGroup)) OF ServCellIndex                       OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":28073},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":28074},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":28075},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    availableRB-SetsToAddModList-r16  SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofAggregatedCellsPerCellGroup)) OF AvailableRB-SetsPerCell-r16   OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":28076},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    availableRB-SetsToReleaseList-r16 SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofAggregatedCellsPerCellGroup)) OF ServCellIndex                 OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":28077},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    switchTriggerToAddModList-r16     SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..4)) OF SearchSpaceSwitchTrigger-r16                                   OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":28078},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    switchTriggerToReleaseList-r16    SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..4)) OF ServCellIndex                                                  OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":28079}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["51b3d9876d8f3a78bec8e8ec48a51e86f2fd828bbf6002e02c7742fbd27dbc63","2eb172f4f575b9382dbfc91dcf1f1ad8c5a42e35901dcc70aa8fb369a81a6afb","a77c64ca367e20c9c437e7ba1646c34e5ec6fb2a47d8bb6568dae01e73a7af08","25dc6d8ef12ebf6a8997e1f5cd0f2d160a3a1b96f73b7fcaa60145ad042a14cc","bc439c09745b09e38e6b1afc9ee4f1480a4348174258733af997c11ec3b27372","6e1132a0539fb5cd2e15fc966abc2536afdb79c85141f5fe299ac58e029c9363","b293b0824f5a7b350dc41cb10df12d3bb2bb96447d623b455e171c8635deb56b","fa13724b31e3e1b5fe8e8d1627c0a81ab773ff73baf6f91061a4723a4e29de99","4279bc63962a62d10f7a5937c64a091e42e2b4478a04c9546207c6b665991969","cf462b9c1ab4fd37f9e4e104baba7b61ec0ac0452fa77d2b69207d3c902a2222","18272ebbe5e5c3612d084cdafe6bf816a2c18b0f58f6f2c88783801f304a645e","461a458ceb78b936214bd4b0e5c390ab1324aca5b18c6ebd57be558d9673f04b","6ebd9cf77bce9f0470f8ca68f5a4d40c04b462dbbbf114b6a16cf34d58c62abe","a48e7409cff5a476c36e189925837bb036dbf2676e961e815ea05449271d31a0","0f29ee083c315b203fbf3e2fa2be7bd760f425b603d226ad17113bc8978045ac","87394867701e96a16f4f8ac0fdefc83b915fd7a6bebcc38696519e5f088be9ac","ff8d695d8a31bfd5d886bc6ebdfd3870cccc48053723e136b705b04ebe3c0ad1","b04343645a2e19777c89cb0d1007667a4688e8fd44b16ff5dd8ca1088e655bfd","03cd1fd99679f50a2491d06