{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TimeAlignmentTimer information element","paragraph_zero_based":29496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":29497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-TIMEALIGNMENTTIMER-START","paragraph_zero_based":29498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TimeAlignmentTimer ::=              ENUMERATED {ms500, ms750, ms1280, ms1920, ms2560, ms5120, ms10240, infinity}","paragraph_zero_based":29500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-TIMEALIGNMENTTIMER-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":29502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":29503},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29504},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–TimeToTrigger","paragraph_zero_based":29505},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE TimeToTrigger specifies the value range used for time to trigger parameter, which concerns the time during which specific criteria for the event needs to be met in order to trigger a measurement report. Value ms0 corresponds to 0 ms and behaviour as specified in 7.1.2 applies, value ms40 corresponds to 40 ms, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":29506},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TimeToTrigger information element","paragraph_zero_based":29507},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":29508},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-TIMETOTRIGGER-START","paragraph_zero_based":29509},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29510},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TimeToTrigger ::=                   ENUMERATED {","paragraph_zero_based":29511},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                        ms0, ms40, ms64, ms80, ms100, ms128, ms160, ms256,","paragraph_zero_based":29512},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                        ms320, ms480, ms512, ms640, ms1024, ms1280, ms2560,","paragraph_zero_based":29513},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                        ms5120}","paragraph_zero_based":29514},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29515},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-TIMETOTRIGGER-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":29516},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":29517},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–UAC-BarringInfoSetIndex","paragraph_zero_based":29518},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE UAC-BarringInfoSetIndex provides the index of the entry in uac-BarringInfoSetList. Value 1 corresponds to the first entry in uac-BarringInfoSetList, value 2 corresponds to the second entry in this list and so on. An index value referring to an entry not included in uac-BarringInfoSetList indicates no barring.","paragraph_zero_based":29519}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["594489308213b96761a54e0b0b012dc7ef6434668dc740865a99a123e10fd75e","9bf657cc47f5802cbe1b8ebcf85322182e9f35861398b2014867b0a4589e142b","8c26340adc857a2ef33dd4e39181ce863aedd110f2ad76c4c52571f955d42374","a497acc807d4d82fcc5a24c2a0f738ea9a28cbd304f324fbef8ae44ea7cfa902","ca259eb87ed6658f71af7302543d6c5645ad4e1211701d0a341d3def733c0323","c884f860a6979b1d82ee59be5c1b122847e018239fdae2d2ad03be8e62f679d9","3e407a9aaa0d907a3b025295b9f93ff61b3ad54d985bcae1b91bdb1ae31abf2c","c03f9b9ec7d5fa27d338ca8788eb7e2ac880c494272ecbf1be7beea36638403e","bf700d5ae645d4150959b3759c3e35df8e79229013fba56736cb3c400ccbd47b","3ddc682efedd