{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"timeGranularityForCI","paragraph_zero_based":29784},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configures the number of partitions within the time region of this serving cell (servingCellId) (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.2A).","paragraph_zero_based":29785},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"uplinkCancellationPriority","paragraph_zero_based":29786},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configures uplink cancellation behavior if both UL CI and intra-UE priority indicator are configured for a given UE. If the field is present, then UL CI is only applicable to the UL transmissions indicated/configured as low priority level. If the field is absent, UL CI is applicable to UL transmission irrespective of its priority level (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.2A).","paragraph_zero_based":29787},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29788},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":29789},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":29790},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SUL-Only","paragraph_zero_based":29791},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present, Need R, if supplementaryUplink is configured in ServingCellConfig. It is absent otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":29792},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SymbolPeriodicity","paragraph_zero_based":29793},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is mandatory present if the configured UL CI monitoring periodicity indicated by monitoringSlotPeriodicityAndOffset for DCI format 2_4 is 1 slot with more than one monitoring occasion, otherwise absent.","paragraph_zero_based":29794},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29795},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–UplinkConfigCommon","paragraph_zero_based":29796},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE UplinkConfigCommon provides common uplink parameters of a cell.","paragraph_zero_based":29797},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UplinkConfigCommon information element","paragraph_zero_based":29798},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":29799},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-UPLINKCONFIGCOMMON-START","paragraph_zero_based":29800},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29801},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UplinkConfigCommon ::=              SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":29802},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    frequencyInfoUL                     FrequencyInfoUL                                 OPTIONAL,   -- Cond InterFreqHOAndServCellAdd","paragraph_zero_based":29803},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    initialUplinkBWP                    BWP-UplinkCommon                                OPTIONAL,   -- Cond ServCellAdd","paragraph_zero_based":29804},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    dummy                               TimeAlignmentTimer","paragraph_zero_based":29805},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":29806},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29807}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5a40a18be3115a2769789501599656fc4eb00e6ba4cb2138215642027701e223","4be035be1e91bc63fdfa503f482c0d75fb33bd9e7c645027956dea1c87c99bf6","55465f9ce904762707cce61468fbe12262ea89002ebcb1479f323c78f6e6d365","b2804caca33f2d4523fe491ad6bcab0da5383e171b81cdeca78673e80dcd024d","85982962d17357199d639a0cfe7a22996720b5c574e4b8abe4a797c9ad781845","4a3681635fcd11d7a9e0a98dbd4a19cbb046da2395cfa7b6521b419f7568da9e","0b1f5c72d061a8d791b0b6c85f507a4a4f6a384b45f1