{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE ZP-CSI-RS-Resource is used to configure a Zero-Power (ZP) CSI-RS resource (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.4.2). Reconfiguration of a ZP-CSI-RS-Resource between periodic or semi-persistent and aperiodic is not supported.","paragraph_zero_based":30096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ZP-CSI-RS-Resource information element","paragraph_zero_based":30097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":30098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-ZP-CSI-RS-RESOURCE-START","paragraph_zero_based":30099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ZP-CSI-RS-Resource ::=              SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":30101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    zp-CSI-RS-ResourceId                ZP-CSI-RS-ResourceId,","paragraph_zero_based":30102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    resourceMapping                     CSI-RS-ResourceMapping,","paragraph_zero_based":30103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    periodicityAndOffset                CSI-ResourcePeriodicityAndOffset                OPTIONAL, --Cond PeriodicOrSemiPersistent","paragraph_zero_based":30104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":30105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":30106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ZP-CSI-RS-ResourceId ::=            INTEGER (0..maxNrofZP-CSI-RS-Resources-1)","paragraph_zero_based":30108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-ZP-CSI-RS-RESOURCE-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":30110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":30111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ZP-CSI-RS-Resource field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":30113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"periodicityAndOffset","paragraph_zero_based":30114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Periodicity and slot offset for periodic/semi-persistent ZP-CSI-RS (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.4.2). Network always configures the UE with a value for this field for periodic and semi-persistent ZP-CSI-RS resource (as indicated in PDSCH-Config).","paragraph_zero_based":30115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"resourceMapping","paragraph_zero_based":30116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"OFDM symbol and subcarrier occupancy of the ZP-CSI-RS resource within a slot.","paragraph_zero_based":30117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"zp-CSI-RS-ResourceId","paragraph_zero_based":30118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ZP CSI-RS resource configuration ID (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.4.2).","paragraph_zero_based":30119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1634862804dd2851f9b20ac2725ebf34430257d647e8a765930303bfb8bc8f00","73deb675c93934e4174cad3e936b9b98fafad764015aebe19fbdc0767d212aea","e55101dabadb4569f10a772c12e82e32baf5509b935f0eee128a6912e6fc0ab4","976401196809a7815c125e070e99f47dbac5dff4d483e4d7697eb2c00b801f79","480a84921b5670745a13b1e33efe94c9be13e5c81f15e675f77f2c7c3f42545f","6722da76f4e7ff4fc8ca1ccfe49daf8b0d4cbace818f8b414e17ec8a6922e26b","35f5e88330974df1179ed6cbf9f3ba69ed52722e9d8343b1a19a53f18321b3e0","55b09112667c2e62766c35aa9a1bd71a184ff079c78fddb511b80d15bd476abe","dda9cfba0639b5f4acd6304cfe09e42a913159b6e05ba0e6edae5665330b10e8","c96cdd827673cd8179ef5e59ff07e3bbfa4ec9c70c91a45441dfa019e85e2fbc","481512f09516be9b04c1d1