{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates, for a particular pair of E-UTRA bands, the RF retuning time when switching between an E-UTRA carrier corresponding to this band entry and another (PUSCH-less) E-UTRA carrier corresponding to the band entry in the order indicated below:","paragraph_zero_based":30552},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-For the first E-UTRA band, the UE shall include the same number of entries for E-UTRA bands as in bandList, i.e. first entry corresponds to first E-UTRA band in bandList and so on,","paragraph_zero_based":30553},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-For the second E-UTRA band, the UE shall include one entry less, i.e. first entry corresponds to the second E-UTRA band in bandList and so on","paragraph_zero_based":30554},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":" -And so on","paragraph_zero_based":30555},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"srs-TxSwitch","paragraph_zero_based":30556},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates supported SRS antenna switch capability for the associated band. If the UE indicates support of SRS-SwitchingTimeNR, the UE is allowed to set this field for a band with associated FeatureSetUplinkId set to 0 for SRS carrier switching.","paragraph_zero_based":30557},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"uplinkTxSwitchingBandParametersList-v1700","paragraph_zero_based":30558},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates a list of per band per band combination capabilities for UL Tx switching.","paragraph_zero_based":30559},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30560},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–BandCombinationListSidelinkEUTRA-NR","paragraph_zero_based":30561},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE BandCombinationListSidelinkEUTRA-NR contains a list of V2X sidelink and NR sidelink band combinations.","paragraph_zero_based":30562},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BandCombinationListSidelinkEUTRA-NR information element","paragraph_zero_based":30563},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":30564},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-BANDCOMBINATIONLISTSIDELINKEUTRANR-START","paragraph_zero_based":30565},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30566},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BandCombinationListSidelinkEUTRA-NR-r16 ::= SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxBandComb)) OF BandCombinationParametersSidelinkEUTRA-NR-r16","paragraph_zero_based":30567},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30568},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BandCombinationListSidelinkEUTRA-NR-v1630 ::= SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxBandComb)) OF BandCombinationParametersSidelinkEUTRA-NR-v1630","paragraph_zero_based":30569},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30570},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BandCombinationListSidelinkEUTRA-NR-v1710 ::= SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxBandComb)) OF BandCombinationParametersSidelinkEUTRA-NR-v1710","paragraph_zero_based":30571},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30572},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BandCombinationParametersSidelinkEUTRA-NR-r16 ::= SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxSimultaneousBands)) OF BandParametersSidelinkEUTRA-NR-r16","paragraph_zero_based":30573},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30574},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BandCombinationParametersSidelinkEUTRA-NR-v1630 ::= SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxSimultaneousBands)) OF BandParametersSidelinkEUTRA-NR-v1630","paragraph_zero_based":30575}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1290c7adaf5b50c5411a987c20b3e2909eed8658296aea23e57