9}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9ef191a8f4a1584f5c641e30f2ebb64246cc758d0254bbe3fab7ecf4384f00a4","04a5d5886531a371e2808f0a6cede02a7f33b1f54c4bcecf67d42ccb43b758e5","8350d5911538f0845088d75909cfbae7e995c86aab4d8019076e011d01312073","4a4487de3313b48c068530cb5ea780923d6cda5e5796c3a49328a316db11ecce","5cbe1e71dcb727597116c3fc900ea8d2729d117d0bb08210eae0ab686d7fc7c3","18a590ea80a7fcc17c91dcc547bbb5fed6457213c65acc3bb668780f081ba2f3","174f71dcaf1946483a31c9ff1e57d122b861991cad0db2f93675c7c69bca5219","7e9909f45ff66c9f8a0f684c0cc6bea753efcf4e1940c0e191015f345cd82016","16f3cb0528606e3beb18f43a1136c6557ff4cca549c6f44cfafc33ce1dc54724","460bcc1a0233b094b2ad2a2ccf343fc271bda3cc0d7751a7076a5bf694273f89","bd6272b2ab0c1e1ec53c0a99063ceb223e6694ab961b764bd5300bf848fd88b1","803ae2155dd02b26a2f514706171f0d7b0cfdd07a72be8ab7d84ee17211fe111","35abb3b6e41791dab22257de9f0e2de496cf42b14e862b535ba27101edde7771","c1b27b46433d765c9b3a0f5ffd0c56c7b6f6b12980cc80578a3075c0c5e70ab8","e2da8c3d976b45e7af92967906c5cc352d1e489d0b4afe0c0552ee9c06c833e3","757490b15be7f001a7553dcc46bb9ce36d3ed574fd13411a662393a77b0353aa","d4695acd34569631bdbb60ff3a043b4062ddfaf242d7e32e67bdff252df71f08","b3dd01d4a74908c2a7cea1fea0a46eae5c0cb8f220640f775dba5621cc6a042e","3b6905f41115336ffb70294ce53dea8e0f227e398fcc8edb9ae51333738d19ba","1e2149d7c2f6883c779b5f400951a1cea3a4b08498a3a4bdcbc196fa5d36adf5","079a5cbf7d064e48604a8ad2b6d1ffc96933d0d8cbc717f2d56b86b19a4d1a2e","95edc34d03344c93cd86b074c6c0c2c93409f226e7260fcce4ca3452fcda4edb","84664dbf176abdff5656466a7afff60bcd7266324c653d833ab8eeb59564e3af","a5747660690d537c67766e4d93ba205f3db78376c4c6d3f6844cc3bfe48c5a23"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[31656,31679],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p31656"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":31680},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SupportedCSI-RS-Resource ::=     SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":31681},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    maxNumberTxPortsPerResource      ENUMERATED {p2, p4, p8, p12, p16, p24, p32},","paragraph_zero_based":31682},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    maxNumberResourcesPerBand        INTEGER (1..64),","paragraph_zero_based":31683},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    totalNumberTxPortsPerBand        INTEGER (2..256)","paragraph_zero_based":31684},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":31685},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":31686},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CODEBOOKPARAMETERS-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":31687},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":31688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":31689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CodebookParameters field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":31690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"supportedCSI-RS-ResourceListAlt","paragraph_zero_based":31691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the alternative list of SupportedCSI-RS-Resource supported for each codebook type. The supported CSI-RS resource is indicated by an integer value which pinpoints SupportedCSI-RS-Resource defined in CodebookVariantsList. The value 0 corresponds to the first entry of CodebookVariantsList. The value 1 corresponds to the second entry of CodebookVariantsList, and so on. For each codebook type, the field shall be included in both codebookParametersPerBC (but optional for single CC) and codebookParametersPerBand.","paragraph_zero_based":31692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":31693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–FeatureSetCombination","paragraph_zero_based":31694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE FeatureSetCombination is a two-dimensional matrix of FeatureSet entries.","paragraph_zero_based":31695},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Each FeatureSetsPerBand contains a list of feature sets applicable to the carrier(s) of one band entry of the associated band combination. Across the associated bands, the UE shall support the combination of FeatureSets at the same position in the FeatureSetsPerBand. All FeatureSetsPerBand in one FeatureSetCombination must have the same number of entries.","paragraph_zero_based":31696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The number of FeatureSetsPerBand in the FeatureSetCombination must be equal to the number of band entries in an associated band combination. The first FeatureSetPerBand applies to the first band entry of the band combination, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":31697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Each FeatureSet contains either a pair of NR or E-UTRA feature set IDs for UL and DL.","paragraph_zero_based":31698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In case of NR, the actual feature sets for UL and DL are defined in the FeatureSets IE and referred to from here by their ID, i.e., their position in the featureSetsUplink / featureSetsDownlink list in the FeatureSet IE.","paragraph_zero_based":31699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In case of E-UTRA, the feature sets referred to from this list are defined in TS 36.331 [10] and conveyed as part of the UE-EUTRA-Capability container.","paragraph_zero_based":31700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The FeatureSetUplink and FeatureSetDownlink referred to from the FeatureSet comprise, among other information, a set of FeatureSetUplinkPerCC-Ids and FeatureSetDownlinkPerCC-Ids. The number of these per-CC IDs determines the number of carriers that the UE is able to aggregate contiguously in frequency domain in the corresponding band. The number of carriers supported by the UE is also restricted by the bandwidth class indicated in the associated BandCombination, if present.","paragraph_zero_based":31701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In feature set combinations the UE shall exclude entries with same or lower capabilities, since the network may anyway assume that the UE supports those.","paragraph_zero_based":31702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The UE may advertise fallback band-combinations in which it supports additional functionality explicitly in two ways: Either by setting FeatureSet IDs to zero (inter-band and intra-band non-contiguous fallback) and by reducing the number of FeatureSet-PerCC Ids in a Feature Set (intra-band contiguous fallback). Or by separate BandCombination entries with associated FeatureSetCombinations.","paragraph_zero_based":31703}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a57c685c2364a9f5acf91466f9b9aa4944630a69df78fb3e7ad047352d382760","43f498a609c5f30b49a181b5ae2eba680e3584f8fdc5f5bde14d5db0fef9e44d","92fe4be9e7df30ca716149caf646dfbd3b1cac1451e99ff7144b76202ca16336","c98467f0599854091b039330faa42c728352ca81723be8e019dba7f7cc67bb44","9782f96beec71b74ad58a4e7ab762d22a00481123e48a88607e9e4c8dedf7b70","4a079d10465e5316fe0404b35a3382e7baeb720cfdfb072e51b9c29964730a84","79c22632bf77836a47f3f3d35fb93913f621c530b0770d6756db40b952605833","c7d2c74d027ba0f1627d42409a0b7934c34f7da21532443114e449b818256036","af4e255e5e51b67455c7de0fc79d8a028d989a1d9c46c1664dfb2c6add278366","3af8362a024a3d745627fc245e0235cd2dea92807378be588797e75bbffa4c11","da13f0387d5babc940d8d730fc26b831d4016e4ab0072846da4bcc870f421417","77680335af6cb3bd4ca4cd33f1a9629347758fe263c3befd6607762b9698553d","dec4fdd5f830fa937fe18ca643e55eba90fcbaa07310967ac0cc3e2148a37497","61b0bae546c3234563c7c19097cfa7c82c34fd9ea2aaed71d449920c94a0937d","52cb27d479e4e147699ca3b388c8e62465d1055ca13cf9b92bc0878de0632e44","54d0771ba39a1bc678f024cf20d51f77bbbcf801faa41196f9fb15e6139b993d","9b12d01f47b864f6f48ac1e335edbb11b0c1121b18b5f7a0fd8eea1fd9de0335","3c0901ab2b6e7a38919806c6e6e49a0e15b43d4921f87151b6a4404bbe33e1fb","a01cd5f8fb4ee146f1504905cb32dcea87fd54a8476ecdbbdd195e12398f0fcc","a852f2072b3b11f4b274fb9cb4053a7de6a5d81666f640ae132dcfa3d43a7b73","93d4dfee11e92b36e796418e39a63d9701fd5f90b208bdab6af107f30ad071da","0c1ac9af5b8b0ce769a4dd035ecfe5e2c0cc3df1cde652f41344a1f43ee341ea","7418c40d02dcf25ecffe4ab85662edda031c35351878c5e44c8564a45d38429b","f8616872cf8e5a6d8d2118961ac64ee241e6df2dff05d04b5f9eecba97982946"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[31680,31703],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p31680"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:The UE may advertise a FeatureSetCombination containing only fallback band combinations. That means, in a FeatureSetCombination, each group of FeatureSets across the bands may contain at least one pair of FeatureSetUplinkId and FeatureSetDownlinkId which is set to 0/0.","paragraph_zero_based":31704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:The Network configures serving cell(s) and BWP(s) configuration to comply with capabilities derived from the combination of FeatureSets at the same position in the FeatureSetsPerBand, regardless of activated/deactivated serving cell(s) and BWP(s).","paragraph_zero_based":31705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FeatureSetCombination information element","paragraph_zero_based":31706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":31707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FEATURESETCOMBINATION-START","paragraph_zero_based":31708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":31709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FeatureSetCombination ::=       SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxSimultaneousBands)) OF FeatureSetsPerBand","paragraph_zero_based":31710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":31711},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FeatureSetsPerBand ::=          SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxFeatureSetsPerBand)) OF FeatureSet","paragraph_zero_based":31712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":31713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FeatureSet ::=                  CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":31714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    eutra                           SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":31715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        downlinkSetEUTRA                FeatureSetEUTRA-DownlinkId,","paragraph_zero_based":31716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        uplinkSetEUTRA                  FeatureSetEUTRA-UplinkId","paragraph_zero_based":31717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    },","paragraph_zero_based":31718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nr                              SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":31719},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        downlinkSetNR                   FeatureSetDownlinkId,","paragraph_zero_based":31720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        uplinkSetNR                     FeatureSetUplinkId","paragraph_zero_based":31721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    }","paragraph_zero_based":31722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":31723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":31724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FEATURESETCOMBINATION-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":31725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":31726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":31727}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a5cb1279ca917aa0580aa5212b73960b0a3a8482abf70d3702f9eccb09caa849","7b2873e7f95ed30b494208df8ec8e7fb16e0e947b7eb11a0adfa9b67fb3220b4","302169924a101e843fe1979bfd5f9cb6fcba1357c28427db2ec53350d04e428b","0abb6da695277be9deda8efddff121473e3d1acd77a9bbee9eb788b33c832813","dbba433bdcaf75aeb3e964c6aad185ef2b80f7ad84772c97fb4e839ce628790f","c4c216d4d655e368a5fd0dfad9c83be7f67d88f5912dac5a149932d80c1738dd","7da065e9dbaf9693cc07ffbdad378e9bd45cc856b25a1eed891519cfd9355bae","dab9f61bbc4e877c9891282f6731f52c56a400eed46d1ac352bcf7701e39259f","b3ea5743670e1d2cd059c366497d45fa3fa89d59458462b3b67f500517dbf68c","bf150a315432d76085ad0ed3f74f6dc10206beedcd879882da2f453a1757a3a1","4792917