{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–FeatureSetUplinkPerCC-Id","paragraph_zero_based":32497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE FeatureSetUplinkPerCC-Id identifies a set of features applicable to one carrier of a feature set. The FeatureSetUplinkPerCC-Id of a FeatureSetUplinkPerCC is the index position of the FeatureSetUplinkPerCC in the featureSetsUplinkPerCC. The first element in the list is referred to by FeatureSetUplinkPerCC-Id = 1, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":32498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FeatureSetUplinkPerCC-Id information element","paragraph_zero_based":32499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":32500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FEATURESETUPLINKPERCC-ID-START","paragraph_zero_based":32501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FeatureSetUplinkPerCC-Id ::=            INTEGER (1..maxPerCC-FeatureSets)","paragraph_zero_based":32503},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32504},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FEATURESETUPLINKPERCC-ID-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32505},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32506},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32507},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–FreqBandIndicatorEUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":32508},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":32509},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FREQBANDINDICATOREUTRA-START","paragraph_zero_based":32510},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32511},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FreqBandIndicatorEUTRA ::=  INTEGER (1..maxBandsEUTRA)","paragraph_zero_based":32512},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32513},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FREQBANDINDICATOREUTRA-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32514},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32515},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32516},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–FreqBandList","paragraph_zero_based":32517},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE FreqBandList is used by the network to request NR CA, NR non-CA and/or MR-DC band combinations for specific NR and/or E-UTRA frequency bands and/or up to a specific number of carriers and/or up to specific aggregated bandwidth. This is also used to request feature sets (for NR) and feature set combinations (for NR and MR-DC). For NR sidelink communication, this is used by the initiating UE to request sidelink UE radio access capabilities from the peer UE.","paragraph_zero_based":32518},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FreqBandList information element","paragraph_zero_based":32519}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["317a330091f86beb3c7e6bf0f5cc25c96a422b2241e5008cf24c425f23cd85e1","db8b58dc034e90edd9007280a9a30d988abb4ee52433c13195b0d019e8f012b6","0923619d9f5abc3d174002b696d3252ce04c588a449cc9de899c74f12f0f106c","9a5a870de1f6939ea1117fb1a4ceb7fee33fa7efec92c72260b7c159160c3ba5","e9f46ccccdcd0b49a7232c229d311ee76b97863845cd034cf262d73a0deb8d3c","7ea3dc2e72b25cac38549cc306e8133cb78d46db33706a2d83cfc7d90c61ab35","d0c66ee6e57f59ba5c423259d53e57a0e155fbbcbbdee1005a2756721e379965","74e97eead283155c139084297b073172db0f9e56b5ecf64d53c1012ffe1ad8cf","168f3416397db340646fb6c9aae75a7267a97c69fb5ec28390e618eea732c8e1","6c10cc13afb733bdefd1b592de5818d4e1a21555ac5c8fd790efbf3413e5fc4