the capability enquiry, if any. The UE filtered the band combinations in the supportedBandCombinationList in accordance with this appliedFreqBandListFilter.","paragraph_zero_based":35177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"supportedBandCombinationList","paragraph_zero_based":35178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list of band combinations that the UE supports for (NG)EN-DC, or both (NG)EN-DC and NE-DC. The FeatureSetCombinationId:s in this list refer to the FeatureSetCombination entries in the featureSetCombinations list in the UE-MRDC-Capability IE.","paragraph_zero_based":35179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"supportedBandCombinationListNEDC-Only, supportedBandCombinationListNEDC-Only-v1610","paragraph_zero_based":35180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list of band combinations that the UE supports only for NE-DC. The FeatureSetCombinationId:s in this list refer to the FeatureSetCombination entries in the featureSetCombinations list in the UE-MRDC-Capability IE.","paragraph_zero_based":35181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"supportedBandCombinationList-UplinkTxSwitch","paragraph_zero_based":35182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list of band combinations that the UE supports dynamic UL Tx switching for (NG)EN-DC. The FeatureSetCombinationId:s in this list refer to the FeatureSetCombination entries in the featureSetCombinations list in the UE-MRDC-Capability IE.","paragraph_zero_based":35183}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c6beb9103955473f1038fbfc0fc804196518415c2c2217d927c1274fbf4be173","b321da61a2d46744ddd893c61b36135d9f3f1f80fc5d9d96183a3b22a86304d5","970896020fbd317599d13dbcc598267f5fd780a5aee549a3643678ce4ec1a3e4","aab7fe1efa79a1e3fb