{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subframeAllocation2","paragraph_zero_based":36384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Field as defined in MBSFN-SubframeConfig-v1430 in TS 36.331 [10], where the UE assumes the duplex mode (FDD or TDD) of the NR cell for which the E-UTRA-MBSFN-SubframeConfig is provided.","paragraph_zero_based":36385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–EUTRA-MultiBandInfoList","paragraph_zero_based":36387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE EUTRA-MultiBandInfoList indicates the list of frequency bands in addition to the band represented by CarrierFreq for which cell reselection parameters are common, and a list of additionalPmax and additionalSpectrumEmission.","paragraph_zero_based":36388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"EUTRA-MultiBandInfoList information element","paragraph_zero_based":36389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":36390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-EUTRA-MULTIBANDINFOLIST-START","paragraph_zero_based":36391},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"EUTRA-MultiBandInfoList ::=     SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxMultiBands)) OF EUTRA-MultiBandInfo","paragraph_zero_based":36393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"EUTRA-MultiBandInfo ::=         SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":36395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    eutra-FreqBandIndicator         FreqBandIndicatorEUTRA,","paragraph_zero_based":36396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    eutra-NS-PmaxList               EUTRA-NS-PmaxList                           OPTIONAL    -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":36397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":36398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36399},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-EUTRA-MULTIBANDINFOLIST-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":36400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":36401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–EUTRA-NS-PmaxList","paragraph_zero_based":36403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE EUTRA-NS-PmaxList concerns a list of additionalPmax and additionalSpectrumEmission, as defined in TS 36.101 [22], table 6.2.4-1 for UEs neither in CE nor BL UEs and TS 36.101 [22], table 6.2.4E-1 for UEs in CE or BL UEs, for a given frequency band.","paragraph_zero_based":36404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"EUTRA-NS-PmaxList information element","paragraph_zero_based":36405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":36406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-EUTRA-NS-PMAXLIST-START","paragraph_zero_based":36407}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ccdd0daefcf40b2fa7b5dc6b45021a22e8894b1fcabe296b3144c904cfb9164f","3b8b8ad82426c63db2293082ab7b33ae700ce8c0220e910bbb0a8ba91c811e24","7d355b884fb0347f70bd04c629207d9fb34efcf6255bb06d0250794fa8a0d198","558e6e351dae4dc953d8b60655febf399c41911122c7dae829013429863445b9","e11301e95c31cbbea597d273d8a9506e82c8766a4ec25652a91e39cb9964f1cf","085ac87295a8a057d0002240745a260c6b54931af3baf0183e73278e6ea59c38","0ee4aef0dfaa1493cfa72ff9e4d264824ef32ff30107e20ce5b706de90fa5a0a","e29bedc3041381337f118c527ab2e5cf9bd520e05a16da0b9608477847924112","c3a52081db1b07986e2ec1723a6b5c19fc9828ccf27273897d21be215d526af6","1cbb13250b1f0e87569e4b53e5e3d1e51c446a63b0a8bea3677c8874ae10e719","5933ba