{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates one or multiple sidelink RLC bearer configurations to remove.","paragraph_zero_based":37392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-RLC-ChannelToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":37393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates one or multiple PC5 Relay RLC Channel configurations to add and/or modify. Each PC5 Relay RLC channel configuration provided by network to L2 U2N Relay UE is uniquely associated with one L2 U2N Remote UE.","paragraph_zero_based":37394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-RLC-ChannelToReleaseList","paragraph_zero_based":37395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates one or multiple PC5 Relay RLC Channel configurations to remove.","paragraph_zero_based":37396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-ScheduledConfig","paragraph_zero_based":37397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the configuration for UE to transmit NR sidelink communication based on network scheduling. This field is not configured simultaneously with sl-UE-SelectedConfig. This field is not configured to a L2 U2N Remote UE.","paragraph_zero_based":37398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-UE-SelectedConfig","paragraph_zero_based":37399},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the configuration used for UE autonomous resource selection. This field is not configured simultaneously with sl-ScheduledConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":37400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-CSI-Acquisition","paragraph_zero_based":37401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether CSI reporting is enabled in sidelink unicast. If the field is absent, sidelink CSI reporting is disabled.","paragraph_zero_based":37402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-CSI-SchedulingRequestId","paragraph_zero_based":37403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If present, it indicates the scheduling request configuration applicable for Sidelink CSI Reporting MAC CE and Sidelink DRX Command MAC CE, as specified in TS 38.321 [3].","paragraph_zero_based":37404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SSB-PriorityNR","paragraph_zero_based":37405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the priority of NR sidelink SSB transmission and reception.","paragraph_zero_based":37406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37407},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":37408},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":37409},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"L2RelayUE","paragraph_zero_based":37410},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For L2 U2N Relay UE, the field is optionally present, Need M. Otherwise, it is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":37411},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"L2RemoteUE","paragraph_zero_based":37412},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For L2 U2N Remote UE, the field is optionally present, Need M. Otherwise, it is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":37413},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"L2U2N","paragraph_zero_based":37414},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optional present for L2 U2N Relay UE and L2 U2N Remote UE, need N. Otherwise, it is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":37415}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fc42ec8b11c66d3ab8770b26c86dc93cc1b063a91a752a0c889c6d7d1ef3e838","e6234d7889aa5ec16ccb421ba8c4bb45c264c835a13161541ac0e5bb1fd0e9c7","0fd1533d5d6ab928c6274e620027f2a6bc69a5b28067f9c268996e8d46718335","d4fc2a3a795e88b656f6f94c5a20e05452dd4241a9976a93f0507d7262ad35b8","574bba888f754731eac9c0b8dbfabcdc2d18