{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37656},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37657},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-DRX-ConfigUC field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":37658},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-drx-CycleStartOffset","paragraph_zero_based":37659},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sidelink drx-Cycle in ms and sidelink drx-StartOffset in multiples of 1 ms.","paragraph_zero_based":37660},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-drx-HARQ-RTT-Timer1, sl-drx-HARQ-RTT-Timer2","paragraph_zero_based":37661},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in number of slot lengths of the BWP where the transport block was received. Value sl0 corresponds to 0 slots, sl1 corresponds to 1 slot, sl2 corresponds to 2 slots, and so on. sl-drx-HARQ-RTT-Timer1 is used for HARQ feedback enabled sidelink retransmission if SCI does not indicate retransmission resource(s). sl-drx-HARQ-RTT-Timer2 is used for HARQ feedback disabled sidelink retransmission in resource pool configured with PSFCH if SCI does not indicate retransmission resource(s).","paragraph_zero_based":37662},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-drx-InactivityTimer","paragraph_zero_based":37663},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in number of slot lengths of the BWP where the transport block was received, sl0 corresponds to 0, sl1 corresponds to 1 slot, sl2 corresponds to 2 slots, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":37664},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-drx-onDurationTimer","paragraph_zero_based":37665},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiples of 1/32 ms (subMilliSeconds) or in ms (milliSecond). For the latter, value ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, value ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":37666},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-drx-RetransmissionTimer","paragraph_zero_based":37667},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in number of slot lengths of the BWP where the transport block was received. Value sl0 corresponds to 0 slots, sl1 corresponds to 1 slot, sl2 corresponds to 2 slots, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":37668},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-drx-SlotOffset","paragraph_zero_based":37669},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in 1/32 ms. Value 0 corresponds to 0 ms, value 1 corresponds to 1/32 ms, value 2 corresponds to 2/32 ms, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":37670},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37671},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-DRX-ConfigUC-SemiStatic","paragraph_zero_based":37672},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-DRX-ConfigUC-SemiStatic is used to indicate the semi-static sidelink DRX related parameters for unicast communication.","paragraph_zero_based":37673},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-DRX-ConfigUC-SemiStatic information element","paragraph_zero_based":37674},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":37675},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-DRX-CONFIGUCSEMISTATIC-START","paragraph_zero_based":37676},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37677},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-DRX-ConfigUC-SemiStatic-r17 ::=          SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":37678},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-drx-onDurationTimer-r17                  CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":37679}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["38fa0cfeda34aa6f04a45aa84b0b4fd2473e5c9439605efccae4c02c7d5f29a4","4403b18ee48d3518061eb6f0dd3aa600915cb056e8ec387023a9958f908316d9","1e71329c55099e91e899abcc4155e39dba6