{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A set of UE specific channel bandwidth and location configurations for different subcarrier spacings (numerologies). Defined in relation to Point A. The UE uses the configuration provided in this field only for the purpose of channel bandwidth and location determination. In this release, only one SCS-SpecificCarrier is allowed to be configured for NR sidelink communication.","paragraph_zero_based":37752},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SyncPriority","paragraph_zero_based":37753},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates synchronization priority order, as specified in clause 5.8.6.","paragraph_zero_based":37754},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"valueN","paragraph_zero_based":37755},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the NR SL transmission with a valueN *5kHz shift to the LTE raster. (see TS 38.101-1 [15], clause 5.4E.2).","paragraph_zero_based":37756},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37757},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":37758},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":37759},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"V2X-SL-Shared","paragraph_zero_based":37760},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is mandatory present if the carrier frequency configured for NR sidelink communication is shared by V2X sidelink communication. It is absent, Need R, otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":37761},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37762},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-FreqConfigCommon","paragraph_zero_based":37763},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-FreqConfigCommon specifies the cell-specific configuration information on one particular carrier frequency for NR sidelink communication.","paragraph_zero_based":37764},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-FreqConfigCommon information element","paragraph_zero_based":37765},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":37766},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-FREQCONFIGCOMMON-START","paragraph_zero_based":37767},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37768},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-FreqConfigCommon-r16 ::=      SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":37769},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-SCS-SpecificCarrierList-r16   SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxSCSs)) OF SCS-SpecificCarrier,","paragraph_zero_based":37770},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-AbsoluteFrequencyPointA-r16   ARFCN-ValueNR,","paragraph_zero_based":37771},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-AbsoluteFrequencySSB-r16      ARFCN-ValueNR                                                       OPTIONAL, -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":37772},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    frequencyShift7p5khzSL-r16       ENUMERATED {true}                                                   OPTIONAL, -- Cond V2X-SL-Shared","paragraph_zero_based":37773},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    valueN-r16                       INTEGER (-1..1),","paragraph_zero_based":37774},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-BWP-List-r16                  SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofSL-BWPs-r16)) OF SL-BWP-ConfigCommon-r16  OPTIONAL, -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":37775}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d65b266466212b447d18e4699623808c8ad26aefc8063f030f7c42060f03ea28","d9a10bfb39a395d7a5ccce2c3c2334f1b478749ec33d32cab4a6ad360a75e8c7","68195f4f10385fea39d5c4e21e6a8e20fbe6e963efaae8f26a3840dd4ac25910","4f07b6b08253f5337522286d80da3644881