{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-DiscardTimer","paragraph_zero_based":38232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in ms of discardTimer specified in TS 38.323 [5]. Value ms50 corresponds to 50 ms, value ms100 corresponds to 100 ms and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":38233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-OutOfOrderDelivery","paragraph_zero_based":38234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether or not outOfOrderDelivery specified in TS 38.323 [5] is configured. This field should be either always present or always absent, after the radio bearer is established.","paragraph_zero_based":38235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PDCP-SN-Size","paragraph_zero_based":38236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PDCP sequence number size for unicast NR sidelink communication, 12 or 18 bits, as specified in TS 38.323 [5]. For groupcast and broadcast NR sidelink communication, only 12 bits is applicable, as specified in 9.1.1.5.","paragraph_zero_based":38237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":38239},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":38240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Setup","paragraph_zero_based":38241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present in case of sidelink DRB setup via dedicated signaling and in case of sidelink DRB configuration via system information and pre-configuration; otherwise the field is optionally present, need M.","paragraph_zero_based":38242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Setup2","paragraph_zero_based":38243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present in case of sidelink DRB setup via dedicated signaling and in case of sidelink DRB configuration via system information and pre-configuration for RLC-AM and RLC-UM for unicast NR sidelink communication; otherwise the field is not present, Need M.","paragraph_zero_based":38244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-PSBCH-Config","paragraph_zero_based":38246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-PSBCH-Config indicates PSBCH transmission parameters on each sidelink bandwidth part.","paragraph_zero_based":38247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-PSBCH-Config information element","paragraph_zero_based":38248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":38249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-PSBCH-CONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":38250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-PSBCH-Config-r16 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":38252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    dl-P0-PSBCH-r16         INTEGER (-16..15)                                                                   OPTIONAL,    -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":38253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    dl-Alpha-PSBCH-r16      ENUMERATED {alpha0, alpha04, alpha05, alpha06, alpha07, alpha08, alpha09, alpha1}   OPTIONAL,    -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":38254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":38255}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["eaafc67f97726b9bbaa163be4f690afbb4ca875964b5624c87057bc3504a28e8","068518e221018b550e7725be3d426840eeb3e9ef9c1f4ee0fba2a0dff1752637","5ee22aef72b7c3843c103a91ff252d3c6233d6b9eb6a5cf242d3d0bd7837606f","6f213b806b243537176bdbdeeb3043ba353abe02d9cacddbd69019098660f201","3656fc1efa0e9663b742359