{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":38256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    dl-P0-PSBCH-r17         INTEGER (-202..24)                                                                  OPTIONAL     -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":38257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]]","paragraph_zero_based":38258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":38259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-PSBCH-CONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":38261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":38262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38263},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-PSBCH-Config field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":38264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dl-Alpha-PSBCH","paragraph_zero_based":38265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates alpha value for DL pathloss based power control for PSBCH. When the field is not configured the UE applies the value 1.","paragraph_zero_based":38266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dl-P0-PSBCH","paragraph_zero_based":38267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates P0 value for DL pathloss based power control for PSBCH. If not configured, DL pathloss based power control is disabled for PSBCH. When dl-P0-PSBCH-r17 is configured, the UE ignores dl-P0-PSBCH-r16.","paragraph_zero_based":38268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A Remote UE which is out of coverage, considers downlink pathloss based power control is disabled for PSBCH when dl-P0-PSBCH is configured.","paragraph_zero_based":38269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-PSSCH-TxConfigList","paragraph_zero_based":38271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-PSSCH-TxConfigList indicates PSSCH transmission parameters. When lower layers select parameters from the range indicated in IE SL-PSSCH-TxConfigList, the UE considers both configurations in IE SL-PSSCH-TxConfigList and the CBR-dependent configurations represented in IE SL-CBR-PriorityTxConfigList. Only one IE SL-PSSCH-TxConfig is provided per SL-TypeTxSync.","paragraph_zero_based":38272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-PSSCH-TxConfigList information element","paragraph_zero_based":38273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":38274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-PSSCH-TXCONFIGLIST-START","paragraph_zero_based":38275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-PSSCH-TxConfigList-r16 ::=    SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxPSSCH-TxConfig-r16)) OF SL-PSSCH-TxConfig-r16","paragraph_zero_based":38277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-PSSCH-TxConfig-r16 ::=        SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":38279}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ec04ecf16f66b546030af7cbd4402d69726b8938bba0bff40a3285e3d1c3640d","e658e12b622066fb3bb854f04a2888cf00dbeca80fef038c924ced1ec81fe567","7fb14f1dbe5736a38e09f67cae625e8829a0a6b58fb981f098f295098b6e2573","5960572f1101730e454bdd16c7e4e2238b9f2ac3388b4957d7ae38284c1009b4","52e4d93f2c5d451c834cf3e396d7c406ac2a607f3f5814e6f715b84aad8e37ad","8fb9a93170d32aacf82836a2f5b16d46acadcc5a0cfdfb30b4fd059cea6d77b6","909eef26965cf6b5782579bd503f25b292ba23b9db3beb7eb9d370b439a91c27","a86828590553ccfa171f754790e6b16cd8f45cad51b84f86cc7424e318081048","e9da7531d38f47ae64839ebc18ab304798324ec