value of maxRetxThreshold for RLC AM for NR sidelink communications, see TS 38.322 [4]. Value t1 corresponds to 1 retransmission, value t2 corresponds to 2 retransmissions and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":39018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PollByte","paragraph_zero_based":39019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter value of pollByte for RLC AM for NR sidelink communications, see TS 38.322 [4]. Value kB25 corresponds to 25 kBytes, value kB50 corresponds to 50 kBytes and so on. infinity corresponds to an infinite amount of kBytes.","paragraph_zero_based":39020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PollPDU","paragraph_zero_based":39021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter value of pollPDU for RLC AM for NR sidelink communications, seeTS 38.322 [4]. Value p4 corresponds to 4 PDUs, value p8 corresponds to 8 PDUs and so on. infinity corresponds to an infinite number of PDUs.","paragraph_zero_based":39022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SN-FieldLength","paragraph_zero_based":39023}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ea8e17a42c0d9a83fb5587bd6a3a7613cbe9ee46a84bfc88f33c29b1cd8914c3","dd836db9f932aac3ae4c3a400d53995b0a1de6a42fb0c15916bf87e423674c58","af92e5a16954391cd65117d7ee0c6b3a3c421b3af94e8d7d8c8e0eccef68a75f","97530692851178329265d6d81f3bb5757b0478907b1901f17d4b5a96ed0e018c","50f4e0b218054748f498812b8b624324fafda2877c91223cc5e7542b05e61a2b","5ce61737f06f15eaa96c33789b216cdd66192e98e8797f44aea4a61e85c2bb16","e1cf1713e446292e13ec91c40dd8c801638e20ea0a2f47ed87c6efbc6f7d1bce","ef024c0fe3c79807d8fce3d6740673098696c896f3d36860ee89f67a2db059ad","9351da1a4f3fe5513fca8b5f1cf8693738ad809587bf7729c89021780d8057fe","3021e18b08716b14e211e925a797c479371e37eb697491854677cbc44a0536f4","4c2f01008a9b18c04e7d91b90ceb2810f157d5e9ca28ae835a0fedc1032aeb29","e3040d95faef0e9458b747d4b77610a5b1b7d04e02a30abec2ffe0c7151bdc12","c300cf68ddf4f8c7ca97d174c939c24852dacc2e862644d657b0819ffd133754","c7ce09451d95625f0453a676e48753bb4e3216228454d96146bc2097a8d3cbf4","bd3f68101a28f813501905f487ea1020885d1e322a355c56933e7e06a99b89a7","fafb213e244438c1a9af56191ad18ef48525cd0fbec3aa31c123b81462a9390f","78d78e88daf6c46f05d747f8da6d69a955c31c120a2727579878dcb70db922c0","4c592a6c8e30072c43b586abf2861e87725b990e9e67ec0411a3b9c0b86b306c","930f60a7ce631924fa7601f69ed2efce74f3aabfef3d97e6a89e8d94588a565c","f56c48e77354f04f4becd9137433ae2a846d535c94631c163a0d479e83b36c78","87069af231d4f15d88dc938d720b4568103c448ea9cbac6edb2b5f4d636da294","8240c7fd9d4017c0ffc7f421a571de19e9320485fd406fd4730273a034f939fc","73a8a4ac035cf0a5c4f75029a8f95805ffe8993a614147df5810a3611633142c","6215f3eda8a45c6c755c7b69fb46a77f51bfae9ac6dbd5c5364d12bdf5479d56"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[39000,39023],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p39000"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the RLC SN field size for NR sidelink communication, see TS 38.322 [4]. For groupcast and broadcast, only value size6 (6 bits) is configured for the field sl-SN-FieldLengthUM.","paragraph_zero_based":39024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-T-PollRetransmit","paragraph_zero_based":39025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Timer value of t-PollRetransmit for RLC AM for NR sidelink communications, see TS 38.322 [4], in milliseconds. Value ms5 means 5 ms, value ms10 means 10 ms and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":39026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":39028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":39029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SLRBSetup","paragraph_zero_based":39030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present in case of sidelink DRB setup via the dedicated signalling and in case of sidelink DRB  configuration via system information and pre-configuration; otherwise the field is optionally present, need M.","paragraph_zero_based":39031},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-ScheduledConfig","paragraph_zero_based":39033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-ScheduledConfig specifies sidelink communication configurations used for network scheduled NR sidelink communication.","paragraph_zero_based":39034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-ScheduledConfig information element","paragraph_zero_based":39035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":39036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-SCHEDULEDCONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":39037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-ScheduledConfig-r16 ::=                   SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":39039},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-RNTI-r16                                  RNTI-Value,","paragraph_zero_based":39040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    mac-MainConfigSL-r16                         MAC-MainConfigSL-r16                                     OPTIONAL,    -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":39041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-CS-RNTI-r16                               RNTI-Value                                               OPTIONAL,    -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":39042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-PSFCH-ToPUCCH-r16                         SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..8)) OF INTEGER (0..15)                OPTIONAL,    -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":39043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-ConfiguredGrantConfigList-r16             SL-ConfiguredGrantConfigList-r16                         OPTIONAL,    -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":39044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":39045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":39046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-DCI-ToSL-Trans-r16                        SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..8)) OF INTEGER (1..32)                OPTIONAL     -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":39047}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a8f5545c1a27c972bd00478c33671bee7ef55f2af4147b99e848cbb5a60914ad","12d2b8f2b30e7faed6c231f64171aaf9264223d26753ad9c2a700721e5ce7dd1","c3d60e22302f3a6d8492e96740d7fb9cad400a3b145708c8aa432436029c1fda","e277aaf6a6e45b293f7834b0c9f040003492e7aee934a0515d96c6b5980e0735","d