{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"LocationAndBandwidthBroadcast-r17 ::= CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":39385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sameAsSib1ConfiguredLocationAndBW          NULL,","paragraph_zero_based":39386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    locationAndBandwidth                       INTEGER (0..37949)","paragraph_zero_based":39387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":39388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CFR-CONFIGMCCH-MTCH-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":39390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":39391},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CFR-ConfigMCCH-MTCH field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":39393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"commonControlResourceSetExt","paragraph_zero_based":39394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"An additional common control resource set which may be configured and used for searchSpaceMCCH/searchSpaceMTCH or UE-specific search space in the BWP where searchSpaceMCCH is configured. It is contained in the bandwidth of the CFR for broadcast and larger than CORESET#0.","paragraph_zero_based":39395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"locationAndBandwidthBroadcast","paragraph_zero_based":39396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates starting PRB and the number of PRBs of CFR used for MCCH and MTCH reception.","paragraph_zero_based":39397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value sameAsSib1ConfiguredLocationAndBW means the CFR for broadcast has the same location and size as the locationAndBandwidth for initial BWP configured in SIB1.","paragraph_zero_based":39398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value locationAndBandwidth is used to configure CFR with bandwidth that is larger than and fully contains the bandwidth for the initial DL BWP configured in SIB1 and CORESET#0. The value of the field shall be interpreted as defined in TS 38.214 [19] with assumptions as described in TS 38.213 [13].","paragraph_zero_based":39399},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the field is absent, the CFR for broadcast has the same location and size as CORESET#0.","paragraph_zero_based":39400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"pdsch-ConfigMCCH","paragraph_zero_based":39401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates PDSCH parameters used for MCCH transmission. If the field is absent, PDSCH parameters used for MCCH are the same as those of PDSCH configuration provided in initialDownlinkBWP in SIB1.","paragraph_zero_based":39402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":39404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":39405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NotSIB1CommonControlResource","paragraph_zero_based":39406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optional present in case commonControlResourceSet is not configured in SIB1, Need R, otherwise it is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":39407}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["efd72f8067eaa70d792ac7438078f6a9fd5febcbf77c85d5d880ceb5ae2080ed","9f9c839f67d2ddb7fa1a96f6201817c0378db2e7b7d861285f740df7a128c76c","744bdfbeb176b5e19fdb7ffcfae139abc21e4cb2625c4f64c1ca49720702e357","b3afd5d29840352ded21515afbfea82777598b2eacc21b614b6863ca871280ed","573de21de50d1b7059905ab8c020ea9b37796e619327ba9b4c