{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present if HARQ feedback is enabled for a G-RNTI/G-CS-RNTI associated with this DRX configuration. It is absent otherwise. ","paragraph_zero_based":39480},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39481},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MBS-NeighbourCellList","paragraph_zero_based":39482},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE MBS-NeighbourCellList indicates a list of neighbour cells where ongoing MBS sessions provided via broadcast MRB in the current cell may also be provided, as indicated in the mtch-NeighbourCell.","paragraph_zero_based":39483},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MBS-NeighbourCellList information element","paragraph_zero_based":39484},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":39485},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MBS-NEIGHBOURCELLLIST-START","paragraph_zero_based":39486},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39487},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MBS-NeighbourCellList-r17 ::=     SEQUENCE (SIZE (0..maxNeighCellMBS-r17)) OF MBS-NeighbourCell-r17","paragraph_zero_based":39488},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39489},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MBS-NeighbourCell-r17 ::=         SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":39490},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    physCellId-r17                    PhysCellId,","paragraph_zero_based":39491},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    carrierFreq-r17                   ARFCN-ValueNR                                  OPTIONAL  -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":39492},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":39493},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39494},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MBS-NEIGHBOURCELLLIST-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":39495},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":39496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MBS-NeighbourCellList field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":39498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"carrierFreq","paragraph_zero_based":39499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the frequency of the neighbour cell indicated by physCellId. Absence of the IE means that the neighbour cell is on the same frequency as the current cell.","paragraph_zero_based":39500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MBS-ServiceList","paragraph_zero_based":39502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE MBS- ServiceList is used to inform the network of the MBS services that the UE is receiving or interested to receive.","paragraph_zero_based":39503}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["33dbff8904d3ec6afa6ed67b5e3938192a7a29daf2845506986671f85bc5c1ad","4a537dcaf559e2516ce58317ebab586e84d63880ef47695fe229f57eb932e815","d716e7c4df2a632cf756a01758048801d35bf4366ba34be0a8333f456255bb93","d4d54681abb0ed9b7bb57f97a610cbc0b32409e2d3a69d6455bcfcfb507ca6fb","d4578702483e285a2faaa60564b61c8f4e655c4050e1bd3a07a1e61486d93cbb","3c34cb69a1c66bb5d91f8ed0dd6a046d24a17970baaf1586bb612215a3d4f5a3","c0381bb79baeb1de105cd0291b4f01fe7afc37d895f662db70679b4effbff630","bd13cbcc4c4221ee059e5d359cf007b27f19aa670f9aa01d3c98df40eb5a6df8","eb85c356ff1fc6274946e95462b00ff6f09762fbd6d66de0c0463e5bf6554c06","6a4d2449c04ada58580e416dced7b562c81e98966b2d2680687e7e1980f5cf7c","1212c5efbee6c21cde164a6ebcbbe83e099b2771a5144a699934eeb35d88bfbd","0794cdd595514bd3fc1ede15b9f