{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346g","paragraph_zero_based":40944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with musim-PreferredRRC-State.","paragraph_zero_based":40945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving RRCRelease, or upon receiving musim-LeaveAssistanceConfig set to release.","paragraph_zero_based":40946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the actions as specified in 5.3.8.6.","paragraph_zero_based":40947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346h","paragraph_zero_based":40948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with musim-GapPreferenceList Information.","paragraph_zero_based":40949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing musim-GapAssistanceConfig during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, or upon receiving musim-GapAssistanceConfig set to release.","paragraph_zero_based":40950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":40951},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346i","paragraph_zero_based":40952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with scg-DeactivationPreference","paragraph_zero_based":40953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing scg-DeactivationPreferenceConfig during RRC connection re-establishment/resume or upon receiving scg-DeactivationPreferenceConfig set to release.","paragraph_zero_based":40954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":40955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346j (The UE maintains one instance of this timer per cell group)","paragraph_zero_based":40956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with rlm-RelaxationReportingConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":40957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing rlm-RelaxationReportingConfig during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, upon receiving rlm-RelaxationReportingConfig set to release, or upon performing MR-DC release.","paragraph_zero_based":40958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":40959},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346k (The UE maintains one instance of this timer per cell group)","paragraph_zero_based":40960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":40961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, upon receiving bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig set to release, or upon performing MR-DC release.","paragraph_zero_based":40962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":40963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T350","paragraph_zero_based":40964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting DedicatedSIBRequest message with requestedSIB-List and/or  requestedPosSIB-List.","paragraph_zero_based":40965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon acquiring the requested SIB(s) or posSIB(s), upon releasing onDemandSIB-Request during the connection re-establishment procedures, upon receiving onDemandSIB-Request set to release, upon reception of RRCRelease or upon successful change of PCell while in RRC_CONNECTED.","paragraph_zero_based":40966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action","paragraph_zero_based":40967}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["cba0b8b6c887c486fedb9bd90b537cbc2c09acfa1619f58116952967ec45f2cb","ea759dd5fe