{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the timing offset for the UE to determine DFN timing when GNSS is used for timing reference. Value 1 corresponds to 0.001 milliseconds, value 2 corresponds to 0.002 milliseconds, and so on. If the field is absent, no offset is applied.","paragraph_zero_based":42384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PreconfigDiscConfig","paragraph_zero_based":42385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the configuration for discovery message transmission used by NR sidelink U2N Remote UE. ","paragraph_zero_based":42386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PreconfigEUTRA-AnchorCarrierFreqList","paragraph_zero_based":42387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the EUTRA anchor carrier frequency list, which can provide the NR sidelink communication configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":42388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PreconfigFreqInfoList","paragraph_zero_based":42389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the NR sidelink communication and/ or NR sidelink discovery configuration some carrier frequency(ies). In this release, only one SL-FreqConfig can be configured in the list.","paragraph_zero_based":42390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PreconfigNR-AnchorCarrierFreqList","paragraph_zero_based":42391},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the NR anchor carrier frequency list, which can provide the NR sidelink communication configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":42392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-RadioBearerPreConfigList","paragraph_zero_based":42393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates one or multiple sidelink radio bearer configurations.","paragraph_zero_based":42394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-RLC-BearerPreConfigList","paragraph_zero_based":42395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates one or multiple sidelink RLC bearer configurations.","paragraph_zero_based":42396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-RoHC-Profiles","paragraph_zero_based":42397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the supported RoHC profiles for NR sidelink communications.","paragraph_zero_based":42398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SSB-PriorityNR","paragraph_zero_based":42399},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the priority of NR sidelink SSB transmission and reception.","paragraph_zero_based":42400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-TxProfileList","paragraph_zero_based":42401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of one or multiple Tx profiles, indicating the compatibility of supporting SL DRX as specified in TS 38.321 [3]. It is up to the UE implementation whether/how to apply this field.","paragraph_zero_based":42402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":42403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–End of NR-Sidelink-Preconf","paragraph_zero_based":42404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":42405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":42406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"END","paragraph_zero_based":42407}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["00d5b1b54f358ad89afc6739124da0431458a7ca5dec8e9ab9cea63fc733488d","b3fac01edd1b4f254ce200a3155f0354005945bc1e24591a61f7ea1768d779a3","18211487224ca81347d1aa0ac4928cd527dfbf8bee6157a7ed45d6507f1e6869","e9d8e6013f5797069e829eef885b9656e9aa239f5c05e1467137bda9b52afb67","e63d324740f579dfbf0e0e757e98b028db3a259cb46f088abab51de9cda2533b","f7e1de1d85318ea2d526ec1db775d397