{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ueAssistanceInformationSCG","paragraph_zero_based":42840},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Includes for each UE assistance feature associated with the SCG, the information last reported by the UE in the NR UEAssistanceInformation message for the SCG, if any.","paragraph_zero_based":42841},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":42842},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ConfigRestrictInfoDAPS field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":42843},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sourceFeatureSetPerUplinkCC/sourceFeatureSetPerDownlinkCC","paragraph_zero_based":42844},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates an index referring to the position of the FeatureSetUplinkPerCC/FeatureSetDownlinkPerCC selected by source in the featureSetsUplinkPerCC/featureSetsDownlinkPerCC.","paragraph_zero_based":42845},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":42846},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RRM-Config field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":42847},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateCellInfoList","paragraph_zero_based":42848},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list of the best cells on each frequency for which measurement information was available","paragraph_zero_based":42849},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateCellInfoListSN-EUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":42850},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list of EUTRA cells including serving cells and best neighbour cells on each serving frequency, for which measurement results were available. This field is only used in NE-DC. ","paragraph_zero_based":42851},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":42852},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":42853},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":42854},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"HO","paragraph_zero_based":42855},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present in case of handover within NR or UE context retrieval, e.g. in case of resume or re-establishment. The field is optionally present in case of handover from E-UTRA/5GC. Otherwise the field is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":42856},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"HO2","paragraph_zero_based":42857},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present in case of handover within NR; otherwise the field is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":42858},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":42859},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The following table indicates per source RAT whether RAT capabilities are included or not.","paragraph_zero_based":42860},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":42861},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Source RAT","paragraph_zero_based":42862},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR capabilities","paragraph_zero_based":42863}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6191642f6d30999073b9657a787a733c3d228d35ea1e0704cfa6807cbb97f7cb","2b3a07b247507e8f517353046fe081133b152ec07b21efb27e713802e352f842","b3e16ea20c9582327b2b36324207f0c04468267a2f48f1e89243679e8324caba","ce56758ab919b70a62745bb08cacbddb3c5c875bacc90a04e2d7574f9d5bba62","10d89ebfa8bee5798e4cff059cbc3a01254e3bb2c689b6a5842f85f5a0faeab3","26d24224066c5c739163b2474d8c02d5a67bdadf4f76db46892d05c149c28db3","10e2db6d1b54fa652b77bd8502ea17fc76e8891938f0b03c9fdaf3525ad6bad1","dc8dc2321a1fc4f0218ef16fa86022a9b94ca624bd3cdd5e68c58ee56b634933","73ce3f155859a013cb1e91276d264d97d6f285b55ad9d22cf56fb2f775ccf314","388fbf1aa640df19cbfd19