{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value true indicates that the SSB indicated in the first instance of MeasTiming in the measTiming list can be used for camping and for a PCell configuration (i.e. in spCellConfigCommon of the masterCellGroup).","paragraph_zero_based":43752},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"csi-RS-CellMobility","paragraph_zero_based":43753},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the CSI-RS configuration of the cell for which this message is included. The timing of the CSI-RS resources is based on the SSB indicated by refSSBFreq.","paragraph_zero_based":43754},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"csi-RS-SubcarrierSpacing","paragraph_zero_based":43755},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the subcarrier spacing of the CSI-RS resources included in csi-rs-CellMobility.","paragraph_zero_based":43756},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measTiming","paragraph_zero_based":43757},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list of SMTC information, SSB RSSI measurement information and associated NR frequency exchanged via EN-DC X2 Setup, EN-DC Configuration Update, Xn Setup and NG-RAN Node Configuration Update procedures, or F1 messages between gNB DU and gNB CU.","paragraph_zero_based":43758},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"physCellId","paragraph_zero_based":43759},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Physical Cell Identity of the SSB on the ARFCN indicated by carrierFreq.","paragraph_zero_based":43760},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"psCellOnlyOnFirstSSB","paragraph_zero_based":43761},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value true indicates that only the SSB indicated in the first instance of MeasTiming in the measTiming list can be used for a PSCell configuration (i.e. in spCellConfigCommon of the secondaryCellGroup).","paragraph_zero_based":43762},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssb-ToMeasure","paragraph_zero_based":43763},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The set of SS blocks to be measured within the SMTC measurement duration (see TS 38.215 [9]).","paragraph_zero_based":43764},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43765},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–UERadioPagingInformation","paragraph_zero_based":43766},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This message is used to transfer radio paging information, covering both upload to and download from the 5GC, and between gNBs.","paragraph_zero_based":43767},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Direction: gNB to/ from 5GC and gNB to/from gNB","paragraph_zero_based":43768},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UERadioPagingInformation message","paragraph_zero_based":43769},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":43770},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-UE-RADIO-PAGING-INFORMATION-START","paragraph_zero_based":43771},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43772},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UERadioPagingInformation ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":43773},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    criticalExtensions                  CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":43774},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        c1                                  CHOICE{","paragraph_zero_based":43775}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a8bc43020eae78d4ac55388ab207cf89d9bfb118312c72352f8903d1a101f4f0","e07d47f3624afe0d610a6471a88c1366fade5c58ea11659ef24f0059b4c6e3e2","61ea36ac53feca45f0e3adc350a25734702c80b871c419780f2d2c94d807ffef","860f4db1f30ae243110f9fe3d0aa4ed19fc6ef575e476610c8f71d856978210a","adff9f297baee8023dbfa86df648c951bc8522af801a2b4656832de59