{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxNumberResAcrossCC-AcrossFR","paragraph_zero_based":43920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum number of configured CSI-RS resources. Corresponds to the UE capability maxNumberResAcrossCC-AcrossFR-r16 in maxTotalResourcesForAcrossFreqRanges-r16.","paragraph_zero_based":43921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ResourceConfigPerFR field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":43923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bm-MaxNumberAperiodicCSI-RS-Resource","paragraph_zero_based":43924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum number of aperiodic CSI-RS resources that the SCG is allowed to configure for the UE to measure L1-RSRP. Corresponds to the UE capability maxNumberAperiodicCSI-RS-Resource in beamManagementSSB-CSI-RS.","paragraph_zero_based":43925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bm-MaxNumberCSI-RS-Resource","paragraph_zero_based":43926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum total number of NZP-CSI-RS resources that can be configured for the UE to measure L1-RSRP. Corresponds to the UE capability maxNumberCSI-RS-Resource in beamManagementSSB-CSI-RS.","paragraph_zero_based":43927},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cg-MaxNumberConfigsAllCC","paragraph_zero_based":43928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum number of active configured grant configurations. Corresponds to the UE capability maxNumberConfigsAllCC-r16 in activeConfiguredGrant-r16.","paragraph_zero_based":43929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxNumberCSI-RS-BFD","paragraph_zero_based":43930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximal number of different CSI-RS resources for the UE to monitor PDCCH quality. Corresponds to the UE capability maxNumberCSI-RS-BFD.","paragraph_zero_based":43931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxNumberCSI-RS-SSB-CBD","paragraph_zero_based":43932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximal number of different CSI-RS (and/or SSB) resources for new beam identifications. Corresponds to the UE capability maxNumberCSI-RS-SSB-CBD.","paragraph_zero_based":43933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxNumberSSB-BFD","paragraph_zero_based":43934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximal number of different SSBs for the UE to monitor PDCCH quality. Corresponds to the UE capability maxNumberSSB-BFD.","paragraph_zero_based":43935},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sps-MaxNumberConfigsAllCC","paragraph_zero_based":43936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum number of SPS configurations. Corresponds to the UE capability maxNumberConfigsAllCC-r16 in sps-r16.","paragraph_zero_based":43937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"trs-MaxConfResourceSetsAllCC","paragraph_zero_based":43938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum configured CSI-RS for tracking (i.e. TRS) resource sets. Corresponds to the UE capability maxConfiguredResourceSetsAllCC in csi-RS-ForTracking.","paragraph_zero_based":43939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"11.4Inter-node RRC multiplicity and type constraint values","paragraph_zero_based":43941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–Multiplicity and type constraints definitions","paragraph_zero_based":43942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":43943}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1e6095266e34de31d12c970a77d4dd701d61f34f42da328e5b89