{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Request","paragraph_zero_based":44184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rx","paragraph_zero_based":44185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reception","paragraph_zero_based":44186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sched","paragraph_zero_based":44187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Scheduling","paragraph_zero_based":44188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SIB","paragraph_zero_based":44189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SystemInformationBlock","paragraph_zero_based":44190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sync","paragraph_zero_based":44191},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Synchronisation","paragraph_zero_based":44192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thr","paragraph_zero_based":44193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Threshold","paragraph_zero_based":44194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Tx","paragraph_zero_based":44195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Transmission","paragraph_zero_based":44196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UL","paragraph_zero_based":44197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Uplink","paragraph_zero_based":44198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44199},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The table A.3.1.2.1-1 is not exhaustive. Additional abbreviations may be used in ASN.1 identifiers when needed.","paragraph_zero_based":44200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A.3.1.3Text references using ASN.1 identifiers","paragraph_zero_based":44201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A text reference into the RRC PDU contents description from other parts of the specification is made using the ASN.1 field identifier of the referenced type. The ASN.1 field and type identifiers used in text references should be in the italic font style. The \"do not check spelling and grammar\" attribute in Word should be set. Quotation marks (i.e., \"\") should not be used around the ASN.1 field or type identifier.","paragraph_zero_based":44202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A reference to an RRC PDU should be made using the corresponding ASN.1 field identifier followed by the word \"message\", e.g., a reference to the RRCRelease message.","paragraph_zero_based":44203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A reference to a specific part of an RRC PDU, or to a specific part of any other ASN.1 type, should be made using the corresponding ASN.1 field identifier followed by the word \"field\", e.g., a reference to the prioritisedBitRate field in the example below.","paragraph_zero_based":44204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- /example/ ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":44205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"LogicalChannelConfig ::=            SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":44207}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e34f0ed6ed2d73cf931f5f82de78646c67b024a84caf391959fcfc7b2e03d181","66a27d4e40a931969d3eb2e324c612627ac64c6921a494c18ac0375572c3d9b5","86d14c66da94ae0facdf651b5da11371f2af076daaf9fe2b3d0b5469c292722f","637f196b75abf588cc72eddceb338cfe7c03aacc5614c2473ddba123162f60b7","456a1204c66c62b6dd1be9aa27db51e8310f355df540cf652c820d0916497a92","88b7458ee874d571412ffe39b0aa7c0d603633570efae40d6f3f8d7567753b97","1d9c34205e7e7a24ac11a705be1fae5835033e21ea277fdfad7f2a8fa14b6979","662b1a9749a0f150b87d986acb096f5a52f0fad680727ca59050b6d01a8edb9f","8da1d40e0ff8bb32ed24775bd18d73a6acf69315fdf0dc6a46bd9af059f162ea","8e295a996c0bf261d71137c873c04607bc094f017e207b13af789ba7d9593a0b","57e2456c0a48ffc0e5c0444c2bcfb06d50ac6cf4f8b0350a6fbac5a48761