{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ul-SpecificParameters               SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":44208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        priority                            Priority,","paragraph_zero_based":44209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        prioritisedBitRate                  PrioritisedBitRate,","paragraph_zero_based":44210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        bucketSizeDuration                  BucketSizeDuration,","paragraph_zero_based":44211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        logicalChannelGroup                 INTEGER (0..3)","paragraph_zero_based":44212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    }       OPTIONAL","paragraph_zero_based":44213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":44214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44215},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":44216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:All the ASN.1 start tags in the ASN.1 clauses, used as examples in this annex to the specification, are deliberately distorted, in order not to include them when the ASN.1 description of the RRC PDU contents is extracted from the specification.","paragraph_zero_based":44218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A reference to a specific type of information element should be made using the corresponding ASN.1 type identifier preceded by the acronym \"IE\", e.g., a reference to the IE LogicalChannelConfig in the example above.","paragraph_zero_based":44219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"References to a specific type of information element should only be used when those are generic, i.e., without regard to the particular context wherein the specific type of information element is used. If the reference is related to a particular context, e.g., an RRC PDU type (message) wherein the information element is used, the corresponding field identifier in that context should be used in the text reference.","paragraph_zero_based":44220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A reference to a specific value of an ASN.1 field should be made using the corresponding ASN.1 value without using quotation marks around the ASN.1 value, e.g., 'if the status field is set to value true'.","paragraph_zero_based":44221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A.3.2High-level message structure","paragraph_zero_based":44222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Within each logical channel type, the associated RRC PDU (message) types are alternatives within a CHOICE, as shown in the example below.","paragraph_zero_based":44223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- /example/ ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":44224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DL-DCCH-Message ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":44226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    message                 DL-DCCH-MessageType","paragraph_zero_based":44227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":44228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DL-DCCH-MessageType ::= CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":44230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    c1                      CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":44231}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["796e06c124f7a7e1b51d628d9fad0e103c9856d832add30033ef5b02371bb121","5474c8273fb7fa57a3b4539b690a7992b76cd1f2be0b28d8b9b9eb25d96e29a5","921b87a0b9de1f1820128fdf5a8adb7acac6f0