{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":44856},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44857},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ListElementExt-vNxy ::=              SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":44858},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    field3-rN                            BIT STRING (SIZE (8))                                              OPTIONAL     -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":44859},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":44860},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44861},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ListElementExt-vNwz ::=              SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":44862},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    field4-rN                            INTEGER (0..255)                                                   OPTIONAL     -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":44863},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":44864},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":44865},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44866},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–When the size of a list is extended and fields are added to the list element structure, an extension marker should normally be used for the added fields if available, and the list extended with the non-critical mechanism as described in example 1 above. Note that if the list element ID type changes in this case, the new ID can be added after the extension marker, and the entries of the size-extended ToRelease list should have the type of the new ID (e.g. ListElementId-vNxy). If no extension marker is available or if overhead or other considerations prevent using the extension marker, an extension structure should be created for the new fields and a parallel list with ToAddMod introduced to hold the extension structures, as in the second example above, for entries of the original list and for entries of the extension list holding new entries. The field description table should indicate that the parallel list contains the same number of entries, and in the same order, as the concatenation of the original list and the extension list. An extended ToRelease list is needed, but no additional parallel ToRelease list is needed (i.e. there is no listElementToReleaseListExt-vNxy in the example below), as the original and extended ToRelease lists suffice to release any element of the combined list. The extended element ID type should be captured as a non-critical extension of the original element ID type, with the field description indicating that if the extended ID is present, the original ID is ignored. The result is as shown in the following example:","paragraph_zero_based":44867},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- /example 3/ ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":44868},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44869},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ContainingStructure ::=             SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":44870},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    listElementToAddModList               SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofListElements)) OF ListElement                 OPTIONAL,    -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":44871},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    listElementToReleaseList              SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofListElements)) OF ListElementId               OPTIONAL,    -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":44872},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":44873},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":44874},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    -- Non-critical extension lists","paragraph_zero_based":44875},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    listElementToAddModListSizeExt-vNxy  SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofListElementsDiff-rN)) OF ListElement           OPTIONAL,    -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":44876},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    listElementToReleaseListSizeExt-vNxy SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofListElementsDiff-rN)) OF ListElementId-vNxy    OPTIONAL,    -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":44877},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    -- Parallel list with maxNrofListElements-rN = maxNrofListElements + maxNrofListElementsDiff-rN","paragraph_zero_based":44878},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    listElementToAddModListExt-vNxy      SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofListElements-rN)) OF ListElementExt-vNxy       OPTIONAL     -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":44879}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f321646cdd3b840c275ed826655eb84ec979b105c88da97e52bab65ec35e7447","0929ccc42b16f7f5ef82e47f02e9829a0542d324bdf04f450b09f7dea2b9d4ea","c7be3215e4e4cd61f9472e66d5d3ab373be263be589a6b802a03d08de634e248","32c112939ab39c87116069587182dba383a9be42ed3798ce79874b4875658783","5618a6c5723727f17d9005e8b906a462b23150fc44f348a5caa4b18b082d09e2","b7b13595e4595721a1c6e931e002b5133ba60067321ef092dfeaddacdcb90416","d3b44bc0153152aa92d3295f498a97cf22b1a0d25d5aa83a6dd6f61ac67295ff","440b29d6a46a8181690eeb04032042c3df8b0caacbe09c4ba27e7be7d8d57055","8c254a05b8d35e197e5f6bdbe4ae0f5b76fcbd9103ae86e2c2638eeab92c1338","c361ae0e1ad14c4e4def6ad33f97aec65928e59c8f563a0ea1f8590b81223e1e","819999ddf139cbecffc1ba99cac5c263527b719792aa1c1ae9d5b8f0a58020bc","8b6dd2ddd6c51be865b6b29bb6413071662cffdfca4ab9f6ec9b614748a86e82","f54d31fb2bb8f21fa39009a66385b34f6c0216e29f6a326ef15cd00f0bec3068","8d788bcb11036eaf06af474ccb140d7fb8dfb4abf19c8c5acc365af46c3952e3","ebd8a6584937e4ed60ccb9a44f8ffddf84b5c1b470e4c3e4beed99d7e4ac5c44","a03dfc8b422ce3158192deba8855dc3285e3a097e515e0102876624f04a74e7e","1cd66689ca336a8ca2d0fb6f5e8e4a498c04842f29e8d533f5dd288de3698c38","ff43daf0b5df8a6b182f8ace79d32faf690ec0cb266b32bc8e8a7a195bf38dcd","1e6471f5c291098ac1f56dfda4426fb9a829cf7db7648cf0ee9d269fee8c09d4","8927e7a3cf9eca47981ae3689f12f386781a42c980d9131f9d3d7f5220b65e9d","3d80c99ee9e83a2a00d03d1455bb0409f825d1add20a225a957ad2abd78c092b","78e429a31b4aec3c5c3aa676bb9869d0e935a3a91179739a4e367e1ce30c4150","3b4ccccd7978acd69b12b690cccab90da613e4a717ae06a9b967324c002ea2a6","44e29f95836c3b7e086dbdc40fe39a3a09c3e7449d7c45e9ab53dcd983b67709"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[44856,44879],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p44856"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]]","paragraph_zero_based":44880},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":44881},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44882},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ListElement ::=                      SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":44883},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    elementId                            ListElementId,","paragraph_zero_based":44884},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    field1                               INTEGER (0..3),","paragraph_zero_based":44885},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    field2                               ENUMERATED { value1, value2, value3 }","paragraph_zero_based":44886},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":44887},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ListElementExt-vNxy ::=              SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":44889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    -- Field description should indicate that if the elementId-vNxy is present, the elementId (without suffix) is ignored","paragraph_zero_based":44890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    elementId-vNxy                       ListElementId-vNxy                                                 OPTIONAL,    -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":44891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    field3-rN                            BIT STRING (SIZE (8))                                              OPTIONAL     -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":44892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":44893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ListElementId ::= INTEGER (0..maxNrofListElements-1)","paragraph_zero_based":44895},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44896},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ListElementId-vNxy ::= INTEGER (maxNrofListElements..maxNrofListElements-1-rN)","paragraph_zero_based":44897},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":44898},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44899},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–When different extensions are made to a list in separate releases, the extension mechanisms described above may interact. In case fields are added in Rel-M (listElementToAddModListExt-vMxy) and later the list size is extended in Rel-N (listElementToAddModListSizeExt-vNwz), the size-extended list in Rel-N should be a single list extending the combination of listElementToAddModList and listElementToAddModListExt-vMxy. This requires creating a new type (ListElement-rN) to contain the combined fields of ListElement and ListElementExt-vMxy. A corresponding ToRelease list is needed. The result is as shown in the following example:","paragraph_zero_based":44900},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- /example 4/ ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":44901},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44902},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ContainingStructure ::=             SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":44903}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a0f995728df580313de86202948d9a88c3c44afa4dcf29a25c505d1c4cdafd5c","312647a5c136309756d1b8f780788abe7b030128c555eee0ec7c891584c17ca7","c9d6565d3eb58a85534b3ba6dc5c064f8acc6f97952df6d04a227a48dca33558","f2a73c09f038c38b2673237d3578e4a4a6511822350b0450defd77dc22c05447","4c00516fb33e58f2b8ab956cb8f355a9a097012e95abdd3486e1f2f12758d2f9","83214c8b1ead883e5b0e2bd10359bec6701d8d4b58738acaa653c8ede5efc751","afac440cd33fd6425d43273502c5164edcc87d9fdf557d7a0c2bba4335506d3d","6bb629cfc08b2696ccab61edb0624182a138a7ccbf03d4ced6dc671d1e776947","20d0e21e9d8fd5337be762598790da92dfa216a258eed6a744fdc50280d391c9","cc775ed0796e5cf45ac1203bd11fae37fb9083dffa23e4cd16f00780778e9819","efa59cd1cd0bb62d09970d782c814dc75886a7e17a0ede3513f85d9a23ea00f4","c143d604ddf7edc11bfa2fd008140e0a48a4d758f5c7fb9b77de12651d3734d3","4da85e63a66e3207bce88de25663960b672a3cbda96ecf1fc9db1571a5d241e6","e6161246f920237ab3ecd888b8d788a54645a51de4bdfda6a5eb0f9ac8a71549","c975b8878bd5e93d6e7cb2531f7ab5936f01f2017a954ec04456ed961d04eccb","c356c1bd97a36c3171edb689f16c663418a40d0b55e758abcaf856949d7f79a5","ec8284559c86496cfe274d4beb477347f503208f5d2d97cf639d1243818b8272","6133d0da14e13e3800f61bdffc1acc6a2fec2e27fd28a116e43e589a1f76b1a1","497c7239bbc6447b8f905f7b468daf60c4b66028d14cfe476bc0e8783c6f1e2a","248725b0d0c36e3ed3142e86d72d09cb6e428a9d87a82a947bfa20aab0e68574","881dd7d3c38c018bc9a8498b60c0ad83fe414d317c81b52857abd5f33fa4efef","5f49fe2e6d8a222009135a2747df9767cbf60fe6b68fe29c20d8ac03f96599e5","0fa66a8c8554477e2cbc0955049ec73393f503d7315317c428203f06f301903f","01b603de9ce58c11f2f735eda4950dc95cfa611282c68b760003086120f42a75"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[44880,44903],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p44880"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    listElementToAddModList              SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofListElements)) OF ListElement             OPTIONAL,    -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":44904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    listElementToReleaseList             SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofListElements)) OF ListElementId           OPTIONAL,    -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":44905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":44906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":44907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    -- Parallel list (Rel-M)","paragraph_zero_based":44908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    listElementToAddModListExt-vMxy      SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofListElements)) OF ListElementExt-vMxy     OPTIONAL     -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":44909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]],","paragraph_zero_based":44910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"[[","paragraph_zero_based":44911},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- Size-extended list (Rel-N) with maxNrofListElements-rN = maxNrofListElements + maxNrofListElementsDiff-rN","paragraph_zero_based":44912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"listElementToAddModListSizeExt-vNwz  SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofListElementsDiff-rN)) OF ListElement-rN   OPTIONAL,    -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":44913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    listElementToReleaseListSizeExt-vNwz SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofListElementsDiff-rN)) OF ListElementId-vNwz     OPTIONAL    -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":44914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"]]","paragraph_zero_based":44915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":44916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ListElement ::=                      SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":44918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    elementId                            ListElementId,","paragraph_zero_based":44919},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    field1                               INTEGER (0..3),","paragraph_zero_based":44920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    field2                               ENUMERATED { value1, value2, value3 }","paragraph_zero_based":44921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":44922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ListElementExt-vMxy ::=              SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":44924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    field3-rM                            BIT STRING (SIZE (8))                                              OPTIONAL     -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":44925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":44926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44927}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9eb3c6ff952f275c14d7122af151d9b3d8143c4c070fb402001a6bd58d004f01","4273313d2697d35974f28432c68456fefcdb092bb153a01cdc9e35ddabc1dac2","18c315882ad88de2664540f8572d11a47a0143d3fc9c224b7ce16f49c19f0595","26d34cbad3aa5a1f3bd5237c342eaf991634f23d06e32ec8f68326db36a3c45b","0ecbf181f27957e90fb8eb631c886c336ef952f7181b292c9944fd296f49db94","af4f43694a14d617e7c4da8e16c2b98892f3f373c542c720efa645ade321fc91","7053346d48a5a0a182c88cd0d9ee465d403da7f9e9afef393eddc22fc0139e7b","35823480a7f1176542c044ab5538e8bbee512b9a597c449efbc26ca0d728b6ca","7631c7219de7495fcbd78da2887db5d9b170cca446436a71c7858ff65898d9ca","e3148ee8b827291b3d52d7805875278494ed35d28359d178cb69d63514af000b","a5a817fae96fc7298ab8299cb8ab52b41a04d5cb5e0529d636ee1813422646f3","0e7b44b8b14d6a2a6035ab33fa6b720979de4a29b96f537ab070fa7da5a49b8c","8d47b39c5b474afc3fa287293bdec139b8ab31d258c36c041ef1e018b91e7065","d868d90420bdcfb3df6b0049d4b19a861d23dabd520315c0371e3efe8399aba1","f4930a92e8cf8894298d98cc8bcc424dff5985798bc3500643a3622d7ed1ae76","0f19f60f293248b7d17c3f36d6ae40263909f91475676baad776d4fd59d30f2d","a15d3c0f5ebc42c458dcea93f0c8576911deb5fea035756d699dd642f2ec78d9","1377ecb3fde4829638c97fd3101f304142d337b2058db5aa1d51719a19381aff","a436e4afa29ab2a16f234a41376c012c39fd9cc664be9986c2c766f56403cf65","f38fbe72a1f392f036dd612919b7ba61d91424c2a46dc7b575d5eb1984f16585","486ec22b9c5928305f81ee20b317c44dfdae8e5bea8a48bd4d45830fba832d39","6734370112913b06839fa98c51d4ea08f72e1304537634b77345326098cf0bda","4ce3553f2b96f6d9a6707b1a5061894f792e8848dd258aff77caf222aff533ea","eeedc466d719dcc43877d152ea5929ba2ff342a5b90024a5498a57ae80c83b5c"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[44904,44927],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p44904"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ListElement-rN ::=                   SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":44928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    elementId-vNwz                       ListElementId-vNwz,","paragraph_zero_based":44929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    field1                               INTEGER (0..3),","paragraph_zero_based":44930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    field2                               ENUMERATED { value1, value2, value3 },","paragraph_zero_based":44931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    field3-rN                            BIT STRING (SIZE (8))                                              OPTIONAL     -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":44932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":44933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ListElementId ::= INTEGER (0..maxNrofListElements-1)","paragraph_zero_based":44935},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ListElementId-vNwz ::= INTEGER (maxNrofListElements..maxNrofListElementsDiff-1-rN)","paragraph_zero_based":44937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":44938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A.5Guidelines regarding inclusion of transaction identifiers in RRC messages","paragraph_zero_based":44940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The following rules provide guidance on which messages should include a Transaction identifier","paragraph_zero_based":44941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1:DL messages on CCCH that move UE to RRC-Idle should not include the RRC transaction identifier.","paragraph_zero_based":44942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2:All network initiated DL messages by default should include the RRC transaction identifier.","paragraph_zero_based":44943},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3:All UL messages that are direct response to a DL message with an RRC Transaction identifier should include the RRC Transaction identifier.","paragraph_zero_based":44944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4:All UL messages that require a direct DL response message should include an RRC transaction identifier.","paragraph_zero_based":44945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5:All UL messages that are not in response to a DL message nor require a corresponding response from the network should not include the RRC Transaction identifier.","paragraph_zero_based":44946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A.6Guidelines regarding use of need codes","paragraph_zero_based":44947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The following rule provides guidance for determining need codes for optional downlink fields:","paragraph_zero_based":44948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- if the field needs to be stored by the UE (i.e. maintained) when absent:","paragraph_zero_based":44949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- use Need M (=Maintain);","paragraph_zero_based":44950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- else, if the field needs to be released by the UE when absent:","paragraph_zero_based":44951}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["59b46d80f5f033158b2931561c98f986ce100172a496bcd585704db9b1b8a429","a1620e6e37113eb14403c0506f81caa2ae9e11971a57188abef2820306de3949","5d7c50f5dc6ee504f462d64706afd89ca071058ebf8eccb41e9620cccbf32a2d","049c62cb8d7ac34730f0abdba2eb79af0474d1536d681014f8a15862556a1b7d","e6225e7ec0d62768b300c1ec140224dd734d64aa1a78295dbc43235ff84aaf68","5ab09a9d979e2b6cd97fef1d9b1c75b6742678f4fb447314a05e9f7b3ebf4997","4b11b8e5bcee220780297e6fdcaa3296b350e83b8ff6a1bc8dc466fe7c58485c","cd22c5c3ff4968a578569717329de167a87f832adf8e9af5cf297e3637c81fbc","4fc9cda9d282b9a32de5d6495c77957d9d78b3dd4b9d5bc80dd4b6e14b7524dc","9240244e7bbd12e5161cfb24f9dc5973691d7c62aaad217238b39ff542e525fc","ae03a9d6e2b929a31c2d7236ca82f9caeed616f354a8dd33b29333469452a3b1","79ae14f5b69f3c7b06c09fb034a44efd06e8996bdb023764e37ba344a920c168","e27108d6e60324230053202a7b4c33e5edbedf7e027033749b2bcc6e7cc70310","8e4bc0cae4a27a38198a70b12de3a243307b6b9da72d0cef01d61565be87f44b","c8426eeea4ac84e982d5c01e6f7034f45f979958a4ef80da6ce8359e9933b664","022cdda607fd5ba39883cff014790e9139f9ff8f0f137953dac6c46e19532708","48ed8b37e156fab84c7fb4b63135792c4156965de06b72c51c1313cbf425e09d","ed356f07a0c2ada8f8be3b2b5cbdf724a87dd09ee0fc315ad21228797a52dfed","cd83af2a3a6e727ed8dadd7bd66a720febd23ad767680014dde623c3bf740906","b73057c7ecd5007368b227f6039db790e505e713ede47f7977139426d3074c36","5e9f0932212259edb5a3ed4aa938952c139a620548615d53256b1938fb68d163","ca8ab426709ee55fb642a2778df97f76441ae20616160007b358613555fc0cd1","e91ff8eb2018d53eb153d73b7413e509560413f3c9e807c31442142c119c570b","2c9560ce0dc37567e0f2a275c7d5135aff828f67fb79c858007a91af0c89eb5c"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[44928,44951],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p44928"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- use Need R (=Release);","paragraph_zero_based":44952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- else, if UE shall take no action when the field is absent (i.e. UE does not even need to maintain any existing value of the field):","paragraph_zero_based":44953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- use Need N (=None);","paragraph_zero_based":44954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- else (UE behaviour upon absence does not fit any of the above conditions):","paragraph_zero_based":44955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- use Need S (=Specified);","paragraph_zero_based":44956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- specify the UE behaviour upon absence of the field in the procedural text or in the field description table.","paragraph_zero_based":44957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A.7Guidelines regarding use of conditions","paragraph_zero_based":44958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditions are primarily used to specify network restrictions, for which the following types can be distinguished:","paragraph_zero_based":44959},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Message Contents related constraints e.g. that a field B is mandatory present if the same message includes field A and when it is set value X.","paragraph_zero_based":44960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Configuration Constraints e.g. that a field D can only be signalled if field C is configured and set to value Y. (i.e. regardless of whether field C is present in the same message or previously configured).","paragraph_zero_based":44961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The use of these conditions is illustrated by an example.","paragraph_zero_based":44962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- /example/ ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":44963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RRCMessage-IEs ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":44965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    fieldA                          FieldA                  OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":44966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    fieldB                          FieldB                  OPTIONAL,   -- Cond FieldAsetToX","paragraph_zero_based":44967},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    fieldC                          FieldC                  OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":44968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    fieldD                          FieldD                  OPTIONAL,   -- Cond FieldCsetToY","paragraph_zero_based":44969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nonCriticalExtension            SEQUENCE {}             OPTIONAL","paragraph_zero_based":44970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":44971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- /example/ ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":44973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional presence","paragraph_zero_based":44975}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e384104803f5fcfa430d7e81a057d09bff0f26cb2c6b69f5e9706311b81f1c9c","5b52a6d43d2e71e541c53be8792fcd8bb9712bca079c2a2bd3d5b3897ab37106","7669033196a70a854e5e066ad30bcdfa7367e7a1f9b98f967044820706f87d34","9fec76bce9122167185a0c98bac3c8567c5bf1822af6f8f1670ab5acd0246b03","5e47e9ba2fa3b4eefce12f1e7c259f2e6e98f4ddc0dc7833f39850147fb6d808","d226cdd8cbd272fe13f59d6c2ecd89e0a19e931fe2d0cd2c28e86495abe25a14","770f4c94ba6e87b22910683bcbecb1e036796278a6df56f5e69c62c87b553852","e7452a1c6f017a0947a5751e855a2f61ee48d684b7e908fe8afe4ccb1552f8e9","000de5c38e602c8fc4b1e395474baab4889bbf91d1f4910e53cc2d932cd33ee2","69c86d8ea41a5baa8f0c15cb6c13a24b22b764fc79b7ef7ceb6a2d38edefb93d","e85caa6ffee87477cd5fcae4a44423af77ce49bec1cdd2b7d2384fd83fb472f9","3b76302011cba282c29ea5723badcebf5d3af62d46f87ec12e9a1f1a5dbd7952","ad386270a47565a3f67af68e09993ee15c20ff98df5940a18c5a2af722511b42","7910880d165ee61cbaa56630a04edac2418637e6f94d8506b939f95535572d36","b22c4c4248c96f0635eebba3ddbd5fa8e288b39f2ef93f439e198e11e6f781b3","ad196020f0b1a03d71c03d9965340405b2a874704488085f64c8216acb37281d","ac39f91b1d5d5b13b38bdd6aafd2e166096e3632581ce37f0085f20a5c020da4","7be154caf6efc2c45b69cd40de1e6f1da423badd58c146e59d8d20e13acb6402","d6e3c6b97976b0db9b97b88d25e22664ba3c4cc0593cece97a24af76b4060889","029a5c29e84fb441e408900c52338f5b27857b324f7d7141dfecc28524e2e567","87ce8317f2ea155bb0a94147bcd32fe338aeac4658cd3e372c11b0328df7fe9b","7a58ae4aa21b2345342acdf41a3956b8d0b6a173199a252c590eafe987856a7a","be5d398736324f5c753f5e6c77962b8ae010907d0348bbb03b171ecaff551cd8","c1b85788760ba40d32492d2d09d9546b5e9385875d923d349734d06fc282ea85"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[44952,44975],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p44952"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":44976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FieldAsetToX","paragraph_zero_based":44977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present if fieldA is included and set to valueX. Otherwise the field is optionally present, need R.","paragraph_zero_based":44978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FieldCsetToY","paragraph_zero_based":44979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present, need M, if fieldC is configured and set to valueY. Otherwise the field is absent and the UE does not maintain the value","paragraph_zero_based":44980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A.8Miscellaneous","paragraph_zero_based":44982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The following miscellaneous convention should be used:","paragraph_zero_based":44983},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-UE capabilities: TS 38.306 [26] specifies that the network should in general respect the UE's capabilities. Hence there is no need to include statement clarifying that the network, when setting the value of a certain configuration field, shall respect the related UE capabilities unless there is a particular need e.g. particularly complicated cases.","paragraph_zero_based":44984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"End of changes","paragraph_zero_based":44985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44988}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha