,"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"7151fcbc7e900c013fbd0727f6f458823df19ac33e354f632323a463c862d10e","original_member_sha256":"9be80f761ab1a5a8e2b40c9ef13f4aa84d7d70b3c6af4a740de3e81f68b17102","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["8faa1303853dd7451a918cb0e6e1178e022c49cb502fd67128b6be348d3eb00f","6690a153cef372e35e3df30774a61d565eaf2590f4bf98dcde94f6ef5606eaa6","7ae559ec2991ca97b15292717e994fec32dd6bb2702fd82d71df5f6d3449fc80","3f8fa0c576529aeb208c7c609db8c24e8aef933c55d72751062ba0925e934843","5b9d3e94b2e2469a162f36c651ac6802b31fcc4b4fed4f8769f27295b66f32e3","0e47661d68410752894205dee6a9bbbad763c4fb8f938472f606caa30fd5b3b2","b30560c83b451021ba19d41e0f61c52c41a68546481a5d2352eda33b8d5e9b6b","046072d789da32203b2dbdc5bf6faf7ce0947321bf61b1475c3867e7f07b4f28","ad7c58beb1d9e90fb0849bcd216a0fa195ed528b17181f725cf2b49a179cb8f1","826ddaefbd35bf5941dd0ba7402603c67afa4054d718e9bc0124542ef7dca6de","f93659204248bf7212a2a073874fa6ef6bab855e1f334d94d95f69bdfcb0d978","cb78f60b587b2a9a13515bad46728e2fd48b5edc8565a221a4be5a49ced58e3a","84cfffd8b170c458e9fd1f937758338e77952052a138c7c60120dc1e8ee9c412","f7b3a7bb9ad97a828da3323273c2deac8004729d61d7f2c7a25185dd92d4eb66","623edfeb67c2d41b2b9e147012100dce2f709456a108863b11db12637e74c692","972c89243ea25b912af8179a8be8c77ab6d50347dd064fa94fff2d9d947bbd4b","022031e640f79d734e0c0078695b4546709c7cc0e2d4b09f740c852d83464850","90739a9b5718a75a6036a95b91a37f44f1e9aef38922942dfe97f431acb1a425","6c4b79aee2df9417fdcf7ff053d8ed2a9ea25e31efedf31e6292500ff9c4b627","8a2054446422db10127b53522c244dd671006eed469081cd46119e9103434846","09696b54939497a8ca2ba620420c03c7479c8446d64fb680ae1962b6d211066f","c002616492b1923e46d6fa95a25dac7944411eca88ccdcee2199f265ed726678","dcfe2bb2be026f64206f96633b2eaa49b0a134a719d3c6657eb778d6d91f60fc","7214a41ef6b3a6543614b5ce4a212e0ee33d96928abcf4a05d7f6fcbc4e661cf"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[96,119],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2313553.zip::R2-2313553 - Running CR 38304_CR0368_h60 for NES.docx:p96"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313553.zip::R2-2313553 - Running CR 38304_CR0368_h60 for NES.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.1Cell status and cell reservations","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Cell status and cell reservations are indicated in the MIB or SIB1 message as specified in TS 38.331 [3] by means of following fields:","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellBarred (IE type: \"barred\" or \"not barred\") Indicated in MIB message. In case of multiple PLMNs or NPNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs and NPNs. This field is ignored by UEs supporting NTN while cellBarredNTN is included in SIB1. This field is ignored by NES capable UEs while cellBarredNES is included in SIB1.","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellBarredNES (IE type: \"not barred\")Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs or NPNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs and NPNs. This field is only applicable to NES-capable UEs.","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellBarredNTN (IE type: \"barred\" or \"not barred\")Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs. This field is ignored if the UE does not support NTN connectivity.","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellBarredRedCap1Rx (IE type: \"barred\" or \"not barred\")Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs or NPNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs and NPNs. This field is only applicable to RedCap UEs.","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellBarredRedCap2Rx (IE type: \"barred\" or \"not barred\")Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs or NPNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs and NPNs. This field is only applicable to RedCap UEs.","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellReservedForOperatorUse (IE type: \"reserved\" or \"not reserved\") Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs or NPNs indicated in SIB1, this field is specified per PLMN or per SNPN.","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellReservedForOtherUse (IE type: \"true\") Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs.","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellReservedForFutureUse (IE type: \"true\") Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs or NPNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs and NPNs.","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0:IAB-MT ignores the cellBarred, cellReservedForOperatorUse, cellReservedForFutureUse, and intraFreqReselection (i.e. treats intraFreqReselection as if it was set to allowed) as defined in TS 38.331 [3]. IAB-MT also ignores cellReservedForOtherUse for cell barring determination (i.e. NPN capable IAB-MT considers cellReservedForOtherUse for determination of an NPN-only cell) as defined in TS 38.331 [3].","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-halfDuplexRedCapAllowed (IE type: \"true\")Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs or NPNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs and NPNs. This field is only applicable to RedCap UEs.","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-iab-Support (IE type: \"true\")Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs or NPNs indicated in SIB1, this field is specified per PLMN or per SNPN.","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When cell status is indicated as \"not barred\" and \"not reserved\" for operator use and not \"true\" for other use and not \"true\" for future use,","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-UEs shall treat this cell as candidate during the cell selection and cell reselection procedures.","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When cell broadcasts any CAG-IDs or NIDs and the cell status is indicated as \"not barred\" and \"not reserved\" for operator use and \"true\" for other use, and not \"true\" for future use:","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-All NPN-capable UEs shall treat this cell as candidate during the cell selection and cell reselection procedures, other UEs shall treat this cell as if cell status is \"barred\".","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When cell status is indicated as \"true\" for other use, and either cell does not broadcast any CAG-IDs or NIDs or does not broadcast any CAG-IDs and the UE is not operating in SNPN Access Mode,","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-The UE shall treat this cell as if cell status is \"barred\".","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When cell status is indicated as \"true\" for future use,","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-The UE shall treat this cell as if cell status is \"barred\".","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When cellBarredNES is absent and cellBarred is set to \"barred\",","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-The UE shall treat this cell as if cell status is \"barred\".","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When cellBarredNTN is not broadcast in this cell,","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"7151fcbc7e900c013fbd0727f6f458823df19ac33e354f632323a463c862d10e","original_member_sha256":"9be80f761ab1a5a8e2b40c9ef13f4aa84d7d70b3c6af4a740de3e81f68b17102","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ce3b2d486ac31edfa9fe75ee7d2cd8f2485decc896779fe3177ee0451661ef13","479ef53a82fc4fd4372eeeacc5749a52a03ae95cccc63684531e21dea917778f","4ba430c1206f8a46dd003576287e9e8d86e4efea4b6edfe7ad22c519accfcde1","565299b59ecfdc1aedd23151cf4d589ab5eb064bdcca929fbefa40098f62ad0d","232efffccbe67d54e6a930c36b496c4966f29950b067608ec907831a53467528","c7ed53c74d664c78eecd18bf190048736ebbd29afa728868dbf10c7ad8fc587c","5f3bdcab16aa01ec2d6609c8edb4a68bf3783dbab60b0577d7c5b8aae497b200","e9a7632638a6bd06d72b400e8203662be7a6eee6a79926b4d4238e9d9cf829c7","51e0c2317be09295016e48e25074321f2ae4ba0644f8ec16cb1929bdecf91d96","61e7410778951bcf91b5afa117a3f2c14aba8c0116e941b0995d52f6db2d26ea","6ec5b17509a4c18e563dee690374d10948be05db8ab0de0198a2e1d82bf580ee","d6c7ce7bc6b5d869688f494f8b9d0e98b92b4d623817c3f65a043331c4683977","909f321e5f5ba7b35ead5dddc97baf063697a870d90470b82b3baf12c9c11ff1","39ef102fcde789810d4b3423c19d735c39fa954fbc7988dfafb7b1ff6b19c0a7","b5ef7fd7a54d46dfa89e25d8672a204eaff94d3ed84c33d222fb8b6beca7ec87","30f50a3ade4fdebedc5cff23a3f71f544fa7c709645fbdc382e0fbfacb746881","282828a66f4e1f4ebfc943d4ac6eea9b3dda262828f662036e6c2a2063fdc2e2","f701d48806356b5c6a69d199876d22178896cabb515bc2e94dd6859602a4f5ca","be8c7560c3f79248f66419b80ffa2123cf4588b3b6796cb6592d640d82adf9ac","fd22fd7f05c89e12d86f33f39578de94bdae1336488f7d1740dca1219fe27bd6","a385ca657451a37ac43007dba16a895c90aea5b8fa5a9f191f3c34942cd3d15a","94359879e719d19f1677bd798231bce5c5e189d4cd29ca65347d4efd13caa782","57ba1eb2eb12458a1c5b233ff53d7c6e039acfd1d8d8fb0bc8a645a1470d3cfa","b28004d9db09b395446631f43fdf7a6a2ca2a43714433c28e1bfc981998153e7"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[120,143],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2313553.zip::R2-2313553 - Running CR 38304_CR0368_h60 for NES.docx:p120"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313553.zip::R2-2313553 - Running CR 38304_CR0368_h60 for NES.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-For NTN access, the UE shall treat this cell as if cell status is \"barred\".","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When halfDuplexRedCapAllowed is not broadcast in this cell,","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-The RedCap UE only capable of operating in half-duplex for FDD shall treat this cell as if cell status is \"barred\".","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When cell status is indicated as \"not barred\" and \"reserved\" for operator use for any PLMN/SNPN and not \"true\" for other use and not \"true\" for future use,","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-UEs assigned to Access Identity 11 or 15 operating in their HPLMN/EHPLMN shall treat this cell as candidate during the cell selection and reselection procedures if the field cellReservedForOperatorUse for that PLMN set to \"reserved\".","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-UEs assigned to Access Identity 11 or 15 shall treat this cell as candidate during the cell selection and reselection procedures if the field cellReservedForOperatorUse for selected/registered SNPN is set to \"reserved\".","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-UEs assigned to an Access Identity 0, 1, 2 and 12 to 14 shall behave as if the cell status is \"barred\" in case the cell is \"reserved for operator use\" for the registered PLMN/SNPN or the selected PLMN/SNPN.","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-UEs assigned to Access Identity 3 shall behave as if the cell status is \"barred\" in case the cell is \"reserved for operator use\" for the registered PLMN or the selected PLMN.","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Access Identities 11, 15 are only valid for use in the HPLMN/ EHPLMN and registered/selected SNPN; Access Identities 12, 13, 14 are only valid for use in the home country and registered/selected SNPN as specified in TS 22.261 [12].","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1a:Access Identity 3 is only valid for PLMNs that indicate to potential Disaster Inbound Roamers that the UEs can access the PLMN as specified in TS 22.261 [12].","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor's Note: A NES-capable UE in the cell barring context is at least UE supporting cell DTX/DRX.  FFS if other NES features will need to be included only if legacy impact is found.   FFS how we capture it in the CR in terms of wording.","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When cell status \"barred\" is indicated or to be treated as if the cell status is \"barred\",","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-The UE is not permitted to select/reselect this cell, not even for emergency calls.","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-The UE shall select another cell according to the following rule:","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-If the cell is to be treated as if the cell status is \"barred\" due to being unable to acquire the MIB:","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE may exclude the barred cell as a candidate for cell selection/reselection for up to 300 seconds.","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE may select another cell on the same frequency if the selection criteria are fulfilled.","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-else:","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-If the UE is a RedCap UE, the UE shall acquire SIB1 and, in the remainder of this procedure, consider 'intraFreqReselection in MIB' to be 'intraFreqReselectionRedCap in SIB1', if available.","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-If the cell is to be treated as if the cell status is \"barred\" due to being unable to acquire the SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE may exclude the barred cell as a candidate for cell selection/reselection for up to 300 seconds.","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE may select another cell on the same frequency if the selection criteria are fulfilled.","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-If the cell status \"barred\" is indicated in MIB but the UE is unable to acquire the SIB1; or","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-If the cell is to be treated as if the cell status is \"barred\" due to not supporting RedCap UEs:","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"7151fcbc7e900c013fbd0727f6f458823df19ac33e354f632323a463c862d10e","original_member_sha256":"9be80f761ab1a5a8e2b40c9ef13f4aa84d7d70b3c6af4a740de3e81f68b17102","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b78d35dd5c0537d1cad5f8e595fcf57aff40813d39bfa18fc0496d8e6b90f278","e616016c5b87559495ef9dc31f6dcc0659db94fe86c29eb4b349178ac7cc3a72","65fb443700a3191b97ce33c39b92bbe7fbab74b609243f715b467011d8f26946","6fadcae1e36796bc54530ce068f3d231ab855404cdfaa98d10dde52d5947d647","a01fc6255978c582fa0aef84b1968dc76749e444b9c615ee24f92daec6050522","30a1b0bce8261db949a3d6fd49a3445f1f12bd489e8c64f1b9625f7478d177be","174454e89bc7d6ff03014f1dc72ff31aae8ffbb69b2b013bea21bb4b5eea9b4c","93569e5a320d6c1563b257bf60b49f2b32bbf1e74f8e03ffc419b72993f8b65e","91db2f154c00bcfcd556b8594d0e3a56bdf4b8e98424ee131f09db47023aa00f","31e2d075f80b3a1d1479e01373e9b379de0378bc826ca3dc83d5049d4b2e4d16","8050c571d238ec141537f6c8813e6a69bae0a8b84eff2d952ca6dc59232abd80","bd9c5920fb33ae414244a6be462eff9f1fe59da203a36808c5fd85e38945b030","69a7542e7146ea5922ff31e1cfc411d0d9fc55adc4252107cc340e96e1b93fad","adfee85528b98898e02f088e6776737c8f630ebd8bd138aca222263fdd251962","a710189d00e8b43bcbeba2b9e75ad90229d72f3390a17dfde1d6549411b7424d","bc1ba8c20ea77525e8097483b1ecf305694af8aed9fb233bbcff25a9053362b9","e403a03e3a56066d7c4fb1986542f6231146c74c02188e826d88f5ab81f73786","2c5f1133af5f7ce18ac963fe38cded0d8a15b9041df6ed5b56234a69145b7a41","dcb18a1feeacf07cfe6c02922b9acc43830f52b89cd6f993ed3168d89759662f","95b81cf991d3a741c8cecb9514524c47ce54b236b0d94e0d42fd1b3e678f196e","2d7f4e2e0d3e55a66b8ec64132ebec94008856cf3b5fc8e9bcab67997f1b69a1","80a5620dcbfe7fbcdb1a811b04e8edadab1c95cac1fca776ba0b705e56391269","ef86bf3236ee4480d7ea885d57dcb2326977148f06fac1af4e6912585a17b491","24f06243a2ce993b827d0a0103323b12b91bbc329e48b2204be8dbda6e8703f0"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[144,167],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2313553.zip::R2-2313553 - Running CR 38304_CR0368_h60 for NES.docx:p144"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313553.zip::R2-2313553 - Running CR 38304_CR0368_h60 for NES.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE shall exclude the barred cell as a candidate for cell selection/reselection for 300 seconds.","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE may select another cell on the same frequency if re-selection criteria are fulfilled.","paragraph_zero_based":169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-If the UE is not a RedCap UE, or if the UE is a RedCap UE and intraFreqReselectionRedCap in SIB1 is available:","paragraph_zero_based":170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-If the field intraFreqReselection in MIB message is set to \"allowed\":","paragraph_zero_based":171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE may select another cell on the same frequency if re-selection criteria are fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-If the cell is to be treated as if the cell status is \"barred\" due to being unable to acquire the SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE may exclude the barred cell as a candidate for cell selection/reselection for up to 300 seconds;","paragraph_zero_based":174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-else:","paragraph_zero_based":175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE shall exclude the barred cell as a candidate for cell selection/reselection for 300 seconds.","paragraph_zero_based":176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-If the field intraFreqReselection in MIB message is set to \"not allowed\":","paragraph_zero_based":177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-If the cell is to be treated as if the cell status is \"barred\" due to being unable to acquire the SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE may exclude the barred cell as a candidate for cell selection/reselection for up to 300 seconds;","paragraph_zero_based":179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-If the cell operates in licensed spectrum:","paragraph_zero_based":180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE shall not re-select to another cell on the same frequency as the barred cell and exclude such cell(s) as candidate(s) for cell selection/reselection for 300 seconds;","paragraph_zero_based":181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-else:","paragraph_zero_based":182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE may select to another cell on the same frequency if the reselection criteria are fulfilled.","paragraph_zero_based":183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-else:","paragraph_zero_based":184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-If the cell operates in licensed spectrum, or if this cell belongs to a PLMN which is indicated as being equivalent to the registered PLMN or the selected PLMN of the UE, or if this cell belongs to the registered SNPN or the selected SNPN of the UE:","paragraph_zero_based":185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE shall not re-select to another cell on the same frequency as the barred cell and exclude such cell(s) as candidate(s) for cell selection/reselection for 300 seconds;","paragraph_zero_based":186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-else:","paragraph_zero_based":187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE may select to another cell on the same frequency if the reselection criteria are fulfilled.","paragraph_zero_based":188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE shall exclude the barred cell as a candidate for cell selection/reselection for 300 seconds.","paragraph_zero_based":189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The cell selection of another cell may also include a change of RAT.","paragraph_zero_based":190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:If barring of a cell is triggered by the condition of trackingAreaCode and trackingAreaList not being provided, as specified in TS 38.331 [3], the barring only applies to this PLMN and the UE can re-evaluate the barring condition again due to selection of another PLMN.","paragraph_zero_based":191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"7151fcbc7e900c013fbd0727f6f458823df19ac33e354f632323a463c862d10e","original_member_sha256":"9be80f761ab1a5a8e2b40c9ef13f4aa84d7d70b3c6af4a740de3e81f68b17102","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["aa816416f57637623c6683c909887243d9bed3c9cbd9549d0558b2d0a2b899c4","7f70b5cc324792807d2787a6b3128709fa005f32a73b4f0bcb045498410b8353","89f3aadbdebd42c6f1bc109506a67fd2e3947cb854694c4a6f5c6e7a77283cff","3e74d2a6f2c0a1b45e698e8ef1a627eeab7594f95d214bbb409bd9f250e701e5","b632a526aaacdc740efc941bdb569619943c7e859c4fc7cf0510c3e99c0dcd75","6970048383fe3931a701d92bbeb36318715a4e642a3ce65a3cbea159410ed921","a84aed378c575058bf6c00c9d7540e7f430885673e8d4615d41b796eefbae51e","e764df0517e0f20fcac1d1c3621344f158c37c90b95fc963b82b0266a3f39187","b4d393ad1ca45849193e0ade9dff832b9cfb1ca0be2a89e86a28db9c80963024","8b874af9f35c5cdc05bad738419f98237fa38e18aa658efbbaa28ec668706c42","d46f213fe8f6270f4596be4e60f7f06bedde96bb82eb857f5cb3e5cd75a42818","77507914de6fd28dc9f27ef39b7af13c4df36d1743b879538161322f1826c346","c41dd5f7cdf50d06caaeb5d8af3ad8784c4ef1996c4aed11deac5e7f268a766a","46f6812a147e17393bc732d9dc47babafe0894281c32177fe306d0d99c5295a9","50df3204c28fba7b49e4e48ffde4eb5664e0f7c0a72c14da5cabea3d10eab18d","e2fae334a1271afd2d41e1fd8ef1c6094e71901a2bc94b9ad33b9bf1419834d0","8d1372666a7d406fdd3afcf40777ff4089bacfe9f638aff3478fc63c09efa808","59159f5e7ae157420389f8fe62c307f9da2405160313cb800fb9cc57394a1162","0b5b9b75e6305e123a7de35ba227dcf3a4531f51877be2668a9fd3b4cd44c5ff","2d9de523dd4b536ca08aa0bbb0ed8a943e27da94fdc6290f06ca39144315adb6","20812438382d6e31c672115e68ac89fc7e771cda6f7a0d68e4aba51d455fd14f","b48bfe206438c823738f3bb0e37e64cd0d6113f141bbc743fd58a96bca1ce293","0b21ca6baac8d8c367119142bd8686dc076f7b7c9bf6c23510b99c2ec13ffe69","ed499f4fd6f350965c1dce5b0e514c12692533