ta Transmission","paragraph_zero_based":380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SFNSystem Frame Number","paragraph_zero_based":381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SFTDSFN and Frame Timing Difference","paragraph_zero_based":382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SISystem Information","paragraph_zero_based":383}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["696e846714647b1a4f60ea22b6e3ec5b3143e9fc498eef7822cfd43a535bcbac","c848759abc059f92b767c4f09b58005b4c4f21dbffccb832182cfe668c4de212","0caa4246c060b3e2fef18796ae88ac569cd48f83ffda5fec4e8ee54e2a70065e","afde84543a92188e89252e979e92d64afeeb7bf986e751e4372b2481ffc9001d","94cd52124df0ef24aa1d7199d01f95cfa9d949ac50076d194aa8b8bf70efd6c1","af8889065e3c616784bf2c5ac3bbba6d526cc8cf5898de19ee9f291025b5f061","21bd71e67619645196dcc412170e6573a38f798b3ff38a5f8b1dd8768cde1872","27b280afd7bcb4e814831768b9991391bd1e750140b700424ee47bf26386b5c0","2c811945460fd41269b9b85776f64dc9b20fdea768c89475bf053072d0b305b6","9666def55803a10f205b7c6d41488adbdd7816dc795bdb06d243f662770cbefc","b8e91778d62a3f89c551ba647832f47b261561c8e7859d3436aa3b61aa47f8ab","22fd12d4268f2a522dda9334285e31a18cbb949c4b63949e21a1ee993db6bff1","6bd5e6106df27d0927f9694ad644e09ecd546c8adce1680e51a026d965490265","ae68d36838787630444c44ca61b9d0c173b44cdb6ae4de76e529b35b2ffda353","beca50a3a826c19d00fa792ecbdaaeff15d69b7ec23dc1fa0f81b8fb41486724","8d30e6084519527c20708d622c11922a7a28d13094944ac598911f88f394ff31","4d0455b784caffb2b9c17b6139c5ac68c448b7fcd445e085a01dbc05dad85587","7a7f4cacb342c92d07456dbc06eae3ffd8b2ac4b3b828cc85b7e4eab56612e07","7c7c44510e9c3643ed9aa736f992486203a33e647159712098a61a57c642c2c6","3d9e57184cb0eee2a3038bc06da42b1a30af4c386cf77f004b630753e853cc