{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for the SI message(s) that, according to the si-SchedulingInfo, contain at least one required SIB and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to broadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for the SI message(s) that, according to the si-SchedulingInfo, contain at least one required SIB and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>trigger a request to acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE has a stored valid version of a posSIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required posSIB(s), in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>use the stored version of the required posSIB;","paragraph_zero_based":893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> if the UE has not stored a valid version of a posSIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several posSIB(s) in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for the SI message(s) that, according to the posSI-SchedulingInfo, contain at least one requested posSIB and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus is set to broadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":895},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":896},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for the SI message(s) that, according to the posSI-SchedulingInfo, contain at least one requested posSIB for which posSI-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":897},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>trigger a request to acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.3a;","paragraph_zero_based":898},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is aerial UE and it supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission values in nr-NS-PmaxListAerial within frequencyBandListAerial in uplinkConfigCommon for FDD or in downlinkConfigCommon for TDD:","paragraph_zero_based":899},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in nr-NS-PmaxListAerial within frequencyBandListAerial in uplinkConfigCommon for FDD or in downlinkConfigCommon for TDD;","paragraph_zero_based":900},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":901},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in NR-NS-PmaxList within frequencyBandList in uplinkConfigCommon for FDD or in downlinkConfigCommon for TDD;","paragraph_zero_based":902},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the additionalPmax is present in the same entry of the selected additionalSpectrumEmission within NR-NS-PmaxList or nr-NS-PmaxListAerial:","paragraph_zero_based":903},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the additionalPmax for UL;","paragraph_zero_based":904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the p-Max in uplinkConfigCommon for UL;","paragraph_zero_based":906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if supplementaryUplink is present in servingCellConfigCommon; and","paragraph_zero_based":907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE supports one or more of the frequency bands indicated in the frequencyBandList for the supplementaryUplink; and","paragraph_zero_based":908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission in the NR-NS-PmaxList for a supported supplementary uplink band; and","paragraph_zero_based":909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE supports an uplink channel bandwidth with a maximum transmission bandwidth configuration (see TS 38.101-1 [15] and TS 38.101-2 [39]) which","paragraph_zero_based":910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is smaller than or equal to the carrierBandwidth (indicated in supplementaryUplink for the SCS of the initial uplink BWP), and which","paragraph_zero_based":911}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["33428b2e2c08c864edcedc4d7e2812685c4de823d8d6e8896447e6e49d35845e","857417c50a8af380ecac90b421e20d3198b1adf6df60e98068a5b94c5d57892d","ae5d6787fbe5d8227f70cab659b997fe586795fdf0d9566e566a618689ac73db","81e62bc18b9a43c88623472b08c4007664a1b004893be24a67e148bb7363c124","e3dd7b537d65489d883b69954cd572b7c5744ffef1bea473fd5e2288c0369177","a039d6f61f3debafcab85286da53e0d17d0eadd26399523f2137c17a37aad85f","0071c7aebe8974110a5738a482a9e2aaecf1c47e8ecf7614eafdc53f8fb5275b","a706854d9b2ecedbeba39e96fb31e85aa8826b2b344ed32b34557e4ae11f0605","bf8e820cad843141c638172e308887252b7b2fb1dfe3c16eab1292520efeb812","ece3db8e3c2d5740bf01fb481d5d7dc3ab15e4cb979ce1c7facaeac48d02caf9","0d7f0c330b3b37d6eb0dc1dfb90b0dcd1c8523c39e1385982426e29eedb87b0b","ccd165724a0f8e26e29b9ababc0d89d972e6083e67d28ae4673373a09c8ba554","05f6425ee9c72111ed2a23783a038061c020d76c27f0622c107215979a0421ad","bd7e8d6c0f3198038f20abfeac97897eb736c2b0e70dca3e2728a1aab5c19249","2565c294f5eca34c532daef00cfa8f7608dd1b1fc9049b4383e064c7facc95a7","7b07d8173c2ab84f2f562151aab7af1805dc9e1e96dfdf1e791d4945b4694a9b","663b8c883c2f10301895668de1e1bcc7ff2b330b52b2fb77c998602d558ccd24","8e1c4a32cdc413f58855d533d0265364277e0e5c278472091b87e10785d3b533","50eef7fe7120ba8577483f606f754442996147becad96cae3460312f2c4b1550","610cc556d33a8f6b25c9adc7890da6dd745e6955574b57e72cddd8285dea8ad6","0b1009086c901ea3269610709b315864bb8f399c1903325fc85beb3a3b69446c","b012f1f12b8aa4feb85e7bc86bfd65119538e7a9cf0353a55ab07e76df757c2c","56a945a103a911886a4a56cd5823e71945761168a381ac7c4fbce93c4cd11b17","e6f682bc8aec5604fdb5be74761d814d2d0782faf7f11a6bc0792cfcef093669"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[888,911],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx:p888"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is wider than or equal to the bandwidth of the initial uplink BWP of the SUL:","paragraph_zero_based":912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider supplementary uplink as configured in the serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>select the first frequency band in the frequencyBandList for the supplementaryUplink which the UE supports and for which the UE supports at least one of the additionalSpectrumEmission values in nr-NS-PmaxList, if present;","paragraph_zero_based":914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply a supported supplementary uplink channel bandwidth with a maximum transmission bandwidth which","paragraph_zero_based":915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is contained within the carrierBandwidth (indicated in supplementaryUplink for the SCS of the initial uplink BWP), and which","paragraph_zero_based":916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is wider than or equal to the bandwidth of the initial BWP of the SUL;","paragraph_zero_based":917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in NR-NS-PmaxList within frequencyBandList for the supplementaryUplink;","paragraph_zero_based":918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the additionalPmax is present in the same entry of the selected additionalSpectrumEmission within NR-NS-PmaxList for the supplementaryUplink:","paragraph_zero_based":919},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>apply the additionalPmax in supplementaryUplink for SUL;","paragraph_zero_based":920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>apply the p-Max in supplementaryUplink for SUL;","paragraph_zero_based":922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:For an out of coverage L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE receiving SIB1 from its connected L2 U2N Relay UE, it is up to Remote UE implementation whether to consider and apply the following parameters: frequencyBandList, carrierBandwidth, frequencyShift7p5khz, frequency band, channel bandwidth, the configuration included in the servingCellConfigCommon, the specified PCCH configuration, additionalSpectrumEmission, additionalPmax, and p-Max.","paragraph_zero_based":923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20]; and","paragraph_zero_based":925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform barring as if intraFreqReselection, or intraFreqReselectionRedCap for RedCap UEs, is set to notAllowed;","paragraph_zero_based":926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.3Actions upon reception of SIB2","paragraph_zero_based":927},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB2, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE or in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if, for the entry in frequencyBandList with the same index as the frequency band selected in clause 5.2.2.4.2, the UE supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission in the NR-NS-PmaxList within the frequencyBandList; or","paragraph_zero_based":930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if, for the entry in frequencyBandListAerial with the same index as the frequency band selected in clause 5.2.2.4.2, the UE supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission in the nr-Ns-PmaxListAerial within the frequencyBandListAerial:","paragraph_zero_based":931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is aerial UE and it supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission values in nr-NS-PmaxListAerial within the frequencyBandListAerial:","paragraph_zero_based":932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in nr-NS-PmaxListAerial within frequencyBandListAerial;","paragraph_zero_based":933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in NR-NS-PmaxList within frequencyBandList;","paragraph_zero_based":935}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5c71323693a309fe147337084cc903fe8f4f49a45dc60671ca0a2b8807270a2f","b84c90c5f4244a3fe08d18ab3f0e8f0d15498a137f34acd62b110a9a957c5fe6","7c81b5316e00ca043fbf209e46715555f5f666f8312b907f1b799bf19c593d0e","6e0147923f8f70d4316980d766b8fa6c8c2cb25253e23fb73c57d4e27711358e","34c0353e7a3cf51791365b123db62710acf099c6f456912bf17bc2086d7c1e5c","da11e114aaaf631a36657a9293e1532e5f7eb6427d4ed4bc5596efc5f55cbafd","6d61800c8ac80880c873c26933b0844459648a4b71626b625f882ac3dc81b1cd","d451eca25636115a288ced5dbab8462e4ebeeb7f3d0264038a6adaee7983974c","53607e855378dcd846e2e44bb00c798a0087fd4241ac64f747315eb771284ef1","80799f4ba9947b1e5cb32d05b1ac7eec7689244729440a31ff2ec8802b586376","da615362f332aca5e139a2a63f84b32142fc1e896e6113a58e48222e079be5e8","c67a4ae2db101468959ad8c7a5e0932056814e98611816553cceeb3b4bf7282a","74f5f1b802351c8fecd344557e45bfafa50fe0be06ce7e8c770aeeae07597eee","f8b0d88a6c2c4771efcd0c7d91cb8fbd39b8cc4df1c493acb2ed678a43f3b470","2dcfff46b3f7a4cf63705bcdc409ac2caa4efc0b5e97511c37bc7d8cee6bfe7d","456732957500b63b4fd68c3bde06037f74b8c68cd886fab736e39513ade865c4","80ee63794880fe59cb15dba2a67ea58fccf613d9c5b00b676cacabe588742ed8","4018be5c3d25d98cdd6313973185f8f985206b