{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the additionalPmax is present in the same entry of the selected additionalSpectrumEmission within NR-NS-PmaxList or nr-NS-PmaxListAerial:","paragraph_zero_based":936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the additionalPmax;","paragraph_zero_based":937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the p-Max;","paragraph_zero_based":939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE selects a frequency band (from the procedure in clause 5.2.2.4.2) for the supplementary uplink:","paragraph_zero_based":940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if, for the entry in frequencyBandListSUL with the same index as the frequency band selected in clause 5.2.2.4.2, the UE supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission in the NR-NS-PmaxList within the frequencyBandListSUL:","paragraph_zero_based":941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in NR-NS-PmaxList within frequencyBandListSUL;","paragraph_zero_based":942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the additionalPmax is present in the same entry of the selected additionalSpectrumEmission within NR-NS-PmaxList:","paragraph_zero_based":943},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>apply the additionalPmax;","paragraph_zero_based":944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>apply the p-Max;","paragraph_zero_based":946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the p-Max.","paragraph_zero_based":948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the p-Max;","paragraph_zero_based":950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.4Actions upon reception of SIB3","paragraph_zero_based":951},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No UE requirements related to the contents of this SIB3 apply other than those specified elsewhere e.g. within procedures using the concerned system information, and/ or within the corresponding field descriptions.","paragraph_zero_based":952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.5Actions upon reception of SIB4","paragraph_zero_based":953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB4 the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in RRC_IDLE, or in RRC_INACTIVE or in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each entry in the interFreqCarrierFreqList:","paragraph_zero_based":956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is not a RedCap UE; or","paragraph_zero_based":957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is a RedCap UE and the interFreqCarrierFreqList-v1700 is absent; or","paragraph_zero_based":958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is a RedCap UE and redCapAccessAllowed is present in interFreqCarrierFreqList-v1700:","paragraph_zero_based":959}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["08abaaa5b770d127a8c0c151ddb3f8d694773426c7ae9fd13c74697f7557d9d0","8958c573c1fc907286ae8ee8f60b8f8dd4706e25a9fab41c2062c99551225376","fc5643257afef74ce9696b2881d3a6084e629e6ae2fd7d95c02f00d1283218cb","879fd6787a9e88fda0190b05ba5895641413bc4ca475e8f962c4a6dd4c5b056a","325151cb59d56bab739b4995d545ffdf67914923af4204ea5ab38db02f0dcf4b","e66705f4eae5a145f5920ca00c7568ee7fdc869dd56d28f14f716092492a9923","f8906902be4d3281bab3