{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>continue reception of SIB8;","paragraph_zero_based":1032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE should discard warningMessageSegment and warningAreaCoordinatesSegment (if any) and the associated values of messageIdentifier and serialNumber for SIB8 if the complete warning message and the geographical area coordinates (if any) have not been assembled within a period of 3 hours.","paragraph_zero_based":1033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The number of warning messages that a UE can re-assemble simultaneously is a function of UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":1034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.10Actions upon reception of SIB9","paragraph_zero_based":1035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB9 with referenceTimeInfo, the UE may perform the related actions except for the action of ignoring all further referenceTimeInfo received in SIB9 as specified in clause 5.7.1.3.","paragraph_zero_based":1036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.11Actions upon reception of SIB10","paragraph_zero_based":1037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB10, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>Forward the HRNN-list entries with the corresponding PNI-NPN and SNPN identities to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":1039},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.12Actions upon reception of SIB11","paragraph_zero_based":1040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB11, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, and T331 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":1042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions as specified in 5.7.8.1a;","paragraph_zero_based":1043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.13Actions upon reception of SIB12","paragraph_zero_based":1044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB12, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has stored at least one segment of SIB12 and the value tag of SIB12 has changed since a previous segment was stored:","paragraph_zero_based":1046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard all stored segments;","paragraph_zero_based":1047},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>store the segment;","paragraph_zero_based":1048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if all segments have been received:","paragraph_zero_based":1049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>assemble SIB12-IEs from the received segments;","paragraph_zero_based":1050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if sl-FreqInfoList is included in sl-ConfigCommonNR:","paragraph_zero_based":1051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if configured to receive NR sidelink communication:","paragraph_zero_based":1052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>use the resource pool(s) indicated by sl-RxPool for NR sidelink communication reception, as specified in 5.8.7;","paragraph_zero_based":1053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if configured to transmit NR sidelink communication:","paragraph_zero_based":1054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>use the resource pool(s) indicated by sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal, or sl-TxPoolExceptional for NR sidelink communication transmission, as specified in 5.8.8;","paragraph_zero_based":1055}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3ed1db05a4532d70dc54a2fcc789a74108614173f52dde9db6bfa0e6fb2fa925","b42634968199b7bb487d3152a91be91e56a9e1c237cb56952baae8d6d8d81b25","3910e4daa9cfd3edaf6a292fef359