{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the conditionalReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":1560},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform conditional reconfiguration as specified in 5.3.5.13;","paragraph_zero_based":1561},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapsConfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":1562},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapsConfigNR is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1563},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1564},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1565},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1566},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":1567},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapNCSG-ConfigNR is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1568},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1569},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1570},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1571},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":1572},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1573},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of EUTRA target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1574},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1575},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of EUTRA target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1576},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the onDemandSIB-Request:","paragraph_zero_based":1577},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if onDemandSIB-Request is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1578},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to request SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in RRC_CONNECTED in accordance with clause 5.2.2.3.5;","paragraph_zero_based":1579},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1580},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to request SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in RRC_CONNECTED in accordance with clause 5.2.2.3.5;","paragraph_zero_based":1581},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T350, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":1582},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR:","paragraph_zero_based":1583}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["55f4bef9c3888bb72a967d3dbb74322c45e21723c57011dcd9d20731d572601c","92cd7db083c19ccb9209dabee3770a31cebd471764a1900c12494576372110c4","a876ea6a9ad8b8d63c338e1832293d3ca6a4719ab66456514128648cdd95f627","ad075c94b3a159594389edfc5ab8fff402caaa54e2bd0c058e8a37d2bc821a21","44