{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if any DAPS bearer is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>use values for timers T301, T310, T311 and constants N310, N311 for the target cell group, as included in ue-TimersAndConstants received in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":1993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else","paragraph_zero_based":1994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>use values for timers T301, T310, T311 and constants N310, N311, as included in ue-TimersAndConstants received in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":1995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SpCellConfig contains spCellConfigDedicated:","paragraph_zero_based":1996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the SpCell in accordance with the spCellConfigDedicated;","paragraph_zero_based":1997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the bandwidth part indicated in firstActiveUplinkBWP-Id, if included in the spCellConfigDedicated, to be the active uplink bandwidth part;","paragraph_zero_based":1998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the firstActiveDownlinkBWP-Id is included in the spCellConfigDedicated:","paragraph_zero_based":1999},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the SpCellConfig is included in an RRCReconfiguration message contained in an NR or E-UTRA RRC message indicating that the SCG is deactivated:","paragraph_zero_based":2000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider the bandwidth part indicated in firstActiveDownlinkBWP-Id to be the bandwidth part for Radio Link Monitoring, Beam Failure Detection and measurements;","paragraph_zero_based":2001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider the bandwith part indicated in firstActiveDownlinkBWP-Id to be the active downlink bandwidth part;","paragraph_zero_based":2003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if any of the reference signal(s) that are used for radio link monitoring are reconfigured by the received spCellConfigDedicated:","paragraph_zero_based":2004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T310 for the corresponding SpCell, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T312 for the corresponding SpCell, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>reset the counters N310 and N311.","paragraph_zero_based":2007},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the SpCellConfig contains the lowMobilityEvaluationConnected:","paragraph_zero_based":2008},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>the UE may perform the evaluation of the low mobility criterion for this cell group as specified in 5.7.13.1;","paragraph_zero_based":2009},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the SpCellConfig contains the goodServingCellEvaluationRLM:","paragraph_zero_based":2010},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>the UE may perform the evaluation of the good serving cell quality criterion for this SpCell as specified in 5.7.13.2;","paragraph_zero_based":2011},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the SpCellConfig contains the goodServingCellEvaluationBFD:","paragraph_zero_based":2012},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>the UE may perform the evaluation of the good serving cell quality criterion for this serving cell as specified in 5.7.13.2;","paragraph_zero_based":2013},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.8SCell Release","paragraph_zero_based":2014},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2015}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["