{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the release is triggered by reception of the sCellToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2016},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sCellIndex value included in the sCellToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2017},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the current UE configuration includes an SCell with value sCellIndex:","paragraph_zero_based":2018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the SCell.","paragraph_zero_based":2019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.9SCell Addition/Modification","paragraph_zero_based":2020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sCellIndex value included in the sCellToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration (SCell addition):","paragraph_zero_based":2022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>add the SCell, corresponding to the sCellIndex, in accordance with the sCellConfigCommon and sCellConfigDedicated;","paragraph_zero_based":2023},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sCellState is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers to consider the SCell to be in activated state;","paragraph_zero_based":2025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers to consider the SCell to be in deactivated state;","paragraph_zero_based":2027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each measId included in the measIdList within VarMeasConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SCells are not applicable for the associated measurement; and","paragraph_zero_based":2029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the concerned SCell is included in cellsTriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":2030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the concerned SCell from cellsTriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":2031},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SCellConfig contains the goodServingCellEvaluationBFD:","paragraph_zero_based":2032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>the UE may perform the evaluation of the good serving cell quality criterion for this serving cell as specified in 5.7.13.2.","paragraph_zero_based":2033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sCellIndex value included in the sCellToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration (SCell modification):","paragraph_zero_based":2034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>modify the SCell configuration in accordance with the sCellConfigDedicated;","paragraph_zero_based":2035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sCellState is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers to consider the SCell to be in activated state;","paragraph_zero_based":2037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers to consider the SCell to be in deactivated state.","paragraph_zero_based":2039}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9737b1475d34fd490f92d3d00fd9d55a27f1b2570af12d74db97d45442cc3bb4","2f11cdc97ba1de05f2f077423d6d8669ca332b46796e6b6f854ab50891508873","2a8551f287e324f1a400e69f77210b07a6f4c791935307f39948145aab7726ed","166ce0f09919596a333fe26bee7891062456c0e8b7aede33da76e9c338d9a3db","d93ef411c5379274e826bffeff22b8ab383fc06c12184c48