{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SCellConfig contains the goodServingCellEvaluationBFD:","paragraph_zero_based":2040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>the UE may perform the evaluation of the good serving cell quality criterion for this serving cell as specified in 5.7.13.2.","paragraph_zero_based":2041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.10BH RLC channel release","paragraph_zero_based":2042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IAB-node shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each BH-RLC-ChannelID value included in the bh-RLC-ChannelToReleaseList that is part of the current IAB-node configuration within the same cell group (LCH release); or","paragraph_zero_based":2044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each BH-RLC-ChannelID value that is to be released as the result of an SCG release according to 5.3.5.4:","paragraph_zero_based":2045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the RLC entity or entities as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3;","paragraph_zero_based":2046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the corresponding logical channel.","paragraph_zero_based":2047},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.11BH RLC channel addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":2048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For each BH-RLC-ChannelConfig received in the bh-RLC-ChannelToAddModList IE the IAB-node shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the current configuration contains a BH RLC Channel with the received bh-RLC-ChannelID within the same cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":2050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reestablishRLC is received:","paragraph_zero_based":2051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>re-establish the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4];","paragraph_zero_based":2052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the RLC entity or entities in accordance with the received rlc-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the logical channel in accordance with the received mac-LogicalChannelConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":2054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else (a backhaul logical channel with the given BH-RLC-ChannelID was not configured before within the same cell group):","paragraph_zero_based":2055},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish an RLC entity in accordance with the received rlc-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure this MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance to the received mac-LogicalChannelConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":2057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.12Uu Relay RLC channel release","paragraph_zero_based":2058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each Uu-RelayRLC-ChannelID value included in the uu-RelayRLC-ChannelToReleaseList that is part of the current configuration within the same cell group (LCH release):","paragraph_zero_based":2060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3;","paragraph_zero_based":2061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the corresponding logical channel.","paragraph_zero_based":2062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.13Uu Relay RLC channel addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":2063}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5d9cb768ffb66459f06aaa6e43031400bbd071d542860f116613329cf6bc3e87","ba87f24d244