{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:In the context above, \"the UE configuration\" includes state variables and parameters of each radio bearer.","paragraph_zero_based":2376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if T304 of a secondary cell group expires:","paragraph_zero_based":2377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if MCG transmission is not suspended:","paragraph_zero_based":2378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release dedicated preambles provided in rach-ConfigDedicated, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release dedicated msgA PUSCH resources provided in rach-ConfigDedicated, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the SCG failure information procedure as specified in clause 5.7.3 to report SCG reconfiguration with sync failure, upon which the RRC reconfiguration procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":2381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is in NR-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":2383},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the connection re-establishment procedure as specified in clause 5.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":2384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (the UE is in (NG) EN-DC):","paragraph_zero_based":2385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the connection re-establishment procedure as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":2386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if T304 expires when RRCReconfiguration is received via other RAT (HO to NR failure):","paragraph_zero_based":2387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset MAC;","paragraph_zero_based":2388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions defined for this failure case as defined in the specifications applicable for the other RAT.","paragraph_zero_based":2389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:In this clause, the term 'handover failure' has been used to refer to 'reconfiguration with sync failure'.","paragraph_zero_based":2390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.9Other configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2391},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the delayBudgetReportingConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if delayBudgetReportingConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to send delay budget reports in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to send delay budget reports and stop timer T342, if running.","paragraph_zero_based":2397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the overheatingAssistanceConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if overheatingAssistanceConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2399}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["769cf59e81c8bece3100bdaef3a114b46af6a247e4b7fd9962473f8bb841ed6d","3d39eb7c68a9cd6c07e6f1cc0f452d3821b16c2eb40857ead17c92b5b78ff92b","40fd7afc52776e47e8a129467c002661a5be7c8f5bf7f84ed160cdb1646bb2ea","270c52dc0e43462876ea90f6979adf5ec8486446bda803a1d63e554b6f8570f6","70729cdf24735688d29bfe7ebab4ac4ef719b3186587bee9bae391edd03fdb85","ed395296289a61eb283