{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide its preference on the maximum number of secondary component carriers for power saving for the cell group and stop timer T346c associated with the cell group, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2424},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2425},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2426},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide its preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers for power saving for the cell group in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2427},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if otherConfig includes maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceConfigFR2-2:","paragraph_zero_based":2428},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider itself to be configured to provide its preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers for FR2-2 for power saving for the cell group in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2429},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2430},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide its preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers for power saving for the cell group and stop timer T346d associated with the cell group, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2431},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2432},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2433},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide its preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling for power saving for the cell group in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2434},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if otherConfig includes minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceConfigExt:","paragraph_zero_based":2435},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider itself to be configured to provide its preference on the minimum scheduling offset for 480 kHz SCS and/or 960 kHz SCS for cross-slot scheduling for power saving for the cell group in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2436},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2437},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide its preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling for power saving for the cell group and stop timer T346e associated with the cell group, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2438},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the releasePreferenceConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2439},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if releasePreferenceConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2440},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide assistance information to transition out of RRC_CONNECTED in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2441},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2442},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide assistance information to transition out of RRC_CONNECTED and stop timer T346f, if running.","paragraph_zero_based":2443},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the obtainCommonLocation:","paragraph_zero_based":2444},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include available detailed location information for any subsequent measurement report or any subsequent RLF report and SCGFailureInformation;","paragraph_zero_based":2445},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The UE is requested to attempt to have valid detailed location information available whenever sending a measurement report for which it is configured to include available detailed location information. The UE may not succeed e.g. because the user manually disabled the GPS hardware, due to no/poor satellite coverage. Further details, e.g. regarding when to activate GNSS, are up to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":2446},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the btNameList:","paragraph_zero_based":2447}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["18981e8790bc98e81c81cfab33a8ef7cfe39948f62411e67496d3f143ded5bcd","2cb80c2362423808eeacfa6993d54d2a904287f2f5d791f82942a33186ab3789","7e5dfb35ab40188cf8418fb574a7feeac7d3f22483c66449fc0d7c6304c0124c","fe049ad52a6a9dbdae6867c6379d63be4654ae76bb5f2cae090426267f3cb5b0","dd90481291dfcb9e0a8cfdcbe31de4642366dde0c94f99dfba8ae0e616dc64c6","5c7fc6b85bc7fa0add06f495568013c9e7955aed5821e7638f1f28222191cd73","c66be1b2e862afa034720428463afca702fdf85c59970e77886c11068e4eff3e","b44b7b0b953d52317ae11f29e453b07af42a9f5f4d5dcd7a9a1a8ca73da09a58","71223425caec8bc7771e16a5433cd44fcc3981af1fbd53b8f43acbe07c67d77f","65750204645b718f94c69b74125191360578087caa8eba3031356304c136e4f3","d8178823a26e496b78fe13a0b851020e36e0abf13e86e702a1ca7a2b1b370808","783d771f7c24289b8fc728fda846d27eba58748b44ee7ee0671b0f2d004189ea","ef4b228c143d5f7431139c81b69c7304fd500686ddee32fe21cf005196a14b50","51f3fa4346e094a1c9f77f4332858ed7406f208269d15da4e867dafc24255b69","eccada7fb15adfc46844833ee4e7fa5778b6b555667438614e5c5121fed57b50","d441c6954322b58316c1836c83d17a0af64f4ba49dc478c313b053534d6a40c1","cd4be197e4713179897c9512764cf4fd434b77418f83064d7