tup:","paragraph_zero_based":2484},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to report the relaxation state of BFD measurements in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2485},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2486},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to report the relaxation state of BFD measurements and stop timer T346k associated with the cell group, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2487},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the scg-DeactivationPreferenceConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2488},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the scg-DeactivationPreferenceConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2489},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide its SCG deactivation preference in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2490},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2491},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide its SCG deactivation preference and stop timer T346i, if running.","paragraph_zero_based":2492},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the propDelayDiffReportConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2493},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the propDelayDiffReportConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2494},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and neighbour cell(s) in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2495}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["