{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and neighbour cell(s).","paragraph_zero_based":2497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the rrm-MeasRelaxationReportingConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the rrm-MeasRelaxationReportingConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to report the fulfilment of the criterion for relaxing RRM measurements in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to report the fulfilment of the criterion for relaxing RRM measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":2502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the uav-FlightPathAvailabilityConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2503},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider itself to be configured to indicate the availability of flight path information in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2504},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.9aMUSIM gap configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2505},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2506},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if musim-GapConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2507},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each musim-GapId included in the received musim-GapToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2508},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the periodic MUSIM gap configuration associated with the musim-GapId;","paragraph_zero_based":2509},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each MUSIM-Gap included in the received musim-GapToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2510},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>setup periodic MUSIM gap configuration indicated by the MUSIM-Gap in accordance with the received musim-GapRepetitionAndOffset (providing musim-GapRepetition and Offset value for the following condition) i.e. the first subframe of each periodic MUSIM gap occurs at an SFN and subframe of the NR PCell meeting the following condition:","paragraph_zero_based":2511},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SFN mod T = FLOOR(Offset/10);","paragraph_zero_based":2512},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subframe = Offset mod 10;","paragraph_zero_based":2513},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"with T = musim-GapRepetition/10;","paragraph_zero_based":2514},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if musim-AperiodicGap is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2515},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>setup aperiodic MUSIM gap configuration indicated by the musim-AperiodicGap in accordance with the received musim-Starting-SFN-AndSubframe, i.e. the first subframe of aperiodic MUSIM gap occurs at an SFN and subframe of the NR PCell meeting the following condition:","paragraph_zero_based":2516},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SFN = starting-SFN;","paragraph_zero_based":2517},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subframe = startingSubframe;","paragraph_zero_based":2518},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if musim-GapConfig is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":2519}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4f87b5bf218d569dfe8654f7298c4e91be13ca55684f9c912a97ad9ceb8297fd","00942e380df1e17d3a94b13b6d4d631b8aa53e7a6d6cab4b