{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the MUSIM gap configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":2520},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.10MR-DC release","paragraph_zero_based":2521},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2522},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>as a result of MR-DC release triggered by E-UTRA or NR:","paragraph_zero_based":2523},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release SRB3, if established, as specified in 5.3.5.6.2;","paragraph_zero_based":2524},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release measConfig associated with SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":2525},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is configured with NR SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":2526},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the SCG configuration as specified in clause 5.3.5.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2527},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release otherConfig associated with the SCG, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timers T346a, T346b, T346c, T346d, T346e, T346j and T346k associated with the SCG, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release bap-Config associated with the SCG, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the BAP entity as specified in TS 38.340 [47], if there is no configured bap-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release iab-IP-AddressConfigurationList associated with the SCG, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the UE is configured with E-UTRA SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":2533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the SCG configuration as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.10.19 to release the E-UTRA SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":2534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.11Full configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2535},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release/ clear all current dedicated radio configurations except for the following:","paragraph_zero_based":2537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the MCG C-RNTI;","paragraph_zero_based":2538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the AS security configurations associated with the master key;","paragraph_zero_based":2539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the SRB1/SRB2 configurations and DRB/multicast MRB configurations as configured by radioBearerConfig or radioBearerConfig2.","paragraph_zero_based":2540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Radio configuration is not just the resource configuration but includes other configurations like MeasConfig. Radio configuration also includes the RLC bearer configurations as configured by RLC-BearerConfig, PC5 Relay RLC channel as configured by SL-RLC-ChannelConfig, and Uu Relay RLC channel as configured by Uu-RelayRLC-ChannelConfig. In case NR-DC or NE-DC is configured, this also includes the entire NR or E-UTRA SCG configuration which are released according to the MR-DC release procedure as specified in 5.3.5.10.","paragraph_zero_based":2541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1a:For NR sidelink communication/discovery, the radio configuration includes the sidelink RRC configuration received from the network, but does not include the sidelink RRC reconfiguration and sidelink UE capability received from other UEs via PC5-RRC. In addition, the UE considers the new NR sidelink configurations as full configuration, in case of state transition and change of system information used for NR sidelink communication/discovery.","paragraph_zero_based":2542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1b:To establish the RLC bearer of SRB(s) after release due to fullConfig, the network can include the srb-Identity within srb-ToAddModList (i.e. the UE applies RLC default configuration) and/or provide rlc-BearerToAddModList of concerned SRB(s) explicitly.","paragraph_zero_based":2543}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f1f582b6999d8963783a9f8f2f72c754c9c06e32723159ce656b1c13c7b486dc","83872e7f66250536bdb067792d47344703eb92f7078f69ca6c2af3d9f191af92","a8c1820de598fac9b7aba73beaf74379e00b1589e13bb78fe5804e10baf439c5","c3da99f6e770337341f2f790a00ce2f78b0dd92b9a85ed97363fdbcc2b829ddb","8a5ef1f4a2fb3007f92736600ce2efa8f786d2725a8ee38e51b63ae4ecc43828","df8ca376675b082f03113887f75ff18c1727b65f9289d5bfcc43f37d48273d78","0d079d082f3206b55b6b9901061a76868d296d9faba9474f3cefe80f61590504","1012feeecee45c804ecb6ab5440d4dabb2711e9ed1fe0ca3c819623dc04e0062","c422aeae1fb03257a1c381edb4037a6fa4cffe6970be83ca34d2951845f0dbcc","1e0a668681a85f070e4f0b369024c3df476ddb0c0254fe5087f3f2f3033b9c58","adc84638b7afbd7ee445224d0a6e594cfa6dd6b386bcbe3514c64fa27eeb34e5","7e8a2fa42a5616238c9fee5ccb95d3f9aeda1887da5f8698525935af26a169b3","ffefa43fbb8960e99c5750c8625be69ba7da2c4ef7f75955b57c9bdfab3df45c","f0a55b1eaca8648c04d232bc2fdeda914c4a5f3e2a5b0e0a0e238c4ac4b32b3a","4ccd8234f169027f5cb09f46893dcc2042924e5f0b56be5f2a4f99d5a3def8a1","0109d2d57015a8c8fc74f956d9ce2a5a3f2741c8b4cead09c95664a3cfc0a277","f3b28a4020973b9d9c13f7ba22ed803b1e8e568558721cdf61d97e87ee767f79","678aaec13ada018e72f8ae54152987515b7ef1a3f948026e50da6fb4bf75fd8b","7c76556addbf0a879a47aae6f9952bc0cab63b2dbec8ed223d534585f924a233","8c4e52935c2e39fb33a0a94b6f6302f9fdead664624f742165ee3af55b986910","730d77a98be1ced6a3928b0c66e3a4994a33d1b24f7527ec85e596f5f5c55277","ff472bb98067340a924f83f9c08fd09dc19c801c5a2afa29c5aca8496ea708a4","78f70969441fa4ceb04b89d35ab319d8deb3f707e51e1212c9309dae7bd884ec","d9319988dca8f55c9130c6556783aa66c5ed8d4ea570d279573060dc10e5f406"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2520,2543],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx:p2520"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the logged measurement configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the spCellConfig in the masterCellGroup includes the reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":2545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release/ clear all current common radio configurations;","paragraph_zero_based":2546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if sl-PathSwitchConfig was included in reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":2547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the default values specified in 9.2.3 for timer T311;","paragraph_zero_based":2548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the default values specified in 9.2.3 for timers T310, T311 and constants N310, N311;","paragraph_zero_based":2550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else (full configuration after re-establishment or during RRC resume):","paragraph_zero_based":2551},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":2552},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use value for timer T311, as included in ue-TimersAndConstants received in SIB1","paragraph_zero_based":2553},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2554},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use values for timers T301, T310, T311 and constants N310, N311, as included in ue-TimersAndConstants received in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2555},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if no measConfigAppLayerId is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2556},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>inform upper layers about the release of all application layer measurement configurations;","paragraph_zero_based":2557},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard any received application layer measurement report from upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":2558},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider itself not to be configured to send application layer measurement report.","paragraph_zero_based":2559},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE at the target side during reconfiguration with sync, or after re-establishment, or during RRC resume:","paragraph_zero_based":2560},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the default configuration of SL-RLC1 as specified in clause 9.2.4 and associate it with the SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2561},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2562},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the default L1 parameter values as specified in corresponding physical layer specifications except for the following:","paragraph_zero_based":2563},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-parameters for which values are provided in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2564},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the default MAC Cell Group configuration as specified in 9.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":2565},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each srb-Identity value included in the srb-ToAddModList (SRB reconfiguration):","paragraph_zero_based":2566},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>establish an RLC entity for the corresponding SRB;","paragraph_zero_based":2567}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b1c1e01352d88dffb2d855513b559dc67a5e158e8aa4855c7921ba8b2fd9af5d","189d7cc4202333eb11f46fe93ec381611adca105e50a72459f52d59fd091f77a","e1d6837da4dfc535cfdd29b80eafa5ed57ff72c794a02c7f39ad2c992425bf44","2d94408f804152b5a6b5c4c4a929eafc3dc5e97eb525476084bc7ae7c125924d","c2ddd4fa06ea86b30fb3e83668816542650c8bd34e8d21b76d9a9acd40579de9","db26ee01b53eda3d2a5f0da1850331bc14c870105803fc5b7c15a8187d613a11","0f0f6c20f1a9f05fc55b215a09c84e047d8831b150112288438a4b48440c2938","1d140780523ef7cf8ad1373f1ceb2fa01325a16dd9c069a8cc7382caac313824","2b71450b1ef98d78642d1f97c0ac354f3e8c7df7dd4c11b432a9b7f45a925aa8","c61c9bd490bd7b2e753ab4d569e1a7833ad1459c433d6e25527db60a33b12ffd","c5d5c4a002d2543e33ab1df4d1c72b9581aa8b262edfa5afe5837e8c39ff2fa9","0c2d290236525e7471e86d7a2be1fb9fadf05ecbda859614c3353ff68955b1d2","eda50e19652ff8e87a005e4266779c0cdf903efb53b1e9d26349328cc17bba54","bbb14184cf07ba25c0753e639f6a21f805a7a74a79435aa617cfd13bdc35d103","add3c99e87cb04f0783972c111e6917c938c4b8e54388b53d594032f7f824173","b1f5c50297438ba62f53bf0a5dae076c5d3743830ecf68128a07acb97e5ffd90","c958dfbd83ca6cddbf7a009220e3ce9614800fca256d13f0a31e468ff0551fb2","533758cc8fcabc28ecd6d53325c89690f11cc0a4ba6569788458035f8e5858a2","a2bb2dca1f8d5dfeac78eeb4d8f735eff9746e1384ad19040215fa41c38b123a","a0f181f2188b65888c8d998434c305785864cac6242e411d51cc53ce3fa4990c","8671393a2ee90c5843b150f0aaa0ed8af74e6f88e591545b4ef354f3463125ff","e8263242a251f660a683a18b7b9719cd447f27534e92bf6541d5314801a963ff","673d0802cee62a4288fd0a16992636462c98bde9dc99adf7374c09a4e5e484d8","e6027bb031127f2a0e944bec2ab8da5767f54618f1bddb656306e11248f802b9"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2544,2567],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx:p2544"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the default SRB configuration defined in 9.2.1 for the corresponding SRB;","paragraph_zero_based":2568},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:This is to get the SRBs (SRB1 and SRB2 for reconfiguration with sync and SRB2 for resume and reconfiguration after re-establishment) to a known state from which the reconfiguration message can do further configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":2569},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each pdu-Session that is part of the current UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":2570},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the SDAP entity (clause 5.1.2 in TS 37.324 [24]);","paragraph_zero_based":2571},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release each DRB associated to the pdu-Session as specified in 5.3.5.6.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2572},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:This will retain the pdu-Session but remove the DRBs including drb-identity of these bearers from the current UE configuration. Setup of the DRBs within the AS is described in clause 5.3.5.6.5 using the new configuration. The pdu-Session acts as the anchor for associating the released and re-setup DRB. In the AS the DRB re-setup is equivalent with a new DRB setup (including new PDCP and logical channel configurations).","paragraph_zero_based":2573},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each mbs-SessionId that is part of the current UE configuration and associated to a multicast MRB:","paragraph_zero_based":2574},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the SDAP entity (clause 5.1.2 in TS 37.324 [24]);","paragraph_zero_based":2575},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release each multicast MRB associated to the mbs-SessionId as specified in 5.3.5.6.6;","paragraph_zero_based":2576},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4:This will retain the mbs-SessionId but remove the multicast MRBs including mrb-identity of these bearers from the current UE configuration. Setup of the multicast MRBs within the AS is described in clause 5.3.5.6.7 using the new configuration. The mbs-SessionId acts as the anchor for associating the released and re-setup multicast MRB. In the AS the multicast MRB re-setup is equivalent with a new multicast MRB setup (including new PDCP and logical channel configurations).","paragraph_zero_based":2577},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each pdu-Session that is part of the current UE configuration but not added with same pdu-Session in the drb-ToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2578},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the procedure was triggered due to reconfiguration with sync:","paragraph_zero_based":2579},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate the release of the user plane resources for the pdu-Session to upper layers after successful reconfiguration with sync;","paragraph_zero_based":2580},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2581},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate the release of the user plane resources for the pdu-Session to upper layers immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":2582},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each mbs-SessionId that is part of the current UE configuration but not added with the same mbs-SessionId in the mrb-ToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2583},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the procedure was triggered due to reconfiguration with sync:","paragraph_zero_based":2584},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate the release of the user plane resources for the mbs-SessionId to upper layers after successful reconfiguration with sync;","paragraph_zero_based":2585},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2586},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate the release of the user plane resources for the mbs-SessionId to upper layers immediately.","paragraph_zero_based":2587},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.12BAP configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2588},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IAB-MT shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2589},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the bap-Config is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2590},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if no BAP entity is established:","paragraph_zero_based":2591}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["43263c28f8480815f02e0a4161b093cd5d24705a3c5461f001578dd7e9b5c7b6","dd1c9e1372a499a2918f67435d7cca99b4891475a55d1ec38b8927cd092dd5ed","35be440f67519b5ef36a17d8c1638890c8892a61668468f929728f00f364044d","26f1bee2a81ac56a940d7951309f71bffe0c65b22b767226abaecdc35bf287b9","054fe6f7a329a04d1bd37e65b1f9ce28f1bb26a37efad8ef247a7ee0e70e5c1b","77547fb7a859afc4301076540e9f037717be59b8cccd7668e616aa8b39f0bf1a","f58e323f9baf8808441f761997cb2c1178348184278919d5695b1bfa7f2539f6","a3df217d04fcc2cc457589279085ad7b9927e5ace4dc82f53a5ee7159b7378f3","a64d8ccf0d913b7402faff26d1a231ac0502f11cd563c9601b318a80367ef983","70b0644afae971af70c455fb712593acb1d1879519527be9ffbd270607b25293","6275708bf4b37b38183e943de1c66071b37462ffb6511da64e0a54c1d41d73f1","869795c916f1422e5f41681bf8f859f1ccda7d7d99f8e0dedec3bce13d089844","015100795af3b786efaa7ce9d825b2b7569f914f9e8a2ba015bae40f7652b6d3","62c453b98794ee4a811c442ae3e9ae4ae1cd9e8cec42ac4d59b0bbca2560fe52","7fdd7b5b881b52b149c4972af3f9435042946b8dc3f09419887f7e379c595012","aeced8e4f8c88118f6dad8d9c88da37a7f8951ca541dc00a97c5ad10a328474c","66e1eeb40201214add7f4f0161832ef2a5e0d5364ba65804c1841c5fc0fb76c3","9c5983285b6d3fdebd081ca318386f081c000a0e62d3d4e756d9f7c661a26616","38d80889cb4246161e330b7d5738ade7a85da093cbef4265781d3a8ff639b49d","3cd49f57e7782922ff586e