{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>establish a BAP entity as specified in TS 38.340 [47];","paragraph_zero_based":2592},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if bap-Address is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2593},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the BAP entity to use the bap-Address as this node's BAP address;","paragraph_zero_based":2594},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if defaultUL-BAP-RoutingID is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2595},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the BAP entity to apply the default UL BAP routing ID according to the configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2596},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if defaultUL-BH-RLC-Channel is included","paragraph_zero_based":2597},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the BAP entity to apply the default UL BH RLC channel according to the configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2598},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if flowControlFeedbackType is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2599},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the BAP entity to apply the flow control feedback according to the configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2600},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the bap-Config is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":2601},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the concerned bap-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2602},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if there is no other configured bap-Config for the MCG or for the SCG","paragraph_zero_based":2603},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the BAP entity as specified in TS 38.340 [47].","paragraph_zero_based":2604},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.12aIAB Other Configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2605},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.12a.1IP address management","paragraph_zero_based":2606},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.12a.1.1IP Address Release","paragraph_zero_based":2607},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IAB-MT shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2608},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the release is triggered by reception of the iab-IP-AddressToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2609},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each iab-IP-AddressIndex value included in iab-IP-AddressToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2610},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the corresponding IAB-IP-AddressConfiguration.","paragraph_zero_based":2611},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.12a.1.2IP Address Addition/Modification","paragraph_zero_based":2612},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IAB-MT shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2613},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each iab-IP-AddressIndex value included in the iab-IP-AddressToAddModList that is not part of the current IAB-MT configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":2614},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>add the IP address indicated in iab-IP-Address, corresponding to the iab-IP-AddressIndex.","paragraph_zero_based":2615}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3b3101694fcb8fc28a0808440abf80a026e839fec5637fef7d321f5a2293fa5a","c445fb871bf5082248e044f67c080e5216827014ab4108e6f73f9266f9babf87","89100f074323b0b35dee7dd7c9381c4b90840f89958afdae1fd02a6d82b70cac","373f846a1b2ba893997c53f1c9cdfd48d3ab338f04ac6c1f90e5c7d2bf8e2113","1c1fb8926b32c47cadb984a0158d2b7021151a22a1c470aa9c7384e54696dc86","ba0f9cb3e985815dbb03fd54aa2512fe68b361d9ceddfe743969c091097ddbce","2a341f674c65473f317bce3bc0e19acb7ec8e495ac5c19e8a93d0af3aae1b59d","d7c073eed0969aaeb1ac92574a411e7306924aa76cccf9343edd110774b58a5a","817c2b4817e74bf7f96ac0b0340d1604