{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>modify the configuration in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigRelay;","paragraph_zero_based":2880},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.16L2 U2N Remote UE configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2881},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network configures the L2 U2N Remote UE with relay operation related configurations, e.g. SRAP configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":2882},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2883},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-L2RemoteUE-Config is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2884},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-L2RemoteUE-Config contains the sl-SRAP-ConfigRemote:","paragraph_zero_based":2885},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if no SRAP entity has been established:","paragraph_zero_based":2886},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>establish a SRAP entity as specified in TS 38.351 [66];","paragraph_zero_based":2887},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the parameters to SRAP entity in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigRemote;","paragraph_zero_based":2888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SRB1 is included in sl-MappingToAddModList, and sl-EgressRLC-ChannelPC5 is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release SL-RLC1, if established;","paragraph_zero_based":2890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> associate the PC5 Relay RLC channel as indicated by sl-EgressRLC-ChannelPC5 with SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else: (i.e. SRB1 is not included in sl-MappingToAddModList, or SRB1 is included in sl-MappingToAddModList, but sl-EgressRLC-ChannelPC5 is not configured)","paragraph_zero_based":2892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if SL-RLC1 is not established:","paragraph_zero_based":2893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the default configuration of SL-RLC1 as specified in clause 9.2.4 and associate it with the SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-L2RemoteUE-Config contains the sl-UEIdentityRemote:","paragraph_zero_based":2895},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the value of the sl-UEIdentityRemote as the C-RNTI in the PCell.","paragraph_zero_based":2896},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if sl-L2RemoteUE-Config is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":2897},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the relay operation related configurations.","paragraph_zero_based":2898},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.6Counter check","paragraph_zero_based":2899},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.6.1General","paragraph_zero_based":2900},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":2901},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.3.6.1-1: Counter check procedure","paragraph_zero_based":2902},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The counter check procedure is used by the network to request the UE to verify the amount of data sent/ received on each DRB. More specifically, the UE is requested to check if, for each DRB, the most significant bits of the COUNT match with the values indicated by the network.","paragraph_zero_based":2903}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c8b964473d9fbeed6aae00e80b187617bfdbd0ca6bbffebe82586df4b90644a0","7a3a2e21dfb4b7d87c559d23ceec9a1a7ba8fe92dcfc1846e615ace56ce438d7","7f26e1b071a5f6c7bbaedadbf71511390cc1935cded0484f1b378bb48499fe57","09d813935d74babe00fa7fe6822f6d96d8dc65b082d819bed449176b881be04b","acf80853c9a7f7bdb3f0a1ff22f134311035371ac323ba6dc3336c6dd3688658","1e42f5d33b905128bb469503b2b0dbe9eec3e4176d47cd7536fc77fb1305dc03","cce0d8bbc962c5251f18c503f8e6d1307457d6a61b789b0137b3537a46755cbc","28f057271a69e4f68e726876cda1534da1cbc0637e456e82a34684de08cabc8c","dab4d7df629268af71a40277dcafb9107bc7badd73f094aae1a1987ea3182280","b4b00f452d97b7c7e214fbb496949fd3193b954e371b57191ddcb53cd74f405f","557876ab21838dd032c3727b25a91fd3e497373dd34667c45a3a45073d718680","99f59480770fa5d2c9e69fa62ba063defebf014554e6ebe3197be13eb31a5098","d6945ab2ee705ee4f5b975b722ba0c7f4b106304464f41677504be8d8c72c3c5","e490fd5cd08911014f7e196422f82fa20d24aa710623ea449bbc01e8f1a37c2c","31278df7259ca9f248daf5aed3b521800e7e81b238059cc1b2da5612104a8ef5","4dccaf29c5feaa522fd80e6b0e0f189d3fee3705ef47b6e9d18133a6a324d8c1","84c6cada767284e23cdea6885a9ed2780ceeff9fcb288c743c18de9efc0cb8e9","9a0ece02c0b9451b2a6b9fe5d558958beb1c1579e6e9bd35097eebf039431baa","13a470d025eefe8bf222cc9862d52a6e5bb2167fad81e765a6a0e101684dc393","9898f5fd309b3d77c1772fbb04c9e1535dd02e184a3235a39897e536be8eb1de","697ec235c067aeba77fdaf9ba7e2c20a6ff97f3a1787a979e3fac2e7363608ea","b296d491d7d7eee3e8e4927ed9a1b5e6de9e2cd5967437beccbb27301c575e74","acbecbd8ec62e94003ed0d96c420815e8e995353e3582c2a96a6a668e406fa15","ce27a8bf0f88efe6526e8cc5b324dd1009e954bb33548b7aa5f15788d92efb38"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2880,2903],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx:p2880"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The procedure enables the network to detect packet insertion by an intruder (a 'man in the middle').","paragraph_zero_based":2904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.6.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":2905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network initiates the procedure by sending a CounterCheck message.","paragraph_zero_based":2906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The network may initiate the procedure when any of the COUNT values reaches a specific value.","paragraph_zero_based":2907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.6.3Reception of the CounterCheck message by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":2908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving the CounterCheck message, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each DRB that is established:","paragraph_zero_based":2910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if no COUNT exists for a given direction (uplink or downlink) because it is a uni-directional bearer configured only for the other direction:","paragraph_zero_based":2911},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>assume the COUNT value to be 0 for the unused direction;","paragraph_zero_based":2912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the drb-Identity is not included in the drb-CountMSB-InfoList:","paragraph_zero_based":2913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the DRB in the drb-CountInfoList in the CounterCheckResponse message by including the drb-Identity, the count-Uplink and the count-Downlink set to the value of TX_NEXT – 1 and RX_NEXT – 1 (specified in TS 38.323 [5]), respectively;","paragraph_zero_based":2914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if, for at least one direction, the most significant bits of the COUNT are different from the value indicated in the drb-CountMSB-InfoList:","paragraph_zero_based":2915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the DRB in the drb-CountInfoList in the CounterCheckResponse message by including the drb-Identity, the count-Uplink and the count-Downlink set to the value of TX_NEXT – 1 and RX_NEXT – 1 (specified in TS 38.323 [5]), respectively;","paragraph_zero_based":2916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each DRB that is included in the drb-CountMSB-InfoList in the CounterCheck message that is not established:","paragraph_zero_based":2917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the DRB in the drb-CountInfoList in the CounterCheckResponse message by including the drb-Identity, the count-Uplink and the count-Downlink with the most significant bits set identical to the corresponding values in the drb-CountMSB-InfoList and the least significant bits set to zero;","paragraph_zero_based":2918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the CounterCheckResponse message to lower layers for transmission upon which the procedure ends.","paragraph_zero_based":2919},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.7RRC connection re-establishment","paragraph_zero_based":2920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.7.1General","paragraph_zero_based":2921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":2922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.3.7.1-1: RRC connection re-establishment, successful","paragraph_zero_based":2923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":2924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":2925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.3.7.1-2: RRC re-establishment, fallback to RRC establishment, successful","paragraph_zero_based":2926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to re-establish the RRC connection. A UE in RRC_CONNECTED, for which AS security has been activated with SRB2 and at least one DRB/multicast MRB setup or, for IAB, SRB2, may initiate the procedure in order to continue the RRC connection. The connection re-establishment succeeds if the network is able to find and verify a valid UE context or, if the UE context cannot be retrieved, and the network responds with an RRCSetup according to clause 5.3.3.4.","paragraph_zero_based":2927}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["98aa1c515af4abdf86ad9ba9a7873c51a1c8fcf0249f696eb68a44e03eca08ef","c81557480c2b8bd136ec5ce420564db35f447eebba43b7b968d79ff68019adfb","a692bfd383e840ec9cf5ae613a18367025ebe783a6648268e70ef7b223f842e3","6dc15aec289a7c5cebf23760a1b71a82326c144c7f25d10ccca3f16bc71395eb","d5855020795832aa04310a70349a16b11b1767fe19ead46052fe64c123a85936","56a3a37fc7d376fb98a4107eaaf6ec070d317e0ff1f9fdd3223f093c273820f7","e5f0d555764955b129022da017197771a9625570156a54c1d541d6df2a0315fb","7a200a0c0c549ea31988ca96ae46a24e15c41478775d530f8e5215cbafb21531","6feb7dcdf20adfd6607b2cc7df3c0e7a4c4ccf313efd0ecebc03d06928a63f90","11da620580471c4146ad80d52ec50f7edbc16975b87862198336578696edbe4b","bec21df2d770bfaa2a76924999815d427860f516cd77b5cc5cd56282df701f6e","3b46cf798f948eb4b5dc3e3e0034d6aa47995acd1fd94f5fcc1ae459613f8b5f","791f9025b9abf4ef487ff2c0f192435516c4ad49f92d81a64f8e5a5be739c00e","0d0022e92c5dbc340a7b6d2ee9584e0b9c6feceb68847c4ba86a88f685d3e5d0","bd2f778b1352b64cc93716586aad6b7a649f858784fa1f8b055dbf5db5788aa1","a7b069335a73b639b97a3d33c51ea0cc37fe8233e8f894f32811cce259013053","1b870ba824ea3dc39bc31a12f1392affb227ad5b4140f613d26a2f2e2853543e","921d2856bd923a8a90a124171c9eadf9a6117ba3ee47b03e1f6ba35af7972be8","53d6e66d5b94848eb2a33545098dcb1d23432a32bbded4dd603610777103a90b","97ee6d889c228cdbbd3a5c0655671d1cb816675772421d51aad9d8c30d106af8","1258b76cd97c26338b1be5ba7adeb5429698deb9cbf583515487575af7ee04af","b91cb3f6b23bc104f1241be4cb1f1a144db123fe7d66537d579efe3d938fe30c","1ece9c58946b18b5033fd8049c16ef8f62586c4ab9aa605623dc5b42b07d51fd","c125739aff58f3c71066e1f460aaddea0d47319b05fa1602fd4930c42c87d670"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2904,2927],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx:p2904"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network applies the procedure e.g as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":2928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-When AS security has been activated and the network retrieves or verifies the UE context:","paragraph_zero_based":2929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-to re-activate AS security without changing algorithms;","paragraph_zero_based":2930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-to re-establish and resume the SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-When UE is re-establishing an RRC connection, and the network is not able to retrieve or verify the UE context:","paragraph_zero_based":2932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-to discard the stored AS Context and release all RBs and BH RLC channels and Uu Relay RLC channels;","paragraph_zero_based":2933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-to fallback to establish a new RRC connection.","paragraph_zero_based":2934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If AS security has not been activated, the UE shall not initiate the procedure but instead moves to RRC_IDLE directly, with release cause 'other'. If AS security has been activated, but SRB2 and at least one DRB or multicast MRB or, for IAB, SRB2, are not setup, the UE does not initiate the procedure but instead moves to RRC_IDLE directly, with release cause 'RRC connection failure'.","paragraph_zero_based":2935},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.7.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":2936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE initiates the procedure when one of the following conditions is met:","paragraph_zero_based":2937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG and t316 is not configured, in accordance with 5.3.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":2938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG while SCG transmission is suspended, in accordance with 5.3.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":2939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG while PSCell change or PSCell addition is ongoing, in accordance with 5.3.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":2940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG while the SCG is deactivated, in accordance with 5.3.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":2941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon re-configuration with sync failure of the MCG, in accordance with clause 5.3.5.8.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":2942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon mobility from NR failure, in accordance with clause 5.4.3.5; or","paragraph_zero_based":2943},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon integrity check failure indication from lower layers concerning SRB1 or SRB2, except if the integrity check failure is detected on the RRCReestablishment message; or","paragraph_zero_based":2944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon an RRC connection reconfiguration failure, in accordance with clause 5.3.5.8.2; or","paragraph_zero_based":2945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure for the SCG while MCG transmission is suspended, in accordance with clause 5.3.10.3 in NR-DC or in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.11.3 in NE-DC; or","paragraph_zero_based":2946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon reconfiguration with sync failure of the SCG while MCG transmission is suspended in accordance with clause 5.3.5.8.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":2947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon SCG change failure while MCG transmission is suspended in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.5.7a; or","paragraph_zero_based":2948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon SCG configuration failure while MCG transmission is suspended in accordance with clause 5.3.5.8.2 in NR-DC or in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.5.5 in NE-DC; or","paragraph_zero_based":2949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon integrity check failure indication from SCG lower layers concerning SRB3 while MCG is suspended; or","paragraph_zero_based":2950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon T316 expiry, in accordance with clause 5.7.3b.5; or","paragraph_zero_based":2951}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c2266971cd0f274743d7db49629d72f471066f9e53393c3ee88a760741cd9dd6","39ad5efc3e247321dd379fe839956760499f0d2e04148c01e208958a172fe3b7","e8d6e10572aec386cba888067c74db9ec2cecd0daf09aa0a4a363c765795069c","184c4193c1c6a1577cb63dee6750478a84d4742e300047014a05274ad328f649","8ea30039f7bc554df278aec31f9781ca704915b6df4c21cf7e5812062eab3a61","0339e4613e035d624e1bf985d3d73cb8010b81393e1ef5ef38ceeaad5048bd86","ff50a034518c0a29ede19720bf1c15d8576b769da3aac2c0ec59d93fb367578e","d7615ff3ae3afd9e2cc8eaed9e3d2708362feb890550dbc82f0a0bc2ff69e6d9","25f850791726a5fc91649456855df9a27bf8527af30f248b0a3dcdee7411b9c3","55ace5806537a5407ded7d07a78454cb0789f46ac4e165d88a362a34910363ef","e7c693bf9fa25e136c5ec4402b046433bcfbd3fb9ca5e16212b6cb5f3f249b91","89896690b993e8f7e723181544df27b13fd7f7f351d506c58d41f86d94df0e70","e737f7b8f03ede99e1db3182c8d06ea8d04fa84d3790ee4d7c91cad326e47380","6efb0703a45052e4deac8dcc86deb2eff9d75344f0929b2e2d4a1ff50ad83175","223a2cb51010989d2a047a3398063d1340e778073bb1156c9d355757ad24bc32","8b01922e11753c28f10b78ca81daf83227790c38ff43ca69a9d6fc943df211c5","af6fe8427e86316bcc69a6bc86c771a3b8f169701e15d0f0641e65d9df93478c","84a3ab58fc077158e2ab44d46519eb15134e05f321d9ac4bcc32f03081dbbb72","92a7ff302404f260b0491ed424e6b880763da9dafb84ef5670e63d202ea0fe89","4b74377bcf4b9f84af2ee9d23ae5156ea13c9b8934562b8cc46c012dbc4f07b9","591e6bf1a8818df605618ac0499604b72d80500c30a7d1bd0917aac7066a05aa","7c7b80b089877053dd63e179f3776c7839b2cf13a0e3280c872977b33ca561ae","97f0a3c5adc60e38c95692cb9586269a53071affefb66f975a6f83dd812df522","bbcaf93ac15c681fd195fba4972130ade7625f13fa8ef8b9f4ede40fd1cd00b2"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2928,2951],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx:p2928"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting sidelink radio link failure by L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":2952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon reception of NotificationMessageSidelink including indicationType by L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":2953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon PC5 unicast link release indicated by upper layer at L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED while T301 is not running.","paragraph_zero_based":2954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0:It is up to UE implementation whether to initiate the procedure while T346g is running.","paragraph_zero_based":2955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiation of the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T310, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T312, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T304, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2959},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>start timer T311;","paragraph_zero_based":2960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T316, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if UE is not configured with attemptCondReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset MAC;","paragraph_zero_based":2963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release spCellConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>suspend all RBs, and BH RLC channels for IAB-MT, and Uu Relay RLC channels for L2 U2N Relay UE, except SRB0 and broadcast MRBs;","paragraph_zero_based":2965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the MCG SCell(s), if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if MR-DC is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2967},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform MR-DC release, as specified in clause 5.3.5.10;","paragraph_zero_based":2968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release delayBudgetReportingConfig, if configured and stop timer T342, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release overheatingAssistanceConfig, if configured and stop timer T345, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release idc-AssistanceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release btNameList, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release wlanNameList, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release sensorNameList, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release drx-PreferenceConfig for the MCG, if configured and stop timer T346a associated with the MCG, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2975}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2a5623ec3d37b46f2dfc343c377319c3c18bab993e02a133632d1f87eb525f83","1ddc33bbbd1c460d37803d0b6c6669b62b527640bdea03ad55562c579a9994ee","675648d5f291f546c680ce16a00f57f47b016d8031652fa7009c109f1d1e1efa","8ed3db3a2bd2847807ac6dd7e36cacd4a3c93d34f8bb5c11926ddca5720a2cd7","5d8d381c77ae46a35ddff5559dde426207121cd4615d12b462f908b55ebbf639","f6d534f2cdd4aff1cd528ca3e9f7fcec13d28ec48209ff499956b09df25fb11e","3b42cd4678af66d7ca05575dbaca9cb08323903794accb902863b252fe9a5b3c","d7ae2207b31ee