{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each DAPS bearer:","paragraph_zero_based":3000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity or entities as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":3001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the PDCP entity to release DAPS as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":3002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":3003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the PDCP entity for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":3004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":3005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the physical channel configuration for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":3006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the keys used in the source SpCell (the KgNB key, the KRRCenc key, the KRRCint key, the KUPint key and the KUPenc key), if any;","paragraph_zero_based":3007},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release sl-L2RelayUE-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3008},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release sl-L2RemoteUE-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3009},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release the SRAP entity, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3010},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":3011},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the PC5-RRC connection with the U2N Relay UE is determined to be released:","paragraph_zero_based":3012},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release;","paragraph_zero_based":3013},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform either cell selection in accordance with the cell selection process as specified in TS 38.304 [20], or relay selection as specified in clause 5.8.15.3, or both;","paragraph_zero_based":3014},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (i.e., maintain the PC5 RRC connection):","paragraph_zero_based":3015},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the connected L2 U2N Relay UE as suitable and perform actions as specified in clause 5.3.7.3a;","paragraph_zero_based":3016},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:It is up to Remote UE implementation whether to release or keep the current PC5 unicast link.","paragraph_zero_based":3017},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> else:","paragraph_zero_based":3018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is capable of L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":3019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform either cell selection as specified in TS 38.304 [20], or relay selection as specified in clause 5.8.15.3, or both;","paragraph_zero_based":3020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform cell selection in accordance with the cell selection process as specified in TS 38.304 [20].","paragraph_zero_based":3022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:For L2 U2N Remote UE, if both a suitable cell and a suitable relay are available, the UE can select either one based on its implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":3023}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4beb6f66412e830cafbba4fab55b2ebadff2656dc4e198b1c36f677c1a44434d","be783f0f36f1fbb0396a17f5d31e848efae781e72cb1525c90c987ecea519b4e","ecdba4538a05b1fa06