{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceConfigExt, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3072},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release uav-FlightPathAvailabilityConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3073},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>suspend all RBs, and BH RLC channels for the IAB-MT, except SRB0 and broadcast MRBs;","paragraph_zero_based":3074},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove all the entries within the MCG VarConditionalReconfig, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":3075},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each measId, if the associated reportConfig has a reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3076},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for the associated reportConfigId:","paragraph_zero_based":3077},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the entry with the matching reportConfigId from the reportConfigList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3078},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the associated measObjectId is only associated to a reportConfig with reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3079},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the entry with the matching measObjectId from the measObjectList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3080},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the entry with the matching measId from the measIdList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3081},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PC5 RLC entity for SL-RLC0, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":3082},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start timer T301;","paragraph_zero_based":3083},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the default L1 parameter values as specified in corresponding physical layer specifications except for the parameters for which values are provided in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":3084},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the default MAC Cell Group configuration as specified in 9.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3085},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the CCCH configuration as specified in 9.1.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3086},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the timeAlignmentTimerCommon included in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":3087},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>initiate transmission of the RRCReestablishmentRequest message in accordance with 5.3.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":3088},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:This procedure applies also if the UE returns to the source PCell.","paragraph_zero_based":3089},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon selecting an inter-RAT cell, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3090},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11, with release cause 'RRC connection failure'.","paragraph_zero_based":3091},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.7.3aActions following relay selection while T311 is running","paragraph_zero_based":3092},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon selecting a suitable L2 U2N Relay UE, the L2 U2N Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3093},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>indicate to upper layer to trigger the PC5 unicast link establishment with the selected L2 U2N Relay UE, if a new L2 U2N Relay UE is selected;","paragraph_zero_based":3094},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>ensure having valid and up to date essential system information as specified in clause 5.2.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3095}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4193c9977db55ec7ad9313da81567fd026de33014d219b30f9fe3ef56c217567","d7ce4e934802b9025d7a19bcd0e6085de0712bb3c5886b4ff381da02562a7397","7a0a3f3805b7c33fd2a4cf9b0596a8dc263694e59b429aa0ba363678aad8a3ef","278f9ed1e63d9d363748223a33c13e701475b798f1daf70139c44442671e02c4","42bfbeed873159120e5032d9a5a0ff67fa024f11e77a548902acb0d8edc565bb","1f313c541ad64b670cc46ad6c3bec059fde05cd0d86c48f79a9b5729f0f1d5b9","70419f536c2c0da1e7bb8e68cc8325760b8a9245014d4593e03645cc77cb19e4","a5cfc17ce5fb78b92e513a106f5ed41837f3f4306b35df7bc083e742fe955a00","ace04358d7f383e16d8b5110f4f72a77d9aea8d4be940e1c87a0b743ab19dca2","8bc04c587df89a0aee41b41d277c10aac432f06461bb862c2c10ba0db5502a3f","7af49eae272c329813d680c7548a4b74b40b99a535f4d2f4411ccc5bca92e96e","f7f36ba8a4362a7bcb6b750ac9482a6875ccf168362c22ff8c81e203f2a4359e","603b9094e4e77e14b7820edf94ac2ee917fdabe7baa739ca87710f1ff5ce92a7","1111cfa1bfb09e2c4711ab31ca1829f9bdd577622a7dc8a7772b32b75629be86","e05240ddfedb1157a73d163d06184356a62a2377c0736f46f1d43035ccfc6e52","696981b1010e024c68cad5acbce777af799b2711ba617d8d23fc90860655fd32","817e4b5c6294187b2c80215fc59c6f1dfbdfbea50bba2032133ddc0a0584ab08","dfd79fc7569ea47be3ae8e4fea436d2fbadb2627957baad88ca955fb57b211a4","5dd7e381f7a8a191fbb6d0cb905188bf058b8bb98a472f466f00a6cbd28ee815","c1eba64edd492a7c0cb4f2c0c157ee55b11734ed2d5bfe1f0ff1a4418a44a045","ed6044c99fb1079a683567e470c2d44ad7434f7375b2a49167522c31f357b6c4","368420a5bbde44734e2440cd0263feed0b9e96fdd91b084d9268bf2d7d8ef972","98b6f28dfa89b1c110bcffb5ad1e3169396b10447372ebbc62e47a9c7e3ff30e","e9b7145f89fc274a2f5a43ba7b87529da038c7a92ea3c33ca79765bcbcbee544"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3072,3095],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx:p3072"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T311;","paragraph_zero_based":3096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if T390 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":3097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T390 for all access categories;","paragraph_zero_based":3098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4;","paragraph_zero_based":3099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop the cell selection procedure, if ongoing;","paragraph_zero_based":3100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>start timer T301;","paragraph_zero_based":3101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release the RLC entity for SRB0, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":3102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>establish a SRAP entity as specified in TS 38.351 [66], if no SRAP entity has been established;","paragraph_zero_based":3103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>apply the specified configuration of SL-RLC0 as specified in 9.1.1.4;","paragraph_zero_based":3104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> apply the SDAP configuration and PDCP configuration as specified in 9.1.1.2 for SRB0;","paragraph_zero_based":3105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>initiate transmission of the RRCReestablishmentRequest message in accordance with 5.3.7.4.","paragraph_zero_based":3106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.7.4Actions related to transmission of RRCReestablishmentRequest message","paragraph_zero_based":3107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of RRCReestablishmentRequest message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":3108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure was initiated due to radio link failure as specified in 5.3.10.3 or reconfiguration with sync failure as specified in 5.3.5.8.3:","paragraph_zero_based":3109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the reestablishmentCellId in the VarRLF-Report to the global cell identity of the selected cell;","paragraph_zero_based":3110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the ue-Identity as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":3111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the c-RNTI to the C-RNTI used in the source PCell (reconfiguration with sync or mobility from NR failure) or used in the PCell in which the trigger for the re-establishment occurred (other cases);","paragraph_zero_based":3112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the physCellId to the physical cell identity of the source PCell (reconfiguration with sync or mobility from NR failure) or of the PCell in which the trigger for the re-establishment occurred (other cases);","paragraph_zero_based":3113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the shortMAC-I to the 16 least significant bits of the MAC-I calculated:","paragraph_zero_based":3114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>over the ASN.1 encoded as per clause 8 (i.e., a multiple of 8 bits) VarShortMAC-Input;","paragraph_zero_based":3115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>with the KRRCint key and integrity protection algorithm that was used in the source PCell (reconfiguration with sync or mobility from NR failure) or of the PCell in which the trigger for the re-establishment occurred (other cases); and","paragraph_zero_based":3116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>with all input bits for COUNT, BEARER and DIRECTION set to binary ones;","paragraph_zero_based":3117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the reestablishmentCause as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":3118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the re-establishment procedure was initiated due to reconfiguration failure as specified in 5.3.5.8.2:","paragraph_zero_based":3119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha25