{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if srs-PosRRC-InactiveConfig is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3792},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>instruct the MAC entity to stop inactivePosSRS-TimeAlignmentTimer, if it is running;","paragraph_zero_based":3793},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release the suspendConfig except the ran-NotificationAreaInfo;","paragraph_zero_based":3794},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume includes the masterCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":3795},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the cell group configuration for the received masterCellGroup according to 5.3.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":3796},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume includes the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":3797},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the received mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup is set to nr-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":3798},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the RRC reconfiguration according to 5.3.5.3 for the RRCReconfiguration message included in nr-SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":3799},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the received mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup is set to eutra-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":3800},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the RRC connection reconfiguration as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.5.3 for the RRCConnectionReconfiguration message included in eutra-SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":3801},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume includes the radioBearerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3802},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the radio bearer configuration according to 5.3.5.6;","paragraph_zero_based":3803},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the sk-Counter:","paragraph_zero_based":3804},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform security key update procedure as specified in 5.3.5.7;","paragraph_zero_based":3805},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the radioBearerConfig2:","paragraph_zero_based":3806},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the radio bearer configuration according to 5.3.5.6;","paragraph_zero_based":3807},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the needForGapsConfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":3808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapsConfigNR is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":3809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":3810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":3812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":3813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapNCSG-ConfigNR is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":3814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":3815}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9eb85d5a96e879d979e9dd8b5f7674126cfe1124c6e9471afcb00c898e15ba5c","cea9653019fbeab4d02c992110ef31289b96ea5bd7a60ae4d2c5aa385b99292b","6620aa267afc5f8109c49202f1fe36907e8ac7d423a727896599a45b8c9d39eb","05099ecc54bd4b3add4291c493f2e5c96cef9ee0928e089d9e032bb154663d