{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove all measId associated with this measObjectId from the measIdList within the VarMeasConfig, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":4368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if a measId is removed from the measIdList:","paragraph_zero_based":4369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the measurement reporting entry for this measId from the VarMeasReportList, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":4370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop the periodical reporting timer or timer T321 or timer T322, whichever is running, and reset the associated information (e.g. timeToTrigger) for this measId.","paragraph_zero_based":4371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The UE does not consider the message as erroneous if the measObjectToRemoveList includes any measObjectId value that is not part of the current UE configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":4372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.2.5Measurement object addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":4373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":4374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each measObjectId included in the received measObjectToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":4375},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if an entry with the matching measObjectId exists in the measObjectList within the VarMeasConfig, for this entry:","paragraph_zero_based":4376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the entry with the value received for this measObject, except for the fields cellsToAddModList, excludedCellsToAddModList, allowedCellsToAddModList, cellsToRemoveList, excludedCellsToRemoveList, allowedCellsToRemoveList, tx-PoolMeasToRemoveList, tx-PoolMeasToAddModList, ssb-PositionQCL-CellsToRemoveList, ssb-PositionQCL-CellsToAddModList, cca-CellsToRemoveList, and cca-CellsToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":4377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received measObject includes the cellsToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":4378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each physCellId included in the cellsToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":4379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>remove the entry with the matching physCellId from the cellsToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":4380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received measObject includes the cellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":4381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each physCellId value included in the cellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":4382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if an entry with the matching physCellId exists in the cellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":4383},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>replace the entry with the value received for this physCellId;","paragraph_zero_based":4384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>add a new entry for the received physCellId to the cellsToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":4386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received measObject includes the excludedCellsToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":4387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each pci-RangeIndex included in the excludedCellsToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":4388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>remove the entry with the matching pci-RangeIndex from the excludedCellsToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":4389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:For each pci-RangeIndex included in the excludedCellsToRemoveList that concerns overlapping ranges of cells, a cell is removed from the exclude-list of cells only if all PCI ranges containing it are removed.","paragraph_zero_based":4390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received measObject includes the excludedCellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":4391}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a750add48f9d39f15dc188a4cfc082c952d44eee9cd684e3feb162a7eaf6c077","f344c58361162f24089babbed2a78d0351869232b5029200d4ee36508b828282","4a357ea6362c69562d2521dc406d5cf9db56601bf629ab3ba6b9746027ed613d","87fc15de68afc2a9cc22f99c48e26e226918258a3654804179f5a2f724c55d61","a66695d04d3e8ae83f4f89f507aa7d0d1e0d8803ed208ed5efa172414bcf4819","ff996c6f618a8fd165871fd6b3ca9ddd1e3ed11c582fbd93592d49f0f30e6ef3","8f8eeccd874982131d26ecf359df920dcb75f08a590cdd3a3a81892415f1c5ff","7c8e2a308b785f548bbd2fcc9a5df309c0c6451f2a8e7f1751fba447d5c58c80","3febb09219c535ba6fa9ef0ad4865da43402883b134a2ed58f4bf8aa9bd4386b","a58822cfc2e0b06aaf925fc0d9268fa03c99c704b3e765fdd6b70935cfe79cb6","e51596cb4ed7c891fbfb1953683ac39fe14b2c8dce63b8bdc71551976c0c9934","96e521e333229710c7acdd2751d27106e360333b1a0b3a7038c783191f0a74a4","cc72d35ab03249535bc97ba7b014e2a6b474b3f2cbc95ea8c160b9d500d9ce8c","d00c16281c22ac0be96c410b5aca85f36f4bf5a6b1145f978822c05fa2119c1d","ac8d8c0e2a1900e502a55fe1142b81baa9f81378b5c4a11aa579fb1d4d75403e","dd174c60e4d7ce1d5b3265b113ac2e45b27dbbfefacdcab598e24e529e6d7683","b0463cc4d3c191a775b26f119b39dd4411cacce2af04604cb51cf0fb090d6257","a91bc9b673f3f90ec7733524c44ba1f3cedb383868b6a58c66668c7fc8caa6b1","748bc4bc605f7f5df9491a476ab8f0f79925e6d90eba53c57f83b63c8d85e82a","d3744f5d683f08afc99bcdf267c4cf7a241b605da64e32e630325fb565a2af48","36b13b86afea27a9b05e6a81d71edbeef47914d334c053512ab0cabc5cd6543d","fc7b459b711850e31e7b4432b420ac3b142933cc8af711ab2c9fc0697be3b686","255d01feca540be0d983c9077d3719d39f4cb2d0d08e5f3b7f29347847420afb","078a8aec97aacffa2064454f3ff44526d8a3d096cb52b1514e99940da89d082a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[4368,4391],"projection":"All w:t and m:t includ