{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if T310 for the corresponding SpCell is running; and","paragraph_zero_based":4800},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if T312 is not running for corresponding SpCell:","paragraph_zero_based":4801},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>start timer T312 for the corresponding SpCell with the value of T312 configured in the corresponding measObjectNR;","paragraph_zero_based":4802},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":4803},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the reportType is set to eventTriggered, and if the corresponding reportConfig does not include numberOfTriggeringCells, and if the entry condition applicable for this event, i.e. the event corresponding with the eventId of the corresponding reportConfig within VarMeasConfig, is fulfilled for one or more applicable cells not included in the cellsTriggeredList for all measurements after layer 3 filtering taken during timeToTrigger defined for this event within the VarMeasConfig (a subsequent cell triggers the event):","paragraph_zero_based":4804},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the numberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":4805},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the concerned cell(s) in the cellsTriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":4806},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if useT312 is set to true in reportConfig for this event:","paragraph_zero_based":4807},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if T310 for the corresponding SpCell is running; and","paragraph_zero_based":4808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if T312 is not running for corresponding SpCell:","paragraph_zero_based":4809},{"literal_text_a