{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else","paragraph_zero_based":4920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5, immediately after the quantity to be reported becomes available for each requested pair of PCell and NR cell or the maximal measurement reporting delay as specified in TS 38.133 [14];","paragraph_zero_based":4921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the corresponding measObject concerns E-UTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":4922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5, immediately after the quantity to be reported becomes available for the pair of PCell and E-UTRA PSCell or the maximal measurement reporting delay as specified in TS 38.133 [14];","paragraph_zero_based":4923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reportType is set to reportCGI:","paragraph_zero_based":4924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE acquired the SIB1 or SystemInformationBlockType1 for the requested cell; or","paragraph_zero_based":4925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE detects that the requested NR cell is not transmitting SIB1 (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 13):","paragraph_zero_based":4926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T321;","paragraph_zero_based":4927},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include a measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":4928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the numberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":4929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":4930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon the expiry of T321 for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":4931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include a measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":4932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the numberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":4933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5.","paragraph_zero_based":4934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon the expiry of T322 for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":4935},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5.","paragraph_zero_based":4936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.2Event A1 (Serving becomes better than threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":4937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":4938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A1-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":4939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A1-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":4940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for this measurement, consider the NR serving cell corresponding to the associated measObjectNR associated with this event.","paragraph_zero_based":4941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A1-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":4942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms – Hys > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":4943}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["68d9f6244fa54ab38