{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A1-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":4944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms + Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":4945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":4946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is the measurement result of the serving cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":4947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":4948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. a1-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":4949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and RS-SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":4950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":4951},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is expressed in the same unit as Ms.","paragraph_zero_based":4952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.3Event A2 (Serving becomes worse than threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":4953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":4954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A2-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":4955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A2-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":4956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for this measurement, consider the serving cell indicated by the measObjectNR associated to this event.","paragraph_zero_based":4957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A2-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":4958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms + Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":4959},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A2-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":4960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms – Hys > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":4961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":4962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is the measurement result of the serving cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":4963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":4964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. a2-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":4965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and RS-SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":4966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":4967}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["360867bb7826439553ec0f9fc3cdcb68c76a9032e80ca84fba72b726514003d7","0e81961358521aff34d81699d10179b08f7a667946012a906c0aa059067e0843","62e714fd53f73054248062f44b145fc324ba9d29f9d9b0c1b2b52d3110f4241e","06acb3ed04d6856a2ab30e7b0b9153a530cbb83bad2970eaf351fe0cbcda9d98","d693d8f9f4e2142172030ab523b56fa485d4b8b21cf0acade28599408f2757eb","2f16173cdd63b2a6c6aa000122e56f4ba62d075ec42731d1a0078202101a57ef","9d