{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for this measurement, consider the (secondary) cell corresponding to the measObjectNR associated to this event to be the serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The reference signal(s) of the neighbour(s) and the reference signal(s) of the SCell are both indicated in the associated measObjectNR.","paragraph_zero_based":5041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A6-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ocn – Hys > Ms + Ocs + Off","paragraph_zero_based":5043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A6-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ocn + Hys < Ms + Ocs + Off","paragraph_zero_based":5045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is the measurement result of the neighbouring cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5047},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocn is the cell specific offset of the neighbour cell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within the associated measObjectNR), and set to zero if not configured for the neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is the measurement result of the serving cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocs is the cell specific offset of the serving cell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within the associated measObjectNR), and is set to zero if not configured for the serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Off is the offset parameter for this event (i.e. a6-Offset as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn, Ms are expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and RS-SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":5053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocn, Ocs, Hys, Off are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":5054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.8Event B1 (Inter RAT neighbour becomes better than threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":5055},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition B1-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition B1-2, as specified below, is fulfilled.","paragraph_zero_based":5058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality B1-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn – Hys > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality B1-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn + Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5063}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d9d89b7d88b813b803851f0ac188bbf6c676bc3bfdb415d9fe07319873a82d01","f571076a0e49b24a1c47e57c7db93d087