{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is the measurement result of the inter-RAT neighbour cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5064},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn is the measurement object specific offset of the frequency of the inter-RAT neighbour cell (i.e. eutra-Q-OffsetRange as defined within the measObjectEUTRA corresponding to the frequency of the neighbour inter-RAT cell, utra-FDD-Q-OffsetRange as defined within the measObjectUTRA-FDD corresponding to the frequency of the neighbour inter-RAT cell).","paragraph_zero_based":5065},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocn is the cell specific offset of the inter-RAT neighbour cell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within the measObjectEUTRA corresponding to the neighbour inter-RAT cell), and set to zero if not configured for the neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5066},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5067},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. b1-ThresholdEUTRA as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event, b1-ThresholdUTRA-FDD as defined for UTRA-FDD within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5068},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is expressed in dBm or in dB, depending on the measurement quantity of the inter-RAT neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5069},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn, Ocn, Hys are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":5070},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is expressed in the same unit as Mn.","paragraph_zero_based":5071},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.9Event B2 (PCell becomes worse than threshold1 and inter RAT neighbour becomes better than threshold2)","paragraph_zero_based":5072},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5073},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when both condition B2-1 and condition B2-2, as specified below, are fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5074},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition B2-3 or condition B2-4, i.e. at least one of the two, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5075},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality B2-1 (Entering condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":5076},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mp + Hys < Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":5077},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality B2-2 (Entering condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":5078},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn – Hys > Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":5079},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality B2-3 (Leaving condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":5080},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mp – Hys > Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":5081},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality B2-4 (Leaving condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":5082},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn + Hys < Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":5083},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5084},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mp is the measurement result of the PCell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5085},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is the measurement result of the inter-RAT neighbour cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5086},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn is the measurement object specific offset of the frequency of the inter-RAT neighbour cell (i.e. eutra-Q-OffsetRange as defined within the measObjectEUTRA corresponding to the frequency of the inter-RAT neighbour cell, utra-FDD-Q-OffsetRange as defined within the measObjectUTRA-FDD corresponding to the frequency of the neighbour inter-RAT cell).","paragraph_zero_based":5087}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e4e440378634106c8f212bfe15f70fdc712ebf136f1594dd0581cf28c976fd8a","09fdeab95a4465956d91ee1d15b004a8b1efb3354f0f8583b3083ffc4721d7d9","72081be07ebdbdc53b17add1d0750ef5d4f5f44bf7ccbb1be39d3a1b6d29b7f0","407a0418b6913d4316be3f586076ed48e352e46f4b8e5846975c160cadc827bd","4becc55ab2b6e0d050e42b3cf55664cda3ad24d419296d8f7fef5fde9bf30447","d12a79fa5fe3f8ad66ce45074107a0221c1d1208d7f1130c58c2398e79ff97c9","06c702acfae7a0fcb7f083bdf0fc9c007c885bee038141a773871e6543e01fc6","8b03f80ce7cb6a626732ca51482cd8b63ab3b021155281f21894db0cd285b361","55cf121061032d31243967f696ab03f3eb7f7b3ded73076c52b1b11c50f0e9f8","60c19def05bce1aa1f41b6c39d10bdd3ce1990f00e95aa04ffac7bf490e87f34","4e663eeac517ff60e84e1c13c4e8c7120ce682bd5d235a1d5a7682d633a65ef4","e5cea2fca1dd863886d41da60c399c046e753ab07e4b51e334a775dedbc9a83f","2c15162b786dfc2b51a1a1d73cbdd12e81e0a2bc8825b11d0e600dda4c14071a","9fe63ff89d2693675faa79693e5026576e40c02a734914fa1797f7d2e74cd14b","f163404b2c317a6fef9eb2f1c76d24047ad8ffe91f975a7ffd8892226038e0a2","ea19b94d373b14c024272ffcb728584fecc6122fea69f3146ee4666c418222a4","b08ff001a443deca9d81d64a251f82ef4c60f0994a95496e5180e578765a6d53","88b591820b37dbbc46546485d22f0c3bea1521e314f6d9ef4c76d2047c6a27f4","15e2338a250b611eafa53eb25f7b06287488335d38af742f241ce432f049186f","1d5fae9077503ac09d092a7beb438386a18d4538905649318f2b918dc88104bf","341056c1e31d163d5611a6664f8fddce186c86e362600e698e9c39930ac2156f","7120ebfb8862f0a936d9a0ba5c55dd9ba96296480f9b1ef43089e1cfbd97fdc8","3950216532e0ed952bf