{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocn is the cell specific offset of the inter-RAT neighbour cell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within the measObjectEUTRA corresponding to the neighbour inter-RAT cell), and set to zero if not configured for the neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5088},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5089},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. b2-Threshold1 as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5090},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. b2-Threshold2EUTRA as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event, b2-Threshold2UTRA-FDD as defined for UTRA-FDD within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5091},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mp is expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":5092},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is expressed in dBm or dB, depending on the measurement quantity of the inter-RAT neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5093},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn, Ocn, Hys are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":5094},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is expressed in the same unit as Mp.","paragraph_zero_based":5095},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is expressed in the same unit as Mn.","paragraph_zero_based":5096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.10Event I1 (Interference becomes higher than threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":5097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition I1-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition I1-2, as specified below, is fulfilled.","paragraph_zero_based":5100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality I1-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mi – Hys > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality I1-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mi+ Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mi is the measurement result of the interference, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. i1-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mi, Thresh are expressed in dBm.","paragraph_zero_based":5109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":5110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.11Event C1 (The NR sidelink channel busy ratio is above a threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":5111}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f5674fca5112320edea55e3584b1428d12c6f3c2186