{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition X2-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition X2-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality X2-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr + Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality X2-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr – Hys > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5215},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr is the measurement result of the serving L2 U2N Relay UE, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event.","paragraph_zero_based":5217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. x2-Threshold-Relay as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr is expressed in dBm.","paragraph_zero_based":5219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":5220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is expressed in the same unit as Mr.","paragraph_zero_based":5221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.19Event Y1 (PCell becomes worse than threshold1 and candidate L2 U2N Relay UE becomes better than threshold2)","paragraph_zero_based":5222},