U2N Relay UE becomes better than threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":5245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition Y2-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition Y2-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality Y2-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr– Hys > Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":5250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality Y2-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr + Hys < Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":5252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr is the measurement result of the candidate L2 U2N Relay UE, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5255}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b210190c2a16fa03ee64413e44b6412effed8fec6db49b66d8535695b3c352bc","4222eb5158e02ba19afdf63cf96fd851a2d5660abf5306aa5a9a4bc16cd49deb","e2a0656ada30da62bb1a2737848273e2c05002fa5e9f06706e12c4df4d98b885","6e681bf5d419fb9e2e812a87b873681221a2f9b8eac57ad756758977986f0129","5848e9028114087640f2fa5e554116b3f1d202