{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. y2-Threshold-Relay as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr is expressed in dBm or dB, depending on the measurement quantity of candidate L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":5257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":5258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is expressed in the same unit as Mr.","paragraph_zero_based":5259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.aEvent H1 (The Aerial UE altitude becomes higher than a threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":5260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition H1-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition H1-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5263},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality H1-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms – Hys > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality H1-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms + Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is the Aerial UE altitude relative to the sea level.","paragraph_zero_based":5269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. h1-Hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. h1-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms, Hys, Thresh are expressed in meters.","paragraph_zero_based":5272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.bEvent H2 (The Aerial UE altitude becomes lower than a threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":5273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition H2-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition H2-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality H2-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms + Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality H2-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5279}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a44b411f278913e0f261e99125037680561a75daca7fa905e2130fd30d07eae2","f82d0d7bce6fb287f334d99767c113e60b026e818a00fc1606124013407ef696","0379b835485be7556862b703802a75b2898e7f2436998de7e2f020efed9c93a1","7c16dd857530d3f21c3d94d450c272d8ba6d87c62f67783292cd4d9ba128ca1e","269c7583649c2beec6707a57da7bebed4431dc512a895bac0a6a60842d084a7b","1b32bc5c1f0920d4c13dc48e3524d7bf68e4634091a737babf3951201c31b83a","29f5890534566d94f7bd626328875fdc5bc850