{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mp is the measurement result of the SpCell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5304},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofp is the measurement object specific offset of the SpCell (i.e. offsetMO as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the SpCell).","paragraph_zero_based":5305},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocp is the cell specific offset of the SpCell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the SpCell), and is set to zero if not configured for the SpCell.","paragraph_zero_based":5306},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys1 is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. a3-Hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5307},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Off is the offset parameter for this event (i.e. a3-Offset as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is the Aerial UE altitude relative to the sea level.","paragraph_zero_based":5309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys2 is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. h1-Hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. h1-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5311},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn, Mp are expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and RS-SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":5312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn, Ocn, Hys1, Ofp, Ocp, Off are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":5313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms, Hys2, Thresh are expressed in meters.","paragraph_zero_based":5314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.dEvent A3H2 (Neighbour becomes offset better than SpCell and the Aerial UE altitude becomes lower than a threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":5315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when both condition A3H2-1 and condition A3H2-2, as specified below, are fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5317},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A3H2-3 or condition A3H2-4, i.e. at least one of the two, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5318},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>use the SpCell for Mp, Ofp and Ocp.","paragraph_zero_based":5319},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The cell(s) that triggers the event has reference signals indicated in the measObjectNR associated to this event which may be different from the NR SpCell measObjectNR.","paragraph_zero_based":5320},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A3H2-1 (Entering condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":5321},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn – Hys1 > Mp + Ofp + Ocp + Off","paragraph_zero_based":5322},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A3H2-2 (Entering condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":5323},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms + Hys2 < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5324},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A3H2-3 (Leaving condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":5325},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn + Hys1 < Mp + Ofp + Ocp + Off","paragraph_zero_based":5326},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A3H1-4 (Leaving condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":5327}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c8