{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms + Hys2 < Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":5376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A4H2-3 (Leaving condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":5377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn + Hys1 < Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":5378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A4H2-4 (Leaving condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":5379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms – Hys2 > Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":5380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is the measurement result of the neighbouring cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn is the measurement object specific offset of the neighbour cell (i.e. offsetMO as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the neighbour cell).","paragraph_zero_based":5383},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocn is the measurement object specific offset of the neighbour cell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the neighbour cell), and set to zero if not configured for the neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys1 is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. a4-Hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. a4-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is the Aerial UE altitude relative to the sea level.","paragraph_zero_based":5387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys2 is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. h2-Hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. h2-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and RS-SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":5390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn, Ocn, Hys are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":5391},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is expressed in the same unit as Mn.","paragraph_zero_based":5392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms, Hys2, Thresh2 are expressed in meters.","paragraph_zero_based":5393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.gEvent A5H1 (SpCell becomes worse than threshold1 and neighbour becomes better than threshold2 and the Aerial UE altitude becomes higher than a threshold3)","paragraph_zero_based":5394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when all of condition A5H1-1 and condition A5H1-2 and condition A5H1-3, as specified below, are fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A5H1-4 or condition A5H1-5 or condition A5H1-6, i.e. at least one of the three, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>use the SpCell for Mp.","paragraph_zero_based":5398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The parameters of the reference signal(s) of the cell(s) that triggers the event are indicated in the measObjectNR associated to the event which may be different from the measObjectNR of the NR SpCell.","paragraph_zero_based":5399}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha25