{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn, Ocn, Hys are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":5424},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is expressed in the same unit as Mp.","paragraph_zero_based":5425},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is expressed in the same unit as Mn.","paragraph_zero_based":5426},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms, Hys2, Thresh3 are expressed in meters.","paragraph_zero_based":5427},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.hEvent A5H2 (SpCell becomes worse than threshold1 and neighbour becomes better than threshold2 and the Aerial UE altitude becomes lower than a threshold3)","paragraph_zero_based":5428},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5429},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when all of condition A5H2-1 and condition A5H2-2 and condition A5H2-3, as specified below, are fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5430},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A5H2-4 or condition A5H2-5 or condition A5H2-6, i.e. at least one of the three, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5431},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>use the SpCell for Mp.","paragraph_zero_based":5432},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The parameters of the reference signal(s) of the cell(s) that triggers the event are indicated in the measObjectNR associated to the event which may be different from the measObjectNR of the NR SpCell.","paragraph_zero_based":5433},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A5H2-1 (Entering condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":5434},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mp + Hys1 < Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":5435},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A5H2-2 (Entering condition 2)","para