{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide the service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and neighbour cell(s) according to 5.7.4.2;","paragraph_zero_based":6624},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the propagationDelayDifference for each neighbour cell in the neighCellInfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":6625},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to indicate the availability of flight path information according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":6626},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the flightPathInfoAvailable;","paragraph_zero_based":6627},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of the UEAssistanceInformation message for configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication:","paragraph_zero_based":6628},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication:","paragraph_zero_based":6629},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the sl-UE-AssistanceInformationNR;","paragraph_zero_based":6630},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4:It is up to UE implementation when and how to trigger configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication.","paragraph_zero_based":6631},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":6632},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure was triggered to provide configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication by an NR RRCReconfiguration message that was embedded within an E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":6633},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the UEAssistanceInformation to lower layers via SRB1, embedded in E-UTRA RRC message ULInformationTransferIRAT as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.6.28;","paragraph_zero_based":6634},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the procedure was triggered to provide UE preference for SCG deactivation or to indicate that the UE with a deactivate SCG has uplink data to send on a DRB for which there is no MCG RLC bearer:","paragraph_zero_based":6635},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the UEAssistanceInformation via SRB1 to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":6636},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE is in (NG)EN-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":6637},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SRB3 is configured and the SCG is not deactivated:","paragraph_zero_based":6638},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the UEAssistanceInformation message via SRB3 to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":6639},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":6640},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the UEAssistanceInformation message via the E-UTRA MCG embedded in E-UTRA RRC message ULInformationTransferMRDC as specified in TS 36.331 [10].","paragraph_zero_based":6641},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE is in NR-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":6642},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE assistance configuration that triggered this UE assistance information is associated with the SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":6643},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SRB3 is configured and the SCG is not deactivated:","paragraph_zero_based":6644},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>submit the UEAssistanceInformation message via SRB3 to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":6645},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":6646},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>submit the UEAssistanceInformation message via the NR MCG embedded in NR RRC message ULInformationTransferMRDC as specified in 5.7.2a.3;","paragraph_zero_based":6647}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2aa8cc279c3bd39d6f4970c7ff50e3b6a1efac0ebc31505aff71d11cd71a1188","645543277a51ac8ba7bc7d25db1009f7119e5d3890ab38ff33a958db65687646","f8719798374ec7a225d4f83aafb0acbfe9a5f3bc02d6de5566a5eb64ff8eed74","bbf5283ca3391190e5fbb67464184e038766dd2506cfc69aa1bb375b702f50c3","62bcfc6a3b8b1bc3c624ded954e50730365a7a0cce14604954e29a4e854f0941","54d631354a01062bed7e2fcc776aaa0f37a58f74ecb446e79a0d1e260454c25c","ca49001f1112eb0ac0f3d9b1bea78b1a0805096a5987902034703b63c21adccc","e43bd45fbb108033afda2aa4a7eda9724173935c707bcb70306ad1e6f25ad197","e7d060c899891e8acb86a229dd62c431962966324e187159eb676a3dbe7929f2","6c7b29794b6e596ebd54e2dbd90d5857228f53fceac54b9e40096c07f07ff85e","34804c09b8f5a9336e9bcfb3343a3082ad2aa471459f6570ff822df5db67f568","457d26858f1fb7b7c314bbb7b96d8ff6103cfe805190643adf010cc8b082575e","43be891441f45088fc5e54363ba7998b0d5ea94b4a985f44962e6ae767b58033","7d890f6e26a4ff6c780afafed1450680e3e5c955afed52ddae58e53c9b987b33","949bd647188c68a55ddcb0f16bb1f9341dce50ad229e425a4ffefcdf4ab7dba7","726f980d81606f6155dcd4368d2173efcd255cc7795da329f9b6d970b511f222","6cf33774c17983bc8c95df8908d50c1a20a87e5097699c141ceda51f47811b85","7c501bf91744d601445e1b947e1a4bc6199a8778679704458b06c439004e496c","ba869d94c768057f90c8d15367ab6b8bcfb1ce2aea95ace46ef567b7bfa8172c","2c7c894b658e5c01c2a82da2ca8728f7628de598437b91182921f29386f762ad","249d3e47296b61ae452e9ad73ee0ce8b4b014a59f0ba04ddf286ecc0bcd47f9a","72c64ab9de81cf10bcc144783b0449b8064b450b5b4e8d108772a51740ef8f0b","18d55f4dc71f36d549da502e01a068e0081afd56511d0723f5c27c0b88acc841","cd27267ce8b030b144aa99f696481e1aca915d2340767a8b334d3a2cabe2e7a5"],"paragraph_ran