{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is selecting a U2N Relay UE / has a selected U2N Relay UE / configured with measurement object associated to L2 U2N Relay UEs, and if SIB12 includes sl-RemoteUE-ConfigCommon:","paragraph_zero_based":7392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate the NR relay sidelink discovery reception frequency of interest in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":7393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":7394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-RxInterestedFreqListDisc:","paragraph_zero_based":7395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate it is no longer interested in NR relay sidelink discovery messages reception in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":7396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink non-relay discovery messages on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-NonRelayDiscovery:","paragraph_zero_based":7397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":7398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-NonRelayDiscovery; or","paragraph_zero_based":7399},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-TxResourceReqListDisc; or if the information carried by the sl-TxResourceReqListDisc has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":7400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate the NR sidelink non-relay discovery messages resources required by the UE in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":7401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":7402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-TxResourceReqListDisc:","paragraph_zero_based":7403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate it no longer requires NR sidelink non-relay discovery messages resources in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":7404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink L2 U2N relay discovery messages on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L2U2N-Relay; or if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink L3 U2N relay discovery messages on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery:","paragraph_zero_based":7405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":7406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR; or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-L2U2N-Relay in case of L2 U2N relay operation; or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery in case of L3 U2N relay operation; or","paragraph_zero_based":7407},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-TxResourceReqListDisc; or if the information carried by the sl-TxResourceReqListDisc has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":7408},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is capable of U2N Relay UE, and if SIB12 includes sl-RelayUE-ConfigCommon, and if the U2N Relay UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.14.2 are met; or","paragraph_zero_based":7409},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is selecting a U2N Relay UE / has a selected U2N Relay UE, and if SIB12 includes sl-RemoteUE-ConfigCommon, and if the U2N Remote UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.15.2 are met:","paragraph_zero_based":7410},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate the NR sidelink relay discovery messages resources required by the UE in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":7411},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":7412},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-TxResourceReqListDisc:","paragraph_zero_based":7413},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate it no longer requires NR sidelink relay discovery messages resources in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":7414},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink L2 U2N relay communication on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L2U2N-Relay; or if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink L3 U2N relay communication on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery:","paragraph_zero_based":7415}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha25