eInformation message, the UEAssistanceInformation message, the RRCReconfigurationComplete message, the IABOtherInformation message or the NR or E-UTRA RRC MCGFailureInformation message).","paragraph_zero_based":13022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Signalling radio bearer: SRB1, SRB3","paragraph_zero_based":13023},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RLC-SAP: AM","paragraph_zero_based":13024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Logical channel: DCCH","paragraph_zero_based":13025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Direction: UE to Network","paragraph_zero_based":13026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ULInformationTransferMRDC message","paragraph_zero_based":13027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":13028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-ULINFORMATIONTRANSFERMRDC-START","paragraph_zero_based":13029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":13030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ULInformationTransferMRDC ::=               SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":13031}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f4f34f207925fb0ae6660fd85b1d1651e02ead94ddd1974d2a5cf06b61acaabd","5f0adc09cffa94cd7c10f1434a1a058766706438cb71b5bf0a5c29e22c87cbce","0d8d9f83f22fc84fe81be7a0a447d20e6d3ad0ecd15f23f3767b4c7a2c0258bf","423ed70bc5d5ab8839fae17e0fb1fb0701e7739f8bcaba10944a0f4429cd85b2","75e4c36c8533012f7a9a1f97c841803bb725c04708c1ba8d26208521d3b82eb3","6c05a5c51b472740a76e970101e7acb8f4b0819153a5d80c1fe96d4a80e9a360","08175041a7f565d2f6fe4bb81b7360bbe5ab88fd53c28c124de350692d5f39ee","3baa279f34caff5b8018860427a22c9ef688639cdeab400a880cf356ed44d412","92c46dbae3e015dc1c1ca8113bdb4e449398603361d8fec6a8e28dd5c764c367","4a77ff004b6e