{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If present, this field indicates that intra-frequency neighbor cells apply channel access mode procedures for operation with shared spectrum channel access in accordance with TS 37.213 [48], clause 4.4 for FR2-2. If absent, the intra-frequency neighbor cells do not apply any channel access procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":13344},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"intraFreqAllowedCellList","paragraph_zero_based":13345},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of allow-listed intra-frequency neighbouring cells, see TS 38.304 [20], clause 5.2.4.","paragraph_zero_based":13346},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"intraFreqCAG-CellList","paragraph_zero_based":13347},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of intra-frequency neighbouring CAG cells (as defined in TS 38.304 [20]) per PLMN.","paragraph_zero_based":13348},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"intraFreqExcludedCellList","paragraph_zero_based":13349},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of exclude-listed intra-frequency neighbouring cells.","paragraph_zero_based":13350},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"intraFreqNeighCellList","paragraph_zero_based":13351},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of intra-frequency neighbouring cells with specific cell re-selection parameters. If intraFreqNeighCellList-v1610 is present, it shall contain the same number of entries, listed in the same order as in intraFreqNeighCellList (without suffix).","paragraph_zero_based":13352},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"intraFreqNeighHSDN-CellList","paragraph_zero_based":13353},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of intra-frequency neighbouring HSDN cells as specified in TS 38.304 [20].","paragraph_zero_based":13354},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"q-OffsetCell","paragraph_zero_based":13355},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter \"Qoffsets,n\" in TS 38.304 [20].","paragraph_zero_based":13356},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"q-QualMinOffsetCell","paragraph_zero_based":13357},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter \"Qqualminoffsetcell\" in TS 38.304 [20]. Actual value Qqualminoffsetcell = field value [dB].","paragraph_zero_based":13358},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"q-RxLevMinOffsetCell","paragraph_zero_based":13359},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter \"Qrxlevminoffsetcell\" in TS 38.304 [20]. Actual value Qrxlevminoffsetcell = field value * 2 [dB].","paragraph_zero_based":13360},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"q-RxLevMinOffsetCellSUL","paragraph_zero_based":13361},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter \"QrxlevminoffsetcellSUL\" in TS 38.304 [20]. Actual value QrxlevminoffsetcellSUL = field value * 2 [dB].","paragraph_zero_based":13362},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssb-PositionQCL","paragraph_zero_based":13363},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the QCL relation between SS/PBCH blocks for a specific intra-frequency neighbor cell as specified in TS 38.213 [13], clause 4.1. If provided, the cell specific value overwrites the value signalled by ssb-PositionQCL-Common in SIB2 for the indicated cell.","paragraph_zero_based":13364},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":13365},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":13366},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":13367}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["63d9a267349521f33f9b5244e6bf692b881d3710a98b5248858bf78120086aca","339ac06a176d2b7e9c6393995eb5f7e3a05f31d39ac18d9efce3239fd5b6614e","90623e900ec24bba5890d75b6fcf9181725ab0d1296af9fad5c70d39