{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-BEAMFAILURERECOVERYRSCONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":14808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":14809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":14810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BeamFailureRecoveryRSConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":14811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateBeamRS-List","paragraph_zero_based":14812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list of reference signals (CSI-RS and/or SSB) identifying the candidate beams for recovery. The network always configures this parameter in every instance of this IE.","paragraph_zero_based":14813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateBeamRS-List2","paragraph_zero_based":14814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list of reference signals (CSI-RS and/or SSB) identifying the candidate beams for recovery.","paragraph_zero_based":14815},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rsrp-ThresholdBFR","paragraph_zero_based":14816},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"L1-RSRP threshold used for determining whether a candidate beam may be included by the UE in MAC CE for BFR (see TS 38.321 [3] and TS 38.213 [13], clause 6). The network always configures this parameter in every instance of this IE.","paragraph_zero_based":14817},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":14818},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–BetaOffsets","paragraph_zero_based":14819},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE BetaOffsets is used to configure beta-offset values, see TS 38.213 [13], clause 9.3.","paragraph_zero_based":14820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BetaOffsets information element","paragraph_zero_based":14821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":14822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-BETAOFFSETS-START","paragraph_z