{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BWP ::=                             SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":14976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    locationAndBandwidth                INTEGER (0..37949),","paragraph_zero_based":14977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    subcarrierSpacing                   SubcarrierSpacing,","paragraph_zero_based":14978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    cyclicPrefix                        ENUMERATED { extended }                                                 OPTIONAL    -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":14979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":14980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":14981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-BWP-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":14982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":14983},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":14984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BWP field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":14985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cyclicPrefix","paragraph_zero_based":14986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether to use the extended cyclic prefix for this bandwidth part. If not set, the UE uses the normal cyclic prefix. Normal CP is supported for all subcarrier spacings and slot formats. Extended CP is supported only for 60 kHz subcarrier spacing. (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 4.2). Except for SUL, the network ensures the same cyclic prefix length is used in active DL BWP and active UL BWP within a serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":14987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"locationAndBandwidth","paragraph_zero_based":14988},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Frequency domain location and bandwidth of this bandwidth part. The value of the field shall be interpreted as resource indicator value (RIV) as defined TS 38.214 [19] with assumptions as described in TS 38.213 [13], clause 12, i.e. setting =275. The first PRB is a PRB determined by subcarrierSpacing of this BWP and offsetToCarrier (configured in SCS-SpecificCarrier contained within FrequencyInfoDL / FrequencyInfoUL / FrequencyInfoUL-SIB / FrequencyInfoDL-SIB within ServingCellConfigCommon / ServingCellConfigCommonSIB) corresponding to this subcarrier spacing. In case of TDD, a BWP-pair (UL BWP and DL BWP with the same bwp-Id) must have the same center frequency (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 12)","paragraph_zero_based":14989},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subcarrierSpacing","paragraph_zero_based":14990},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Subcarrier spacing to be used in this BWP for all channels and reference signals unless explicitly configured elsewhere. Corresponds to subcarrier spacing according to TS 38.211 [16], table 4.2-1. The value kHz15 corresponds to µ=0, value kHz30 corresponds to µ=1, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":14991},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Only the following values are applicable depending on the used frequency:","paragraph_zero_based":14992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FR1:    15, 30, or 60 kHz","paragraph_zero_based":14993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FR2-1:  60 or 120 kHz","paragraph_zero_based":14994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FR2-2:  120, 480, or 960 kHz","paragraph_zero_based":14995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For the initial DL BWP and operation in licensed spectrum this field has the same value as the field subCarrierSpacingCommon in MIB of the same serving cell. Except for SUL, the network ensures the same subcarrier spacing is used in active DL BWP and active UL BWP within a serving cell. For the initial DL BWP and operation with shared spectrum channel access, the value of this field corresponds to the subcarrier spacing of the SSB associated to the initial DL BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":14996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":14997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–BWP-Downlink","paragraph_zero_based":14998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE BWP-Downlink is used to configure an additional downlink bandwidth part (not for the initial BWP).","paragraph_zero_based":14999}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["484c13e6db5627f1f1feca67f74c7730bc75484dd72e1869650ceb464c3e3690","d87b7cb2b55955d4a1630183d0710965ea7bebd0749a2438efe406bca69ff6c3","285371f1bb6fe5d18343789409115e2c64b939d3c57ff5d9bf0f728dc3f37057","28b12bc7b766855d99a8abc37529a90ba11e78b95d0ab24d9d5ba2626adb81aa","10008b92dce67f090c60fd1d57ec86607862987130340a171aa53b0fb0c96e36","3111af229b359b0c4ea9e9ebba28f057d5e724bd9cfd32552cae561f57563eb9","f15edd247b723f8d8aacd24d187955fcb95e7f9b014a24b490cd69f33edf0304","c9c367449f030a83c915de836023972d09fde530e2e78f299ae796a8dd568063","6863305dabd76bceb17c0954b0137c9be68c31087d2ebe23bdb65c7a74586f12","bd5d5da99d95df42264d52b5cc33f2afb2ca47a6d941ddc684216790acb8cda0","cb9981d63dbba0768d6a09930d30079ed1581c91e19092886adc34bc09bbd542","4bcc1f7f79dafe95baeece72826a964eafefd5cb134b8a281cdc81ce463e91c8","16c7a652c7fbf7967e92327f1805ef60214c89b6987378dbfbf6068fe77d146e","71cea618d257195b6d264448bed6a56787870de271373191f12f487ab8e134df","b6951fbc74b589b4575c45cac5be7c0ad72b0223e4a4d1bd992b72f9bfd53458","8eba6b4cf3cb4a0b0a259ae94cfb5096bad43c934a11e2f3a832c1069a2924af","6826b14013280e37e32d16f0d4dacd3c8e79bedcbf83fa392b7610e786c174d2","0ce028bf65a0e3eb33647a86fe547af7e40a82473ae0ad94968c80a5817bf036","f75f7227082df8ab991d3f21938aeb583bdd748d2181986252dfdd3899f27c2b","237b8f8cf5acc7168c654c377a9c4092deaafdaa0d868b473d657e8d59b20955","df467fbc48f129945e548581700d9a32c1a89eb640e3892e7a843d7780956ad7","27f26b38e43851bfbdb723b4e4741b1d3cb585e8fc814c7405de12c3f6b32f86","12ea8c8560a36f4284fa58bef2614cc079c3c5d1e8a5b7598268a1a4e19a8392","a974d15efef384007b6b8f3b17f5748a633111548af9c82606fde796570128a2"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[14976,14999],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx:p14976"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BWP-Downlink information element","paragraph_zero_based":15000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":15001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-BWP-DOWNLINK-START","paragraph_zero_based":15002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":15003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BWP-Downlink ::=                    SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":15004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    bwp-Id                              BWP-Id,","paragraph_zero_based":15005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    bwp-Common                          BWP-DownlinkCommon                                         OPTIONAL,   -- Cond SetupOtherBWP","paragraph_zero_based":15006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    bwp-Dedicated                       BWP-DownlinkDedicated                                      OPTIONAL,   -- Cond SetupOtherBWP","paragraph_zero_based":15007},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":15008},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":15009},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":15010},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-BWP-DOWNLINK-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":15011},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":15012},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":15013},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BWP-Downlink field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":15014},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bwp-Id","paragraph_zero_based":15015},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"An identifier for this bandwidth part. Other parts of the RRC configuration use the BWP-Id to associate themselves with a particular bandwidth part.","paragraph_zero_based":15016},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network configures the BWPs with consecutive IDs from 1. The Network does not include the value 0, since value 0 is reserved for the initial BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":15017},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":15018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":15019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":15020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SetupOtherBWP","paragraph_zero_based":15021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present upon configuration of a new DL BWP. The field is optionally present, Need M, otherwise. ","paragraph_zero_based":15022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":15023}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b84727770a52d44357ba945c5ced0c3dcb6b7eeeaf6f894257a14590c152c992","62c02c61be8b8eac705b769edb8a7e82799719686f6d35778bcdcd498a6bda56","4d22813c9bd7bf5506071ce9d980daa307b9f95ee4761a86f438ef83440c729c","1fe63655a6b396ba955a0ea0f29ca289e7cfc2381f692aa7391e1bf16b32ef72","50ab6b1a851e57641d8188956434d81294255bf34e93233aebde87271df1fe1b","dfb9c59e022e2e1fc6f969483a374fd61e2465331ab3eac03250e0a106747016","05c5408ddc22073b22cbedeb47c9535b61d1fd1a4d710bb057cc90631e091a37","f6bf10a5ba3e700303490d0934adc0659abd81e8d765926a7a40df4678dabb9d","05e3228d294617501e3873cfcf66e0463d69d8b0e1ecd09d9b460c31e0fd7f5a","4f97ba892da75d9f7b830cd878816e085fbe5cfadceb379bec511cb3a7f7979f","0cd318a42de3d9c673495b95002c02a0e63f8ddfd85e1dd8f486296ebba4891b","8b8fe7e90c5a2b29634fb7fc7d80b587da4d2c01c777ed3022178057f9476411","0944f3b1ded9b925225e074fc7d1849f4faffd65835e3377fd87f67d8303a9d3","abd05296b41e0ffcd315dfbff8e1c6a5fd82a7c33b1938b86ce2ddb1901c7b74","e9bd5f61fabf2b3f6c21bd115a6b02c09a8b4c3b71bf51c08820c3bb7ec96451","6b5b4ac5fad28235933b689ece41818bdf9877fe5a54a9e4b14b146c25342bae","4bf0fedbd1e3b708dff6c36fb80eb6b3c12c21f90e0bf496d0f89c67c307b7cb","1c13147769ea4cc2a494d9e6aefec4fabdb9e06f2538788c63971042968247ca","0eb333255b71ff429ebcb66a7c3ef37cbbeec7bac0cd164089dc8e5844c680fa","12862882366e40d39bb9dc1c42247c26d5584a1f991004653b36ea87db1b8ea5","3a03eb77bb27f969b9c52ca87a4603504e2168dff2bfdb81608b66d23a555b3e","f43875575af782711657d93442402bd04cd62bd2a301aa2a12ef759b795ec2ff","723a6338d552f3608495bfa2a652778a749e23f6848b6ce9cb5b42588a7a2e49","7245d2d03c1193fef58c73cf0bc18dbe9c010fae3e88fe0b9fe25e46bfac8510"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[15000,15023],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx:p15000"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–BWP-DownlinkCommon","paragraph_zero_based":15024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE BWP-DownlinkCommon is used to configure the common parameters of a downlink BWP. They are \"cell specific\" and the network ensures the necessary alignment with corresponding parameters of other UEs. The common parameters of the initial bandwidth part of the PCell are also provided via system information. For all other serving cells, the network provides the common parameters via dedicated signalling.","paragraph_zero_based":15025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BWP-DownlinkCommon information element","paragraph_zero_based":15026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":15027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-BWP-DOWNLINKCOMMON-START","paragraph_zero_based":15028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":15029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BWP-DownlinkCommon ::=              SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":15030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    genericParameters                   BWP,","paragraph_zero_based":15031},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    pdcch-ConfigCommon                  SetupRelease { PDCCH-ConfigCommon }                                     OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":15032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    pdsch-ConfigCommon                  SetupRelease { PDSCH-ConfigCommon }                                     OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":15033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":15034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":15035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":15036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-BWP-DOWNLINKCOMMON-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":15037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":15038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":15039},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BWP-DownlinkCommon field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":15040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"pdcch-ConfigCommon","paragraph_zero_based":15041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Cell specific parameters for the PDCCH of this BWP. This field is absent for a dormant BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":15042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"pdsch-ConfigCommon","paragraph_zero_based":15043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Cell specific parameters for the PDSCH of this BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":15044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":15045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–BWP-DownlinkDedicated","paragraph_zero_based":15046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE BWP-DownlinkDedicated is used to configure the dedicated (UE specific) parameters of a downlink BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":15047}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ddab9c5c5da502701113cc43160d07746e465bcad2c07465bd6e7e2615b209bb","14f0d3f182daaa524d8c85af5f595c78ccf6b0d78a1e9ca99892da9c200c8c62","915e20cda23765dba35e70dd905a15c6d3630aa5b2816b299174426ffe6348f7","20e2416f07746a60a324b3b8e891521a7e6e3637656736cb5ca51bcc5121d56a","811bd7fdff0ba2510a4611564c7e3798c80cf3dffea8bd6eaed38e4d38b0c322","b8a7aaaf16d0b66bc2283c9ff10a76f492a41d7cd5bbab8bc84dae394d6091ec","5290b891f3c4a9406734810e19a90fe70cd2e2b3291c6c43c70dde50e2b75599","87f633c182431a68686a4941915b98696ae875adb59e900c352188a4ed9f46cc","db29b2f8aa5573631a913321dd27d7de780a0aef03f525a0378ce0db98dd33ad","8b8f4ce2f412242e41acf4cac27614b284c52cbf213db5dc92eb3575ed07a1f1","6d877a0134033925a9b5711e53657a44e2d6e69171d1abcf9328baccb7d4baf3","024f8910a9199b6c32ae76735bf8dc809317d7f9c227147429c9f6bdc2af8d2a","624b84d0bfe105c6834291183a3f70c34814dc189aa1a52bd4c965b6f19fc308","c1f2ed31247594da8451aa4e6de94b87f8ec533fdd163210d4b77f341110cae3","ad2747cf97ef5ee7ffebe1a689c1f4b29ea52424a08efee0fa9d83e5ef37688e","aa1b0e2379b00a6107050d5359e404b0613dc048628a63caec89ed5b882f1a94","dbed7d8d7a1c15de5104484d8481bd5a9c8a93414e834c1613cb3821159497ac","3ae71616a2eb75b2078741a7306afe06ee5e1dca4138a5f934779e44a97f75e7","22c45a9ca1033419d9a93cf7ed9c963f38e01b6956d86bdf1d9f33c3a83b0ffc","638e2d91e208fc4a8448a2a71532dc740f343128a708866d806b880ba037f742","4370214f83d5343802a401de58c6abdad2cf156514b106ff3fd4b5d51f1cc021","55ed95f059d03b063ebf95bab6af2c2047b126b682e6027b8a9e0ad60c81a869","95fc5606dcc811beaf67c66ad2e4f8b008d55400679eda7731efd00c35a5794e","ac8fbbf01571883ad0ecc82617fb58a464c4f40c5ffd4158b296deb1b0b00b23"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[15024,15047],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx:p15024"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BWP-DownlinkDedicated information element","paragraph_zero_based":15048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":15049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-BWP-DOWNLINKDEDICATED-START","paragraph_zero_based":15050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":15051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BWP-DownlinkDedicated ::=           SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":15052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    pdcch-Config                        SetupRelease { PDCCH-Config }                                     OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":15053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    pdsch-Config                        SetupRelease { PDSCH-Config }                                     OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":15054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sps-Config                          SetupRelease { SPS-Config }                                       OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":15055},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    radioLinkMonitoringConfig           SetupRelease { RadioLinkMonitoringConfig }                        OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":15056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":15057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":15058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sps-ConfigToAddModList-r16          SPS-ConfigToAddModList-r16                                        OPTIONAL,   -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":15059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sps-ConfigToReleaseList-r16         SPS-ConfigToReleaseList-r16                                       OPTIONAL,   -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":15060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sps-ConfigDeactivationStateList-r16 SPS-ConfigDeactivationStateList-r16                               OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":15061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    beamFailureRecoverySCellConfig-r16  SetupRelease {BeamFailureRecoveryRSConfig-r16}                    OPTIONAL,   -- Cond SCellOnly","paragraph_zero_based":15062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-PDCCH-Config-r16                 SetupRelease { PDCCH-Config }                                     OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":15063},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-V2X-PDCCH-Config-r16             SetupRelease { PDCCH-Config }                                     OPTIONAL    -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":15064},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]],","paragraph_zero_based":15065},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":15066},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    preConfGapStatus-r17                BIT STRING (SIZE (maxNrofGapId-r17))                              OPTIONAL,   -- Cond PreConfigMG","paragraph_zero_based":15067},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    beamFailureRecoverySpCellConfig-r17 SetupRelease { BeamFailureRecoveryRSConfig-r16}                   OPTIONAL,   -- Cond SpCellOnly","paragraph_zero_based":15068},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    harq-FeedbackEnablingforSPSactive-r17 BOOLEAN                                                         OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":15069},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    cfr-ConfigMulticast-r17             SetupRelease { CFR-ConfigMulticast-r17 }                          OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":15070},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    dl-PPW-PreConfigToAddModList-r17    DL-PPW-PreConfigToAddModList-r17                                  OPTIONAL,   -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":15071}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950