{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":16968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":16969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    resourcesForChannel2-r17        CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":16970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        nzp-CSI-RS2-r17                 SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":16971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"            resourceSet2-r17                INTEGER (1..maxNrofNZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSetsPerConfig),","paragraph_zero_based":16972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"            qcl-info2-r17                   SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofAP-CSI-RS-ResourcesPerSet)) OF TCI-StateId","paragraph_zero_based":16973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                                                                  OPTIONAL   -- Cond Aperiodic","paragraph_zero_based":16974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        },","paragraph_zero_based":16975},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        csi-SSB-ResourceSet2-r17        INTEGER (1..maxNrofCSI-SSB-ResourceSetsPerConfigExt)","paragraph_zero_based":16976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    }                                                                                             OPTIONAL,  -- Cond NoUnifiedTCI","paragraph_zero_based":16977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    csi-SSB-ResourceSetExt          INTEGER (1..maxNrofCSI-SSB-ResourceSetsPerConfigExt)          OPTIONAL   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":16978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]]","paragraph_zero_based":16979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":16980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":16981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-APERIODICTRIGGERSTATELIST-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":16982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":16983},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":16984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-AssociatedReportConfigInfo field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":16985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ap-CSI-MultiplexingMode","paragraph_zero_based":16986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates if the behavior of transmitting aperiodic CSI on the first PUSCH repetitions corresponding to two SRS resource sets configured in srs-ResourceSetToAddModList or srs-ResourceSetToAddModListDCI-0-2 with usage 'codebook' or 'noncodebook' is enabled or not.","paragraph_zero_based":16987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"csi-IM-ResourcesForInterference","paragraph_zero_based":16988},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-IM-ResourceSet for interference measurement. Entry number in csi-IM-ResourceSetList in the CSI-ResourceConfig indicated by csi-IM-ResourcesForInterference in the CSI-ReportConfig indicated by reportConfigId above (value 1 corresponds to the first entry, value 2 to the second entry, and so on). The indicated CSI-IM-ResourceSet should have exactly the same number of resources like the NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet indicated in resourceSet within nzp-CSI-RS.","paragraph_zero_based":16989},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"csi-SSB-ResourceSet, csi-SSB-ResourceSet2","paragraph_zero_based":16990},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-SSB-ResourceSet for channel measurements. Entry number in csi-SSB-ResourceSetList in the CSI-ResourceConfig indicated by resourcesForChannelMeasurement in the CSI-ReportConfig indicated by reportConfigId above (value 1 corresponds to the first entry, value 2 to the second entry, and so on).","paragraph_zero_based":16991}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b8dd3b058debfa16ad1b158e32cfa2bc8609e322670065736fe66887c1a33a5d","3bde82835f3549b18dc1c55bf428e6696b4cef0284024f2581a2b363f35a7b90","e9314221f3e277f6ed1465b8c713c62372dd14feec0687ae6c5142edc355dfa9","59a954a568952fbee5cb62167c37e342f3ce41bbeba730cd38ab4499a3e72031","ad3c7c9914ea66dc60984bbbed8abe2f1ed4db0b8f841c4ca19447341ed9e0d4","864f6ee620c11e27be48b12ecad859b245c825bfca715ee0e32f71763b2b572f","81682fb6d9d561adacbd714a524166d0e90a80f017ffbe6eeec2b8b72f6866bc","20ec8d328c7334a634216c7968fdac52ed1128f38dcc5f785fa7285d42277b81","b950d3533db42d35c269f63de9ea9505b118dc74934f41e72c8c61d8d8b0b1cc","d15ca2db23653426b671a4b2186a6f275ba60506238944a8db1675182a10998b","8cfc17061ca35f0f938b078d9f5a3e5730a0a31f0d96ac8812d16b332088dc52","f4e93a5b12c1b28b84cdb2f526addf11f963dee2bfa7176ce270f483319a6707","4393268ea0115694c168f10451977c79ccee07edd68e7848a71b78740283e8d1","3adc845ad63d48a2135a731dcb58390f718345a2da108987b829f26bde8cd6c8","b8ee80d2ff4cea80e480631611b92e24db3fd83d5ef8f59a64148aade7e2670e","6015dd6999e342dd1765138f0af950567b81eff358c74ebe0cd50bd541282b6a","4c8bd4c01078829eeb5c61a3d9c2d58d8706f8666e2a268a7c276c2f90d07fbc","060ac93d8e9761417bcf4e02be558344240a73bff1ba27b61d216c45e870a013","b0188773ecb9987ffe836ae421914aef02e41bd716ce82c13544f1dbae2b54a0","e22a80eee8fb2122365ad9cb0fc2dcaff9aaa8b057528c37a4deff973c45f629","c03fdb87757aa65531037a6cfe99bc218a7ddef59cbd93dc2b6114372ba53452","633e4b664f695379c02ba39943509b18229b6a11fb21837e494486b95fe364b0","035ce9c17ba5696a3743f9118ace9b1a4b2f9b4c3d5bd2ad53876f3eb103ba7b","329c7a2cdfecfadc0b2efe056f30d47ba80c8060583c962eee967953f33f707e"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[16968,16991],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx:p16968"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nzp-CSI-RS-ResourcesForInterference","paragraph_zero_based":16992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet for interference measurement. Entry number in nzp-CSI-RS-ResourceSetList in the CSI-ResourceConfig indicated by nzp-CSI-RS-ResourcesForInterference in the CSI-ReportConfig indicated by reportConfigId above (value 1 corresponds to the first entry, value 2 to the second entry, and so on). ","paragraph_zero_based":16993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"qcl-info, qcl-info2","paragraph_zero_based":16994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of references to TCI-States for providing the QCL source and QCL type for each NZP-CSI-RS-Resource listed in nzp-CSI-RS-Resources of the NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet indicated by resourceSet within nzp-CSI-RS. Each TCI-StateId refers to the TCI-State which has this value for tci-StateId and is defined in tci-StatesToAddModList or in dl-OrJointTCI-StateList in the PDSCH-Config included in the BWP-Downlink corresponding to the serving cell and to the DL BWP to which the resourcesForChannelMeasurement (in the CSI-ReportConfig indicated by reportConfigId above) belong to. First entry in qcl-info corresponds to first entry in nzp-CSI-RS-Resources of that NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet, second entry in qcl-info corresponds to second entry in nzp-CSI-RS-Resources, and so on (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.1.5.1). When this field is absent for aperiodic CSI RS, the UE shall use QCL information included in the  \"indicated\" DL only/Joint TCI state as specified in TS 38.214","paragraph_zero_based":16995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportConfigId","paragraph_zero_based":16996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The reportConfigId of one of the CSI-ReportConfigToAddMod configured in CSI-MeasConfig","paragraph_zero_based":16997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"resourcesForChannel2","paragraph_zero_based":16998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configures reference signals for channel measurement corresponding to the second resource set for L1-RSRP measurement as configured in IE CSI-ResourceConfig when nrofReportedGroups-r17 is configured in IE CSI-ReportConfig. If this is present, network configures csi-SSB-ResourceSetExt instead of csi-SSB-ResourceSet and the UE ignores csi-SSB-ResourceSet in resourcesForChannel, and the resourcesForChannel configures the reference signals for channel measurement corresponding to the first resource set for L1-RSRP measurement (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.1.4).","paragraph_zero_based":16999},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"resourceSet","paragraph_zero_based":17000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet for channel measurements. Entry number in nzp-CSI-RS-ResourceSetList in the CSI-ResourceConfig indicated by resourcesForChannelMeasurement in the CSI-ReportConfig indicated by reportConfigId above (value 1 corresponds to the first entry, value 2 to the second entry, and so on).","paragraph_zero_based":17001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":17003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":17004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Aperiodic","paragraph_zero_based":17005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present if the NZP-CSI-RS-Resources in the associated resourceSet have the resourceType aperiodic and unifiedTCI-StateType is not configured. The field is optionally present, Need R, if the NZP-CSI-RS-Resources in the associated resourceSet have the resourceType aperiodic and unifiedTCI-StateType is configured. The field is absent otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":17006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-IM-ForInterference","paragraph_zero_based":17007},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is mandatory present if the CSI-ReportConfig identified by reportConfigId is configured with csi-IM-ResourcesForInterference; otherwise it is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":17008},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NZP-CSI-RS-ForInterference","paragraph_zero_based":17009},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is mandatory present if the CSI-ReportConfig identified by reportConfigId is configured with nzp-CSI-RS-ResourcesForInterference; otherwise it is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":17010},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NoUnifiedTCI","paragraph_zero_based":17011},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is absent, Need R, if unifiedTCI-StateType is configured for the serving cell in which the CSI-AperiodicTriggerStateList is included. It is optionally present, Need R, otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":17012},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17013},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–CSI-FrequencyOccupation","paragraph_zero_based":17014},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE CSI-FrequencyOccupation is used to configure the frequency domain occupation of a channel state information measurement resource (e.g. NZP-CSI-RS-Resource, CSI-IM-Resource).","paragraph_zero_based":17015}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["8e7504ff8eb069c3a76f23b3e35990e7ac53a2efd40177504c5dd9bdbcb2d426","eec2d2528b4871390eede4fd9bdd35090ca8054cb3a5a5ae55768a3cf6ead184","9895a5c2ab2bc52a0b031f7240a17fd1ec9e07d58e327bb4404a572a9858db89","1ca4dd0713638021ea1691087acebd6550068e5d9ce17f77633e02294d40b3f1","8360fe82770426488d6bb6906b5fcb80894f5a955b38364ed7b1ffa256548acc","0fa1c7a8182e217da993cf3660317534fe818e1c430352ac8341ddc6eb686ea8","f3dc1262