{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE CSI-IM-ResourceSetId is used to identify CSI-IM-ResourceSets.","paragraph_zero_based":17112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-IM-ResourceSetId information element","paragraph_zero_based":17113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":17114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-IM-RESOURCESETID-START","paragraph_zero_based":17115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-IM-ResourceSetId ::=            INTEGER (0..maxNrofCSI-IM-ResourceSets-1)","paragraph_zero_based":17117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-IM-RESOURCESETID-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17119},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–CSI-MeasConfig","paragraph_zero_based":17122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE CSI-MeasConfig is used to configure CSI-RS (reference signals) belonging to the serving cell in which CSI-MeasConfig is included, channel state information reports to be transmitted on PUCCH on the serving cell in which CSI-MeasConfig is included and channel state information reports on PUSCH triggered by DCI received on the serving cell in which CSI-MeasConfig is included. See also TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.","paragraph_zero_based":17123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-MeasConfig information element","paragraph_zero_based":17124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":17125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-MEASCONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":17126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-MeasConfig ::=                  SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":17128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nzp-CSI-RS-ResourceToAddModList     SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofNZP-CSI-RS-Resources)) OF NZP-CSI-RS-Resource   OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":17129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nzp-CSI-RS-ResourceToReleaseList    SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofNZP-CSI-RS-Resources)) OF NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceId OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":17130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nzp-CSI-RS-ResourceSetToAddModList  SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofNZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSets)) OF NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet","paragraph_zero_based":17131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                                                                                  OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":17132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nzp-CSI-RS-ResourceSetToReleaseList SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofNZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSets)) OF NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSetId","paragraph_zero_based":17133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                                                                                  OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":17134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    csi-IM-ResourceToAddModList         SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofCSI-IM-Resources)) OF CSI-IM-Resource           OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":17135}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ff6e6ec7e19a978d85ded1881ea60811cba6f3f7808140ac66c9e2a5b93e8efe","c56cc85bbb3e756c714ef77e5015b3afa5ae0b5f37c6fe18a39e25abd418e203","4acb63297efcf4b589a242fd089aa8fd1ddf7b6a1a6f7d3732035d11e760097