{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":17664},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":17665},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17666},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-RS-RESOURCEMAPPING-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17667},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17668},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17669},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-RS-ResourceMapping field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":17670},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cdm-Type","paragraph_zero_based":17671},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CDM type (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.3.1).","paragraph_zero_based":17672},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"density","paragraph_zero_based":17673},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Density of CSI-RS resource measured in RE/port/PRB (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 7.4.1.5.3).","paragraph_zero_based":17674},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Values 0.5 (dot5), 1 (one) and 3 (three) are allowed for X=1, values 0.5 (dot5) and 1 (one) are allowed for X=2, 16, 24 and 32, value 1 (one) is allowed for X=4, 8, 12.","paragraph_zero_based":17675},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For density = 1/2, includes 1-bit indication for RB level comb offset indicating whether odd or even RBs are occupied by CSI-RS.","paragraph_zero_based":17676},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"firstOFDMSymbolInTimeDomain2","paragraph_zero_based":17677},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Time domain allocation within a physical resource block. See TS 38.211 [16], clause 7.4.1.5.3.","paragraph_zero_based":17678},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"firstOFDMSymbolInTimeDomain","paragraph_zero_based":17679},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Time domain allocation within a physical resource block. The field indicates the first OFDM symbol in the PRB used for CSI-RS. See TS 38.211 [16], clause 7.4.1.5.3.","paragraph_zero_based":17680},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"freqBand","paragraph_zero_based":17681},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Wideband or partial band CSI-RS, (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.3.1).","paragraph_zero_based":17682},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"frequencyDomainAllocation","paragraph_zero_based":17683},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Frequency domain allocation within a physical resource block in accordance with TS 38.211 [16], clause 7.4.1.5.3. The applicable row number in table 7.4.1.5.3-1 is determined by the frequencyDomainAllocation for rows 1, 2 and 4, and for other rows by matching the values in the column Ports, Density and CDMtype in table 7.4.1.5.3-1 with the values of nrofPorts, cdm-Type and density below and, when more than one row has the 3 values matching, by selecting the row where the column (k bar, l bar) in table 7.4.1.5.3-1 has indexes for k ranging from 0 to 2*n-1 where n is the number of bits set to 1 in frequencyDomainAllocation.","paragraph_zero_based":17684},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nrofPorts","paragraph_zero_based":17685},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of ports (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.3.1).","paragraph_zero_based":17686},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17687}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9139c510927deb456fbe4a9ffbacf55f4ab36f6d514f806517a71b12e3a4fa38","71c9375f727f87ea4baa0b4f9751fe40a164ae496ec068588dcc5bbf2b57d749","427eb63c521c3c7b30d26f9b74ff86e87224ec76fc1f599038e9f6302454a90d","9caf6cf5d6c83852156141fad7701fca3208bfaa72eeb9dd9252fe993216f97d","67b