{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE CSI-SSB-ResourceSet is used to configure one SS/PBCH block resource set which refers to SS/PBCH as indicated in ServingCellConfigCommon and ServingCellConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":17712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-SSB-ResourceSet information element","paragraph_zero_based":17713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":17714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-SSB-RESOURCESET-START","paragraph_zero_based":17715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-SSB-ResourceSet ::=             SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":17717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    csi-SSB-ResourceSetId               CSI-SSB-ResourceSetId,","paragraph_zero_based":17718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    csi-SSB-ResourceList                SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofCSI-SSB-ResourcePerSet)) OF SSB-Index,","paragraph_zero_based":17719},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":17720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":17721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    servingAdditionalPCIList-r17        SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofCSI-SSB-ResourcePerSet)) OF ServingAdditionalPCIIndex-r17  OPTIONAL  -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":17722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]]","paragraph_zero_based":17723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":17724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ServingAdditionalPCIIndex-r17  ::=  INTEGER(0..maxNrofAdditionalPCI-r17)","paragraph_zero_based":17726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17727},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-SSB-RESOURCESET-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17728},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17729},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17730},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-SSB-ResourceSet field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":17731},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"servingAdditionalPCIList","paragraph_zero_based":17732},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the physical cell IDs (PCI) of the SSBs in the csi-SSB-ResourceList. If present, the list has the same number of entries as csi-SSB-ResourceList. The first entry of the list indicates the value of the PCI for the first entry of csi-SSB-ResourceList, the second entry of this list indicates the value of the PCI for the second entry of csi-SSB-ResourceList, and so on. For each entry, the following applies:","paragraph_zero_based":17733},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- If the value is zero, the PCI is the PCI of the serving cell in which this CSI-SSB-ResourceSet is defined;","paragraph_zero_based":17734},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- otherwise, the value is additionalPCIIndex-r17 of an SSB-MTC-AdditionalPCI-r17 configured using the additionalPCI-ToAddModList-r17 in ServingCellConfig, and the PCI is the additionalPCI-r17 in this SSB-MTC-AdditionalPCI-r17.","paragraph_zero_based":17735}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1e94c32c2ec639e29ea7f5dd6fc37e5feffe97729fc2bdaea92d1af048b375cb","4d4c4d73b50137895a3c0eb183884b13175ea2cccfc034f63eebeba4bd20c7b9","cda43dcaa336e81e8401df78f0942126517cfe2fba92227ef11fde4fc65c241b","30a684de1f948ddc989330f65e3be0e7c2cf0179012812313c0e4e2f148b7be8","c5a92bd215d3002e5675aba8657a892bd5739ae9781e65e67147843d8d3feca9","a960a3efeaa104b521d40074e6ee2102a0fd6b498