{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    drx-HARQ-RTT-TimerDL-r17                INTEGER (0..448),","paragraph_zero_based":18336},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    drx-HARQ-RTT-TimerUL-r17                INTEGER (0..448)","paragraph_zero_based":18337},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":18338},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18339},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-DRX-CONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18340},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18341},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18342},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DRX-Config field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":18343},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-HARQ-RTT-TimerDL","paragraph_zero_based":18344},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in number of symbols of the BWP where the transport block was received. drx-HARQ-RTT-TimerDL-r17 is only applicable for SCS 480 kHz and 960 kHz. If configured, the UE shall ignore drx-HARQ-RTT-TimerDL (without suffix) for SCS 480 kHz and 960 kHz.","paragraph_zero_based":18345},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-HARQ-RTT-TimerUL","paragraph_zero_based":18346},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in number of symbols of the BWP where the transport block was transmitted. drx-HARQ-RTT-TimerUL-r17 is only applicable for SCS 480 kHz and 960 kHz. If configured, the UE shall ignore drx-HARQ-RTT-TimerUL (without suffix) for SCS 480 kHz and 960 kHz.","paragraph_zero_based":18347},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-InactivityTimer","paragraph_zero_based":18348},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiple integers of 1 ms. ms0 corresponds to 0, ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":18349},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-LongCycleStartOffset","paragraph_zero_based":18350},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-LongCycle in ms and drx-StartOffset in multiples of 1 ms. If drx-ShortCycle is configured, the value of drx-LongCycle shall be a multiple of the drx-ShortCycle value.","paragraph_zero_based":18351},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-onDurationTimer","paragraph_zero_based":18352},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiples of 1/32 ms (subMilliSeconds) or in ms (milliSecond). For the latter, value ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, value ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":18353},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-RetransmissionTimerDL","paragraph_zero_based":18354},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in number of slot lengths of the BWP where the transport block was received. value sl0 corresponds to 0 slots, sl1 corresponds to 1 slot, sl2 corresponds to 2 slots, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":18355},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-RetransmissionTimerUL","paragraph_zero_based":18356},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in number of slot lengths of the BWP where the transport block was transmitted. sl0 corresponds to 0 slots, sl1 corresponds to 1 slot, sl2 corresponds to 2 slots, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":18357},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-ShortCycleTimer","paragraph_zero_based":18358},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiples of drx-ShortCycle. A value of 1 corresponds to drx-ShortCycle, a value of 2 corresponds to 2 * drx-ShortCycle and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":18359}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["8a609a9c60f4709b7fc239b3989242b9b14d0348f8d95f2b5d4da2d8035bb367","e090515f88c245c021be5bede307bea2b03f63935c85fff7