{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-DRX-CONFIGSECONDARYGROUP-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DRX-ConfigSecondaryGroup field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":18388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-InactivityTimer","paragraph_zero_based":18389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiple integers of 1 ms. ms0 corresponds to 0 ms, ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, and so on, as specified in TS 38.321 [3]. The network configures a drx-InactivityTimer value for the second DRX group that is smaller than the drx-InactivityTimer configured for the default DRX group in IE DRX-Config.","paragraph_zero_based":18390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-onDurationTimer","paragraph_zero_based":18391},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiples of 1/32 ms (subMilliSeconds) or in ms (milliSeconds). For the latter, value ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, value ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, and so on, as specified in TS 38.321 [3]. The network configures a drx-onDurationTimer value for the second DRX group that is smaller than the drx-onDurationTimer configured for the default DRX group in IE DRX-Config.","paragraph_zero_based":18392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–DRX-ConfigSL","paragraph_zero_based":18394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE DRX-ConfigSL is used to configure additional DRX parameters for the UE performing sidelink operation with resource allocation mode 1, as specified in TS 38.321 [3].","paragraph_zero_based":18395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DRX-ConfigSL information element","paragraph_zero_based":18396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":18397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-DRX-CONFIGSL-START","paragraph_zero_based":18398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18399},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DRX-ConfigSL-r17 ::=            SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":18400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    drx-HARQ-RTT-TimerSL-r17        INTEGER (0..56),","paragraph_zero_based":18401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    drx-RetransmissionTimerSL-r17   ENUMERATED {sl0, sl1, sl2, sl4, sl6, sl8, sl16, sl24, sl33, sl40, sl64, sl80, sl96, sl112, sl128,","paragraph_zero_based":18402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                sl160, sl320, spare15, spare14, spare13, spare12, spare11, spare10, spare9, spare8,","paragraph_zero_based":18403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                spare7, spare6, spare5, spare4, spare3, spare2, spare1}","paragraph_zero_based":18404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":18405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-DRX-CONFIGSL-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18407}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1822552a30ec1f87a5bbcc074c5f6d9716c5bb340efff8f5216b63b51079fcea","3dcb90b3aff0b8cbf2f016d3d29fcf2a3a4d4513de1674fbc80054c17d2f4cc7","6259153fa439c2093ad34510b9a9cea7625d930c785c0a46a57f0354b37a05e6","9991aa9c3da6039a643559fc0b09b938522db75d7d1e1af4206c4482dd6ddfb8","dc0b12f873d6a5c2e2df5a1b9bf8b2df37c24f4478fca8555d94ad0a4c9d903d","a63dd4ef82f94a1dd511b1106fe