{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Used to indicate a cell, or frequency specific offset to be applied when evaluating triggering conditions for measurement reporting. The value is in dB. Value dB-24 corresponds to -24 dB, value dB-22 corresponds to -22 dB and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":19920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"excludedCellsToAddModListEUTRAN","paragraph_zero_based":19921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of cells to add/ modify in the exclude-list of cells.","paragraph_zero_based":19922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"excludedCellsToRemoveListEUTRAN","paragraph_zero_based":19923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of cells to remove from the exclude-list of cells.","paragraph_zero_based":19924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"widebandRSRQ-Meas","paragraph_zero_based":19925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If set to true, the UE shall, when performing RSRQ measurements, use a wider bandwidth in accordance with TS 36.133 [40]. The network may set the field to true if the measurement bandwidth indicated by allowedMeasBandwidth is 50 resource blocks or larger; otherwise the network sets this field to false.","paragraph_zero_based":19926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":19927},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MeasObjectId","paragraph_zero_based":19928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE MeasObjectId used to identify a measurement object configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":19929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MeasObjectId information element","paragraph_zero_based":19930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":19931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MEASOBJECTID-START","paragraph_zero_based":19932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":19933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MeasObjectId ::=                    INTEGER (1..maxNrofObjectId)","paragraph_zero_based":19934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":19935},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MEASOBJECTID-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":19936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":19937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":19938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MeasObjectNR","paragraph_zero_based":19939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE MeasObjectNR specifies information applicable for SS/PBCH block(s) intra/inter-frequency measurements and/or CSI-RS intra/inter-frequency measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":19940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MeasObjectNR information element","paragraph_zero_based":19941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":19942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MEASOBJECTNR-START","paragraph_zero_based":19943}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["334e28980e79943e69a38f6a424af919d3ad99a0d7a2372ef80f428d735261c2","4fec285dbe8c28bbab4820277681df54377169c9c44861ef5b1081da0811f402","8f5edb4b287c3f15989a178a37729c88fc7ad8e21355f9c65c6b2c1c29b421d2","ee38e3f46e86a69f1526455551c21907ba08781d61e35df5946f3b3a67db4bbb","f2ca49eb402eef7d37c291d090ccbdc13c0171de72f75ab41225100c5a514f5b","69407a269a73bcb77c24e08c6d758d06b89f45f7167791c2c8ca2aefbdd5a062","e3920149ea2cbb6512db5cd1bc3c7fb3160cb958a47913c7593e99db5d01198f","4e54b95363ef8091e7324ec0e8a26729f07dbc92bacee7fcb83e62bc9f61b94d","f103ce025a7eaeceed958d340d260f68f84ebab556cb9c2f5a211210d014ed5e","e32b676ecc19575fb69ed5a29b7a027613ba584069af53f8fcb2a2ad26720de1","760b76846fad364d7b0640c5448b8033b75