{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20616},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MeasResults field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":20617},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"coarseLocationInfo","paragraph_zero_based":20618},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the coarse location information reported by the UE. This field is coded as the Ellipsoid-Point defined in TS 37.355 [49]. The first/leftmost bit of the first octet contains the most significant bit. The least significant bits of degreesLatitude and degreesLongitude are set to 0 to meet the accuracy requirement corresponds to a granularity of approximately 2 km.","paragraph_zero_based":20619},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is up to UE implementation how many LSBs are set to 0 to meet the accuracy requirement","paragraph_zero_based":20620},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"excessDelay","paragraph_zero_based":20621},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the ratio of packets in UL per DRB exceeding the configured delay threshold among the UL PDCP SDUs, according to the UL PDCP Excess Packet Delay per DRB mapping table, as defined in TS 38.314 [53], Table 4.3.1.e-1.","paragraph_zero_based":20622},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measId","paragraph_zero_based":20623},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Identifies the measurement identity for which the reporting is being performed.","paragraph_zero_based":20624},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measQuantityResults","paragraph_zero_based":20625},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The value sinr is not included when it is used for LogMeasReport-r16.","paragraph_zero_based":20626},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultCellListSFTD-NR","paragraph_zero_based":20627},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SFTD measurement results between the PCell and the NR neighbour cell(s) in NR standalone.","paragraph_zero_based":20628},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultCLI","paragraph_zero_based":20629},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CLI measurement results.","paragraph_zero_based":20630},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultEUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":20631},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Measured results of an E-UTRA cell.","paragraph_zero_based":20632},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultForRSSI","paragraph_zero_based":20633},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Includes measured RSSI result in dBm (see TS 38.215 [9]) and channelOccupancy which is the percentage of samples when the RSSI was above the configured channelOccupancyThreshold for the associated reportConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":20634},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultListEUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":20635},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of measured results for the maximum number of reported best cells for an E-UTRA measurement identity.","paragraph_zero_based":20636},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultListNR","paragraph_zero_based":20637},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of measured results for the maximum number of reported best cells for an NR measurement identity.","paragraph_zero_based":20638},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultListUTRA-FDD","paragraph_zero_based":20639}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["27d731cd693abf06504bc36a10e8dde51dde1b658becdf1e3c8b928771834ee4","ebfec658c6327211d69fedac21b77693f7da6960333d6ff0902ca2e53c245098","58984fc63002439243026af5ef443dfb50c09f3128f898aa0e64be1775cd5928","4161b7eeabdc10160abbb4353481156a6143a2c95cf934d9b8a51c734b5a49df","c96859146f3fce46bef9c555f21b7ae42dc