{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of measured results for the maximum number of reported best cells for a UTRA-FDD measurement identity.","paragraph_zero_based":20640},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultNR","paragraph_zero_based":20641},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Measured results of an NR cell.","paragraph_zero_based":20642},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultServFreqListEUTRA-SCG","paragraph_zero_based":20643},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Measured results of the E-UTRA SCG serving frequencies: the measurement result of PSCell and each SCell, if any, and of the best neighbouring cell on each E-UTRA SCG serving frequency.","paragraph_zero_based":20644},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultServFreqListNR-SCG","paragraph_zero_based":20645},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Measured results of the NR SCG serving frequencies: the measurement result of PSCell and each SCell, if any, and of the best neighbouring cell on each NR SCG serving frequency.","paragraph_zero_based":20646},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultServingMOList","paragraph_zero_based":20647},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Measured results of measured cells with reference signals indicated in the serving cell measurement objects including measurement results of SpCell, configured SCell(s) and best neighbouring cell within measured cells with reference signals indicated in on each serving cell measurement object. If the sending of the MeasurementReport message is triggered by a measurement configured by the field sl-ConfigDedicatedForNR received within an E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration message (i.e. CBR measurements), this field is not applicable and its contents is ignored by the network.","paragraph_zero_based":20648},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultSFTD-EUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":20649},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SFTD measurement results between the PCell and the E-UTRA PScell in NE-DC.","paragraph_zero_based":20650},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultSFTD-NR","paragraph_zero_based":20651},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SFTD measurement results between the PCell and the NR PScell in NR-DC.","paragraph_zero_based":20652},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultsSL","paragraph_zero_based":20653},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CBR measurements results for NR sidelink communication/discovery.","paragraph_zero_based":20654},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultUTRA-FDD","paragraph_zero_based":20655},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Measured result of a UTRA-FDD cell.","paragraph_zero_based":20656},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MeasResultsCandRelay","paragraph_zero_based":20657},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Measurement result(s) of candiate L2 U2N relay UE(s).","paragraph_zero_based":20658},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MeasResultServingRelay","paragraph_zero_based":20659},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Measurement result of serving L2 U2N relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":20660},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20661},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MeasResult2EUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":20662},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE MeasResult2EUTRA contains measurements on E-UTRA frequencies.","paragraph_zero_based":20663}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f05370cf796e602496238f4da84ecb93df97b5022c9eb29a901894f705bf4aed","d37c57b707825f51d8be3a647ae705b1f98214f5655dbc77405a191af27cb322","de6ec2e9062692fc0c18552c662f1a09b4113d99404e21d6eb1c42aadf5f5cb9","f847385