{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MOBILITYSTATEPARAMETERS-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":20904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":20905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MobilityStateParameters field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":20907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"n-CellChangeHigh","paragraph_zero_based":20908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The number of cell changes to enter high mobility state. Corresponds to NCR_H in TS 38.304 [20].","paragraph_zero_based":20909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"n-CellChangeMedium","paragraph_zero_based":20910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The number of cell changes to enter medium mobility state. Corresponds to NCR_M in TS 38.304 [20].","paragraph_zero_based":20911},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"t-Evaluation","paragraph_zero_based":20912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The duration for evaluating criteria to enter mobility states. Corresponds to TCRmax in TS 38.304 [20]. Value in seconds, s30 corresponds to 30 s and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":20913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"t-HystNormal","paragraph_zero_based":20914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The additional duration for evaluating criteria to enter normal mobility state. Corresponds to TCRmaxHyst in TS 38.304 [20]. Value in seconds, value s30 corresponds to 30 seconds and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":20915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MRB-Identity","paragraph_zero_based":20917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE MRB-Identity is used to identify a multicast MRB used by a UE.","paragraph_zero_based":20918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MRB-Identity information element","paragraph_zero_based":20919},