{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MsgA-ConfigCommon","paragraph_zero_based":20928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE MsgA-ConfigCommon is used to configure the PRACH and PUSCH resource for transmission of MsgA in 2-step random access type procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":20929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":20930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MSGACONFIGCOMMON-START","paragraph_zero_based":20931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MsgA-ConfigCommon-r16 ::=           SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":20933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    rach-ConfigCommonTwoStepRA-r16      RACH-ConfigCommonTwoStepRA-r16,","paragraph_zero_based":20934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    msgA-PUSCH-Config-r16               MsgA-PUSCH-Config-r16                                      OPTIONAL --Cond InitialBWPConfig","paragraph_zero_based":20935},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":20936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MSGACONFIGCOMMON-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":20938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":20939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MsgA-ConfigCommon field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":20941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"msgA-PUSCH-Config","paragraph_zero_based":20942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration of cell-specific MsgA PUSCH parameters which the UE uses for contention-based MsgA PUSCH transmission of this BWP. If the field is not configured for the selected UL BWP, the UE shall use the MsgA PUSCH configuration of initial UL BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":20943},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rach-ConfigCommonTwoStepRA","paragraph_zero_based":20944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration of cell specific random access parameters which the UE uses for contention based and contention free 2-step random access type procedure as well as for 2-step RA type contention based beam failure recovery in this BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":20945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":20947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":20948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"InitialBWPConfig","paragraph_zero_based":20949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present when MsgA-ConfigCommon is configured for the initial uplink BWP, or when MsgA-ConfigCommon is configured for a non-initial uplink BWP and MsgA-ConfigCommon is not configured for the initial uplink BWP, otherwise the field is optionally present, Need S.","paragraph_zero_based":20950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20951}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9f96b7b4976980a60d7fb058a81eeb9eaacc598e58cc6259226d3a8b62f79a66","a4c3e5801184a464186da952e54c5b0a4b7f2db0fa8061e9cb4241b96323aefe","83c46c60dd267fc2deef7e7ac1bd13b986f4e9396cb7bab1e31b864bac0e7e57","bd255feacd44c91efe60cf6b13d406a52fc692e3f22dee4704c19a86517a008c","23985e746df9da7fc883c37ff88c01fc628be115a1cf93ee86b2e11f19e74788","8f5a11aaa6cb1c624c3fd1779c1babb09541c1e37b14da456b8c978a49a8933e","db5299b43e7f71e3cfeec3cabf97de77031dd9824e1480c4918309f49f314c5a","1a0f53e8b1a328c09d65d56e43b9bf86bf26877f66210184dce9ea0bddc1cd35","ebcea488adb35