{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    bandNR-r16                                   FreqBandIndicatorNR,","paragraph_zero_based":21264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    gapIndication-r16                            ENUMERATED {gap, no-gap}","paragraph_zero_based":21265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":21266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NeedForGapsInfoNR-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":21268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":21269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForGapsInfoNR field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":21271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"intraFreq-needForGap","paragraph_zero_based":21272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the measurement gap requirement information for NR intra-frequency measurement.","paragraph_zero_based":21273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"interFreq-needForGap","paragraph_zero_based":21274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the measurement gap requirement information for NR inter-frequency measurement.","paragraph_zero_based":21275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForGapsIntraFreq field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":21277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"servCellId","paragraph_zero_based":21278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the serving cell which contains the target SSB (associated with the initial DL BWP) to be measured. ","paragraph_zero_based":21279},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gapIndicationIntra","paragraph_zero_based":21280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether measurement gap is required for the UE to perform intra-frequency SSB based measurements on the concerned serving cell. Value gap indicates that a measurement gap is needed if any of the UE configured BWPs (except the BWP(s) configured with servingCellMO associated with NCD-SSB) do not contain the frequency domain resources of the SSB associated to the initial DL BWP (CD-SSB). Value no-gap indicates a measurement gap is not needed to measure the SSB associated to the initial DL BWP (CD-SSB) for all configured BWPs (except the BWP(s) configured with servingCellMO associated with NCD-SSB), no matter the SSB is within the configured BWP or not. ","paragraph_zero_based":21281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForGapsNR field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":21283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bandNR","paragraph_zero_based":21284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the NR target band to be measured.","paragraph_zero_based":21285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gapIndication","paragraph_zero_based":21286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether measurement gap is required for the UE to perform SSB based measurements on the concerned NR target band while NR-DC or NE-DC is not configured. The UE determines this information based on the resultant configuration of the RRCReconfiguration or RRCResume message that triggers this response. Value gap indicates that a measurement gap is needed, value no-gap indicates a measurement gap is not needed. ","paragraph_zero_based":21287}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["33f4cece98788011e0746bf8c144b1d71f6bcfcc0db8cabce58075133eaf5465","8482ac6ea3b5b7bad652689ecf9812384741adc632fe744110db3c13f481