_and_m_t":"NeedForGapNCSG-InfoNR field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":21379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"intraFreq-needForNCSG","paragraph_zero_based":21380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information for NR intra-frequency measurement.","paragraph_zero_based":21381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"interFreq-needForNCSG","paragraph_zero_based":21382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information for NR inter-frequency measurement.","paragraph_zero_based":21383}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7dca5f0c3551012cda6f5a42329a7890b13e2fcc24cc65372ebe00d88e8e0570","04182953a270c55cf30b23963688ca436414974b829968db76e28a5a815ca0ed","027f525704105de63ff3fd11b7a210397f3a25f7c87420b596eb6171d253aa5e","6266ef915f0bf321e45ea7f8b180117e47d27791dba0dd30000c4103a0660a8c","a26de600e0a3bbb9e7cd457e01ef4d3847289f8565489f11d3fce9004a335226","32eb2f48801992d8b893baf3ab9ab7648583e98966c2768b3ff1051141c37309","fd3a9de075f2592dc83e643420f73e3f76405948cf23d8ebba9a0a3a22395172","92324184bd1655564c9ea959ad743a933ece0945e7e74c28ead93816f230290e","50f24650bee4f86d723bf412eea683069d36efc84ad69c27cb700c5f437c8257","83a47e1b2635199501df72dc4c8797a79e2a906449f90719e72bea5d1804b7a2","a240fed703afad31399054c3ded97bae374d753452edb846ad9bddfd8f1444db","9fc0fe61d5b277a51e12b82fbdd7691a310aff16ecc4d9b224bb39f72303a17b","b4f5337e6c5cebaabb1ccb16830d22aeed81c26c4328e16fd15840d247bd13aa","9b3d36d6440a406e5f629243fe7132657c8153e5276077db1be7f1d05e042201","2a0268c57e6f3f9a91f25de9481b5249c99904eae3e8a5ba5e63197f5b1f0b13","d5ff237fabcafe13979fec849a4ccc82f503fe6ab1e3b1cac587acc0f63e