{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForNCSG-IntraFreq field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":21385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"servCellId","paragraph_zero_based":21386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the serving cell which contains the target SSB (associated with the initial DL BWP) to be measured.","paragraph_zero_based":21387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gapIndicationIntra","paragraph_zero_based":21388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether measurement gap or NCSG is required for the UE to perform intra-frequency SSB based measurements on the concerned serving cell. Value gap indicates that a measurement gap is needed if any of the UE configured BWPs (except the BWP(s) configured with servingCellMO associated with NCD-SSB) do not contain the frequency domain resources of the SSB associated to the initial DL BWP (CD-SSB). Value ncsg indicates that a NCSG is needed if any of the UE configured BWPs do not contain the frequency domain resources of the SSB associated to the initial DL BWP. Value nogap-noncsg indicates that neither a measurement gap nor a NCSG is needed to measure the SSB associated to the initial DL BWP (CD-SSB) for all configured BWPs (except the BWP(s) configured with servingCellMO associated with NCD-SSB), no matter the SSB is within the configured BWP or not.","paragraph_zero_based":21389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForNCSG-NR field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":21391},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bandNR","paragraph_zero_based":21392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the NR target band to be measured.","paragraph_zero_based":21393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gapIndication","paragraph_zero_based":21394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether measurement gap or NCSG is required for the UE to perform SSB based measurements on the concerned NR target band while NR-DC or NE-DC is not configured. The UE determines this information based on the resultant configuration of the RRCReconfiguration or RRCResume message that triggers this response. Value gap indicates that a measurement gap is needed, value ncsg indicates that a NCSG is needed, and value nogap-noncsg indicates neither a measurement gap nor a NCSG is needed. ","paragraph_zero_based":21395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NextHopChainingCount","paragraph_zero_based":21397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NextHopChainingCount is used to update the KgNB key and corresponds to parameter NCC: See TS 33.501 [11].","paragraph_zero_based":21398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NextHopChainingCount information element","paragraph_zero_based":21399},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":21400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NEXTHOPCHAININGCOUNT-START","paragraph_zero_based":21401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NextHopChainingCount ::=                    INTEGER (0..7)","paragraph_zero_based":21403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NEXTHOPCHAININGCOUNT-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":21405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":21406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21407}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragrap