_w_t_and_m_t":"dl-PRS-ResourceBandwidth","paragraph_zero_based":21668},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the number of PRBs allocated for all the DL-PRS Resource (allocated DL-PRS bandwidth) in multiples of 4 PRBs in this resource set. All DL-PRS Resources of the DL-PRS-PDC Resource Set have the same bandwidth. Integer value 1 corresponds to 24 PRBs, value 2 corresponds to 28 PRBs, value 3 corresponds to 32 PRBs and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":21669},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dl-PRS-StartPRB","paragraph_zero_based":21670},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the start PRB index defined as offset with respect to subcarrier 0 in common resource block 0 for the DL-PRS Resource. All DL-PRS Resources of the DL-PRS-PDC Resource Set have the same value of dl-PRS-StartPRB.","paragraph_zero_based":21671}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["eee34aad02490ceebbd8a6cc7ec3cb776f7f4d7382c6370561d58a5cd2c31159","94a6306b97cf36b1a52a10b4073e00d9bb11bcf91a05308c7903ddb9e91ff7e2","03fb598b059e5064fe319b71abcb5ee4556cf38fd7d7216d52478c01d2cd3022","20d1bdbc310f96ec0fe666db1fc0b7d11e9fb73352ced5a958117d02cd94f30c","508f423ecf34c71642367e347d4f77e6397813f3d7216bc373abdf0278c7dc7f","8bc4045d2f8cb44261f8f1ebb46ac4c44dd6e1ead2f10890333ea4672a112209","221f34a7fa7f7eaca9e7c166c7936406856f9a0d69657289b4ee809ce3e45bb9","cdb3ec714749b416150f3cbaf11f8ebb308cda07f60d65783d9629363a49215a","2b89f73b291a6cc7e199fb342f08452b75ac7dcd6472fa3d948a91f2c65da92d","2b3812ea933ceed2730189d48c35e266be88a197845619495e278de235076c17","88deae185b71d2805bfdfd53cb23ccafd0537771f92132acdc7a94b5086217e9","42e7facc313b34b835a7ba383f6ab2e19319514d6cf7cd9643bb98ea34820870","c71d7a137b5e6fdf6bff4917f103f14d0d70574ddae5b73258649e776e3f4d25","f26e89609b3d86b0e5c2375342adef8277129e030d0c3cf7e1350ebf229944b3","a752becf276971897a00d14e622048d54c652e350444eada0a426ab805e95605","fe92e939093e9a696d923dccf330ad7ce01ee62e9493ce273a2001562bff551e","8dbbbd42850200d22d20f561edd804775ca7c5aa2f4c8f930d30ae28f63bad52","d986241e0adf2136ea77e48c47a40f6d291234ac16c22a4330f347708522fea9","8f4010bb2ff6995be4906ae0b9d68fd494b1228e72d1c843a9505f7796636fbc","c19ac185cd8709a218473d9b9abde176be1e32fd8b48bb039fd8d85cff0b2bc3","1700859df76c718bae69c94d4dcc60f7493b66b5e9d82da819f355abb25768a6","d384483db04e22df60e564a65cf0eeb2194fde8b0b6a85734704efe01ea77e51","a694dac5515f83ecb00d9c9b360701463345ae2d22c13ae18bfea6e689163fdc","d3ffefe9049972d1583f04fdffa1f4358af6d1e5dea2f26262641a2df8780766"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[21648,21671],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx:p21648"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"numSymbols","paragraph_zero_based":21672},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the number of symbols per DL-PRS Resource within a slot.","paragraph_zero_based":21673},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"periodicityAndOffset","paragraph_zero_based":21674},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the periodicity of DL-PRS allocation in slots and the slot offset with respect to SFN #0 slot #0 in the PCell where the DL-PRS-PDC Resource Set is configured (i.e., slot where the first DL-PRS Resource of DL-PRS-PDC Resource Set occurs).","paragraph_zero_based":21675},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"repFactorAndTimeGap","paragraph_zero_based":21676},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If this field is absent, the value for repetitionFactor is 1 (i.e., no resource repetition).","paragraph_zero_based":21677},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21678},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RepFactorAndTimeGap field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":21679},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"repetitionFactor","paragraph_zero_based":21680},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies how many times each DL-PRS Resource is repeated for a single instance of the DL-PRS Resource Set. It is applied to all resources of the DL-PRS Resource Set. Enumerated values n2, n4, n6, n8, n16, n32 correspond to 2, 4, 6, 8, 16, 32 resource repetitions, respectively.","paragraph_zero_based":21681},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"timeGap","paragraph_zero_based":21682},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the offset in units of slots between two repeated instances of a DL-PRS Resource corresponding to the same DL-PRS Resource ID within a single instance of the DL-PRS Resource Set. The time duration spanned by one DL-PRS Resource Set containing repeated DL-PRS Resources should not exceed the periodicity configured by periodicityAndOffset.","paragraph_zero_based":21683},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21684},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NR-NS-PmaxList","paragraph_zero_based":21685},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NR-NS-PmaxList is used to configure a list of additionalPmax and additionalSpectrumEmission, as defined in TS 38.101-1 [15], table 6.2.3.1-1A, TS 38.101-2 [39], table 6.2.3.1-2, and TS 38.101-5 [75], table 6.2.3.1-1A for a given frequency band.","paragraph_zero_based":21686},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-NS-PmaxList information element","paragraph_zero_based":21687},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":21688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NR-NS-PMAXLIST-START","paragraph_zero_based":21689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-NS-PmaxList ::=                      SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNR-NS-Pmax)) OF NR-NS-PmaxValue","paragraph_zero_based":21691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-NS-PmaxValue ::=                     SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":21693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    additionalPmax                          P-Max                               OPTIONAL,   -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":21694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    additionalSpectrumEmission              AdditionalSpectrumEmission","paragraph_zero_based":21695}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b58171813b083824dcdb37aff161faab3d9c7df34ae5df90cd26b80c24639902","825e53b4cbcaf0e849eb