{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":23448},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PTRS-UplinkConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":23449},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"frequencyDensity","paragraph_zero_based":23450},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Presence and frequency density of UL PT-RS for CP-OFDM waveform as a function of scheduled BW If the field is absent, the UE uses K_PT-RS = 2 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1).","paragraph_zero_based":23451},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxNrofPorts","paragraph_zero_based":23452},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The maximum number of UL PTRS ports for CP-OFDM (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.2.3.1).","paragraph_zero_based":23453},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ptrs-Power","paragraph_zero_based":23454},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UL PTRS power boosting factor per PTRS port (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1, table 6.2.3.1.3).","paragraph_zero_based":23455},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"resourceElementOffset","paragraph_zero_based":23456},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the subcarrier offset for UL PTRS for CP-OFDM. If the field is absent, the UE applies the value offset00 (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 6.4.1.2.2).","paragraph_zero_based":23457},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sampleDensity","paragraph_zero_based":23458},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sample density of PT-RS for DFT-s-OFDM, pre-DFT, indicating a set of thresholds T={NRBn, n=0,1,2,3,4}, that indicates dependency between presence of PT-RS and scheduled BW and the values of X and K the UE should use depending on the scheduled BW, see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1, table 6.2.3.2-1.","paragraph_zero_based":23459},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"timeDensity","paragraph_zero_based":23460},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Presence and time density of UL PT-RS for CP-OFDM waveform as a function of MCS If the field is absent, the UE uses L_PT-RS = 1 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1).","paragraph_zero_based":23461},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"timeDensityTransformPrecoding","paragraph_zero_based":23462},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Time density (OFDM symbol level) of PT-RS for DFT-s-OFDM. If the field is absent, the UE applies value d1 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1).","paragraph_zero_based":23463},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"transformPrecoderDisabled","paragraph_zero_based":23464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration of UL PTRS without transform precoder (with CP-OFDM).","paragraph_zero_based":23465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"transformPrecoderEnabled","paragraph_zero_based":23466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration of UL PTRS with transform precoder (DFT-S-OFDM).","paragraph_zero_based":23467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":23468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–PUCCH-Config","paragraph_zero_based":23469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE PUCCH-Config is used to configure UE specific PUCCH parameters (per BWP).","paragraph_zero_based":23470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PUCCH-Config information element","paragraph_zero_based":23471}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1565d069d86338beb079763f9e2c7ebeff56d2affebbe147b1ec98e58d145ea9","10da40f7488b5965f28f72e35bdb380c50ed16c2f68a2363e23fdf05d82e9083","e95d258fa12ac873e693b4774fa8769112de228556756c8434f12d1394b4c9d9","f8862652f9d811ebc6b692649c36ce691af7ab66e0577fbd38447eb7e512d673","f4c61567b97d697a8a8c9ae7a5f82b7d117e8fe358aed45e1adf7dcd4d3c8c5d","e158eb3a8c1b67071aecd3633f4d1d3012a7