{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":24672},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":24673},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–Q-QualMin","paragraph_zero_based":24674},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE Q-QualMin is used to indicate for cell selection/ re-selection the required minimum received RSRQ level in the (NR) cell. Corresponds to parameter Qqualmin in TS 38.304 [20]. Actual value Qqualmin = field value [dB].","paragraph_zero_based":24675},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Q-QualMin information element","paragraph_zero_based":24676},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":24677},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-Q-QUALMIN-START","paragraph_zero_based":24678},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":24679},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Q-QualMin ::=                       INTEGER (-43..-12)","paragraph_zero_based":24680},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":24681},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-Q-QUALMIN-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":24682},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":24683},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":24684},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–Q-RxLevMin","paragraph_zero_based":24685},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE Q-RxLevMin is used to indicate for cell selection/ re-selection the required minimum received RSRP level in the (NR) cell. Corresponds to parameter Qrxlevmin in TS 38.304 [20]. Actual value Qrxlevmin = field value * 2 [dBm].","paragraph_zero_based":24686},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Q-RxLevMin information element","paragraph_zero_based":24687},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":24688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-Q-RXLEVMIN-START"