{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":25488},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":25489},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BeamLinkMonitoringRS-r17 ::=        SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":25490},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    beamLinkMonitoringRS-Id-r17         BeamLinkMonitoringRS-Id-r17,","paragraph_zero_based":25491},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    detectionResource-r17               CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":25492},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        ssb-Index                       SSB-Index,","paragraph_zero_based":25493},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        csi-RS-Index                    NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceId","paragraph_zero_based":25494},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    },","paragraph_zero_based":25495},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":25496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":25497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":25498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BeamLinkMonitoringRS-Id-r17 ::=     INTEGER (0..maxNrofFailureDetectionResources-1-r17)","paragraph_zero_based":25499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":25500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-RADIOLINKMONITORINGCONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":25501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":25502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":25503},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RadioLinkMonitoringConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":25504},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"additionalPCI","paragraph_zero_based":25505},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the physical cell IDs (PCI) of the SSBs in the failureDetectionSet2. If candidateBeamRS-List2 is configured in IE BeamFailureRecoveryRSConfig the field indicates the physical cell IDs (PCI) of the SSBs in the candidateBeamRS-List2.","paragraph_zero_based":25506},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"beamFailureDetectionTimer","paragraph_zero_based":25507},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Timer for beam failure detection (see TS 38.321 [3], clause 5.17). See also the BeamFailureRecoveryConfig IE. Value in number of \"Qout,LR reporting periods of Beam Failure Detection\" Reference Signal (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 6). Value pbfd1 corresponds to 1 Qout,LR reporting period of Beam Failure Detection Reference Signal, value pbfd2 corresponds to 2 Qout,LR reporting periods of Beam Failure Detection Reference Signal and so on. ","paragraph_zero_based":25508},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"beamFailureInstanceMaxCount","paragraph_zero_based":25509},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field determines after how many beam failure events the UE triggers beam failure recovery (see TS 38.321 [3], clause 5.17). Value n1 corresponds to 1 beam failure instance, value n2 corresponds to 2 beam failure instances and so on. ","paragraph_zero_based":25510},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"failureDetectionResourcesToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":25511}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["82aeafb8d5191086a6975e82150476dd7703e3670fe9c345ffac8da3d92f18c8","563f2df1553736e0bc43a08d09fb33f7e260892d8f88be60a61272898fc6803e","873a43fa03237eb6d69809e1d7d89524326ad4e8ad2b7eb1f9fa993bf6834d36","ed33e23c44ca2d36140aa77bd7d64c01fe942e689cff3a95c4fac7e8d5a06982","996c92ba8ea6416d6e312afb76508f99fca35893e3febeee042d6227c56a5c43","24b4aef29eedbbd23d64f5164d55212c30a5845706a11ddc7196c9942a1a4f18","869572dd5496fcde3c948437b4fbdd6762