{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A5:PCell/PSCell becomes worse than absolute threshold1 AND Neighbour/SCell becomes better than another absolute threshold2;","paragraph_zero_based":25968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A6:Neighbour becomes amount of offset better than SCell;","paragraph_zero_based":25969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event D1:Distance between UE and a reference location referenceLocation1 becomes larger than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference1 and distance between UE and a reference location referenceLocation2 becomes shorter than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference2;","paragraph_zero_based":25970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent A3: Conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes amount of offset better than PCell/PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":25971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent A4: Conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes better than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":25972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent A5: PCell/PSCell becomes worse than absolute threshold1 AND Conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes better than another absolute threshold2;","paragraph_zero_based":25973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent D1: Distance between UE and a reference location referenceLocation1 becomes larger than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference1 and distance between UE and a reference location referenceLocation2 of conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes shorter than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference2;","paragraph_zero_based":25974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent T1: Time measured at UE becomes more than configured threshold t1-Threshold but is less than t1-Threshold + duration;","paragraph_zero_based":25975},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event X1:Serving L2 U2N Relay UE becomes worse than absolute threshold1 AND NR Cell becomes better than another absolute threshold2;","paragraph_zero_based":25976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event X2:Serving L2 U2N Relay UE becomes worse than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":25977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For event I1, measurement reporting event is based on CLI measurement results, which can either be derived based on SRS-RSRP or CLI-RSSI.","paragraph_zero_based":25978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event I1:Interference becomes higher than absolute threshold.","paragraph_zero_based":25979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The reporting events concerning Aerial UE altitude are labelled HN with N equal to 1 and 2. Additionally, the reporting events concerning Aerial UE altitude and the neighboring cell measurements simultaneously are labelled AMHN with M equal to 3, 4, 5 and N equal to 1, 2.  ","paragraph_zero_based":25980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event H1:Aerial UE altitude becomes higher than a threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":25981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event H2:Aerial UE altitude becomes lower than a threshold.","paragraph_zero_based":25982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A3H1: Neighbour becomes offset better than SpCell and the Aerial UE altitude becomes higher than a threshold.","paragraph_zero_based":25983},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A3H2: Neighbour becomes offset better than SpCell and the Aerial UE altitude becomes lower than a threshold.","paragraph_zero_based":25984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A4H1: Neighbour becomes better than threshold1 and the Aerial UE altitude becomes higher than a threshold2.","paragraph_zero_based":25985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A4H2: Neighbour becomes better than threshold1 and the Aerial UE altitude becomes lower than a threshold2.","paragraph_zero_based":25986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A5H1: SpCell becomes worse than threshold1 and neighbour becomes better than threshold2 and the Aerial UE altitude becomes higher than a threshold3.","paragraph_zero_based":25987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A5H2: SpCell becomes worse than threshold1 and neighbour becomes better than threshold2 and the Aerial UE altitude becomes lower than a threshold3.","paragraph_zero_based":25988},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ReportConfigNR information element","paragraph_zero_based":25989},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":25990},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-REPORTCONFIGNR-START","paragraph_zero_based":25991}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["28e2b9b190dd4c1737fe8bd7cda24dd60e8f536654702226a432035792bf591a","1e8dc60650a0efd719ff1b94fb75a1f7da1de1db9057bbf37838398f922ff129","d406c7117a0a855623a2cee4e0af4245b684ca9eafc2b834f0b320f9eeb411c5","f3f00f3b018e714bbf306c3bc9e0a8050d2d77f4c8a2d039193f6ab413ea0677","4e2250c7236f0cdae8d547aac206a5c7ca8c611ef2e976ae31984f0c77c082f3","8abb6e1b16a1d7601ec1f3481cb35c91b6ada70d15b57dcbb88727419e231361","a2f83e249bbfca908a019cf76335c354dfe1264cb3d8fc7f87ad933d79a195bd","d3a6942371ff963e0cb4adf4612690aef0a1021ab5d0d11048957f71f0988d8e","1f0b6a59d23f0ffe79ef51272a58c67c3afeac297b12d9ca082f8ad655cc1753","4c445e19eec8fdc8bdbec225bf45b32dd61362f84241a3c2b7894aa3f9132ba4","e28a6a898f16fecc9ee46cb6d878c7f1a50a06ec6789ff2cb24931ddc6dcb4da","44cce4639e2e41f9b184a685937a408ea7ba5fd7bdc7b26bbf1e8ae39715f369","b3926ea8a9eafbb577d65380557ea66ebf46d52b76b67f95f41614701123be29","2d1bf808a01cf4912f57891e1307a07b34ed492d5275080aca3031e43f33c022","532914205fac858ea35a8f942309a96e685fd5657af3d91f4072bac255770f30","8af5a2b90b2d55b