{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The cell measurement quantities to be included in the measurement report.","paragraph_zero_based":26400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportQuantityRS-Indexes","paragraph_zero_based":26401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates which measurement information per RS index the UE shall include in the measurement report.","paragraph_zero_based":26402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"simulMultiTriggerSingleMeasReport","paragraph_zero_based":26403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates when multiple events of the same type satisfy the entering condition(s), whether to consider only the event with the smallest value between the altitude of the UE and the configured altitude threshold.","paragraph_zero_based":26404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"timeToTrigger","paragraph_zero_based":26405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Time during which specific criteria for the event needs to be met in order to trigger a measurement report.","paragraph_zero_based":26406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"useAllowedCellList","paragraph_zero_based":26407},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether only the cells included in the allow-list of the associated measObject are applicable as specified in 5.5.4.1.","paragraph_zero_based":26408},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"useT312","paragraph_zero_based":26409},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If value TRUE is configured, the UE shall use the timer T312 with the value t312 as specified in the corresponding measObjectNR. If value FALSE is configured, the timer T312 is considered as disabled. Network configures value TRUE only if reportType is set to eventTriggered.","paragraph_zero_based":26410},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"xN-ThresholdM","paragraph_zero_based":26411},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Threshold value associated to the selected trigger quantity (e.g. RSRP, RSRQ, SINR) per RS Type (e.g. SS/PBCH block, CSI-RS) to be used in NR measurement report triggering condition for event xN. If multiple thresholds are defined for event number xN, the thresholds are differentiated by M. x1-Threshold1 and x2-Threshold indicates the threshold value for the serving L2 U2N Relay UE, x1-Threshold2 indicates the threshold value for the NR Cells.","paragraph_zero_based":26412},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26413},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CLI-EventTriggerConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":26414},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"i1-Threshold","paragraph_zero_based":26415},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Threshold value associated to the selected trigger quantity (e.g. SRS-RSRP, CLI-RSSI) to be used in CLI measurement report triggering condition for event i1.","paragraph_zero_based":26416},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"eventId","paragraph_zero_based":26417},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Choice of CLI event triggered reporting criteria.","paragraph_zero_based":26418},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxReportCLI","paragraph_zero_based":26419},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Max number of CLI measurement resource to include in the measurement report.","paragraph_zero_based":26420},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportAmount","paragraph_zero_based":26421},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of measurement reports.","paragraph_zero_based":26422},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportOnLeave","paragraph_zero_based":26423}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c611b5cb350ce2e8d9832cf097f76f32ecabd884b98cc7b74888c261a710f322","