{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    scellActivationRS-Id-r17         SCellActivationRS-ConfigId-r17,","paragraph_zero_based":26928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    resourceSet-r17                  NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSetId,","paragraph_zero_based":26929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    gapBetweenBursts-r17             INTEGER (2..31)                                                            OPTIONAL, -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":26930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    qcl-Info-r17                     TCI-StateId,","paragraph_zero_based":26931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":26932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":26933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SCELLACTIVATIONRS-CONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26935},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SCellActivationRS-Config field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":26938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gapBetweenBursts","paragraph_zero_based":26939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When this field is present, there are two bursts and it indicates the gap between the two bursts in number of slots. When this field is absent, there is a single burst.","paragraph_zero_based":26940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"qcl-Info","paragraph_zero_based":26941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reference to TCI-State for providing the QCL source and QCL type for each NZP-CSI-RS-Resource listed in nzp-CSI-RS-Resources of the NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet indicated by resourceSet (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.6.1.1.1). TCI-StateId refers to the TCI-State which has this value for tci-StateId and is defined in tci-StatesToAddModList or dl-OrJointTCI-StateList in the PDSCH-Config included in the BWP-Downlink of this serving cell indicated by firstActiveDownlinkBWP-Id in the ServingCellConfig in which this IE is included.","paragraph_zero_based":26942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"resourceSet","paragraph_zero_based":26943},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nzp-CSI-ResourceSetId of the NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet of this serving cell used as resource configuration for one or two bursts for SCell activation. This NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet consists of four NZP CSI-RS resources in two consecutive slots with two NZP CSI-RS resources in each slot (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.6.1.1.1). The CSI-RS associated with this NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet are located in the BWP addressed by firstActiveDownlinkBWP-Id.","paragraph_zero_based":26944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SCellActivationRS-ConfigId","paragraph_zero_based":26946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SCellActivationRS-ConfigId is used to identify one SCellActivationRS-Config.","paragraph_zero_based":26947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SCellActivationRS-ConfigId information element","paragraph_zero_based":26948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":26949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SCELLACTIVATIONRS-CONFIGID-START","paragraph_zero_based":26950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26951}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b8d485a0c6decc4071241387028baac5007f96fa4b180b18cc8419e5d45020c9","dc8e1dc06b31ed632b1d0d4ce758886232dbda4785bffb6804fccdfb5533890b","064608