{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SpeedStateScaleFactors","paragraph_zero_based":28560},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SpeedStateScaleFactors concerns factors, to be applied when the UE is in medium or high speed state, used for scaling a mobility control related parameter.","paragraph_zero_based":28561},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SpeedStateScaleFactors information element","paragraph_zero_based":28562},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":28563},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SPEEDSTATESCALEFACTORS-START","paragraph_zero_based":28564},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28565},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SpeedStateScaleFactors ::=          SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":28566},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sf-Medium                           ENUMERATED {oDot25, oDot5, oDot75, lDot0},","paragraph_zero_based":28567},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sf-High                             ENUMERATED {oDot25, oDot5, oDot75, lDot0}","paragraph_zero_based":28568},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":28569},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SPEEDSTATESCALEFACTORS-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":28570},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":28571},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28572},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SpeedStateScaleFactors field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":28573},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sf-High","paragraph_zero_based":28574},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The concerned mobility control related parameter is multiplied with this factor if the UE is in High Mobility state as defined in TS 38.304 [20]. Value oDot25 corresponds to 0.25, value oDot5 corresponds to 0.5, oDot75 corresponds to 0.75 and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":28575},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sf-Medium","paragraph_zero_based":28576},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The concerned mobility control related parameter is multiplied with this factor if the UE is in Medium Mobility state as defined in TS 38.304 [20]. Value oDot25 corresponds to 0.25, value oDot5 corresponds to 0.5, value oDot75 corresponds to 0.75, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":28577},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28578},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SPS-Config","paragraph_zero_based":28579},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SPS-Config is used to configure downlink semi-persistent transmission. Multiple Downlink SPS configurations may be configured in one BWP of a serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":28580},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SPS-Config information element","paragraph_zero_based":28581},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":28582},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SPS-CONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":28583}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ee96a128e950981b9f539f10d512cb420a6237815c530ef9a1d424a1dfc5ba93","4743dfd1374c3315ce7408070bf598b26e4dd2e4a4bac883fd110d249c172a3f","6341985cd97eab4c1882916d520a1c3437abd36acaf907bca1bfbc351840f995","acd2856419f73e25faea06630adbf024068b30c137480e4d5ab0a2243382ae2d","139f0d4d84673d0ec7c9dc64ae11c59bc41721d6985c229e8602f928afb70547","2286c88c0998837080c2a0b67d1fe3088be5dffe42cdc914d04987abd8d7e2cc","dfb7a975faee2ac78c6399b75eee2dac7acf6cbf93179dda728f95bc143d90c7","c0be9986091c4178d2058c13af929df14949209adff105bbf7b910eb20a41e59","efd6d48ae5a6c40567ece5c6a9a9927d37110e7185b9732748a252a5ff