{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    cc-IndexInOneCC-Set                 INTEGER (0..7)                                                          OPTIONAL    -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":28728},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":28729},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28730},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SRS-CARRIERSWITCHING-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":28731},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":28732},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28733},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-CC-SetIndex field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":28734},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cc-IndexInOneCC-Set","paragraph_zero_based":28735},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the CC index in one CC set for Type A (see TS 38.212 [17], TS 38.213 [13], clause 7.3.1, 11.4). The network always includes this field when the srs-TPC-PDCCH-Group is set to typeA.","paragraph_zero_based":28736},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cc-SetIndex","paragraph_zero_based":28737},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the CC set index for Type A associated (see TS 38.212 [17], TS 38.213 [13], clause 7.3.1, 11.4). The network always includes this field when the srs-TPC-PDCCH-Group is set to typeA. The network does not configure this field to 3 in this release of specification.","paragraph_zero_based":28738},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28739},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-CarrierSwitching field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":28740},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"monitoringCells","paragraph_zero_based":28741},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A set of serving cells for monitoring PDCCH conveying SRS DCI format with CRC scrambled by TPC-SRS-RNTI (see TS 38.212 [17], TS 38.213 [13], clause 7.3.1, 11.3).","paragraph_zero_based":28742},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"srs-SwitchFromServCellIndex","paragraph_zero_based":28743},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the serving cell whose UL transmission may be interrupted during SRS transmission on a PUSCH-less SCell. During SRS transmission on a PUSCH-less SCell, the UE may temporarily suspend the UL transmission on a serving cell with PUSCH in the same CG to allow the PUSCH-less SCell to transmit SRS. (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.2.1.3).","paragraph_zero_based":28744},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"srs-TPC-PDCCH-Group","paragraph_zero_based":28745},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Network configures the UE with either typeA-SRS-TPC-PDCCH-Group or typeB-SRS-TPC-PDCCH-Group, if any.","paragraph_zero_based":28746},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"typeA","paragraph_zero_based":28747},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Type A trigger configuration for SRS transmission on a PUSCH-less SCell (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.4). In this release, the network configures at most one entry (the first entry) of typeA, and the first entry corresponds to the serving cell in which the SRS-CarrierSwitching field is configured. SRS carrier switching to SUL carrier is not supported in this version of the specification.","paragraph_zero_based":28748},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"typeB","paragraph_zero_based":28749},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Type B trigger configuration for SRS transmission on a PUSCH-less SCell (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.4).","paragraph_zero_based":28750},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28751}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["dc4ad99c10c7