{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UAC-BarringInfoSet ::=              SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":29905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    uac-BarringFactor                   ENUMERATED {p00, p05, p10, p15, p20, p25, p30, p40,","paragraph_zero_based":29906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                    p50, p60, p70, p75, p80, p85, p90, p95},","paragraph_zero_based":29907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    uac-BarringTime                     ENUMERATED {s4, s8, s16, s32, s64, s128, s256, s512},","paragraph_zero_based":29908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    uac-BarringForAccessIdentity        BIT STRING (SIZE(7))","paragraph_zero_based":29909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":29910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29911},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UAC-BarringInfoSet-v1700 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":29912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    uac-BarringFactorForAI3-r17  ENUMERATED {p00, p05, p10, p15, p20, p25, p30, p40, p50, p60, p70, p75, p80, p85, p90, p95}","paragraph_zero_based":29913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                                       OPTIONAL  -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":29914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":29915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-UAC-BARRINGINFOSETLIST-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":29917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":29918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29919},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UAC-BarringInfoSetList field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":29920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"uac-BarringInfoSetList","paragraph_zero_based":29921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of access control parameter sets. Each access category can be configured with access parameters corresponding to a particular set by uac-barringInfoSetIndex. Association of an access category with an index that has no corresponding entry in the uac-BarringInfoSetList is valid configuration and indicates no barring.","paragraph_zero_based":29922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"uac-BarringForAccessIdentity","paragraph_zero_based":29923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether access attempt is allowed for each Access Identity. The leftmost bit, bit 0 in the bit string corresponds to Access Identity 1, bit 1 in the bit string corresponds to Access Identity 2, bit 2 in the bit string corresponds to Access Identity 11, bit 3 in the bit string corresponds to Access Identity 12, bit 4 in the bit string corresponds to Access Identity 13, bit 5 in the bit string corresponds to Access Identity 14, and bit 6 in the bit string corresponds to Access Identity 15. Value 0 means that access attempt is allowed for the corresponding access identity.","paragraph_zero_based":29924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"uac-BarringFactor","paragraph_zero_based":29925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Represents the probability that access attempt would be allowed during access barring check.","paragraph_zero_based":29926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"uac-BarringFactorForAI3","paragraph_zero_based":29927}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d7fb075b933dc2a438b7be4bd572d7ba0d923df88efcab141514baae2345a692","b46934c17b653ab07e4b1694e44c1286b67023206e9f84