{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    p0AlphaSetforPUSCH-r17       P0AlphaSet-r17                                                               OPTIONAL, -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":30264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    p0AlphaSetforPUCCH-r17       P0AlphaSet-r17                                                               OPTIONAL, -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":30265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    p0AlphaSetforSRS-r17         P0AlphaSet-r17                                                               OPTIONAL  -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":30266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":30267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"P0AlphaSet-r17 ::=           SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":30269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    p0-r17                       INTEGER (-16..15)                                                            OPTIONAL, -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":30270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    alpha-r17                    Alpha                                                                        OPTIONAL, -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":30271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    closedLoopIndex-r17          ENUMERATED { i0, i1 }","paragraph_zero_based":30272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":30273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Uplink-powerControlId-r17 ::= INTEGER(1.. maxUL-TCI-r17)","paragraph_zero_based":30275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-UPLINK-POWERCONTROL-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":30277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":30278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30279},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Uplink-PowerControl field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":30280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"p0AlphaSetforPUSCH, p0AlphaSetforPUCCH, p0AlphaSetforSRS","paragraph_zero_based":30281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configures power control parameters for PUSCH, PUCCH and SRS (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 7.2). When the field alpha is absent in p0AlphaSetforPUSCH, the UE applies the value 1 for PUSCH power control. When the field alpha is absent in p0AlphaSetforSRS, the UE applies the value 1 for SRS power control. In p0AlphaSetForPUCCH, the field alpha is absent (not used).","paragraph_zero_based":30282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–Uu-RelayRLC-ChannelConfig","paragraph_zero_based":30284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE Uu-RelayRLC-ChannelConfig is used to configure an RLC entity, a corresponding logical channel in MAC for Uu Relay RLC channel between L2 U2N Relay UE and network.","paragraph_zero_based":30285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Uu-RelayRLC-ChannelConfig information element","paragraph_zero_based":30286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":30287}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["979902c1a5eb38dae74f0268e8817d8906d3523f0a838b29d6604570349cac23","c876ceb4fabddf7b67beb96bbba75060932d270da0190ac64d1794fb5d1cbe96","45ca293e1ed05dde7393c59d3c48c477fee3637d4bc68005256437cb53b2753d","a0cb1f4a094b7406da98d3969e68bfa4f24a01fd93c1cadb04cd815e2e2548d8","109218686f756bf5e0ae5f6b95824b80db620a1fd27cfa7d1bdbdbd56728b701","32aa9fe275fcbbabcb6d98aad3e5a8aa625cbb3332d