{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether there is 7.5 kHz shift or not. 7.5 kHz shift is applied if the field is set to true. Otherwise 7.5 kHz shift is not applied.","paragraph_zero_based":30360},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"txDirectCurrentLocation","paragraph_zero_based":30361},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The uplink Tx Direct Current location for the carrier. Only values in the value range of this field between 0 and 3299, which indicate the subcarrier index within the carrier corresponding to the numerology of the corresponding uplink BWP and value 3300, which indicates \"Outside the carrier\" and value 3301, which indicates \"Undetermined position within the carrier\" are used in this version of the specification.","paragraph_zero_based":30362},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30363},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UplinkTxDirectCurrentCell field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":30364},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"servCellIndex","paragraph_zero_based":30365},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The serving cell ID of the serving cell corresponding to the uplinkDirectCurrentBWP.","paragraph_zero_based":30366},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"uplinkDirectCurrentBWP","paragraph_zero_based":30367},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The Tx Direct Current locations for all the uplink BWPs configured at the corresponding serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":30368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"uplinkDirectCurrentBWP-SUL","paragraph_zero_based":30369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The Tx Direct Current locations for all the supplementary uplink BWPs configured at the corresponding serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":30370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–UplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrierList","paragraph_zero_based":30372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE UplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrierList indicates the Tx Direct Current locations for intra-band CA including one, two or more uplink carriers. The UE does not report the uplink Direct Current location information for SUL carrier(s).","paragraph_zero_based":30373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrierList information element","paragraph_zero_based":30374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":30375},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-UPLINKTXDIRECTCURRENTMORECARRIERLIST-START","paragraph_zero_based":30376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrierList-r17 ::=   SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofCC-Group-r17)) OF CC-Group-r17","paragraph_zero_based":30378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CC-Group-r17 ::=           SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":30380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    servCellIndexLower-r17     ServCellIndex,","paragraph_zero_based":30381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    servCellIndexHigher-r17    ServCellIndex              OPTIONAL,","paragraph_zero_based":30382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    defaultDC-Location-r17     DefaultDC-Location-r17,","paragraph_zero_based":30383}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["bfe11ec048c91961ff942746cbcf605cf8bf7a9f18bab9dc5bbdffbfc1dd3d62","9d15d0413e2bf0301162c107e451bf54ba1e602bf1366aa54823a2ad50ae5d20","1d120e529e24ef1cb04d7e2ff383456652cd14a4273c4c118c89718c8273c3e7","b35d3db7fc68a608df987b484904abf36fecc05