{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The serving cell ID and BWP ID of the first carrier of the uplink carrier aggregation for which the uplink Tx Direct Current location(s) are being reported. ","paragraph_zero_based":30480},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"carrierTwoInfo","paragraph_zero_based":30481},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The serving cell ID and BWP ID of the second carrier of the uplink carrier aggregation for which the uplink Tx Direct Current location(s) are being reported.","paragraph_zero_based":30482},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"singlePA-TxDirectCurrent","paragraph_zero_based":30483},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The uplink Tx Direct Current location for the UE which support single PA for this uplink carrier aggregation. For the UEs which support dual PA for this uplink carrier aggregation, this field is for reporting the uplink Tx Direct Current location of the first PA.  ","paragraph_zero_based":30484},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"secondPA-TxDirectCurrent","paragraph_zero_based":30485},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The uplink Tx Direct Current location used by the UE with the second PA for the UEs which support dual PA for this uplink carrier aggregation. This field shall be absent for the UplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier entity where deactivatedCarrier of carrierOneInfo or carrierTwoInfo is set to deactivated.","paragraph_zero_based":30486},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30487},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–ZP-CSI-RS-Resource","paragraph_zero_based":30488},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE ZP-CSI-RS-Resource is used to configure a Zero-Power (ZP) CSI-RS resource (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.4.2). Reconfiguration of a ZP-CSI-RS-Resource between periodic or semi-persistent and aperiodic is not supported.","paragraph_zero_based":30489},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ZP-CSI-RS-Resource information element","paragraph_zero_based":30490},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":30491},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-ZP-CSI-RS-RESOURCE-START","paragraph_zero_based":30492},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30493},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ZP-CSI-RS-Resource ::=              SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":30494},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    zp-CSI-RS-ResourceId                ZP-CSI-RS-ResourceId,","paragraph_zero_based":30495},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    resourceMapping                     CSI-RS-ResourceMapping,","paragraph_zero_based":30496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    periodicityAndOffset                CSI-ResourcePeriodicityAndOffset                OPTIONAL, --Cond PeriodicOrSemiPersistent","paragraph_zero_based":30497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":30498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":30499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ZP-CSI-RS-ResourceId ::=            INTEGER (0..maxNrofZP-CSI-RS-Resources-1)","paragraph_zero_based":30501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-ZP-CSI-RS-RESOURCE-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":30503}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["eaaff5699b97429777573a3d2c3c8e0d464dfb94b8e672a4c4b6b5d00a44fcab","2a45b663654b0a794514366270eeb48d661e878103ccd1402bf422fc92468339","f967404b474cf4df70df2e5e4725286373f3312e82ef6c250d356ee53b9a34ec","90ffddaa110b72de83c8bee9c03aadaadf08fa4c27c