{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    maxNumberSemiPersistentCSI-ReportPerBWP     INTEGER (0..4),","paragraph_zero_based":32832},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    simultaneousCSI-ReportsAllCC                INTEGER (5..32)","paragraph_zero_based":32833},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":32834},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32835},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FEATURESETUPLINK-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32836},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32837},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32838},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FeatureSetUplink field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":32839},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"featureSetListPerUplinkCC","paragraph_zero_based":32840},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates which features the UE supports on the individual UL carriers of the feature set (and hence of a band entry that refers to the feature set). The UE shall hence include at least as many FeatureSetUplinkPerCC-Id in this list as the number of carriers it supports according to the ca-BandwidthClassUL, except if indicating additional functionality by reducing the number of FeatureSetUplinkPerCC-Id in the feature set (see NOTE 1 in FeatureSetCombination IE description). The order of the elements in this list is not relevant, i.e., the network may configure any of the carriers in accordance with any of the FeatureSetUplinkPerCC-Id in this list.","paragraph_zero_based":32841},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32842},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–FeatureSetUplinkId","paragraph_zero_based":32843},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE FeatureSetUplinkId identifies an uplink feature set. The FeatureSetUplinkId of a FeatureSetUplink is the index position of the FeatureSetUplink in the featureSetsUplink list in the FeatureSets IE. The first element in the list is referred to by FeatureSetUplinkId = 1, and so on. The FeatureSetUplinkId =0 is not used by an actual FeatureSetUplink but means that the UE does not support a carrier in this band of a band combination.","paragraph_zero_based":32844},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FeatureSetUplinkId information element","paragraph_zero_based":32845},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":32846},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FEATURESETUPLINKID-START","paragraph_zero_based":32847},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32848},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FeatureSetUplinkId ::=                  INTEGER (0..maxUplinkFeatureSets)","paragraph_zero_based":32849},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32850},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FEATURESETUPLINKID-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32851},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32852},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32853},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–FeatureSetUplinkPerCC","paragraph_zero_based":32854},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE FeatureSetUplinkPerCC indicates a set of features that the UE supports on the corresponding carrier of one band entry of a band combination.","paragraph_zero_based":32855}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["169c44b6e239e2919e43dcfdb4455ef914fa6b88b5adc3ac4974e1225235edcf","b15b4035d421ea6fa478379e2df829eca6aca82c83bda09e6f1ec47e11649c61","e72976194da00bc1d81aefce080730e4abbd318a385001bdc519389cfa7f70cd","57851306390c9e74a06820