{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    -- R1 23-3-1-3FeMIMO: Multi-TRP PUSCH repetition (type B) - non-codebook based","paragraph_zero_based":32880},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    mTRP-PUSCH-RepetitionTypeB-r17    ENUMERATED {n1,n2,n3,n4}                          OPTIONAL,","paragraph_zero_based":32881},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    -- R1 23-3-1-1 -codebook based Multi-TRP PUSCH repetition (type B)","paragraph_zero_based":32882},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    mTRP-PUSCH-TypeB-CB-r17           ENUMERATED {n1,n2,n4}                             OPTIONAL,","paragraph_zero_based":32883},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    supportedBandwidthUL-v1710        SupportedBandwidth-v1700                          OPTIONAL","paragraph_zero_based":32884},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":32885},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32886},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FEATURESETUPLINKPERCC-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32887},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–FeatureSetUplinkPerCC-Id","paragraph_zero_based":32890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE FeatureSetUplinkPerCC-Id identifies a set of features applicable to one carrier of a feature set. The FeatureSetUplinkPerCC-Id of a FeatureSetUplinkPerCC is the index position of the FeatureSetUplinkPerCC in the featureSetsUplinkPerCC. The first element in the list is referred to by FeatureSetUplinkPerCC-Id = 1, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":32891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FeatureSetUplinkPerCC-Id information element","paragraph_zero_based":32892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":32893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t