ons","paragraph_zero_based":34719},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"csi-RS-IM-ReceptionForFeedback/ csi-RS-ProcFrameworkForSRS/ csi-ReportFramework","paragraph_zero_based":34720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"These fields are optionally present in fr1-fr2-Add-UE-NR-Capabilities in UE-NR-Capability. They shall not be set in any other instance of the IE Phy-ParametersFRX-Diff. If the network configures the UE with serving cells on both FR1 and FR2 bands, these parameters, if present, limit the corresponding parameters in MIMO-ParametersPerBand.","paragraph_zero_based":34721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":34722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–Phy-ParametersMRDC","paragraph_zero_based":34723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE Phy-ParametersMRDC is used to convey physical layer capabilities for MR-DC.","paragraph_zero_based":34724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Phy-ParametersMRDC information element","paragraph_zero_based":34725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":34726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-PHY-PARAMETERSMRDC-START","paragraph_zero_based":34727}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d67c0c83dd6a19798590cac21e9751f558cce59d9157efb6d4369a277c891668","3afebe2ca6ce86d960e08d90ebfd24f1d79dc0623dbc13e13ce5f52faccacee7","20481c5bcd893dcd46885b25b2c2eae31994c891b40b552603d9863effedcf68","992efd03e45e7402c17cc2fd187f88a059d593b9cff920daf7b6383c88fa5ab5","08328ead668781067f8447ab1169929bf2e950e65c9419dac765b6c7838429e9","e792443d06277baf757a5c9e53192d48e326a27b4358bab74f2ec965bb026214","4806d8d88318579ab8fa647b74173bac9269feb4c272431e190917b2b23a4d5f","92c0b3c04eac7383d6c291