{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36792},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-EUTRA-MULTIBANDINFOLIST-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":36793},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":36794},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36795},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–EUTRA-MultiBandInfoListAerial","paragraph_zero_based":36796},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE EUTRA-MultiBandInfoListAerial indicates the list of frequency bands for aerial UE in addition to the band represented by CarrierFreq for which cell reselection parameters are common, and a list of additionalPmax and additionalSpectrumEmission.","paragraph_zero_based":36797},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"EUTRA-MultiBandInfoListAerial information element","paragraph_zero_based":36798},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":36799},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-EUTRA-MULTIBANDINFOLISTAERIAL-START","paragraph_zero_based":36800},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36801},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"EUTRA-MultiBandInfoListAerial-r18 ::=     SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxMultiBands)) OF EUTRA-MultiBandInfoAerial-r18","paragraph_zero_based":36802},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36803},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"EUTRA-MultiBandInfoAerial-r18 ::=         SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":36804},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    eutra-FreqBandIndicator-r18               FreqBandIndicatorEUTRA,","paragraph_zero_based":36805},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    eutra-NS-PmaxListAerial-r18               EUTRA-NS-PmaxList                 OPTIONAL    -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":36806},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":36807},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-EUTRA-MULTIBANDINFOLISTAERIAL-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":36809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":36810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–EUTRA-NS-PmaxList","paragraph_zero_based":36812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE EUTRA-NS-PmaxList concerns a list of additionalPmax and additionalSpectrumEmission, as defined in TS 36.101 [22], table 6.2.4-1 for UEs neither in CE nor BL UEs, TS 36.101 [22], table 6.2.4E-1 for UEs in CE or BL UEs, and TS 36.101 [22], table TBD for Aerial UEs, for a given frequency band.","paragraph_zero_based":36813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"EUTRA-NS-PmaxList information element","paragraph_zero_based":36814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":36815}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["308cd4b4344636b9b8d48dcf27f5544bcb9e3fe7b3adadad0c59ba53b69fbca3","0b5ac6895eda52e848c403640eee9a3b7aae4bcab8fadf9912078f5ccfeb9f29","5f1dd9f9084e0bd6dc1747ebcd61ec75a1fcb190efb73aa842e9729805905224","ebce8027ade72eaea042766c32bc130843456df8d9e3f36401db2842ccb68beb","e5da4a1b850e0c35c58dd4719c9f39ea5091c9f7268818d04b3121f8176794ca","006cf3b20ff9197ca5dcbf821d0a89274c6d8162e5ed245403ec1cddac6e85a2","d6371aa7be8250a26bc3de6e5d99755f26253525f0b640f3c6c4958bbda0ca5b","c1aca44bedc8971ad57bbfec17d803827a16abe63701d5d9e54216d1084cb572","120fe24a6d553a3028271dfcbcf7b6fbe5fd5e777163ba5247653e4fca4e96ca","be3b0c6ab8e47350b22b70d4d90f66386ae9b6508d918487d768268a152ed912","1d704e8516edda9774a48ad8369e7894cc240dfc27a224f68fe735c4e4dd65bf","84869bc98e