{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":37200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"OtherConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":37202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig","paragraph_zero_based":37203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report the relaxation state of BFD measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":37204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"btNameList","paragraph_zero_based":37205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report measurements from specific Bluetooth beacons. NG-RAN configures the field if includeBT-Meas is configured for one or more measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":37206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateServingFreqListNR","paragraph_zero_based":37207},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates for each candidate NR serving cells, the center frequency around which UE is requested to report IDC issues.","paragraph_zero_based":37208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"connectedReporting","paragraph_zero_based":37209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates that the UE can report a preference to remain in RRC_CONNECTED state following a report to leave RRC_CONNECTED state. If absent, the UE cannot report a preference to stay in RRC_CONNECTED state.","paragraph_zero_based":37210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"delayBudgetReportingProhibitTimer","paragraph_zero_based":37211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Prohibit timer for delay budget reporting. Value in seconds. Value s0 means prohibit timer is set to 0 seconds, value s0dot4 means prohibit timer is set to 0.4 seconds, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":37212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-PreferenceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":37213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report assistance information to inform the gNB about the UE's DRX preferences for power saving.","paragraph_zero_based":37214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-PreferenceProhibitTimer","paragraph_zero_based":37215},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Prohibit timer for DRX preferences assistance information reporting. Value in seconds. Value s0 means prohibit timer is set to 0 seconds, value s0dot5 means prohibit timer is set to 0.5 seconds, value s1 means prohibit timer is set to 1 second and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":37216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"idc-AssistanceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":37217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report assistance information to inform the gNB about UE detected IDC problem.","paragraph_zero_based":37218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxBW-PreferenceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":37219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report assistance information to inform the gNB about the UE's preferred bandwidth for power saving.","paragraph_zero_based":37220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxBW-PreferenceProhibitTimer","paragraph_zero_based":37221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Prohibit timer for preferred bandwidth assistance information reporting. Value in seconds. Value s0 means prohibit timer is set to 0 seconds, value s0dot5 means prohibit timer is set to 0.5 seconds, value s1 means prohibit timer is set to 1 second and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":37222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxCC-PreferenceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":37223}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["88c4baf30f8