{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report measurements from specific sensors. NG-RAN configures the field if includeSensor-Meas is configured for one or more measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":37272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-AssistanceConfigNR","paragraph_zero_based":37273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate whether UE is configured to provide configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication.","paragraph_zero_based":37274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sourceDAPS-FailureReporting","paragraph_zero_based":37275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates whether the UE shall generate the SHR upon successfully completing the DAPS handover to the target cell and if a radio link failure was experienced in the source PCell while executing the DAPS handover. This field is set in the otherConfig configured by the source cell of the DAPS handover.","paragraph_zero_based":37276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"successHO-Config","paragraph_zero_based":37277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report the successful handover information to the network.","paragraph_zero_based":37278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"t-SearchDeltaP-Stationary","paragraph_zero_based":37279},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter \"TSearchDeltaP-StationaryConnected\" in 5.7.4.4. Value in seconds. Value s5 means 5 seconds, value s10 means 10 seconds and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":37280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"thresholdPercentageT304","paragraph_zero_based":37281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the threshold for the ratio in percentage between the elapsed T304 timer and the configured value of the T304 timer. Value p40 corresponds to 40%, value p60 corresponds to 60% and so on. This field is set in the otherConfig configured by the target cell of the handover.","paragraph_zero_based":37282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"thresholdPercentageT310","paragraph_zero_based":37283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the threshold for the ratio in percentage between the elapsed T310 timer and the configured value of the T310 timer. Value p40 corresponds to 40%, value p60 corresponds to 60% and so on. This field is set in the otherConfig configured by the source cell of the handover.","paragraph_zero_based":37284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"thresholdPercentageT312","paragraph_zero_based":37285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the threshold for the ratio in percentage between the elapsed T312 timer and the configured value(s) of the T312 timer. Value p20 corresponds to 20%, value p40 corresponds to 40% and so on. This field is set in the otherConfig configured by the source cell of the handover.","paragraph_zero_based":37286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"threshPropDelayDiff","paragraph_zero_based":37287},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Threshold for one-way service link propagation delay difference report as specified in 5.7.4.2.","paragraph_zero_based":37288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"uav-FlightPathAvailabilityConfig ","paragraph_zero_based":37289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to indicate the availability of flight path information for Aerial UE operation.","paragraph_zero_based":37290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ul-GapFR2-PreferenceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":37291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether UE is configured to request for FR2 UL gap activation/deactivation and preferred FR2 UL gap pattern.","paragraph_zero_based":37292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"wlanNameList","paragraph_zero_based":37293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report measurements from specific WLAN APs. NG-RAN configures the field if includeWLAN-Meas is configured for one or more measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":37294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37295}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["542c522c7dc8a21daf238e85deecd73f5a7f3192396901e747c2b25e18ae0d8f","58c782b992ea777e0741af1966a5e52dcc12ba5b7267f46a2a62adfd33b1d806","4ea3bcbae0777b59611fc5d27b18a2251d455da36417942857894117b6f78ff4","4cf8ce901d285aa0c0bca186d1ff7d6bc355bd4a1f5572e1e493a88ca1018a6f","11a98e11a804484640e14ed007f635e62c064209b174a74c74957fa344001dec","724e8a3a027abb20413cb3f96c7c5aa036b9ee8c5367f18cba3598bdbb9e5a7c","cef2d7f9239b64cac9405404ca6d9f145acc4b6724fd0243fd14d198a1a3e4bb","933476c2fc8f972a3c2f1d9830d22f8e671f2f330f50b5723b8fe60c5cd81cc9","a3d837271511baf30e81e38146cd73e2c7a15511ba0ea2014e5f244be5c84969","7de4963b831c669375621a766678275a30b02e623782b5478f24b18b12432330","6ef409b2ced65fcefc848f86b6ea39e5e13713042b040dbdea90e76a7fcad0ff","dda8e8a76a2cd6001e119d3b49078b2dae2ab2fe78b4195894acfba4ddfdfeb3","bd3d10ed66742b484d66921746bf22ba73a941fc6dec14d4c42f41b60c2d5df7","6facd786bff8e64ea2429f899b9d10202e23ebfe24c0282d9534f1e9026fcadf","cf25baf9018eee4cd65fd029ec3cf8763e6124b458ab02ff100ef01203b0a37c","2f88560168ad63c322263929d734a43cb9acbdbe87a16d3f8595ab5f5497849d","3079c5112472835cde44c3df3b9eb5a5f872d6f66eef59008d116c754eb6440e","53e89471ed6ebdc8a49b1f4646669b91dc135353b3890cb854aa151408102945","f085eba360dac4237cf027e0dba3c2b6a5747b73af4212d9d7cc72caeac2a123","0cdabc1543a951bed522546604374726c3f34ed64fe267147897c963d2132dde","8708322aaeeae8916bf67c6779f6f000854c819eed91316db14f6c51868f0d9c","ff86e7de4edca99c57009510e987f2840ebd38d311fdcd8d82d94cb9160d6a1b","90c4d8013553d8a0f471ca52ce1c