{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeighbourCellInfo field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":37296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"epochTime","paragraph_zero_based":37297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the epoch time used along with the ephemerisInfo to derive the propagation delay difference for the associated neighbour cell. The UE considers epoch time, indicated by the SFN and sub-frame number in this field, to be the frame nearest to the frame in which the message indicating the epoch time is received. This field is used based on the timing of the serving cell, i.e. the SFN and sub-frame number indicated in this field refers to the SFN and sub-frame of the serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":37298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":37300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":37301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxBW","paragraph_zero_based":37302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is optionally present, need R, if maxBW-PreferenceConfig-r16 is setup; otherwise it is absent, need R.","paragraph_zero_based":37303},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxMIMO","paragraph_zero_based":37304},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is optionally present, need R, if maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceConfig-r16 is setup; otherwise it is absent, need R.","paragraph_zero_based":37305},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"minOffset","paragraph_zero_based":37306},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is optionally present, need R, if minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceConfig-r16 is setup; otherwise it is absent, need R.","paragraph_zero_based":37307},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SCG","paragraph_zero_based":37308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is optionally present, need M, in an RRCReconfiguration message not within mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup and received, either via SRB3 within DLInformationTransferMRDC or via SRB1. Otherwise, it is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":37309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–PhysCellIdUTRA-FDD","paragraph_zero_based":37311},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE PhysCellIdUTRA-FDD is used to indicate the physical layer identity of the cell, i.e. the primary scrambling code, as defined in TS 25.331 [45].","paragraph_zero_based":37312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PhysCellIdUTRA-FDD information element","paragraph_zero_based":37313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":37314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-PHYSCELLIDUTRA-FDD-START","paragraph_zero_based":37315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PhysCellIdUTRA-FDD-r16 ::=        INTEGER (0..511)","paragraph_zero_based":37317},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37318},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-PHYSCELLIDUTRA-FDD-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":37319}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["41e007f5402ad4b4e0fd81a3e9227aadf6e6c3bd69eccf827d2b41d7cfdeeafd","c934038d0b070a66d01b060afce495565fce772188b0cb23ed19443129779133","24f2ffebf8960f7a029307f124b862083a11d788a2848ab65ab591df34419c2c","e59b7ae75c717a1db639487debbf56d94d0579050263ce7d56c75d21a36fc649","ace94341ddcc9c20e7622e4f1da2323312f70766df4de364b68007f2542c1ef1","c3fdd648a76f09e5bddc4bccd2e48b065ff0c0f0746956a9a7e56170aaa0f69a","e9989806da8ee68e1c36596d9b08255efb