{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-BWP-DiscPoolConfig","paragraph_zero_based":37512},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the NR sidelink discovery dedicated resource pool configurations on the configured sidelink BWP. The total number of Rx/Tx resource pools configured for communication and discovery does not exceed the maximum number of Rx/Tx resource pool for NR sidelink communication (i.e. maxNrofRXPool-r16/maxNrofTXPool-r16).","paragraph_zero_based":37513},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-BWP-Generic","paragraph_zero_based":37514},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the generic parameters on the configured sidelink BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":37515},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-BWP-PoolConfig","paragraph_zero_based":37516},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the resource pool configurations on the configured sidelink BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":37517},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-BWP-Id","paragraph_zero_based":37518},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"An identifier for this sidelink bandwidth part.","paragraph_zero_based":37519},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-BWP-PoolConfigA2X","paragraph_zero_based":37520},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the resource pool configurations for A2X services on the configured sidelink BWP. This field does not include sl-TxPoolScheduling.","paragraph_zero_based":37521},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-BWP-PoolConfigPS","paragraph_zero_based":37522},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the resource pool configurations for power saving on the configured sidelink BWP. This field does not include sl-TxPoolExceptional.","paragraph_zero_based":37523},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37524},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-BWP-Generic field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":37525},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-LengthSymbols","paragraph_zero_based":37526},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the number of symbols used for sidelink in a slot without S-SSB. A single value can be (pre)configured per sidelink bandwidth part.","paragraph_zero_based":37527},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-StartSymbol","paragraph_zero_based":37528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the starting symbol used for sidelink in a slot without S-SSB. A single value can be (pre)configured per sidelink bandwidth part.","paragraph_zero_based":37529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-TxDirectCurrentLocation","paragraph_zero_based":37530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The sidelink Tx/Rx Direct Current location for the carrier. Only values in the value range of this field between 0 and 3299, which indicate the subcarrier index within the carrier corresponding to the numerology of the corresponding sidelink BWP and value 3300, which indicates \"Outside the carrier\" and value 3301, which indicates \"Undetermined position within the carrier\" are used in this version of the specification.","paragraph_zero_based":37531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-BWP-ConfigCommon","paragraph_zero_based":37533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-BWP-ConfigCommon is used to configure the cell-specific configuration information on one particular sidelink bandwidth part.","paragraph_zero_based":37534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-BWP-ConfigCommon information element","paragraph_zero_based":37535}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_Elem