{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":37728},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37729},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-CBR-CommonTxConfigList field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":37730},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-CBR-RangeConfigList","paragraph_zero_based":37731},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the list of CBR ranges. Each entry of the list indicates in SL-CBR-LevelsConfig the upper bound of the CBR range for the respective entry. The upper bounds of the CBR ranges are configured in ascending order for consecutive entries of sl-CBR-RangeConfigList. For the first entry of sl-CBR-RangeConfigList the lower bound of the CBR range is 0. Value 0 corresponds to 0, value 1 to 0.01, value 2 to 0.02, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":37732},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-CR-Limit","paragraph_zero_based":37733},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum limit on the occupancy ratio. Value 0 corresponds to 0, value 1 to 0.0001, value 2 to 0.0002, and so on (i.e. in steps of 0.0001) until value 10000, which corresponds to 1.","paragraph_zero_based":37734},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-CBR-PSSCH-TxConfigList","paragraph_zero_based":37735},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the list of available PSSCH transmission parameters (such as MCS, sub-channel number, retransmission number and CR limit) configurations.","paragraph_zero_based":37736},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-TxParameters","paragraph_zero_based":37737},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates PSSCH transmission parameters.","paragraph_zero_based":37738},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37739},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-ConfigDedicatedNR","paragraph_zero_based":37740},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-ConfigDedicatedNR specifies the dedicated configuration information for NR sidelink communication/discovery.","paragraph_zero_based":37741},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-ConfigDedicatedNR information element","paragraph_zero_based":37742},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":37743},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-CONFIGDEDICATEDNR-START","paragraph_zero_based":37744},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37745},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-ConfigDedicatedNR-r16 ::=         SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":37746},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-PHY-MAC-RLC-Config-r16            SL-PHY-MAC-RLC-Config-r16                                              OPTIONAL,    -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":37747},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-RadioBearerToReleaseList-r16      SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofSLRB-r16)) OF SLRB-Uu-ConfigIndex-r16        OPTIONAL,    -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":37748},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-RadioBearerToAddModList-r16       SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofSLRB-r16)) OF SL-RadioBearerConfig-r16       OPTIONAL,    -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":37749},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-MeasConfigInfoToReleaseList-r16   SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofSL-Dest-r16)) OF SL-DestinationIndex-r16     OPTIONAL,    -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":37750},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-MeasConfigInfoToAddModList-r16    SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofSL-Dest-r16)) OF SL-MeasConfigInfo-r16       OPTIONAL,    -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":37751}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["269ec7db1b0f5a89de5f5690529ad1ed752ad1db993645d2ded