{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in ms, ms10 corresponds to 10ms, ms20 corresponds to 20 ms, ms32 corresponds to 32 ms, and so on. ","paragraph_zero_based":38016},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-DRX-GC-BC-MappedQoS-FlowsList","paragraph_zero_based":38017},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of QoS profiles of the NR sidelink communication, which are mapped to a sidelink DRX configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":38018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-DRX-GC-BC-OnDurationTimer","paragraph_zero_based":38019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiples of 1/32 ms (subMilliSeconds) or in ms (milliSecond). For the latter, value ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, value ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":38020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-DRX-GC-HARQ-RTT-Timer1, sl-DRX-GC-HARQ-RTT-Timer2","paragraph_zero_based":38021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in number of slot lengths of the sidelink BWP where the transport block was received. Value sl0 corresponds to 0 slots, sl1 corresponds to 1 slot, sl2 corresponds to 2 slots, and so on. sl-DRX-GC-HARQ-RTT-Timer1 is used for HARQ feedback enabled sidelink retransmission if SCI does not indicate retransmission resource(s). sl-DRX-GC-HARQ-RTT-Timer2 is used for HARQ feedback disabled sidelink retransmission in resource pool configured with PSFCH if SCI does not indicate retransmission resource(s).","paragraph_zero_based":38022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-DRX-GC-Generic","paragraph_zero_based":38023},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates a sidelink DRX configuration for groupcast communication, which is applicable to any QoS profile or any Destination Layer-2 ID.","paragraph_zero_based":38024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-DRX-GC-InactivityTimer","paragraph_zero_based":38025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiple integers of 1 ms, ms0 corresponds to 0, ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, and so on. This field is only valid for groupcast communication.","paragraph_zero_based":38026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-DRX-GC-RetransmissionTimer","paragraph_zero_based":38027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in number of slot lengths of the sidelink BWP where the transport block was received. Value sl0 corresponds to 0 slots, sl1 corresponds to 1 slot, sl2 corresponds to 2 slots, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":38028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-DRX-ConfigUC","paragraph_zero_based":38030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-DRX-ConfigUC is used to configure sidelink DRX related parameters for unicast communication.","paragraph_zero_based":38031},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-DRX-ConfigUC information element","paragraph_zero_based":38032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":38033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-DRX-CONFIGUC-START","paragraph_zero_based":38034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-DRX-ConfigUC-r17 ::=                 SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":38036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-drx-onDurationTimer-r17              CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":38037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                subMilliSeconds INTEGER (1..31),","paragraph_zero_based":38038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                milliSeconds    ENUMERATED {","paragraph_zero_based":38039}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed08