STOP","paragraph_zero_based":38080},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38081},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38082},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-DRX-ConfigUC field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":38083},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-drx-CycleStartOffset","paragraph_zero_based":38084},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sidelink drx-Cycle in ms and sidelink drx-StartOffset in multiples of 1 ms.","paragraph_zero_based":38085},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-drx-HARQ-RTT-Timer1, sl-drx-HARQ-RTT-Timer2","paragraph_zero_based":38086},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in number of slot lengths of the BWP where the transport block was received. Value sl0 corresponds to 0 slots, sl1 corresponds to 1 slot, sl2 corresponds to 2 slots, and so on. sl-drx-HARQ-RTT-Timer1 is used for HARQ feedback enabled sidelink retransmission if SCI does not indicate retransmission resource(s). sl-drx-HARQ-RTT-Timer2 is used for HARQ feedback disabled sidelink retransmission in resource pool configured with PSFCH if SCI does not indicate retransmission resource(s).","paragraph_zero_based":38087}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["575919063d00a2cde030469ddf7373d43448e61f75e1265bb42b2706e52ab127","e2b4b2123bca8b539352e84f90f1b7c914704ead2466aafb20adcb9a4ebc36e1","4c505d7c1d1fbf4876caaa70408f8352bb39c04b7eba1c3ce7dd49b3bbc0c94a","69ae7471c5ef5a1b0e4eafa5d03115ebdcaf194b923d32df7e5475e73a58d0f1","b9d1d3919ae572065cd752ef69bb3aad9692b98158d4efa6050bd7810c9ea2e9","09c4527bbd637c990d192d6add4e40caa821828319800e93a6281da90d0d7249","fbc55c4fc9a4d4aae9cfc517c10a2b0ea5f1e2225905ea6bc05cce6daa81070c","59bd6f46f02f38f2d5