{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-FREQCONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":38160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":38161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-FreqConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":38163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"frequencyShift7p5khzSL","paragraph_zero_based":38164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Enable the NR SL transmission with a 7.5 kHz shift to the LTE raster. If the field is absent, the frequency shift is disabled.","paragraph_zero_based":38165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-AbsoluteFrequencyPointA","paragraph_zero_based":38166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Absolute frequency of the reference resource block (Common RB 0). Its lowest subcarrier is also known as Point A.","paragraph_zero_based":38167},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-AbsoluteFrequencySSB","paragraph_zero_based":38168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the frequency location of sidelink SSB. The transmission bandwidth for sidelink SSB is within the bandwidth of this sidelink BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":38169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-BWP-ToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":38170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the list of sidelink BWP(s) on which the NR sidelink communication configuration is to be added or reconfigured. In this release, only one BWP is allowed to be configured for NR sidelink communication.","paragraph_zero_based":38171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-BWP-ToReleaseList","paragraph_zero_based":38172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the list of sidelink BWP(s) on which the NR sidelink communication configuration is to be released. ","paragraph_zero_based":38173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-Freq-Id","paragraph_zero_based":38174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the identity of the dedicated configuration information on the carrier frequency for NR sidelink communication.","paragraph_zero_based":38175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SCS-SpecificCarrierList","paragraph_zero_based":38176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A set of UE specific channel bandwidth and location configurations for different subcarrier spacings (numerologies). Defined in relation to Point A. The UE uses the configuration provided in this field only for the purpose of channel bandwidth and location determination. In this release, only one SCS-SpecificCarrier is allowed to be configured for NR sidelink communication.","paragraph_zero_based":38177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SyncPriority","paragraph_zero_based":38178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates synchronization priority order, as specified in clause 5.8.6.","paragraph_zero_based":38179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"valueN","paragraph_zero_based":38180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the NR SL transmission with a valueN *5kHz shift to the LTE raster. (see TS 38.101-1 [15], clause 5.4E.2).","paragraph_zero_based":38181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":38183}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4a46397ed60e2c40b400547ce2c2a45d03d93b7205f63125e22f05b496a4485c","6e28c7425669293ffc23c095a077080868e187c13ddbb6694b09a99435179ed2","8cd28b3de447fef9ef2d03740efbea201e9583ceea906b746cca17b2893e80fc","d4e2914d8bc0fc02cd28d7324763ae6b26489e9f5ef