ENUMERATED { enabled, disabled }                                    OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":38601},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":38602},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":38603},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38604},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-PBPS-CPS-CONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":38605},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":38606},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38607},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-PBPS-CPS-Config field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":38608},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-Additional-PBPS-Occasion","paragraph_zero_based":38609},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates that UE additionally monitors periodic sensing occasions that correspond to a set of values. (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 8.1.4).","paragraph_zero_based":38610},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig","paragraph_zero_based":38611},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the allowed resource selection mechanism(s), i.e. full sensing only, partial sensing only, random resource selection only, or any combination(s) thereof. (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 8.1.4). Only c1, c4 , c5 or c7 can be configured for a Rel-16 resource pool. If this field is not configured for a resource pool included in sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal, only full sensing is allowed in the corresponding resource pool.","paragraph_zero_based":38612},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"c1: only full sensing allowed","paragraph_zero_based":38613},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"c2: only partial sensing allowed","paragraph_zero_based":38614},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"c3: only random selection allowed","paragraph_zero_based":38615}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3