{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-PSBCH-Config field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":38689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dl-Alpha-PSBCH","paragraph_zero_based":38690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates alpha value for DL pathloss based power control for PSBCH. When the field is not configured the UE applies the value 1.","paragraph_zero_based":38691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dl-P0-PSBCH","paragraph_zero_based":38692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates P0 value for DL pathloss based power control for PSBCH. If not configured, DL pathloss based power control is disabled for PSBCH. When dl-P0-PSBCH-r17 is configured, the UE ignores dl-P0-PSBCH-r16.","paragraph_zero_based":38693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A Remote UE which is out of coverage, considers downlink pathloss based power control is disabled for PSBCH when dl-P0-PSBCH is configured.","paragraph_zero_based":38694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38695},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-PSSCH-TxConfigList","paragraph_zero_based":38696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-PSSCH-TxConfigList indicates PSSCH transmission parameters. When lower layers select parameters from the range indicated in IE SL-PSSCH-TxConfigList, the UE considers both configurations in IE SL-PSSCH-TxConfigList and the CBR-dependent configurations represented in IE SL-CBR-PriorityTxConfigList. Only one IE SL-PSSCH-TxConfig is provided per SL-TypeTxSync.","paragraph_zero_based":38697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-PSSCH-TxConfigList information element","paragraph_zero_based":38698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":38699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-PSSCH-TXCONFIGLIST-START","paragraph_zero_based":38700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-PSSCH-TxConfigList-r16 ::=    SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxPSSCH-TxConfig-r16)) OF SL-PSSCH-TxConfig-r16","paragraph_zero_based":38702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38703},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-PSSCH-TxConfig-r16 ::=        SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":38704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-TypeTxSync-r16                SL-TypeTxSync-r16                                   OPTIONAL,    -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":38705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-ThresUE-Speed-r16             ENUMERATED {kmph60, kmph80, kmph100, kmph120,","paragraph_zero_based":38706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                kmph140, kmph160, kmph180, kmph200},","paragraph_zero_based":38707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-ParametersAboveThres-r16      SL-PSSCH-TxParameters-r16,","paragraph_zero_based":38708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-ParametersBelowThres-r16      SL-PSSCH-TxParameters-r16,","paragraph_zero_based":38709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":38710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":38711}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["69aec852675ff0106c25e035acaf006acdea538db4a14268e9daa4eaf4c71452","a9ed9f78c89ff08ce9f929c89bb8e5353db90b41ca23ab6f925d5ba44d4f9daf","52bd3af3a62965a9b8e8f8b6b9895cf4d404c0cb49fe684daf3d370d297710cf","96b8a3ef554f75bdf14aa5605ef4e9d214a7c914a68630a3f721aced483302a1","68852db31ed6cefa634b465c6cc1566435b8c5c6c667403037b0d6d3f0b9d4d3","b2bb248c6572093639