9617},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MappingToReleaseList","paragraph_zero_based":39618},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the list of mappings between the bearer identity of the L2 U2N Remote UE and the egress RLC channel as specified in TS 38.351 [66] to be released.","paragraph_zero_based":39619},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-RemoteUE-RB-Identity","paragraph_zero_based":39620},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Identity of the end-to-end Uu bearer identity of the L2 U2N Remote UE. The value 3 for the field srb-identity-r17 (i.e., for configuring SRB3) is not supported in this version of the specification.","paragraph_zero_based":39621},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-EgressRLC-ChannelUu","paragraph_zero_based":39622},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the egress RLC channel on Uu Hop for uplink transmissions at the L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":39623}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0a03b3f27dc37b7a607b2e0fa843664c7b5effaead86d21c80ba083d1a5e4707","06b3eedab2975d54dabdebedcbe9fe7eac500d68e9d190c39f4a5c8acf7af082","baafba67f4a91e35f1d8963ad063b62e0625f0410dbc828b54a5ddbf906dc7ed","a4e0e80bc6eb7fa3da44984cebedfa353cdf719acec104386f0643bdf45b9770","001bf51166faa18e0b4fd2c8b023cf90173fd098a5b2753ef788abc4040ccb6b","9312125858a5c2b804fd973d407178ff52ea52206c3a023a957e346ccd5bfdd7","ec6927187cfeb01342c079d8d05b5ae25fe00fd1c918120ff652ce193722b938","790857e20d2c6b0917aca3d56bedee4d0b145a4fc78a07e68f6f722731320524","0951a214fd13b2de0c0ac813ac44a9bf6a2bd510af9ae1c53773e9550c3eb865","8ff16d767a9830f46032d075330d4a3aa45f0ea36b52cad6835d0bc0aa99aab6","5ad0e7ad84b69cd3a6800679793d32f89596d2c45ee352591bca52e9d2350274","2