{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":39744},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":39745},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39746},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-UE-SELECTEDCONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":39747},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":39748},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39749},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-UE-SelectedConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":39750},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PrioritizationThres","paragraph_zero_based":39751},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the SL priority threshold, which is used to determine whether SL TX is prioritized over UL TX, as specified in TS 38.321 [3]. Network does not configure the sl-PrioritizationThres and the ul-PrioritizationThres to the UE separately.","paragraph_zero_based":39752},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-ProbResourceKeep","paragraph_zero_based":39753},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the probability with which the UE keeps the current resource when the resource reselection counter reaches zero for sensing based UE autonomous resource selection (see TS 38.321 [3]).","paragraph_zero_based":39754},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PSSCH-TxConfigList","paragraph_zero_based":39755},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates PSSCH TX parameters such as MCS, sub-channel number, retransmission number, associated to different UE absolute speeds and different synchronization reference types for UE autonomous resource selection.","paragraph_zero_based":39756},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-ReselectAfter","paragraph_zero_based":39757},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the number of consecutive skipped transmissions before triggering resource reselection for sidelink communication (see TS 38.321 [3]).","paragraph_zero_based":39758},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ul-PrioritizationThres","paragraph_zero_based":39759},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the UL priority threshold, which is used to determine whether SL TX is prioritized over UL TX, as specified in TS 38.321 [3]. Network does not configure the sl-PrioritizationThres and the ul-PrioritizationThres to the UE separately.","paragraph_zero_based":39760},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39761},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-ZoneConfig","paragraph_zero_based":39762},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-ZoneConfig is used to configure the zone ID related parameters.","paragraph_zero_based":39763},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-ZoneConfig information element","paragraph_zero_based":39764},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":39765},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-ZONECONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":39766},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39767}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ec86b5dc3eb19d9b026f340b1ed465bb3adc35d6e8a5f6f5bda15113fafc6b53","e8fc9590de48b923908b9fbb34b6b3303b0337533cf32ff8308c02e2520cc4bb","854c4d962bc7613f5049fc385ee5b54ec14c8bec8669353885173d45138b50cc","18cda5629f61811aef24e3d7d053cd45d3e0559b2a571aca3e1efca73a03de42","8cca7fc4f6b4677656b14a87b7d62f7ae9e71f6f9681804ad98dd6c96cc878e0","6ced145e88fa81b40d4668ff30026d755e20d38854c9f1e384dcd7b2a4d2366d","d025fe76c50687fa8215033bc42844daa9fd39be31653fe5d6094eb25349d9f6","e02560feff792ed0e86940054db8462fbfe721a9e9b2e699dc5c5ae8e5ba0e37","2e3eabed