{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the T312 is kept in SCG, Inform E-UTRAN/NR about the SCG radio link failure by initiating the SCG failure information procedure.as specified in 5.7.3.","paragraph_zero_based":41304},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T316","paragraph_zero_based":41305},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmission of the MCGFailureInformation message","paragraph_zero_based":41306},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving RRCRelease,  RRCReconfiguration with reconfigurationwithSync for the PCell, MobilityFromNRCommand, or upon initiating the re-establishment procedure","paragraph_zero_based":41307},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the actions as specified in 5.7.3b.5.","paragraph_zero_based":41308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T319","paragraph_zero_based":41309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmission of RRCResumeRequest or RRCResumeRequest1 when the resume procedure is not initiated for SDT.","paragraph_zero_based":41310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of RRCResume, RRCSetup, RRCRelease, RRCRelease with suspendConfig or RRCReject message, upon cell re-selection or upon relay (re)selection.","paragraph_zero_based":41311},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the actions as specified in 5.3.13.5.","paragraph_zero_based":41312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T319a","paragraph_zero_based":41313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmission of RRCResumeRequest or RRCResumeRequest1 when the resume procedure is initiated for SDT.","paragraph_zero_based":41314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of RRCResume, RRCSetup, RRCRelease, RRCReject message or upon failure to resume RRC connection for SDT as specified in 5.3.13.5 or upon cell reselection.","paragraph_zero_based":41315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the actions as specified in 5.3.13.5.","paragraph_zero_based":41316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T320","paragraph_zero_based":41317},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of t320 or upon cell (re)selection to NR from another RAT with validity time configured for dedicated priorities (in which case the remaining validity time is applied).","paragraph_zero_based":41318},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon entering RRC_CONNECTED, upon reception of RRCRelease, when PLMN selection or SNPN selection is performed on request by NAS, when the UE enters RRC_IDLE from RRC_INACTIVE, or upon cell (re)selection to another RAT (in which case the timer is carried on to the other RAT).","paragraph_zero_based":41319},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Discard the cell reselection priority information provided by dedicated signalling.","paragraph_zero_based":41320},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T321","paragraph_zero_based":41321},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving measConfig including a reportConfig with the reportType set to reportCGI","paragraph_zero_based":41322},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon acquiring the information needed to set all fields of cgi-info, upon receiving measConfig that includes removal of the reportConfig with the reportType set to reportCGI and upon detecting that a cell is not broadcasting SIB1.","paragraph_zero_based":41323},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Initiate the measurement reporting procedure, stop performing the related measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":41324},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T322","paragraph_zero_based":41325},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving measConfig including reportConfigNR with the reportType set to reportSFTD and drx-SFTD-NeighMeas is set to true.","paragraph_zero_based":41326},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon acquiring the SFTD measurement results, upon receiving measConfig that includes removal of the reportConfig with the reportType set to reportSFTD.","paragraph_zero_based":41327}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["078cf1f2476b019b4a816cdb3f7f037b7ec6787176e31a10a693b6a11fe619de","cf172bbdf9e1603a17dd6a8ae5628d4ec1746ea77c0d2d95465f68d811160b06","b4ffe33df97e900963ce4a01999dc06797c828286c49a8541713093427c554d5","4bd8ccae259d92612cd6964f88b36bf05cc5bb10fc66f144104700d2a066fdee","39b82ce324551fcc148b7f8c7114571f309ec04ffeed10b35ba75f4b379e28a2","24f444622883411196931f3851b825a94baf8880704be980dc6745dc77fc571f","bae6c4872772de2b186a403dba0e9a1c566e043b58b9b5e041c439c418556971","8a88ad64506d8f48fef22ee3ea3af53e9c80e186ca486d760347ced170abc266","3f2d2f0e135814fb484625c3d6ca637e0fa60983fc62d02416f13d91d1bf0b61","d1153267f40ae14048de8e54276e36e6253bb963725286703e1a7d75b636895d","cbfb688819252f9d3b708d7afebf2f5e2705fa5fc8c57155089f8bc54e31cdfa","3823c06f137d3ad9619d4d0ef48bb579ff99da45bf605c4cc19cee58c8ff3511","0762a93d957053ff562f66c4c7c8ddf06030775d442111a3852ecb5d6330bc30","c3454ea2e7e9b167e5399a8ec847f405c26fca76859b05568d012e9a009bf288","1659cb54952d55113f5ea3bcd42c5d2ea19652ab700da06b3ffbc27f0eb948e9","a244c9dea693055baf01bdf01c6c1aabd2f069a9a20e344c864d74cf80db0b5d","ed97552772a08e1caa0afad7a71bffca2a835f985e4b19e34f45c4f3f3b9fbc5","9df34a66bc15a1daf550c70b6175b48c08f7f0c1d4105ba6aea83d28da8ceda5","ede936a10dd5fee15c593e7f5c13222866019d9c86be3aff51b9744b1f7e9b3a","f2f0341e4ae05a9d4d2f69184de9edd7c93406202789f3807068b02ad212a958","40eec33158a0a0fa90b081d2b7b6e32d198fdf78fdfdbeaa7fb521924da14c68","51425846e64ef3c4c45061a446945cd704c0a279d6cd69d549a0fe561c7a1fc0","2fdf56bfac42ff28c8b43566ee84311a9793847032dc68b338ce2ce2d3fc7e56","7b2fce1c9b2b50b8606cbc8c6bea1ec11f2f411cd3deb65cd046f3ea8c47d7d2"],"paragraph_range_zero_base