{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the actions as specified in 5.3.8.6.","paragraph_zero_based":41376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346h","paragraph_zero_based":41377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with musim-GapPreferenceList Information.","paragraph_zero_based":41378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing musim-GapAssistanceConfig during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, or upon receiving musim-GapAssistanceConfig set to release.","paragraph_zero_based":41379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":41380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346i","paragraph_zero_based":41381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with scg-DeactivationPreference","paragraph_zero_based":41382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing scg-DeactivationPreferenceConfig during RRC connection re-establishment/resume or upon receiving scg-DeactivationPreferenceConfig set to release.","paragraph_zero_based":41383},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":41384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346j (The UE maintains one instance of this timer per cell group)","paragraph_zero_based":41385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with rlm-RelaxationReportingConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":41386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing rlm-RelaxationReportingConfig during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, upon receiving rlm-RelaxationReportingConfig set to release, or upon performing MR-DC release.","paragraph_zero_based":41387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":41388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346k (The UE maintains one instance of this timer per cell group)","paragraph_zero_based":41389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":41390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, upon receiving bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig set to release, or upon performing MR-DC release.","paragraph_zero_based":41391},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":41392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T350","paragraph_zero_based":41393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting DedicatedSIBRequest message with requestedSIB-List and/or  requestedPosSIB-List.","paragraph_zero_based":41394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon acquiring the requested SIB(s) or posSIB(s), upon releasing onDemandSIB-Request during the connection re-establishment procedures, upon receiving onDemandSIB-Request set to release, upon reception of RRCRelease or upon successful change of PCell while in RRC_CONNECTED.","paragraph_zero_based":41395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action","paragraph_zero_based":41396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T380","paragraph_zero_based":41397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of t380 in RRCRelease.","paragraph_zero_based":41398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of RRCResume, RRCSetup or RRCRelease.","paragraph_zero_based":41399}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["414852ce4e094e2824b301fb48bfdff635cf28485a289f14604ac15e4e13721d","d32747b4558e2daf9a4ed4843d76a1d5da57405ab1f3d597850ebd67b19888d9","38800f9624a19a12cd9c91fcd8f1a15d2