{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When reaching max value","paragraph_zero_based":41424},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"N310","paragraph_zero_based":41425},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of \"in-sync\" indication from lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":41426},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"upon receiving RRCReconfiguration with reconfigurationWithSync for that cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":41427},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"upon initiating the connection re-establishment procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":41428},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of \"out-of-sync\" from lower layer while the timer T310 is stopped.","paragraph_zero_based":41429},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Start timer T310","paragraph_zero_based":41430},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"N311","paragraph_zero_based":41431},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of \"out-of-sync\" indication from lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":41432},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"upon receiving RRCReconfiguration with reconfigurationWithSync for that cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":41433},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"upon initiating the connection re-establishment procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":41434},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of the \"in-sync\" from lower layer while the timer T310 is running.","paragraph_zero_based":41435},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Stop the timer T310.","paragraph_zero_based":41436},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":41437},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7.3Constants","paragraph_zero_based":41438},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Constant","paragraph_zero_based":41439},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Usage","paragraph_zero_based":41440},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"N310","paragraph_zero_based":41441},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Maximum number of consecutive \"out-of-sync\" indications for the SpCell received from lower layers","paragraph_zero_based":41442},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"N311","paragraph_zero_based":41443},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Maximum number of consecutive \"in-sync\" indications for the SpCell received from lower layers","paragraph_zero_based":41444},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":41445},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7.4UE variables","paragraph_zero_based":41446},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:To facilitate the specification of the UE behavioural requirements, UE variables are represented using ASN.1. Unless explicitly specified otherwise, it is however up to UE implementation how to store the variables. The optionality of the IEs in ASN.1 is used only to indicate that the values may not always be available.","paragraph_zero_based":41447}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7792c5b2627c1e7b9429dd855a763523a82dd73a355fe75b07c51a889d286ffb","d94a942e80c4e87a7043dc56baf2a34fad3a7f0d9008397dd054724df40fcc83","dc470cd29291ef74423dad03355f9a45662a9bed552fb2a4ecf81b578a503902","de288e5bd20dd33ddd15d41c25f2ec369546fd6fce7f5780f1bf637387876b08","017a06928317e91031797dbdb7ddc7e29ef7d07314f33bfec0ca7ba92926bb15","a98fa2302d1052d2c01e0871a7a31a9813634c42cd59bed2e70f476062bb0c31","c65eb6c5674121c21278f5fc8c199341d38551db95b16f7ff155833ae9901fa4","d46b37dc90a9e9b0c3aa192dd2f6e44e4eabf36c02081c5199006d3ace600d49","5d4f3f0e677255badecdeee879b25f90aa482ba703b7f236cf75fe70927291c4","a770cff22d9f14aa7cf4baf0673b28ed2a3d74c8503ae12d54a84007a310682c","d11dc5992b0cf6fb473b6fc922ed1f7d3b59899c5228367a418