of those fields with only default values.","paragraph_zero_based":42500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:In general, the signalling should preferably support a \"release\" option for fields introduced after v15.3.0. The \"value not applicable\" should be used restrictively, mainly limited to for fields which value is relevant only if another field is set to a value other than its default.","paragraph_zero_based":42501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:For parameters in ServingCellConfig, the default values are specified in the corresponding specification.","paragraph_zero_based":42502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"9.2.1Default SRB configurations","paragraph_zero_based":42503}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2712df6e64386dab91951d1774d9d3024c57eddebcfb42c828647d23840a75fc","48d4e9751c1a599d16108163b00c9a7de7ef13645bc185fcbf1ad44a64b5151a","c5375187388abe4483ea64c282abb7caf7a4c4b886fc3b5b3dab0868c49d032f","16ddb921aff5a222cc1c6babb5f69577b87894bd7cf194708fd56f9647a943e6","347b5a65880f2b9d7c3af1f881ec61315b103cc0db29b68ce3a6e17363deb797","7fbbe02668236badbab1c16407a4d2a253eb1a25ba133472ba79ce15d3107fc0","5869bed2748b1a02bc209aeec4fd964b426db6c37960c5bfe9c61b7dc88dcc49","2df195c837b1b197b6237d8e8e147ec3ff42d342e12f3cfac6994fe909ef6df7","6d51fc8e51466b87594022c55d6dc86272640e471be12c8e99b3d74f5d688bbe","8bda95ac62a341535b7eeb7230dd1c937e718ef3d538a9761636b5a66d10c993","92f402519d3af63df8343f8a6b6c7b5c2ac022e4420d2c852cef987e50c1e805","ed63866165ba6cc1c09b0f134b32ac7dc31f4b27bad49fa47e7a23d9c91a2107","6073bcb8a7b81720cbc163f2adf77f49ddf88ac2c5b72e4a69bb1fb348aa0f5f","69ab524074ad50bc3712f12ad75b817c148fe19537448ea511818b9cece07180","186d