foBlock1-v940-IEs    OPTIONAL","paragraph_zero_based":42928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":42929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":42930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BroadcastInfoBlock1-v940-IEs::=SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":42931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    field3-r9                           Field3-r9               OPTIONAL,           -- Cond Cond1","paragraph_zero_based":42932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    field4-r9                           Field4-r9               OPTIONAL,           -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":42933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nonCriticalExtension                SEQUENCE {}             OPTIONAL            -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":42934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":42935}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["814773fc0a61728f70c7b7f29eb93a744f86f46386adfcb56767bcb7a43c22f4","1b25ebbf9c37963fb0647ce4fa88f2f07418097a50a68601bcb2e554abd3edb0","10088e16541968cc1dfcd694e107e10eb0b29b58fdff4211334ae946d825cc03","5dc6a01e625b8f0e294b93235c0f63509c7fd2d45c63560f39ae0239b5b95cf0","76070b16100a395e9f8811b1fe1d83c7649550d7a0ca848c1a2c91d6428e16c5","b7b1e412f7162bd6de02358320fd96847b81636fc98eeed73131fa52244f980c","1a01ec6ef7a9e69b2191aa878876eef81ca831211faa1202dd801d5cd280ba04","583ce657b3458c69ddc13c7e716e56f693cd1a91f70b8aa16ef59022bdc58f07","ed4cda6a9fa72de9b08fdc4713f5c30fd993dc125b21470865f4fafc804ea5eb","1013c0a58954a2412dbd368da756073000409edcb0c53dede91b88cd1723af49","c4435f2f7e8cf6ae7ade53f2769f5c205e4f2e3301d14fd00e554579e7ee5846","e830c2417629c08e1111a6190c190ae7d36563b74b916084c4742fbc3eff0bb9","71d1062bdcfc38ce33059b5d25b0f76a63ebbc26f2a2f53d05cf66907ea2a7a8","601afa321e237aaa387a65c50e8b83dfe65b8ea9946338815124bea593e98c9a","4c60f258b51832a815b59fb64822359f16c279f1dec9d6ea3170152153dbcb43","13cc95054b3d9d2b91e7856d1577093decf98b9452173cfe0f91132d95046e8c","e828bec8f9c8a47145d3b49794897205b4ccff56a117be80b2c12776ec0aca4f","11f26add5fb3ffccfe724ed05a29d058441214d1f9f2cb40b7bbbb3af575461d","85f848946b4181808d7bfc77007bf65d6fbccf1b72f036a965ce7885788abd5e","bed1db2be838ad78b6f0cbaf069ae2e35073b7217a811ef1907f4673ecfd4044","4b4ccb1af04b31807273e6f5ace5798f7fb66b6c849811562283e2b00d5950ad","1ae936f27e67c2e6c553c0a5d7711bfbec6783f700df9c7988a4e498d19cfff9","6dc001f270db6bdcd75e5b2ee98d7307208584a62c7695dbd3ccef7eff00e900","836cc4b9f170362d032e3e861e00663d6b1b671f699fb987a235e6e2a89d7a3e"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[42912,42935],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx:p42912"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":42936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":42937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":42938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall, apply the following principles regarding the levels applicable in case of nested error handling:","paragraph_zero_based":42939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-an extension addition group is not regarded as a level on its own. E.g. in the ASN.1 extract in the previous, a error regarding the conditionality of field3 would result in the entire itemInfo entry to be ignored (rather than just the extension addition group containing field3 and field4);","paragraph_zero_based":42940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-a traditional nonCriticalExtension is not regarded as a level on its own. E.g. in the ASN.1 extract in the previous, an error regarding the conditionality of field3 would result in the entire BroadcastInfoBlock1 to be ignored (rather than just the non-critical extension containing field3 and field4).","paragraph_zero_based":42941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"10.5Not comprehended field","paragraph_zero_based":42942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall, when receiving an RRC message on any logical channel:","paragraph_zero_based":42943},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the message includes a field that the UE does not comprehend:","paragraph_zero_based":42944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>treat the rest of the message as if the field was absent.","paragraph_zero_based":42945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:This clause does not apply to the case of an extension to the value range of a field. Such cases are addressed instead by the requirements in clause 10.3.","paragraph_zero_based":42946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":42947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"11Radio information related interactions between network nodes","paragraph_zero_based":42948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"11.1General","paragraph_zero_based":42949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This clause specifies RRC messages that are transferred between network nodes. These RRC messages may be transferred to or from the UE via another Radio Access Technology. Consequently, these messages have similar characteristics as the RRC messages that are transferred across the NR radio interface, i.e. the same transfer syntax and protocol extension mechanisms apply.","paragraph_zero_based":42950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"11.2Inter-node RRC messages","paragraph_zero_based":42951},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"11.2.1General","paragraph_zero_based":42952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This clause specifies RRC messages that are sent either across the X2-, Xn- or the NG-interface, either to or from the gNB, i.e. a single 'logical channel' is used for all RRC messages transferred across network nodes. The information could originate from or be destined for another RAT.","paragraph_zero_based":42953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":42954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NR-INTER-NODE-DEFINITIONS-START","paragraph_zero_based":42955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":42956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-InterNodeDefinitions DEFINITIONS AUTOMATIC TAGS ::=","paragraph_zero_based":42957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":42958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BEGIN","paragraph_zero_based":42959}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbe