{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":43224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    candidateCellInfoListSN-EUTRA      MeasResultServFreqListEUTRA-SCG                      OPTIONAL","paragraph_zero_based":43225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]]","paragraph_zero_based":43226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":43227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-HANDOVER-PREPARATION-INFORMATION-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":43229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":43230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"HandoverPreparationInformation field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":43232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"as-Context","paragraph_zero_based":43233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Local RAN context required by the target gNB or DU.","paragraph_zero_based":43234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rrm-Config","paragraph_zero_based":43235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Local RAN context used mainly for RRM purposes.","paragraph_zero_based":43236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sourceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":43237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The radio resource configuration as used in the source cell.","paragraph_zero_based":43238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ue-CapabilityRAT-List","paragraph_zero_based":43239},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE radio access related capabilities concerning RATs supported by the UE. A gNB that retrieves MRDC related capability containers ensures that the set of included MRDC containers is consistent w.r.t. the feature set related information.","paragraph_zero_based":43240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ue-InactiveTime","paragraph_zero_based":43241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Duration while UE has not received or transmitted any user data. Thus the timer is still running in case e.g., UE measures the neighbour cells for the HO purpose. Value s1 corresponds to 1 second, s2 corresponds to 2 seconds and so on. Value min1 corresponds to 1 minute, value min1s20 corresponds to 1 minute and 20 seconds, value min1s40 corresponds to 1 minute and 40 seconds and so on. Value hr1 corresponds to 1 hour, hr1min30 corresponds to 1 hour and 30 minutes and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":43242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"AS-Config field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":43244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rrcReconfiguration","paragraph_zero_based":43245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains the RRCReconfiguration configuration as generated entirely by the MN. If the TMGI-r17 is included in the MRB-ToAddMod-r17 in the RadioBearerConfig, the plmn-Index is replaced by the PLMN ID, if needed.","paragraph_zero_based":43246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sdt-Config","paragraph_zero_based":43247}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ba24258796f0755edb814fc6d6789527cba0714fb3d330af6879acce653b245f","5870a7a8b32bf5e00f7c22b29506756a94bb62a76ccd4c79bec49e67ef6c00cb","7c02dc77ed207f13df6491362e3ecea7d05493f38ca6fd7b6dab85fb4a6f41b7","aa0c238b7af272b52df50f4daf11161a408ed29f8bdcd0465b94aa781c710496","8f846e6971858b72e7f566b3869d3159d12b7d8707ede0029c70821b1572949c","5ec6c87f7c0fa5513c8c64ab5b3c682b73a0722a3177f999cad9287b8f869fcf","9966b0e171d3fbc9d5bb892e9533e7e2f4c158ab00dfc47d3a1b5863d94aba62","f6efb7d77aba593dd0ad33d0ded2