{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Includes for each UE assistance feature the information last reported by the UE, if any.","paragraph_zero_based":43272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ueAssistanceInformationSCG","paragraph_zero_based":43273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Includes for each UE assistance feature associated with the SCG, the information last reported by the UE in the NR UEAssistanceInformation message for the SCG, if any.","paragraph_zero_based":43274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ConfigRestrictInfoDAPS field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":43276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sourceFeatureSetPerUplinkCC/sourceFeatureSetPerDownlinkCC","paragraph_zero_based":43277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates an index referring to the position of the FeatureSetUplinkPerCC/FeatureSetDownlinkPerCC selected by source in the featureSetsUplinkPerCC/featureSetsDownlinkPerCC.","paragraph_zero_based":43278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43279},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RRM-Config field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":43280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateCellInfoList","paragraph_zero_based":43281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list of the best cells on each frequency for which measurement information was available","paragraph_zero_based":43282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateCellInfoListSN-EUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":43283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list of EUTRA cells including serving cells and best neighbour cells on each serving frequency, for which measurement results were available. This field is only used in NE-DC. ","paragraph_zero_based":43284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":43286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":43287},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"HO","paragraph_zero_based":43288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present in case of handover within NR or UE context retrieval, e.g. in case of resume or re-establishment. The field is optionally present in case of handover from E-UTRA/5GC. Otherwise the field is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":43289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"HO2","paragraph_zero_based":43290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present in case of handover within NR; otherwise the field is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":43291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The following table indicates per source RAT whether RAT capabilities are included or not.","paragraph_zero_based":43293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Source RAT","paragraph_zero_based":43295}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["33cd69534c176cb66899cecdffff72d15fd1a03948366c5d6eb4913b86db208d","dc32d822ecab4afd198bb597ccbcdf2f68b27d482127a4da13b7cc79ae71deb4","c1e6923245c9b547b64817c7f7fe6608a8162a26d37f6be98d68119165a04f9c","95f0abf9e5a6e125905b01179f03ddcf68d16c6f60361977c38188c3e12baefb","38a4e922ef6f82efd1bea3ea1ebe86d8d34d9e5055a652c3f0115cb61529f003","e5c744b16fb0f20089bdf98b16fecddfd7a856314e83bc9093d198466c3de9d0","2b02a4f7032fae7ee0d05fc57581f985544a20392532ae8e5a21bee0881c5c17","da139c8ba832d56fd516d5359227232198f9886c189b234e31d7d1431ca3fd75","0e5dc242eb8133fa6342369f5f