{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"campOnFirstSSB","paragraph_zero_based":44184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value true indicates that the SSB indicated in the first instance of MeasTiming in the measTiming list can be used for camping and for a PCell configuration (i.e. in spCellConfigCommon of the masterCellGroup).","paragraph_zero_based":44185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"csi-RS-CellMobility","paragraph_zero_based":44186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the CSI-RS configuration of the cell for which this message is included. The timing of the CSI-RS resources is based on the SSB indicated by refSSBFreq.","paragraph_zero_based":44187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"csi-RS-SubcarrierSpacing","paragraph_zero_based":44188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the subcarrier spacing of the CSI-RS resources included in csi-rs-CellMobility.","paragraph_zero_based":44189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measTiming","paragraph_zero_based":44190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list of SMTC information, SSB RSSI measurement information and associated NR frequency exchanged via EN-DC X2 Setup, EN-DC Configuration Update, Xn Setup and NG-RAN Node Configuration Update procedures, or F1 messages between gNB DU and gNB CU.","paragraph_zero_based":44191},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"physCellId","paragraph_zero_based":44192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Physical Cell Identity of the SSB on the ARFCN indicated by carrierFreq.","paragraph_zero_based":44193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"psCellOnlyOnFirstSSB","paragraph_zero_based":44194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value true indicates that only the SSB indicated in the first instance of MeasTiming in the measTiming list can be used for a PSCell configuration (i.e. in spCellConfigCommon of the secondaryCellGroup).","paragraph_zero_based":44195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssb-ToMeasure","paragraph_zero_based":44196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The set of SS blocks to be measured within the SMTC measurement duration (see TS 38.215 [9]).","paragraph_zero_based":44197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–UERadioPagingInformation","paragraph_zero_based":44199},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This message is used to transfer radio paging information, covering both upload to and download from the 5GC, and between gNBs.","paragraph_zero_based":44200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Direction: gNB to/ from 5GC and gNB to/from gNB","paragraph_zero_based":44201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UERadioPagingInformation message","paragraph_zero_based":44202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":44203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-UE-RADIO-PAGING-INFORMATION-START","paragraph_zero_based":44204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UERadioPagingInformation ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":44206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    criticalExtensions                  CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":44207}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c28951824dddce4d31feb89274332b4377af15cc891f609359c957bfb76b42b3","e9f9f4fae951bd9398170201d9d2d318ae92532a0e115c0c6438b4424414c52b","e36d068b32be05bab780882ee9c7da6e11c747e70e4ebe20a7980894a5f38129","3e0eb718124a270ba164b8f73ef4280e155778bd6287847bd4103a9a746bad95","1d3ed200a47cfc3ae0593a204ffe5fd8b6b9830451e1a1e69b0fd75debd32c9d","34036d13fae6818ff17a527b312dcbb10ab79