{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313638.zip::R2-2313638 NR-UAV-RRC-CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum number of resources that SCG is allowed to configure for FR1/FR2, respectively. ","paragraph_zero_based":44352},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxNumberResAcrossCC-AcrossFR","paragraph_zero_based":44353},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum number of configured CSI-RS resources. Corresponds to the UE capability maxNumberResAcrossCC-AcrossFR-r16 in maxTotalResourcesForAcrossFreqRanges-r16.","paragraph_zero_based":44354},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44355},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ResourceConfigPerFR field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":44356},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bm-MaxNumberAperiodicCSI-RS-Resource","paragraph_zero_based":44357},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum number of aperiodic CSI-RS resources that the SCG is allowed to configure for the UE to measure L1-RSRP. Corresponds to the UE capability maxNumberAperiodicCSI-RS-Resource in beamManagementSSB-CSI-RS.","paragraph_zero_based":44358},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bm-MaxNumberCSI-RS-Resource","paragraph_zero_based":44359},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum total number of NZP-CSI-RS resources that can be configured for the UE to measure L1-RSRP. Corresponds to the UE capability maxNumberCSI-RS-Resource in beamManagementSSB-CSI-RS.","paragraph_zero_based":44360},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cg-MaxNumberConfigsAllCC","paragraph_zero_based":44361},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum number of active configured grant configurations. Corresponds to the UE capability maxNumberConfigsAllCC-r16 in activeConfiguredGrant-r16.","paragraph_zero_based":44362},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxNumberCSI-RS-BFD","paragraph_zero_based":44363},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximal number of different CSI-RS resources for the UE to monitor PDCCH quality. Corresponds to the UE capability maxNumberCSI-RS-BFD.","paragraph_zero_based":44364},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxNumberCSI-RS-SSB-CBD","paragraph_zero_based":44365},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximal number of different CSI-RS (and/or SSB) resources for new beam identifications. Corresponds to the UE capability maxNumberCSI-RS-SSB-CBD.","paragraph_zero_based":44366},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxNumberSSB-BFD","paragraph_zero_based":44367},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximal number of different SSBs for the UE to monitor PDCCH quality. Corresponds to the UE capability maxNumberSSB-BFD.","paragraph_zero_based":44368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sps-MaxNumberConfigsAllCC","paragraph_zero_based":44369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum number of SPS configurations. Corresponds to the UE capability maxNumberConfigsAllCC-r16 in sps-r16.","paragraph_zero_based":44370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"trs-MaxConfResourceSetsAllCC","paragraph_zero_based":44371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum configured CSI-RS for tracking (i.e. TRS) resource sets. Corresponds to the UE capability maxConfiguredResourceSetsAllCC in csi-RS-ForTracking.","paragraph_zero_based":44372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"11.4Inter-node RRC multiplicity and type constraint values","paragraph_zero_based":44374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–Multiplicity and type constraints definitions","paragraph_zero_based":44375}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e3250e6c0cd3fb3aba61a07b59149d950b97cf801261256eaaffa40eb003836b","original_member_sha256":"43effeec8825b995fac78441fed0808abcec562c85ad3256681daf06dadbee2c","paragraph_Ele