{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313652.zip::R2-2313652 TEI18 SDT_ReleaseEnh 38331 CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release propDelayDiffReportConfig from the UE Inactive AS context, if stored;","paragraph_zero_based":312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release ul-GapFR2-PreferenceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release rrm-MeasRelaxationReportingConfig from the UE Inactive AS context, if stored;","paragraph_zero_based":314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the specified configuration of SL-RLC0 used for the delivery of RRC message over SRB0 as specified in 9.1.1.4;","paragraph_zero_based":316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the SDAP configuration and PDCP configuration as specified in 9.1.1.2 for SRB0;","paragraph_zero_based":317},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":318},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the CCCH configuration as specified in 9.1.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":319},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the timeAlignmentTimerCommon included in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":320},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sdt-MAC-PHY-CG-Config is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":321},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the resume procedure is initiated in a cell that is different to the PCell in which the UE received the stored sdt-MAC-PHY-CG-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":322},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the stored sdt-MAC-PHY-CG-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":323},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>instruct the MAC entity to stop the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer, if it is running;","paragraph_zero_based":324},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if ncd-SSB-RedCapInitialBWP-SDT is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":325},{"litera