{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313675.zip::R2-2313675 38.321 CR for UAV.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SSSynchronization Signals","paragraph_zero_based":240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SSBSynchronization Signal Block","paragraph_zero_based":241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"STAGSecondary Timing Advance Group","paragraph_zero_based":242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SULSupplementary Uplink","paragraph_zero_based":243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TAGTiming Advance Group","paragraph_zero_based":244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TCITransmission Configuration Indicator","paragraph_zero_based":245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TPC-SRS-RNTITransmit Power Control-Sounding Reference Signal-RNTI","paragraph_zero_based":246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TRIVTime Resource Indicator Value","paragraph_zero_based":247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TRPTransmit/Receive Point","paragraph_zero_based":248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TRSCSI-RS for tracking","paragraph_zero_based":249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"U2NUE-to-Network","paragraph_zero_based":250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UCIUplink Control Information","paragraph_zero_based":251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"V2XVehicle-to-Everything","paragraph_zero_based":252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ZP CSI-RSZero Power CSI-RS","paragraph_zero_based":253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.22.1.1SL Grant reception and SCI transmission","paragraph_zero_based":255},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sidelink grant is received dynamically on the PDCCH, configured semi-persistently by RRC or autonomously selected by the MAC entity. The MAC entity shall have a sidelink grant on an active SL BWP to determine a set of PSCCH duration(s) in which transmission of SCI occurs and a set of PSSCH duration(s) in which transmission of SL-SCH associated with the SCI occurs. A sidelink grant addressed to SL-CS-RNTI with NDI = 1 is considered as a dynamic sidelink grant.","paragraph_zero_based":256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the MAC entity has been configured with Sidelink resource allocation mode 1 as indicated in TS 38.331 [5], the MAC entity shall for each PDCCH occasion and for each grant received for this PDCCH occasion:","paragraph_zero_based":257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if a sidelink grant has been received on the PDCCH for the MAC entity's SL-RNTI:","paragraph_zero_based":258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the NDI received on the PDCCH has not been toggled compared to the value in the previously received HARQ information for the HARQ Process ID:","paragraph_zero_based":259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the received sidelink grant to determine PSCCH duration(s) and PSSCH duration(s) for one or more retransmissions of a single MAC PDU for the corresponding Sidelink process according to clause 8.1.2 of TS 38.214 [7].","paragraph_zero_based":260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the received sidelink grant to determine PSCCH duration(s) and PSSCH duration(s) for initial transmission and, if available, retransmission(s) of a single MAC PDU according to clause 8.1.2 of TS 38.214 [7].","paragraph_zero_based":262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if a sidelink grant has been received on the PDCCH for the MAC entity's SL-CS-RNTI:","paragraph_zero_based":263}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"fba70860f835d9038c47a1505397a4d028ca137ae0fa283b50bee18b2e83b295","original_member_sha256":"59b1d22b48df6067ac54d71b650dbe3cbd5d4468742f5ada8121a61670aac922","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f25aabe0f4597f242b55381dffc752867894e0326c1122f678e8afc2dc97a4d5","9