{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313691.zip::R2-2313691_Introduction of support for BWP operation without restriction in TS38.331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information for NR inter-frequency measurement.","paragraph_zero_based":744},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":745},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForNCSG-IntraFreq field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":746},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"servCellId","paragraph_zero_based":747},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the serving cell which contains the target SSB (associated with the initial DL BWP) to be measured.","paragraph_zero_based":748},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gapIndicationIntra","paragraph_zero_based":749},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether measurement gap or NCSG is required for the UE to perform intra-frequency SSB based measurements on the concerned serving cell. Value gap indicates that a measurement gap is needed if any of the UE configured BWPs (except the BWP(s) configured with servingCellMO associated with NCD-SSB) do not contain the frequency domain resources of the SSB associated to the initial DL BWP (CD-SSB). Value ncsg indicates that a NCSG is needed if any of the UE configured BWPs do not contain the frequency domain resources of the SSB associated to the initial DL BWP. Value nogap-noncsg indicates that neither a measurement gap nor a NCSG is needed to measure the SSB associated to the initial DL BWP (CD-SSB) for all configured BWPs (except the BWP(s) configured with servingCellMO associated with NCD-SSB), no matter the SSB is within the configured BWP or not. This field shall be set to ‘nogap-noncsg’ for the corresponding band(s) where bwpOperationMeasWithoutInterrupt-r18 is supported by the UE.","paragraph_zero_based":750},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":751},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForNCSG-NR field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":752},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bandNR","paragraph_zero_based":753},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the NR target band to be measured.","paragraph_zero_based":754},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gapIndication","paragraph_zero_based":755},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether measurement gap or NCSG is required for the UE to perform SSB based measurements on the concerned NR target band while NR-DC or NE-DC is not configured. The UE determines this information based on the resultant configuration of the RRCReconfiguration or RRCResume message that triggers this response. Value gap indicates that a measurement gap is needed, value ncsg indicates that a NCSG is needed, and value nogap-noncsg indicates neither a measurement gap nor a NCSG is needed. ","paragraph_zero_based":756},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":757},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":758},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Next change ","paragraph_zero_based":759},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NonCellDefiningSSB","paragraph_zero_based":760},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NonCellDefiningSSB is used to configure a NCD-SSB to be used while the UE operates in a RedCap-specific initial BWP or a dedicated BWP that does not contain the CD-SSB.","paragraph_zero_based":761},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NonCellDefiningSSB information element","paragraph_zero_based":762},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":763},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NONCELLDEFININGSSB-START","paragraph_zero_based":764},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":765},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NonCellDefiningSSB-r17 ::=      SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":766},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    absoluteFrequencySSB-r17        ARFCN-ValueNR,","paragraph_zero_based":767}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"61f02ceef1d524906560f8f1a482d15e83f76eb00023609c334c63ed8d6c34a9","original_member_sha256":"f9c2336c81c37716b94a78c676bf5f6ace0ec61f8e01450cd0d55d702a9ad7ba","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c2f240d6d56ccdf4c3f290def147a9e0f8807eb186383f34df161c0f6e5ef314","fdfc70e8036240e54ec32cfb12032fa0f110cab3fd1f7cc9b4c59f1a6237cc19","28ccc3807d7b7cdd3663f5d2446e739527626b190ff332d7711b6eb4bc614384","231d3aed7629b91ed531a9a6b11de8af044bf38e3e076ea4483869f3c2d87743","5540b59b05c779f55088be7e9b09f82e80b5335d90fa60843c57e80179d22d90","21f10db228b807dea9d41c88a11a5201dd729a2a690c0548e03dc84c589e009e","ef19d73d39574c833d4401decf9f954b7e6d81ebe1bae2fa22c9b6591fbf9be6","2bb8a6411d02d13c7ff27554559c9828c39947161ef172f9e2831cd5590b5b12","71ce4516b00dc5ff11839e898c930e0f72438fb515ccbef8fa6984bbeec1ccdd","93d6f57a62a489e63f9538e1af64ea4825c419aa0e07a0f62da8a43370ee0e3a","636ac48c630dfeec75ac1acbe86755ad7d3fe8c8b8d1e672123075debe68f461","7e28bb444a2d7c283ab25b81d5ed6c9b01d563beab860dfe7ce741ee09d30530","6353516339c7bd9fcbb5f7196912f75ba6c3a623e1e451661756020d382b68c6","703fa5ef943a87e522a7c11df9d49a945bf08c051e97182c12cf4a4227327a41","cc7fc2334e434d0633b57c7dbb628ea80ec841c59bcd19c2147c31b4997d6bbd","125feb361e95608437562885f59b0c26c58927ab1bc6cea6a1a6ff9e2718982c","06d4a886e97b4fde27fa7cef0d4a3c0395342af4bb260e2e56e6ff17d4e939a6","064acf492e7890fa3732e456c57ec54eb837a6b93347f4281e63f3b620eb5b81","74b5be1ea95c17d96cd5c1b7616b526f316f36dc424277e7f1b05c97a9f5909c","3bcffc5d60772e3e66af595ef101f92e5d7d0cb2ec8f5757f1f014072767acdb","a970537efd277c45944d45d43820371a04bef22018078aa27741363451e03a5b","55f442478b666749880492d23d392c4aa74dc91e4de0d831dfcef50292d122bf","86891203e84a002c30f79486a74dd65d3929f30ea0e4d168e8e70ec981aad5b8","1da337c5805b313b1b1684acff69bfd516d8943f414e4904e6c578c51ae023c4"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[744,767],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2313691.zip::R2-2313691_Introduction of support for BWP operation without restriction in TS38.331.docx:p744"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313691.zip::R2-2313691_Introduction of support for BWP operation without restriction in TS38.331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ssb-Periodicity-r17             ENUMERATED { ms5, ms10, ms20, ms40, ms80, ms160, spare2, spare1 }       OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":768},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ssb-TimeOffset-r17              ENUMERATED { ms5, ms10, ms15, ms20, ms40, ms80, spare2, spare1 }      OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":769},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":770},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":771},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":772},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NONCELLDEFININGSSB-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":773},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":774},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":775},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NonCellDefiningSSB field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":776},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"absoluteFrequencySSB","paragraph_zero_based":777},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Frequency of the NCD-SSB. The network configures this field so that the SSB is within the bandwidth of the BWP configured in BWP-DownlinkCommon.","paragraph_zero_based":778},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssb-Periodicity","paragraph_zero_based":779},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The periodicity of this NCD-SSB. The network configures only periodicities that are larger than the periodicity of serving cell's CD-SSB. If the field is absent, the UE applies the SSB periodicity of the CD-SSB (ssb-periodicityServingCell configured in ServingCellConfigCommon or ServingCellConfigCommonSIB).","paragraph_zero_based":780},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssb-TimeOffset","paragraph_zero_based":781},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The time offset between CD-SSB of the serving cell and this NCD-SSB. Value ms5 means the first burst of NCD-SSB is transmitted 5ms later than the first burst of CD-SSB transmitted after the first symbol of SFN=0 of the serving cell, value ms10 means the first burst of NCD-SSB is transmitted 10ms later than the first burst of CD-SSB transmitted after the first symbol in SFN=0 of the serving cell, and so on. If the field is absent, UE considers that the time offset between the first burst of CD-SSB transmitted in the serving cell and the first burst of this NCD-SSB transmitted is zero.","paragraph_zero_based":782},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":783},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"End of change ","paragraph_zero_based":784},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":785},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":786},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":787}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"61f02ceef1d524906560f8f1a482d15e83f76eb00023609c334c63ed8d6c34a9","original_member_sha256":"f9c2336c81c37716b94a78c676bf5f6ace0ec61f8e01450cd0d55d702a9ad7ba","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["00a21fc4da8485b14b49b8cf959b160d98b0df4ecacdee51615b6f7bd87ad02e","d4dbc11373aaa46e3727ca237de32e8ac85cf10069de6dfddb7eff002fb6226a","83716b84598f2336af64dc10a4d582dcdc5b4ac41ae9434dbc84559a16e487fb","5f54e541d6d0c02447cb17ac1f5f246fa5e964c3695b291ecc5e60df493720f9","8717c6fac3783cde5095d24f1534960eb4c0fa0d007c6e931e2f0f3b24f15d7b","f51be5e60f51df4796c2f688a3eb5997f260da278f4d50a28da3fc789760e7b9","c9eaa560bab80b547a0ec37d3996e7abf2d2c52e0a2739b797f9499cec5496e0","ec4ffa61907ba356d14f52db6e07a62f3baae4f04841d1e3a30378325b21f550","3b77e4a3ae804acc564ceadc0c8c1f9a0773e62ded262f10627535e326e920d4","cad00ed77f967f787a935b5cbbabb5083e4ce07aaa70bbdcb653877cacac4648","5ac383cc65c43aaf8a6077fcc0871eeee46271099355eea1