{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313845.zip::R2-2313845 Introduction of R18 positioning to MR-DC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"B","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Issue1: It needs to be clarified whether ranging/sidelink positioning is supported for MR-DC","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Issue2: During RAN2#124, the following agreement has been reached in RAN2: It needs to be captured in TS 37.340 that “Sidelink positioning cannot be configured in MR-DC in this release”.","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The following changes have been applied in the current CR","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Change1: Generic introduction of the feature of SL positioning to the spec","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Change2: clarify that MR-DC does not support ranging/sidelink positioning","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"da5f2e9ad82a2fe16c0ac8f47ac3a2bf5df15d5802210995528b085ea041fe8c","original_member_sha256":"4dd1bab56896055218acba90ada05dd206b70fbd7a2f3b846c0e4a02e9fd0070","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["007e4afaeee7cd2690e91c49d8d6f05dd3b6c9f326ff4f5c317ca63937382982","71e64e63dc6606d250e7d2abca7cdfca3c19976469e49fd1662beff7e50cb7d0","c9722102a6e77ef5fb9776dd3a3653bc3c9d2fa62ed4222492fd3e1e2a9a163a","0b9d29160855a38240fdd629a10f321f0605940c13a1e035d9ad98d1a4ea0653","0c548d8163a2bb44903282c3395a7cb915946cd71c625e70b1de6bc94834dc34","c87aadf271a71c5c8eb50727b0171e65f6262e35a5a46ef6b591123a8bdcf0f1","6cd14fa4e7842a580ff988ec950c90108e96f3a9342264e03cd92cdbc9fdd495","b13d2e51b74699836454584a9a4b18615e7ff840feb1dccb8fdb397afea6a9e1","5c3166e275bffa156d5bd50bcb0363ad8a14482ee7bce16c62aac87dd0c0b6a4","20c4e0ee7a1b84516c104cc3766608eb7edcb45c21eaaa9ea50a828a5731ccb3","6159239cde9699ef9bf8f933bd770e37f82a8a5b8710b1cf7792817a028edce8","67dee8db8f739c3fa8bc63eeb0ef8e07610eca4a8007982e3cda6889c98ae024","a31eaf8dec668e2fe654e637169e990fbc1f597b215bbea5149a4f5a7467940c","13082e81d5f9bfc399c36eb477dfaa13d86bd65a799c2426cdde5b65f3f8a9f6","ac194bfb