{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2313935.zip::R2-2313935 - 38321_CR1706_Rel-18_Introduction of Cross-RRH TCI state switch indication for high speed train.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"B","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Introduction of the new MAC CE indicated in RAN4 LS R4-2306399, R4-2314299 and R4-2321371.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Based on the RAN R4-2321371, RAN2 has agreed in RAN2#124 to introduce 1-bit new MAC CE indication corresponding to Case “0” and Case “1”.","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In clause 3.2, define the abbreviation RRH.","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In clause 5.18.5, define the MAC procedure when the MAC entity receives a Cross-RRH TCI State Indication for UE-specific PDCCH MAC CE on a Serving Cell.","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In clause 6.2.1, introduce the LCID for the Cross-RRH TCI State Indication for UE-specific PDCCH MAC CE","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In clause 6.1.3.x, add texts on the Cross-RRH TCI State Indication for UE-specific PDCCH MAC CE","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9006a5e4d405d2bab4da8adbe85c8c54348a814c5ca98f37bc600850b83d6866","original_member_sha256":"d5d414423b1048f375344cb48c2ef975c9c8e9f4329d79a9fea35e05ea08452c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f3a4c234a18b844f587985d608eb57b409fade4c5dd79908790de259b097be68","04e2637611f67113ccffdfeb736ba7694159b3e867c9fe876642e4ad3c8c3df3","2ad04fff81da196ef8fdcbe0cbede5a9b54684dd4cbf6583710e50f0493cce2c","87e4d069010f063c28132f924109430093feb04fa5afdbc476e8e8df2c1d9c21","440a8f5e73a7e7867e868a56b54293ce398f90aec677ff602a4b69dfc2b5be74","711ceb7ff8f2e8e9df70512f6847fbbef91eb3bbc1692561c801fcccdeb9993e","d67cf147c2b595f7724b008fba731c22caef98181430dae2c0ecf1c848079381","7e48018cea5799a3a7d08c3d24fd593c89eebd5033c113d5439ff3334fe19a9a","4453eee843f766f6c037354b7e8abd3d9a123dbd6078a658270cec7f7e147a11","beb6c063b24d7a19b1877a018fcc0019c3ed8c1d155f7eeb931366e6bda3d4b0","e9025a29329d114bda1ce9a015116c3f8d92d76fb35f5d5c7558018e3413a39b","45dd3517c439d4186d75f36644406a4b5915509d4900