ation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2314047.zip::R2-2314047.docx:p96"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2314047.zip::R2-2314047.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"START OF CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.8.3Reception of the RRCConnectionRelease by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>except for NB-IoT, BL UEs or UEs in CE, delay the following actions defined in this clause 60 ms from the moment the RRCConnectionRelease message was received or optionally when lower layers indicate that the receipt of the RRCConnectionRelease message has been successfully acknowledged, whichever is earlier;","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for BL UEs or UEs in CE, delay the following actions defined in this clause 1.25 seconds from the moment the RRCConnectionRelease message was received or optionally when lower layers indicate that the receipt of the RRCConnectionRelease message has been successfully acknowledged, whichever is earlier;","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for NB-IoT, delay the following actions defined in this clause 10 seconds from the moment the RRCConnectionRelease message was received or optionally when lower layers indicate that the receipt of the RRCConnectionRelease message has been successfully acknowledged, whichever is earlier.","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0:For BL UEs, UEs in CE and NB-IoT, when STATUS reporting, as defined in TS 36.322 [7], has not been triggered and the UE has sent positive HARQ feedback (ACK), as defined in TS 36.321 [6], the lower layers can be considered to have indicated that the receipt of the RRCConnectionRelease message has been successfully acknowledged.","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop T380, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if timer T316 is running;","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T316;","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>clear the information included in VarRLF-Report, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for NB-IoT:","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has reported anr-InfoAvailable, clear VarANR-MeasConfig-NB and VarANR-MeasReport-NB;","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has reported rlf-InfoAvailable, clear VarRLF-Report-NB;","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCConnectionRelease message is received in response to an RRCConnectionResumeRequest for EDT or for UP transmission using PUR:","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate to upper layers that the suspended RRC connection has been resumed;","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the stored UE AS context and resumeIdentity;","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T300;","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T302, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T303, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"30bab297e2c1559150f28c715187cd2b042427217032b939c40fbda0b98d5d22","original_member_sha256":"cb272e610fd9cd8910cfd70983738fb68760b249a2966dd09d1d153b23cfa274","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3c87416eb28dc6812775a561018d648aacb1a1ae1ec371499fa9db201006ac28","464857d68bd205e2fbbdb1e4c7f543d005d1d340f751ba5667840a040359424e","ca916bd5f7262a6a306ea494aab0230c9e3fac381e4cac7700fdc6d326eb2d5d","7f88bd3fd0f42b1407f8b0cef8594ce27d16932f69983d8f1dabbdfc1a243ffc","beb02d4a5c1dbb94e354a5a684a9817e87eea668c8aa21158fa068f332bbccd6","2978360e2108f63c766e8ebc487436d9d97fb7408d60b6c4f6116b2abc6aa032","fa95f9bacd152a9d785104faaf27f8ee4e1a27865afdb6ef6570ab18d9fb75ff","1a1463ddc8355c40a4c2756f8cdbc73c26ddbe8cb03000b53cc3adcebc8b2509","1262eade6a520253589d5b4039f19756742981acc4994199b417281847b6171d","d77f7a4c8d0cfa237ac17d79c27340f3fbf22da250ec410842304b8bc23ff8c8","b996d87d370d4f7d9d332b8aa7e3ef429b24199240c7fe2c137d4408eb068e9c","437635b87506544ce79435abe57accaccd7a1265ae2f02cc7c323df1d64b8a1e","32df59b503531271d5d29ef412a20b262adb461f2e30fb02adfb3889eee3292e","1d31e4092683a104b62ecbe2e2caaec3dfb792f495e9e13beb815b02a92b9d14","442ae63fd6f5ccb1041edf3e98fa3d0b943329144a5ccae43847a8ea37ccf0f6","e7f17657f3128ad61d2525f76d130b7b679b869b5014ceb278b8755b8796de76","c1143b519fca58627d09c3fcd617cb7bfe2dea3f446afca805807a7d66150e7c","068974165496cdaed5bd6346c3f7a71fd89ca4e0d7d32c9f82a6fdfa67377b06","ebd37703252fcccdcc36715059695c2ae91071988b7b937925d9211c80e36db0","b500830f91821fccba786a728e065cad1a45363a71e5b9d6a45c54684e08b389","fec01c285ef6ab434ecbf92d0fc98d7c0dd231d28deb1b91d1bcd7e0787f75d5","e340513f2f961749d42d23421cb8b971fd2e59c26c37baa19af2ec80dc39aef9","70dbe232fb656815f1032efe7d76a821675afac2f84efe9ae2b411f70b1878c4","ad21840db258fc9f2cefde1273c429d2a640d19ee1d61fc97a3c60cf6f95d942"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[120,143],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2314047.zip::R2-2314047.docx:p120"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2314047.zip::R2-2314047.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T305, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T306, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T308, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T320, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T322, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T323, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>except for UEs using the Control Plane CIoT 5GS optimisation, if AS security is not activated and if UE is connected to 5GC:","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>ignore any field included in RRCConnectionRelease message except waitTime;","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions upon leaving RRC_CONNECTED or RRC_INACTIVE as specified in 5.3.12 with the release cause 'other' upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCConnectionRelease message includes redirectedCarrierInfo indicating redirection to geran, utra-FDD, utra-TDD or utra-TDD-r10;  or","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCConnectionRelease message includes idleModeMobilityControlInfo including freqPriorityListGERAN or freqPriorityListUTRA-FDD or freqPriorityListUTRA-TDD:","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if AS security has not been activated; and","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if upper layers indicate that redirect to GERAN or UTRAN without AS security is not allowed (see TS 24.301):","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>ignore the content of the RRCConnectionRelease;","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the actions upon leaving RRC_CONNECTED or RRC_INACTIVE as specified in 5.3.12, with release cause 'other', upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if AS security has not been activated:","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>ignore the content of redirectedCarrierInfo, if included and indicating redirection to nr;","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>ignore the content of idleModeMobilityControlInfo, if included and including freqPriorityListNR;","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>ignore the altFreqPriorities and T323, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE ignores the content of redirectedCarrierInfo or of idleModeMobilityControlInfo, or of altFreqPriorities and T323:","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the actions upon leaving RRC_CONNECTED as specified in 5.3.12, with release cause 'other', upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCConnectionRelease message includes redirectedCarrierInfo indicating redirection to eutra and if UE is connected to 5GC:","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if cn-Type is included:","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"30bab297e2c1559150f28c715187cd2b042427217032b939c40fbda0b98d5d22","original_member_sha256":"cb272e610fd9cd8910cfd70983738fb68760b249a2966dd09d1d153b23cfa274","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3106d69376aa09ce9b088c373ad8737404d065bc3a514f51fd1ad78ea11de458","8aba5a10d320a9313d7c43fa2a3980735679de082fe9fad6eff7d4efbcaf9118","f197b248baf45181603941ba53d0f42b815e7379899bc0c98113a8eb17dd6db8","b58a0d257baa6793672f2d5c6b54a63c7556e79de2b7111642bf0057ed4b4040","e061730d6005d285b668ba2a3307561a51137696fdf43e263adfa09d8d8bb12d","ccc0184ccc2fe991eeb9c44692498a689560156eab81c252ff254f491d50dea9","2979251674e1f0cc9e0481973edade8c7aa6e846b82957f39b262be2a5c50dd9","32654b1241ad8955b43883a5f62ea3dcf28a26772dab4cede44c59d79fa38cdc","e749bc0fb8c2a9d0507cb5323b8f78f4528debc8f74741af54f0798310f824e8","f8a1ed161bf19608752c0d6aa0f86d68b70add0d923dbf0361f078baf8cfd039","e9af68333a809ee82f46cc456ba2e6508874e2267f02d655dcb7b5ac26ecb28f","984dc4ec7c643f6007ac3c52dedcb1e14ab051cba404baef3e47141b499799e5","840ae8d23177a7c98f233cc923bf7502a0e7eb3d2f4b2b64a3bf5b3b50c97543","af8d3305d6460728ecaa073d2389b35e260c3b89345f00adf5c3444620c96d85","86b35aacc91e34bf7968eb1de835a4ffc428be76bda46055bef29e8bad7e08c4","1f2576be7e73f57260f4bda3e4a5253720a7c08885da5369290295e8e00e17f3","6387cd30c8fef193c07b26d28b676a144af1179cd38b29ac47747356f898dbd7","8f2dfb6521d84e6656f759a53f75935a37355b266670d76b55ce921ad5548212","bb7e23e37eb807b64c23c2277770f8b9f8323113f02aae407a2c2b91b36b69b2","2b6755f73de6955b8e01b98f6b15a8d84bf0a205a66edf8ffdddcbc166534b8b","dde07668174269286b565137ed3bbd00d82a1d66d7ceb6ca2f421e20ae1259ac","623fe79ea07905510f6f3f2a673d6e6438117a0e022d55469533f6a2339923f0","8658727943ce4aaeb118fabc161abaf8f31adb55bd8027b1b92ac929c380302d","efda11ce50fb6303f1b9b6ce5aea1ae93ae38adfe8a2f2cb97d5cadd92dcf3cd"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[144,167],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2314047.zip::R2-2314047.docx:p144"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2314047.zip::R2-2314047.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>after the cell selection, indicate the available CN Type(s) and the received cn-Type to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Handling the case if the E-UTRA cell selected after the redirection does not support the core network type specified by the cn-Type, is up to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCConnectionRelease message includes the idleModeMobilityControlInfo:","paragraph_zero_based":170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>store the cell reselection priority information provided by the idleModeMobilityControlInfo;","paragraph_zero_based":171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the t320 is included:","paragraph_zero_based":172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T320, with the timer value set according to the value of t320;","paragraph_zero_based":173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the RRCConnectionRelease message includes the altFreqPriorities:","paragraph_zero_based":174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>store the received altFreqPriorities;","paragraph_zero_based":175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for E-UTRA frequency, apply the alternative cell reselection priority information broadcast in the system information if available, otherwise apply the cell reselection priority broadcast in the system information;","paragraph_zero_based":176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for inter-RAT frequency, apply the cell reselection priority broadcast in the system information;","paragraph_zero_based":177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the t323 is included:","paragraph_zero_based":178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T323, with the timer value set according to the value of t323;","paragraph_zero_based":179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the cell reselection priority information broadcast in the system information;","paragraph_zero_based":181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCConnectionRelease message includes the releaseMeasIdleConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if timer T331 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T331;","paragraph_zero_based":184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the actions as specified in 5.6.20.3;","paragraph_zero_based":185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCConnectionRelease message includes the measIdleConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>clear VarMeasIdleConfig and VarMeasIdleReport;","paragraph_zero_based":187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>store the received measIdleDuration in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start or restart T331 with the value of measIdleDuration;","paragraph_zero_based":189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the measIdleConfig contains measIdleCarrierListEUTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store the received measIdleCarrierListEUTRA in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"30bab297e2c1559150f28c715187cd2b042427217032b939c40fbda0b98d5d22","original_member_sha256":"cb272e610fd9cd8910cfd70983738fb68760b249a2966dd09d1d153b23cfa274","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0a2c7b39e399c3c15c0bf29b11368db6e52cc66611868d3685deded999c6cd2b","8f60c76305092afea5fe1bfd396b3c47a10d82eb7c7c00b6987902dd1f3bb8a2","0cf3b3361fe5ac3fc6df6da36177235a527b25e43e1d66184a810e1f9b122639","b414b58c09f59115ea91681795b35c038340c1ecde5c1c724326c627e523ffca","ef66be4c14a5a671f0b45fc7a72ea692c755fd1a706fa0c4fbc1aaff82d6ad2e","71eb87bef457e7845a96bcf1a056eb27ec988308c98484004befeeb4cc7e65a6","43d1d49571e263a7517e759a34f6ed2fb5b6d56dc7997166a67778ffd2b40e16","10d679289ceb92e3d86430f88535adaf13a1a06eaa4652cf3deb3a10b4dd2440","5bc32c6adb2e8a0746bf9b21f0ffda70622d5253ddccea138b1b7ba05f9c1266","f6bc4178d4ca2691f02561f41098f07b61e3652f2530096e02b1c6a329ff7fbb","5c3c9a6bf596b20d5718fe65a56644bf803bb7d846cc121e4667f8fbd33359f9","bd20beda35ed8100c68ccf767ff1920d458b01c5c560d3ad214ff4f91a017aec","8b6bf5a2e25ec529f099fb5d779da7f7571dfbb7d511f66481382d9a2281c7f5","573e0c1e352a7ac0d4f8a59193dfdc6578c969ae352bbd01dfc3ef9457227af5","1f14b11a6fee104fcb90e87287e99f88c0b23f6eb70e5bda79a53bbc2665ff8c","69ed12c846525d71895abc760d41b8909cf15a9c87f6522c8c0273ba91f063d3","964ca57d02a2c29f78743c6861386eee22c79441548264f9be314dfbee8f62e9","4e5aee20d6b25949c97105f22c10179ad6fe2971c915dd50e63f322b43c19a14","32308119f2d1d0c8f720ce102af8b9fed77af3bb6782662475762dcd2bd7c2ca","5b5232d3a89d36f46bfe054d3becf1150517fdc8e8e860e9de875a288b782858","eb0e953ddb32f0e6fa28557dcff0b539bf105392a4fd84bec1e5d272490ca39c","997a5a6967a33600f5d872beb2d3a9b9521b7666d4ae6fb296bc65474cc4a8d8","fea18e347846b11c044aa76e50b21bffea92396350ff8d0a0e19b63ef2559c04","2392d4a73a61be6cc0a858a0e1f37f52d6175bc4ade036abf31d48c4436cc6cc"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[168,191],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2314047.zip::R2-2314047.docx:p168"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2314047.zip::R2-2314047.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the measIdleConfig contains measIdleCarrierListNR:","paragraph_zero_based":192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store the received measIdleCarrierListNR in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the measIdleConfig contains validityAreaList:","paragraph_zero_based":194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store the received validityAreaList in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:If the measIdleConfig contains neither measIdleCarrierListEUTRA nor measIdleCarrierListNR, UE may receive measIdleCarrierListEUTRA and/or measIdleCarrierListNR as specified in 5.6.20.1a.","paragraph_zero_based":196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for NB-IoT, if the RRCConnectionRelease message includes the anr-MeasConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>clear VarANR-MeasConfig-NB and VarANR-MeasReport-NB;","paragraph_zero_based":198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>store the received anr-QualityThreshold in VarANR-MeasConfig-NB;","paragraph_zero_based":199},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the anr-MeasConfig contains anr-CarrierList:","paragraph_zero_based":200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store the received anr-CarrierList in VarANR-MeasConfig-NB;","paragraph_zero_based":201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set plmn-IdentityList in VarANR-MeasReport-NB to include the list of EPLMNs stored by the UE (i.e. includes the RPLMN);","paragraph_zero_based":202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set servCellIdentity in VarANR-MeasReport-NB to the global cell identity of the Pcell;","paragraph_zero_based":203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start performing ANR measurements as specified in 5.6.24;","paragraph_zero_based":204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCConnectionRelease message includes the pur-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if pur-Config is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store or replace the PUR configuration provided by the pur-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":207},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if pur-TimeAlignmentTimer is included in the received pur-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure lower layers in accordance with pur-TimeAlignmentTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if pur-TimeAlignmentTimer is configured, indicate to lower layers that pur-TimeAlignmentTimer is released;","paragraph_zero_based":211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if pur-RSRP-ChangeThreshold (pur-NRSRP-ChangeThreshold in NB-IoT) is included in the received pur-Config and set to setup; or","paragraph_zero_based":212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if pur-RSRP-ChangeThreshold (pur-NRSRP-ChangeThreshold in NB-IoT) is configured and pur-TimeAlignmentTimer is included in the received pur-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store or replace the serving cell reference (N)RSRP value with the current serving cell (N)RSRP value (see 5.3.3.19);","paragraph_zero_based":214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start maintenance of PUR occasions as specified in 5.3.3.20;","paragraph_zero_based":215}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"30bab297e2c1559150f28c715187cd2b042427217032b939c40fbda0b98d5d22","original_member_sha256":"cb272e610fd9cd8910cfd70983738fb68760b249a2966dd09d1d153b23cfa274","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c55d52559d9d6326201839b04c51817ed41dd3746b7afd9d452b548772d34c07","a72929c52d1bee8c39446f76ce22f5b7521ed4dc743cb13025e3d431a26b508a","7fc94b0320f2aaf32261d80e94e1bcc5afa9a418023c4dfa643ad86c3051c584","2fdffa44d805a127ce462ea6d56cbdba1baaf490c55bee45ba76595c861db0ab","b669562928a44cfed0c6daaadafdb2c0d32a227e72241951836464ad892dc243","369bfa53a195070198712ead65e382bcb22900d94232b2bb0a3e42ed1711e60f","ee0a7255bcb8db389a22de9238d6a023f70842787bb21a08ad30ea9396f9bc57","1bf6aadeb4cd953205de3ac333ec59eebcb10de5d11dbc60921ec3a6091e866d","bf208426e7bdf6694c474b56339ecdd53cd98e44f5111aedb8acf4bc785fb89d","b2df243889a880f29b091ad87f4c50de737359e1d90521caac950be20ad3ac9b","252ac315685da13bb0372352570a8853f5446d33fb8ab4d1054e9ebbe530d1db","e45e8b12c0823233a1f4f25190a11f59f559b2739793ea45369112b79333d3f8","3c1461753f756062170ed9ea97637ddea6bec2f8a65710c1d1d2e4d043b5aa28","dce5fde91317561cf577dd73a176dc758d2c38edd7c3b5ddbf6386d389d34934","cb39170091fa109a9d84785e2c2c8a1966b73e20d9887b7e1c0eef8daee455b7","5a8863a772af4cc4d415cc91657df9e8a91b8b188e65beb01a58b358f2f03f31","00c11df0b08af83112819d88c4e6fe3beda484a99601b25eeaf355241c91dbf9","446233dbe3954fa856ad236f9496f9fd81d88a1cc7d74ac9ce70738d942155e2","7e827358820672d36a1cde0e3c3360012e14b21f10ba963020926c84e59e56fb","e280398aaaf2f6508bd5b4f7fd7daadd17a4c2079e02de20e88dd10ecb67f19b","44a222c144ca72ffb964b7c9fe683910adcc5c28df93970c7b469a82f2823497","6789523a8f7e6638bab4b847cba53fda4fc63bcbbe26caeadec1ec4643ac313e","6e6c69f5bc6e8902760c2eca292b00b4422fc88bbb141bc563cd794faf5addcf","325df04a093569e7fa735d5b625963489be449400d45e530071aa22ebce16c76"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[192,215],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2314047.zip::R2-2314047.docx:p192"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2314047.zip::R2-2314047.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if pur-TimeAlignmentTimer is configured, indicate to lower layers that pur-TimeAlignmentTimer is released;","paragraph_zero_based":217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release pur-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>discard previously stored pur-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for NB-IoT, if the RRCConnectionRelease message includes the redirectedCarrierInfo:","paragraph_zero_based":220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the redirectedCarrierOffsetDedicated is included in the redirectedCarrierInfo:","paragraph_zero_based":221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store the dedicated offset for the frequency in redirectedCarrierInfo;","paragraph_zero_based":222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T322, with the timer value set according to the value of T322 in redirectedCarrierInfo;","paragraph_zero_based":223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the releaseCause received in the RRCConnectionRelease message indicates loadBalancingTAURequired:","paragraph_zero_based":224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions upon leaving RRC_CONNECTED as specified in 5.3.12, with release cause 'load balancing TAU required';","paragraph_zero_based":225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the releaseCause received in the RRCConnectionRelease message indicates cs-FallbackHighPriority:","paragraph_zero_based":226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions upon leaving RRC_CONNECTED as specified in 5.3.12, with release cause 'CS Fallback High Priority';","paragraph_zero_based":227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the extendedWaitTime is present; and","paragraph_zero_based":229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports delay tolerant access or the UE is a NB-IoT UE:","paragraph_zero_based":230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>forward the extendedWaitTime to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the extendedWaitTime-CPdata is present and the NB-IoT UE only supports the Control Plane CIoT EPS optimisation:","paragraph_zero_based":232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>forward the extendedWaitTime-CPdata to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the releaseCause received in the RRCConnectionRelease message indicates rrc-Suspend:","paragraph_zero_based":234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the actions upon leaving RRC_CONNECTED as specified in 5.3.12, with release cause 'RRC suspension';","paragraph_zero_based":235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if rrc-InactiveConfig is included:","paragraph_zero_based":236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the actions upon entering RRC_INACTIVE as specified in 5.3.8.7;","paragraph_zero_based":237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the actions upon leaving RRC_CONNECTED or RRC_INACTIVE as specified in 5.3.12, with release cause 'other';","paragraph_zero_based":239}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"30bab297e2c1559150f28c715187cd2b042427217032b939c40fbda0b98d5d22","original_member_sha256":"cb272e610fd9cd8910cfd70983738fb68760b249a2966dd09d1d153b23cfa274","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fdccd517127d8ccc5bc41d753fe3d0a0046fad3eaf74d2ce9180311cb344d95e","dbde18c2a21b21c2bbb92464baf78739a83397576f7c83b406cf3f1d5279aa83","39b404e605ca457fbe01a38f0def00fb78c5c651da7bc82c6633f2041ddf2b52","5471cde4f4756b0b8136afe321d3b98d077e3