{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2400190.zip::R2-2400190_SDT CR 38306 for TEI18_v2a.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Support polarization signalling for non-serving cell in RRM measurement configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TRS occasions for idle mode and RRC_INACTIVE UEs","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is optional for UE to support reading TRS configuration from SIB and receiving L1 indication for TRS availability.","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:Receiving L1 indication via DCI format 2_7 is supported only if the UE supports receiving DCI format 2_7.","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Beam Failure recovery for SDT ","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is optional for UE to support Beam failure recovery during RA-SDT for MO-SDT and MT-SDT (performed over RACH) as specified in TS 38.321 [8] and TS 38.331 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"=============================== END OF FIRST CHANGES ========================","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":152}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"f3779c4942e4132bf14e54630a3f2f0b8893eece19e5dc42691f294b0354bcd0","original_member_sha256":"ace666b0db14934649204ad805e520e6a36388be5b1f344a61b8b24664d23898","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f586409cec4cb7063be874dbe74ea736fc945a7f92738592bcefb077e85e8983","f4955ce130f5f139fc5af23b45f68e31c4a17a7c1567fce7c0e23c966b5b0063","98ff52ce01abdfba756386a6372d289b2a8ef881f0e2748b0bc72bacf7714de6","823950e08974df1f09e539a04d75e82df42948b5efc7be5ff9cac5de7ace583d","23febad