{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2400627.zip::R2-2400627 Correction BT positioning mode support TS38305.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-sensor based methods:","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-barometric Pressure Sensor;","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-motion sensor.","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-NR enhanced cell ID methods (NR E-CID) based on NR signals;","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Multi-Round Trip Time Positioning (Multi-RTT based on NR signals);","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Downlink Angle-of-Departure (DL-AoD) based on NR signals;","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Downlink Time Difference of Arrival (DL-TDOA) based on NR signals;","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Uplink Time Difference of Arrival (UL-TDOA) based on NR signals;","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Uplink Angle-of-Arrival (UL-AoA), including A-AoA and Z-AoA based on NR signals;","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-SL positioning and Ranging based on sidelink signals, incl.:","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Sidelink Round Trip Time Positioning (SL-RTT);","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Sidelink Angle-of-Arrival (SL-AoA);","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Sidelink Time Difference of Arrival (SL-TDOA);","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Sidelink Time of Arrival (SL-TOA).","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hybrid positioning using multiple methods from the list of positioning methods above is also supported.","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Standalone mode (e.g. autonomous, without network assistance) using one or more methods from the list of positioning methods above is also supported.","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"These positioning methods (except SL positioning and ranging methods) may be supported in UE-based, UE-assisted/LMF-based, and NG-RAN node assisted versions. Table 4.3.1-1 indicates which of these versions are supported in this version of the specification for the standardised positioning methods.","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Table 4.3.1-1: Supported versions of UE positioning methods","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Method","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE-based","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE-assisted, LMF-based","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NG-RAN node assisted","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SUPL Note 8","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A-GNSS","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"5b02fa5d38f26c57ef4ae3249c9ddc3542b9c288e8b322c96b1e55a5ae8bf1e8","original_member_sha256":"c9d97b7a48bdd260906825d063a9aeaa517c5eaf9d984f932ecbcf5b265095df","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9edaf9994164f812b5828acdeca2453d522b80ac8d7e2daf936b9761422cb8e3","8b57cf5f356dbf72b151daaa60624c7c9aecd6a1b369922baf0838d346f38fe8","55ffc29c489a8a1141fb233453faf2c2ace076b788ee02e5b8c8ac2989f4b1ef","486f6a6aa9d279b35fae8f31fcd878f887bd97c3a89cc127084225f17a3db5f1","ca8b988267ecdd3f7aeb39c9ee092b3f4f70db7274322b9779c852c2ff5dac4c","bf01b0a4c0cd58d05fdf102a3da95da9ff526cb7852ac5184b2a259348ec6e14","ac6a0afee0dbaf5da4cbe8bcd3d511e282ee0935e8335331aa33be8e3f9913b3","923c60cc34725c51dcbd90f63b8bd70c662d3353958a951591d252e2b244631b","757acc538f964566d7d5c8d972e5e90af