{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401275.zip::R2-2401275 Introduction of two QCL-TypeD properties identification and monitoring.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"B","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"According to RAN1’s Rel-18 higher layers parameter list (R1-2312708), the higher layer parameter twoQCL-TypeD-ForMultiDCI should be introduced in RRC by RAN2.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This parameter indicates whether a UE is expected to identify and monitor two QCL-Type D properties for multiple overlapping CORESETs, where the first QCL-TypeD is associated with coresetPoolIndex value 0, and the second QCL-Type D is associated with coresetPoolIndex value 1.","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Add the parameter ' twoQCL-TypeD-ForMultiDCI ' in the PhysicalCellGroupConfig IE.","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE cannot know whether it should monitor two QCL-TypeD properties for multiple overlapping CORESETs.","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9ef79a4eb2cc359be77b260df29ccfb41d1690d829d9f72664c79151548c2096","original_member_sha256":"e0a2c9353da6a7184b58797c60442cdf9a142252349ae303a56438bc61293dd7","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a7b8faeb97c2e7bce821fcc5af64b68bb5d8224285b7bda61396971afe2db15a","8e0dc0cfc542d1e683d25af6083c6b5739bab7518cb48efeaab2ab277a8fb23a","6ba142295ff835955524f160ab38b863cea762029933cea534b00c8930bacc9e","d32c72c4c1cf0fdd7cf0013dc94f977b279a36604ce35c79a9a9af143a9464c3","5ecf8037d37e3ae3407d702f915bebc9476042b7954d03d224fae795fabbf7c1","6bdccfdd4a287115f188ae373dec720d925e50f42ccf9a84fe9c418d17367cde","ad3c2b7bd416b63f9b0723896a34ea87c363b85207615345eb46c318e2c8dbcb","33f2f81062bf3309c60bcb0d0a89b86612a7b1a3b16cde88612bb2f56b468c05","ce505c0b8ad558cb758d87b4dbf7f2a9214aae6d32be349cd942fd72ca7cb3f1","39fb9c5b1e97846fd4e73643a5364c6e156fa405e8c35de435b41e2af2aa1c30","f24cb55aa08efe22bb89089a0e6f46d55c58de3f2cfd7bf73f171519f61ea8c8","b81ecd08ebc40e7d65b1dbc9eb2420310fd4b9c8229e1f