{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":96},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"x","paragraph_zero_based":97},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":" O&M Specifications","paragraph_zero_based":98},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":99},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Other comments:","paragraph_zero_based":102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This CR's revision history:","paragraph_zero_based":106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Revision 1: The changes according to the conclusions reached during RAN2#125 meeting were added, i.e. RILs: H551, I052, H552, H553, F011, H556, H399. Editorial corrections were introduced to address class 0 issues identified during ASN.1 review.","paragraph_zero_based":107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1Scope","paragraph_zero_based":109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The present document specifies the Radio Resource Control protocol for the radio interface between UE and NG-RAN.","paragraph_zero_based":110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The scope of the present document also includes:","paragraph_zero_based":111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the radio related information transported in a transparent container between source gNB and target gNB upon inter gNB handover;","paragraph_zero_based":112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the radio related information transported in a transparent container between a source or target gNB and another system upon inter RAT handover.","paragraph_zero_based":113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the radio related information transported in a transparent container between a source eNB and target gNB during E-UTRA-NR Dual Connectivity.","paragraph_zero_based":114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The RRC protocol is also used to configure the radio interface between an IAB-node and its parent node [2].","paragraph_zero_based":115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2References","paragraph_zero_based":116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The following documents contain provisions which, through reference in this text, constitute provisions of the present document.","paragraph_zero_based":117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-References are either specific (identified by date of publication, edition number, version number, etc.) or nonspecific.","paragraph_zero_based":118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-For a specific reference, subsequent revisions do not apply.","paragraph_zero_based":119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["788c4cf9fcf982ca6d5174aa1521e56fe276d9e9c280c875a75b7779fda2209a","685b173e0866b8833e7b97c1840ca73c4bb87a06d1da858babfb9d35798e44ca","3fe18f6a0ec35e70013702ab55ef4a44bb82e29acf301c464060726c911ef30a","15fbe48015bbd6add4e30294b8fe9c17bc8833bc8d9cf11881305ffa121277b3","1178b7b8099b871bf82c9b59291bde973c6430805fd652a42432e0844e288031","e63ea55bc749918d654b64e1d6846cfae82f971246322a4f50d31ae8111833d5","e82c0f5ca781b0ddd39e2163cf6c65408df2c6eb336f7f0c9fee126eb902e2ee","2c652f72501ee799bf8425263a6d2798700dc02992ed6737af591ef853cd0b2b","3d3a1d6a5bf32953abd59c559d50c1088f3bb9a91a7bc298896d136f59a97239","0307fbeeecbe043742d42b5de74090c9f287e44dbbead7ea4d