{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is an (e)RedCap UE and if initialUplinkBWP-RedCap is not configured in UplinkConfigCommonSIB and if SIB1 includes si-SchedulingInfo containing si-RequestConfig and criteria to select normal uplink as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1 is met:","paragraph_zero_based":768},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>trigger the lower layer to initiate the Random Access procedure on normal uplink in accordance with TS 38.321 [3] using the PRACH preamble(s) and PRACH resource(s) in si-RequestConfig corresponding to the SI message(s) that the UE requires to operate within the cell, and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting;","paragraph_zero_based":769},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if acknowledgement for SI request is received from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":770},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the requested SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2, immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":771},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":772},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the default L1 parameter values as specified in corresponding physical layer specifications except for the parameters for which values are provided in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":773},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the default MAC Cell Group configuration as specified in 9.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":774},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the timeAlignmentTimerCommon included in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":775},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the CCCH configuration as specified in 9.1.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":776},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the RRCSystemInfoRequest message with rrcSystemInfoRequest in accordance with 5.2.2.3.4;","paragraph_zero_based":777},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if acknowledgement for RRCSystemInfoRequest message with rrcSystemInfoRequest is received from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":778},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the requested SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2, immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":779},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if cell reselection occurs while waiting for the acknowledgment for SI request from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":780},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset MAC;","paragraph_zero_based":781},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SI request is based on RRCSystemInfoRequest message with rrcSystemInfoRequest:","paragraph_zero_based":782},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release RLC entity for SRB0.","paragraph_zero_based":783},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:After RACH failure for SI request it is up to UE implementation when to retry the SI request.","paragraph_zero_based":784},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.3.3aRequest for on demand positioning system information","paragraph_zero_based":785},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall, while SDT procedure is not ongoing:","paragraph_zero_based":786},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if SIB1 includes si-SchedulingInfo containing posSI-RequestConfigSUL-MSG1-Repetition and criteria to select supplementary uplink as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1 is met and if criteria to apply MSG1 repetition as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1e for the concerned posSI-RequestConfigSUL-MSG1-Repetition is met:","paragraph_zero_based":787},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>trigger the lower layer to initiate the Random Access procedure on supplementary uplink in accordance with TS 38.321 [3] using the PRACH preamble(s) and PRACH resource(s) associated with the applicable MSG1 repetition number in posSI-RequestConfigSUL-MSG1-Repetition corresponding to the SI message(s) that the UE requires to operate within the cell, and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting;","paragraph_zero_based":788},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if acknowledgement for SI request is received from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":789},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>acquire the requested SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2, immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":790},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE is a RedCap UE and if initialUplinkBWP-RedCap is configured in UplinkConfigCommonSIB and if SIB1 includes si-SchedulingInfo containing posSI-RequestConfigRedCap-MSG1-Repetition and criteria to select normal uplink as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1 is met and if criteria to apply MSG1 repetition as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1e for the concerned posSI-RequestConfigRedCap-MSG1-Repetition is met:","paragraph_zero_based":791}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c98749f53d5f12e70f4585edd9ed49cdc84184d3d23c1078e82ce40f4a94945d","a91076d038dd009fc83484b0c61594d6ba77cb35342a9029517d88e6d455c0b5","008d73bf81f29e3f77f5a36340df99f50a580d323fae5c58467c40d71e9f24d9","43191949d3a5aaecab8cbff7d5214850b843e0446e4b45dca74377a133d8243d","c975dbf6b1d317eff2c2ea1f7f036717fb6314d1d05754a38aef99a4215286a5","f25cfa377660083e080fcbc4c3bdc24e54fca8dda33a45009e32935961754b3b","a9980fc5055e58199994dba69a4b68c10470f574ea73edfa69959a85800c477b","c217b90dc6fd96408982b9653b4388344aa991f5f3e4fc0516a1ee936cb222ad","49b9e011a0cec81f54b7a8ecd328f8137505e6943165928e0972522b0dcd7d69","60a4b9d84751c4109d71b5a49e8610a83c0d6f6084124ca01dddacc1cfea862a","4eeff9307e34f47c8bea87d532b5ebcd4f0df8ec70ac3fa4a3fcbace36b8f193","0cb90d756c0a8151711981d95644e4775910576fe3f2aec39369c7458b9da245","24b97c2091ebed53c3e3