{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the default MAC Cell Group configuration as specified in 9.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":816},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the timeAlignmentTimerCommon included in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":817},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the CCCH configuration as specified in 9.1.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":818},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the RRCSystemInfoRequest message with rrcPosSystemInfoRequest in accordance with 5.2.2.3.4;","paragraph_zero_based":819},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if acknowledgement for RRCSystemInfoRequest message with rrcPosSystemInfoRequest is received from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the requested SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2, immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if cell reselection occurs while waiting for the acknowledgment for SI request from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset MAC;","paragraph_zero_based":823},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SI request is based on RRCSystemInfoRequest message with rrcPosSystemInfoRequest:","paragraph_zero_based":824},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release RLC entity for SRB0.","paragraph_zero_based":825},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:After RACH failure for SI request it is up to UE implementation when to retry the SI request.","paragraph_zero_based":826},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.3.4Actions related to transmission of RRCSystemInfoRequest message","paragraph_zero_based":827},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of RRCSystemInfoRequest message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":828},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is triggered to request the required SI message(s) other than positioning:","paragraph_zero_based":829},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the requested-SI-List to indicate the SI message(s) that the UE requires to operate within the cell, and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting;","paragraph_zero_based":830},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the procedure is triggered to request the required SI message(s) for positioning:","paragraph_zero_based":831},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the requestedPosSI-List to indicate the SI message(s) that the UE upper layers require for positioning operations, and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting.","paragraph_zero_based":832},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall submit the RRCSystemInfoRequest message to lower layers for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":833},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.3.5Acquisition of SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in RRC_CONNECTED","paragraph_zero_based":834},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":835},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED with an active BWP not configured with common search space with the field searchSpaceOtherSystemInformation and the UE has not stored a valid version of a SIB or posSIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1, or","paragraph_zero_based":836},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED and acting as a L2 U2N Remote UE and the UE has not stored a valid version of a SIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required SIB(s) in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":837},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the si-SchedulingInfo or posSI-SchedulingInfo in the stored SIB1, contain at least one required SIB or requested posSIB:","paragraph_zero_based":838},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if onDemandSIB-Request is configured and timer T350 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":839}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1e4f9688e53cef104e1aced583441f64808c6dc27ad00f8241a90540e0af50f8","24fc926eff8869a2440af6c5cc33c6bdd722d1bfaa22c06b8937bf3fca12895d","c0d6df8486a9c5db27866c6a798370db23e3e4cb8e45f0cba8415ac1913c7eb7","c1a290f94c31de1ce16dfe1535587d718e44439dff5fea7fe93f149291078b5d","ff603d46e01a0f9f7f3bbb1bc61d6da8dc8771bd793c952097319953e1c258ff","63da9a69c02ec65a5f79d8e3b3bab661e467139676a3ff647ac29d27eabfc9aa","afea7c1846feaf058ac5ca9f6b08a965763d8b1ff8719da0c9bdebb018c58a8f","56f90e7b5a4cda25471206f3082b481a1bf1d412fc83aa372678d94550471c71","1326511b0a6dd86dfe106f13a33614bf10367625eddfc539574b39e5016c6833","63789b0ce27d76e6868ea35ae25a53f3c2094118aafe2b324f6135925a211557","25c6bfb826b5bf2ae947bee5c4c9ed54e293ede1257d7dd46ae616e40a4b37f2","0ef116f0ed54694c530cc6c12b5f3862a577e4621a36421459549a093342cea7","69117a44b455805a53c8d86981136ce8576747209b8dcbda8b50734835658965","df51dbd4abe7b311b6c8e94ffeaf5454ddce3b87408c280bd6982ea564d9e60f","e82f514a2226cc30398b7b154abf6c4bca3ee79fc3e0c08bdbc287332c35b2ff","a550b8e6d4d3a354821955a9e51dee95635dbf4f78735cb701dc2b3119514ac6","f63ef4d51332b4d5bad3b3982275e053f0dbf3f8651504e0745994a4d0a039de","0258db0bacf5a1d01efa0d1416ed0b52a1aedf8f2fd4c8395ad55c9daf5af6c4","b6b8bf3aaf84f403bcf9c935894d901fae217ee4203723f1e382ee8d8eb77fc7","a6781fd40dda7c7d14d2ad9601328073cd27a87de1acbf0dada3facbbfee077d","2552430d81b3227ce9db0156dffd41cfb591443918f09c3f5224c1d7747a99fa","a2673e468e9f5754207084c0a8edf939a1fb4a41fae50f3e4b7da05a26ad7db3","b17050287e8648c124b13f2f617a60fb51a84513e466c5b195e8e407df