{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in nr-NS-PmaxList within frequencyBandListSUL;","paragraph_zero_based":1080},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>if the additionalPmax is present in the same entry of the selected additionalSpectrumEmission within nr-NS-PmaxList:","paragraph_zero_based":1081},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"8>apply the additionalPmax;","paragraph_zero_based":1082},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1083},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"8>apply the p-Max;","paragraph_zero_based":1084},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1085},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>apply the p-Max;","paragraph_zero_based":1086},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1087},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>apply the p-Max;","paragraph_zero_based":1088},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, and T331 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":1089},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions as specified in 5.7.8.1a;","paragraph_zero_based":1090},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.6Actions upon reception of SIB5","paragraph_zero_based":1091},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No UE requirements related to the contents of this SIB5 apply other than those specified elsewhere e.g. within procedures using the concerned system information, and/ or within the corresponding field descriptions.","paragraph_zero_based":1092},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.7Actions upon reception of SIB6","paragraph_zero_based":1093},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving the SIB6 the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1094},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>forward the received warningType, messageIdentifier and serialNumber to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":1095},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.8Actions upon reception of SIB7","paragraph_zero_based":1096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving the SIB7 the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if there is no current value for messageIdentifier and serialNumber for SIB7; or","paragraph_zero_based":1098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if either the received value of messageIdentifier or of serialNumber, or of both messageIdentifier and serialNumber are different from the current values of messageIdentifier and serialNumber for SIB7:","paragraph_zero_based":1099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>use the received values of messageIdentifier and serialNumber for SIB7 as the current values of messageIdentifier and serialNumber for SIB7;","paragraph_zero_based":1100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard any previously buffered warningMessageSegment;","paragraph_zero_based":1101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if all segments of a warning message have been received:","paragraph_zero_based":1102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>assemble the warning message from the received warningMessageSegment(s);","paragraph_zero_based":1103}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d36f658b7b363aab957888707a48ce62eef7aa0d126c5292d851f042bf00aba9","70ee9d9afe4d31b204c539f01e5e68168d3074d0cff19a448a7d75f99b4d581e","8b99c6cbf4a4ebdcbbeb5975bebc75e4c688cb5b29deb6df64c18ef18075360f","b74fdd543ebd1cd7e1daf4476d4d0999fb919e567c853eecdf65435be2702091","25ac24accc4bbae9fc0fa90a80241416471441eeebf24836cf96223ccc063f3a","218cd67750e1138e00acddf50273261b951