{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform IAB IP address addition/update as specified in 5.3.5.12a.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1776},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the conditionalReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":1777},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform conditional reconfiguration as specified in 5.3.5.13;","paragraph_zero_based":1778},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapsConfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":1779},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapsConfigNR is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1780},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1781},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1782},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1783},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":1784},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapNCSG-ConfigNR is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1785},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1786},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1787},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1788},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":1789},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1790},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of EUTRA target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1791},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1792},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of EUTRA target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1793},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the onDemandSIB-Request:","paragraph_zero_based":1794},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if onDemandSIB-Request is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1795},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to request SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in RRC_CONNECTED in accordance with clause 5.2.2.3.5;","paragraph_zero_based":1796},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1797},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to request SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in RRC_CONNECTED in accordance with clause 5.2.2.3.5;","paragraph_zero_based":1798},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T350, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":1799}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["eb7332ae3badfa8177cbed67ed67e504ab96202d6e5c8dd63f6a99aa6c52c106","bfef0dfe483ebb321f6580b5511da3befe096e643c4fb33a25f4e40689c17cea","bc4c564ff92566646cc9c34c52111d1fc3de3c89f47f21606ef776590b4072a4","e3b5f5b46dfc2e764b1f7c781c5f9c87facdac6e11a82825d4849aae2e95834e","1a861b631f9f8a7b77399fe37c00fffe281479dd92d7ec1419571cee671dc6d8","10c1ceabc565017eed6724cf825700ee3624431b17aca3711cddfee96eb53402","9c65f077103d20952ea777d71f50de34654f776108283b3ec5489dfc3ce0d7e6","0f427c692810f2685aa0160d9bb8f2b15072495ca3ad40e1d9676b40ab931a07","987c9e26ef0fef2bf68490621151dfcd015d28ac3d1c21e3b3bb43191c0f92a3","e78534b6cd51b32711d67f858391dd0b2d713dbe31e70ca50d528512d67c6933","cea40c0390d4c4a811ca5b9cc958f1a43a638aa10b721c94a5e94148c578e257","f98aa7143693ff232b0c4f375cce25a23a2dfe0ac581cb927b61623bd399b090","afa43d81d9a0439b2703ace9fe3bd034b455aa1eef38d74f70d733207c0a5414","3a44ab443894767c18b6a65dc0a9805fce1d905e825bdff3a738fde665af5ef6","2c5afef3a7c6a73977235be5598656ef0f6dc3775ee372c5ec437186299271ad","c98ba96e8c27f93530af6e334694eca0229b3b5cb8f33f64c84dcb3a2d5d79d7","8db907f11fd59f41c9a88234dd5c64041d7123b830a2b9ad012cd0bf090b63ec","6b29b723757b6543abdab1de44c729f39fb9197aff11235894fd1ac61ff50b80","32cb6509788f974a5c47157a61a607f2e20ca54b445b7078da1b903eca3b5922","b84d5417b073f23314b3c117029b31e85ebef18b7a7e9f7dda31211965828400","16f546c83b70d41df7f13bc1f5b8f45ecdf318ff57e395507fa4a499bbe733b3","3b83d388fe0975649a40e2a3b135d33e9b3e4763dc8a4a3711bf53986c071949","f108833ada79461088202ec610db0a3a704c01729754faad3807e77a6b058b63","f9152caca35d9c7bddb124b93f87fd0958d159102f16dd31c87b129ddda2c293"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1776,1799],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p1776"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR:","paragraph_zero_based":1800},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the sidelink dedicated configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.14;","paragraph_zero_based":1801},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0a:If the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR was received embedded within an E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration message, the UE does not build an NR RRCReconfigurationComplete message for the received sl-ConfigDedicatedNR.","paragraph_zero_based":1802},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-L2RelayUE-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":1803},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the L2 U2N or U2U Relay UE configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.15;","paragraph_zero_based":1804},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-L2RemoteUE-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":1805},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the L2 U2N or U2U Remote UE configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.16;","paragraph_zero_based":1806},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the dedicatedPagingDelivery:","paragraph_zero_based":1807},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the Paging message reception procedure as specified in 5.3.2.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-ConfigDedicatedEUTRA-Info:","paragraph_zero_based":1809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform related procedures for V2X sidelink communication in accordance with TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.10 and clause 5.5.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the ul-GapFR2-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":1811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the FR2 UL gap configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.13c;","paragraph_zero_based":1812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the musim-GapConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the MUSIM gap configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.9a;","paragraph_zero_based":1814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if idleInactiveReportAllowed is not included in the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":1815},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each application layer measurement configuration with configforRRC-IdleInactive set to true:","paragraph_zero_based":1816},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>forward the measConfigAppLayerId and inform upper layers about the release of the application layer measurement configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":1817},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>discard any application layer measurement reports which were not yet submitted to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":1818},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if stored, release the application layer measurement configuration in UE variables VarAppLayerIdleConfig and VarAppLayerPLMN-ListConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":1819},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to send application layer measurement report for the measConfigAppLayerId;","paragraph_zero_based":1820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the appLayerMeasConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the application layer measurement configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.13d;","paragraph_zero_based":1822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the ue-TxTEG-RequestUL-TDOA-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":1823}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ea82fc2c556d06c310a1c308e21760fffeb67513b3e1b002aabd85da48c214b5","36c54039f1b1ffcc5392d06183c83796ebdfe6d34355da34a32710cf9bc490e5","545162b14e2fb1bad93d1b1cd4a0607c8e7ea08ed72cee59f4e656b407c036ad","dbafb9c677b9442e0394e20818d94065f8706758e7342ff2644d3a295b102dfc","77770fb75d39995879dd625d81119c4f71ea81e7cbd01e0f87da97e4b843ed8f","5be4a0374bd7f75a893d8e00404caa39aa13851233a3c3dc99c7325504050c0f","2e82f615777a94dc8c77fc3f4fb7ea7305a0e9a07573e8cf6aeccaa3d2443967","f70190f563b0448cac5334f09d5ffa43887e615dbf72d1a4b7f591d7a8aef8c8","488abb347b13cbb5f412332f4d276a525828c0ce2d1031722298fc9c84e2792b","cb94308a074c503c37139399c7e080ac562ab472778593f62ed6438d9a4a2f06","21ca3bfe27cb4f06a2ae45923919883062e8747d20f81c1c1c186ca42b4d330d","ddd12cded5d1e0ad011e3b0fb3a636600648baf974e0b396bac0f771682680be","04620567c6a4bf94ae2bc8a1c8344c21d5c508fc4198f7c050c639635ef72df0","f2dc1b1b246414d81334b580aee697a7111e7cfd5f8778cf90f0b3a0a45de5d2","4c1a8c37158d7f26dcb52c2469b2dd0808f80b2cdac8533fa253b6f0ba627366","04361ae21a57b14ccc783568b75fcdc6c1cb3d1c31c6c2330e64befd84541877","640cee3259a66d5db40d0a45e93dd25683b5c601da4deb4c10ed2090abff48cb","e3112b28ded982780cd62f7644df92ec128ee0379e49b5d93db62e1201a77d02","75a4bc397950743106fd7bc52f270068ac3c5e0a802e00fbd2071d346397cad2","9bb1cc91557b5cb10a22ad7cac723a89b740b10d55742df0cc387f300e3b5672","1196f85aa25cdea2ef841084c0bf0969303b0b04d904eeb4da97b40aee44f3f4","19faf5de7339fd74e25b7f5c581d668c83adcbc523dfe925c4f7056ddc561775","3020ee3992c5a9a05c7744726d93af72ea65067d7962efd227fffa879ca087c7","0536e5638109dddba86d50dfcac38e208a8aea5a83f3028178e759415c2c54d2"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1800,1823],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p1800"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if ue-TxTEG-RequestUL-TDOA-Config is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1824},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the UE positioning assistance information procedure as specified in 5.7.14;","paragraph_zero_based":1825},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1826},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the configuration of UE positioning assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":1827},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the uav-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":1828},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>(re)configure the UAV parameters in accordance with the included uav-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":1829},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-IndirectPathAddChange:","paragraph_zero_based":1830},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the SL indirect path specific configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.17.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1831},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the n3c-IndirectPathAddChange:","paragraph_zero_based":1832},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform configuration procedure for the remote UE part of N3C indirect path as specified in 5.3.5.17.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1833},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the n3c-IndirectPathConfigRelay:","paragraph_zero_based":1834},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the configuration procedure for the relay UE part of N3C indirect path as specified in 5.3.5.17.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1835},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the ltm-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":1836},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the ltm-Config is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1837},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the LTM configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.18.1;","paragraph_zero_based":1838},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1839},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the LTM configuration release procedure as specified in clause 5.3.5.18.7;","paragraph_zero_based":1840},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the content of the RRCReconfigurationComplete message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1841},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the masterCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrent:","paragraph_zero_based":1842},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList for each MCG serving cell with UL;","paragraph_zero_based":1843},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include uplinkDirectCurrentBWP-SUL for each MCG serving cell configured with SUL carrier, if any, within the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList;","paragraph_zero_based":1844},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the masterCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":1845},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured intra-band uplink carrier aggregation in the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":1846},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the masterCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":1847}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2787fd45284238c19d4e026f35bd2d9f33c36416508e19e43a362ae53a863cd1","6937f58d8c5ca70f754383e83a525a10913486b84e80d2c2723f68afd8a9c203","99d8018e35a826faee53b10c2324a096be7bb3a4faf538dabc570286f3e71b5d","dd89568c7d342e56668750d3249206b3c71dbbea9830fb48642a45782d57971d","9f621219df4ef31bb7ba54a41c443ebcdc79188d7bf0f3f7bcf119757314c4cd","ae4b9f353a7f93457d5f2112b7ca67719c7af345c3d231538bdda9ae1a1a1965","06a38d0f1f3995e1d19888c56bbce2d43ad694a932937fefee7f3db8e74bdee0","51fedc4cf401a52ba9d96493a692f4fcb9852b9c7102fef78956825ed105b6e2","04cfe915eb6695a32d20cdef96698a0f692b28cffb4559e0d744d6b001eaf12b","91f865e80b06b5cce5fd08d6ab277227568967d1a2c34cba69042b22593b476b","4f9b76b8ea7efd3b2204e567b24068faadb841023748200404e429f563b709ee","b50c1bdede97b8748ef746f4bd18dba684dd36fefb28a47a5b052ba27712e426","89ebf3b8e88edfb3825ffc4168628947fc694b458251b416390d969fcb2c0afa","47afe20049bd7a3f305807af4d60ae21e7af293b2b67bf0402765c6993a5d1bd","10cfa56f667c6c244ecd2d2822ebf9a80d7e75681fb012e8db9ed46cf7288ad0","1bbb4d58ab793c29dc714a9d9f340525cf8a90bef0d82d6ffc0d33dce2841abc","1452b59c32e4d7b684f369e01bfba5bc8dab593f467b5292a4f2a5dee75774e9","0a0fbf7ce2f14e463b16969dda5d7afb3a683930b1f0058fcf8eeea3bac8783e","722d75bf4c6c996a04e57d5aff2934b705e0d7acc4017ac1f2f8f351241bbdde","426f6a9e4b01a8f7f28a089d8e9d6ea86ba2d724ddd21299fb565a51b1488af9","f5cbf17c5fae0d2845254ab9ea72a992873cdd3b31b222bb427f4a1faef411f9","da67757dc7e9995cef977df32c12fbf014de6410dc6ed1b6d0265466a23b36a9","0b2bdffd0bd709f1325bc4bf3a98388a69f7a245a2a4c39d8c0a75c7c3a968b2","459dc48bdab754b41b1d829183dbce20b2313d025f6fe47d370cad935f234099"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1824,1847],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p1824"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured intra-band uplink carrier aggregation in the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":1848},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the secondaryCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrent:","paragraph_zero_based":1849},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList for each SCG serving cell with UL;","paragraph_zero_based":1850},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include uplinkDirectCurrentBWP-SUL for each SCG serving cell configured with SUL carrier, if any, within the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList;","paragraph_zero_based":1851},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the secondaryCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":1852},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured intra-band uplink carrier aggregation in the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":1853},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the secondaryCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":1854},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured intra-band uplink carrier aggregation in the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":1855},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0b:The UE does not expect that the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier or reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier is received in both masterCellGroup and in secondaryCellGroup. Network only configures at most one of reportUplinkTxDirectCurrent, reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier or reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier in one RRC message.","paragraph_zero_based":1856},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig with mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup set to eutra-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":1857},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the eutra-SCG-Response the E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete message in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1858},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig with mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup set to nr-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":1859},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the nr-SCG-Response the SCG RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1860},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to conditional reconfiguration execution and the RRCReconfiguration message does not include the reconfigurationWithSync in the masterCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":1861},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include in the selectedCondRRCReconfig the condReconfigId for the selected cell of conditional reconfiguration execution;","paragraph_zero_based":1862},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if a new sk-Counter value has been selected due to the conditional reconfiguration execution for subsequent CPAC:","paragraph_zero_based":1863},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include selectedSK-Counter and set its value to the selected sk-Counter value;","paragraph_zero_based":1864},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to conditional reconfiguration execution and condExecutionCondPSCell is configured for the selected PSCell:","paragraph_zero_based":1865},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include in the selectedPSCellForCHO-WithSCG and set it to the information of the selected PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":1866},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig of an MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":1867},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has logged measurements available for NR and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarLogMeasReport; or","paragraph_zero_based":1868},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has logged measurements available for NR and if the current registered SNPN is included in snpn-ConfigIDList stored in the VarLogMeasReport:","paragraph_zero_based":1869},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the logMeasAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1870},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if Bluetooth measurement results are included in the logged measurements the UE has available for NR:","paragraph_zero_based":1871}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c95bda7a782f93951500d12f021825854ed6473d22723df7f879eb6ae8268f06","5964c249d16c2f0743c2845a0603737b91363ba5df2a91b1c233bad391da6418","30eeecd34d9c264b4c75b28b6e53d29419843d6c8ae08890fcafd3926baf0bcc","1b50b09e7f27a7f125623544892792b2964e7a3df714c0fcd77282bae1a3d03f","d5f6cf3f0eea89845094cdec0fd037c6267b39cd60e2cbc84981dd6120b07285","227ab36ad7e1a3ef28715151eaeb12c0b4cb09fd46942279119b8c755bb5934e","4cb20b24030f24fb9ac6af3b54dffa6a925fb9aedffc1afe42222c1e99f80608","a0ab0541d8ac60012c655a16f746b81cf4948d4935b9652215c29ee117c4c9eb","a8d9602e4a28be8590e73c27d265b59f7d50688fb20b9781b622efd6bcd39532","ae95fe362650d11218b26c3e9b1356fd26542a96d1c604d53d2e9f8d9422c321","9e2122666cdbf3f4e65bc740500d2caf5400c0b11bcee389ceeaec98aa84704e","557c45d88f9407031fde38d1581f80ad32f4897368e1ae35cbe358287395a8ea","c5d086331e9c2b8b093bad880618ecea9ed825b6bc3023a13c6f6ffe156730a1","921d925646e3e1a2c916bdb241a53011a8be7d1e2a9b989e680403098b31ea8d","75ff1f781714e83890225b71b13c3173eabb225ece3ecb18ce1f2788625e45b6","96601ce005b64faac2182ae9e7248886c92f18d12274ee8fc1a9ced23e286aaa","560bbc80b34cd54e10c695d56688248522c6eaf405ac6665a562d54af2980cd9","4235e868baf3f32d43b71cfb102745ec6d467420e9db4987784d9000ff93b278","f572d9709918259fe4c3b6572bef3b9aeecc9d10b8bf8df6026de505858cdccb","7db3a560b01543cdfd09fc635411bec94c8494795285db913a2f1f8e809aa469","ef4f3ce2fe57234d3101658c7388b8305fd67da1a0b34362acea11ce2b17d8f3","3b1c7ba69af53bbc87ceaa92b0c2f95127211b15b3e24e71cc036dc428e6f393","3482a8c12c590fdf49fcd23fd64dbcf2152e7fa7e3945fc13311279c9da8c576","fd360aa50ec05e73202056f47c8aa83d478dddaa2aba523923cffeb219e13fa1"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1848,1871],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p1848"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the logMeasAvailableBT in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1872},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if WLAN measurement results are included in the logged measurements the UE has available for NR:","paragraph_zero_based":1873},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the logMeasAvailableWLAN in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1874},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the sigLoggedMeasType in VarLogMeasReport is included; or","paragraph_zero_based":1875},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is capable of reporting availability of signalling based logged MDT for inter-RAT (i.e. LTE to NR), and if the sigLoggedMeasType in VarLogMeasReport of TS 36.331 [10] is included:","paragraph_zero_based":1876},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if T330 timer is running (associated to the logged measurement configuration for NR or for LTE):","paragraph_zero_based":1877},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sigLogMeasConfigAvailable to true in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1878},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1879},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the UE has logged measurements:","paragraph_zero_based":1880},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set sigLogMeasConfigAvailable to false in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1881},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has connection establishment failure or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport or VarConnEstFailReportList and if the RPLMN is equal to plmn-Identity stored in VarConnEstFailReport or in at least one of the entries of VarConnEstFailReportList; or","paragraph_zero_based":1882},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has connection establishment failure information or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport or VarConnEstFailReportList and if the registered SNPN identity is equal to snpn-identity stored in VarConnEstFailReport or any entry of VarConnEstFailReportList:","paragraph_zero_based":1883},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include connEstFailInfoAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1884},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has radio link failure or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":1885},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has radio link failure or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10] and if the UE is capable of cross-RAT RLF reporting and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10]; or","paragraph_zero_based":1886},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has radio link failure or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report and if the current registered SNPN is included in snpn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":1887},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include rlf-InfoAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE was configured with successHO-Config when connected to the source PCell; and","paragraph_zero_based":1889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the applied RRCReconfiguration is not due to a conditional reconfiguration execution upon cell selection performed while timer T311 was running, as defined in 5.3.7.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the actions for the successful handover report determination as specified in clause 5.7.10.6, upon successfully completing the Random Access procedure triggered for the reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig of the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":1891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has successful handover information available in VarSuccessHO-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarSuccessHO-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":1892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has successful handover information available in VarSuccessHO-Report and if the current registered SNPN is included in snpn-IdentityList stored in the VarSuccessHO-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":1893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include successHO-InfoAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE supports logging the successful PSCell change or addition information, release successPSCell-Config configured by the source PCell, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":1895}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["cbdb7fdd43d41a080bc8316abc5bb0f5fef2d6fd01e150a303aa1d0c015a552e","f2a2fa3bb306ee7c1ce908a6ec3570f7f30ad5e43b374e71ae37b9b1102d415c","f98a943413ac58e44566b8be17bec8a3446461dfe46fa44fa9242da0ec85b6f4","3ba34049324e7ec797e6098c607b6839f34e1472e9db5bc4e86e59b4724d6382","f23cfb357cec0c2431f5aa3d37629b40c812b430431d68be948b70b4aa1617b9","5595226c04206253b48f32c5cdb33e5ac4042eb10609cbfd1ad5f1e6f1729698","fb817590bfa5dd9d51da4884cd905250055510be2374478174b6791a0a3a9f75","5fffb0f74099fd0d579e3a5c07e241307af3e50677b1bf692a0fb0bffb996919","01751fa35071e7e4e5175d48f1bbd42edcc56fbe530cf2defc417fc074d08d37","988b871829057fd2583b3e441ef096d810eb5d1302e294213238a2c1cb830bcc","40ef0d139255b4a1f90e155fd62b477ebcabde76084d3312d0d1aa0f96fa5a47","9e29b73cceec619d1fb77066154d50d8c2987d9ec09a50cfd968098268653115","92b568da6af899401d45e10b998dbfe50e686b58a3a350cd786800f42e5b7d5c","931593a56f50c1de8b8a85853566f7816de60a23a48def5c4e90239dea103014","91ccfcfbcaec01d0f85f3d81a5b6e2e10e6804efd7a5410220d1eef006e4c433","7af340a67cc6ad65d441fc89a34444f24b83e6e613727d70a73dfdd06db4c45d","c96a925013271fcdf82d0b22c50672dc4019be7e48f21366239e792fe1a3f523","380d3a32bf92bfadac56fc7b3abc37a9df91b05411780de9efb74c256ceb5d44","7c9d31ebfdc1cde6013ef2b45b0c67cade8d8182f376cfdfdb49e6697682445b","6e02b462ea19ad15d01eb0005b60f6b7da430c084ec537b82f4e194d1a2abdf8","60288e3ebee16cf6752f8c4604dee81770d48eac5a29b0b68ae01952f79791bd","a88c1287daafa1e0f9936cc8d2552dcd8aee22312965a53afb6ba751259148e0","d7d41af3fbf8cfc15c4cd2f633683f36f783b078788c8f24e217119cc1583ae7","e1d660de8280581125210aa6cf696e9e2bf950a2fd895849030c41d34e6c939f"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1872,1895],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p1872"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has successful PSCell change or addition information available in VarSuccessPSCell-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarSuccessPSCell-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":1896},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has successful PSCell change or addition information available in VarSuccessPSCell-Report and if the current registered SNPN is included in snpn-IdentityList stored in the VarSuccessPSCell-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":1897},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include successPSCell-InfoAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1898},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received via SRB1, but not within mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup or E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration or E-UTRA RRCConnectionResume:","paragraph_zero_based":1899},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is configured to provide the measurement gap requirement information of NR target bands:","paragraph_zero_based":1900},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapsConfigNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":1901},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the NeedForGapsInfoNR information is changed compared to last time the UE reported this information; or","paragraph_zero_based":1902},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForInterruptionConfigNR and set it to enabled; or","paragraph_zero_based":1903},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the needForInterruptionConfigNR is enabled and the NeedForInterruptionInfoNR information is changed compared to last time the UE reported this information:","paragraph_zero_based":1904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the NeedForGapsInfoNR and set the contents as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include intraFreq-needForGap and set the gap requirement information of intra-frequency measurement for each NR serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":1906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if requestedTargetBandFilterNR is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>for each supported NR band that is also included in requestedTargetBandFilterNR, include an entry in interFreq-needForGap and set the gap requirement information for that band;","paragraph_zero_based":1908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>include an entry in interFreq-needForGap and set the corresponding gap requirement information for each supported NR band;","paragraph_zero_based":1910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the needForInterruptionConfigNR is enabled:","paragraph_zero_based":1911},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include the needForInterruptionInfoNR and set the contents as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>include intraFreq-needForInterruption with the same number of entries, and listed in the same order, as in intraFreq-needForGap;","paragraph_zero_based":1913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7> for each entry in intraFreq-needForInterruption, include interruptionIndication and set the interruption requirement information if the corresponding entry in intraFreq-needForGap is set to no-gap;","paragraph_zero_based":1914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>include interFreq-needForInterruption with the same number of entries, and listed in the same order, as in interFreq-needForGap;","paragraph_zero_based":1915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7> for each entry in interFreq-needForInterruption, include interruptionIndication and set the interruption requirement information if the corresponding entry in interFreq-needForGap is set to no-gap;","paragraph_zero_based":1916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands:","paragraph_zero_based":1917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":1918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the needForGapNCSG-InfoNR information is changed compared to last time the UE reported this information:","paragraph_zero_based":1919}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7e010abe95278c32ee351a514ca069a5b87dbd8e037c31b1c1c869ed305c19fa","e6057b7f25b3a30c19dc2175128f37e8ff61b461907b6d4026aef0bd12e4df25","dd9edaf5aac829bea0f6657ba98b384dfef92b5a439b4cc16b0efdfaaaec6451","29785b8bca76ecb2111a55052e4e16c1e6e86bd99a0679ca5a861a623239bd71","6d6c17e670b7a480d922b663c6243ac9394756898e73dbb81f2fb600956ba562","053ab89c1906613f3f4d46766b0ea9d912452f8e3130459ea3481f2a99041502","fe4c7affd58d2ea182913f515bacc909a499d6a4d2095d891db3822f75980680","d5731b14867bb52b9fb3acc6ab4ab486946d95e4ce73ae1cd28099ef49379c0f","9264e13a9d4f06f89fcd536ec6980419836ae874b689bd42108d2ecf743d15a5","dfc5937228a52fb0de06379f4c053765bac40b7920cf2d56d6bc34f9f9dde9f6","b440bfa8be157656d54330b4357872f76dc1f52104af0cf7195aefc368fc2fc7","a8636e244221be38032d18a22a791b82c2241beec63129db3f24b7605dc98764","ad562a195abc14b8f008d72f594b785a9c8c5a1daef36f14477607bf14366514","1df561afa2a337fc869f774f16a65b8c55845aea3cbf2157449dc4a0d5759ec3","bf85132d95e043c42d7391c5d5a1fe09b7674911b30f572fbab264bf6ba78354","9d3a680f5126058827f09e4c7145891d898fcad8bc078c3f5beb719914d99b36","27a8bb117ea2843d63054847dfa61773b3a53b36ad31890bc5c02701e553c0e3","8743b71c4eff8b49df93854790c95c9a09603be8e3dd7056b6403cd64a0cb028","b4a243f54546d1e15a672677f50b8a721072b5717594cfd4f27377e0cd6bc8c4","86b2b72bad6fb3f018a8d0017856743e39abd50d75a945bbf943ea3ed2c569a2","bd14d09c7dccc5caf0845e47810e6118b54da5a3fde8e701dde7ae2e63544e6b","63308f2c2003761ad6fd20a7e5c2bd52e27db3ff6c5caf2b4fc3ae9a0327f3a6","05db6937f903775f947bd1df2b06551b7c6b43971f94c1ff0e71c679e9174703","45a798cd5c65619ed0e29f70f8c0a0ce5149d3218a312a49ed2f8216634927ed"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1896,1919],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p1896"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the NeedForGapNCSG-InfoNR and set the contents as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include intraFreq-needForNCSG and set the gap and NCSG requirement information of intra-frequency measurement for each NR serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":1921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-NR is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>for each supported NR band included in requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-NR, include an entry in interFreq-needForNCSG and set the NCSG requirement information for that band;","paragraph_zero_based":1923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>include an entry for each supported NR band in interFreq-needForNCSG and set the corresponding NCSG requirement information;","paragraph_zero_based":1925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of EUTRA target bands:","paragraph_zero_based":1926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA; or","paragraph_zero_based":1927},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the needForGapNCSG-InfoEUTRA information is changed compared to last time the UE reported this information:","paragraph_zero_based":1928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the NeedForGapNCSG-InfoEUTRA and set the contents as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-EUTRA is configured, for each supported E-UTRA band included in requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-EUTRA, include an entry in needForNCSG-EUTRA and set the NCSG requirement information for that band; otherwise, include an entry for each supported E-UTRA band in needForNCSG-EUTRA and set the corresponding NCSG requirement information;","paragraph_zero_based":1930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has flight path information available:","paragraph_zero_based":1931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE had not previously provided a flight path information since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":1932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if at least one waypoint was not previously provided; or","paragraph_zero_based":1933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if at least one upcoming waypoint that was previously provided is being removed; or","paragraph_zero_based":1934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if flightPathUpdateDistanceThr is configured and for at least one waypoint, the 3D distance between the previously provided location and the new location is more than or equal to the distance threshold configured by flightPathUpdateDistanceThr; or","paragraph_zero_based":1935},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> if flightPathUpdateTimeThr is configured and for at least one waypoint, the timestamp was not previously provided but is now available, or the time between the previously provided timestamp and the new timestamp, if available, is more than or equal to the time threshold configured by flightPathUpdateTimeThr:","paragraph_zero_based":1936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include flightPathInfoAvailable;","paragraph_zero_based":1937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0c:If neither flightPathUpdateDistanceThr nor flightPathUpdateTimeThr is configured, it is up to UE implementation whether to include flightPathInfoAvailable when updated flight path information is available.","paragraph_zero_based":1938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is configured with E-UTRA nr-SecondaryCellGroupConfig (UE in (NG)EN-DC):","paragraph_zero_based":1939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received via E-UTRA SRB1 as specified in TS 36.331 [10]; or","paragraph_zero_based":1940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received via E-UTRA RRC message RRCConnectionReconfiguration within MobilityFromNRCommand (handover from NR standalone to (NG)EN-DC);","paragraph_zero_based":1941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution for CPC which is configured via conditionalReconfiguration contained in nr-SecondaryCellGroupConfig specified in TS 36.331 [10]:","paragraph_zero_based":1942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete message via the E-UTRA MCG embedded in E-UTRA RRC message ULInformationTransferMRDC as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.6.2a.","paragraph_zero_based":1943}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["880266453170a56a4eaf0c02c5b08809d543acf3637ff134430d77c1fec7c9fc","0972bc1d4dc0536e99d88f609edf14f70d405c282ad29bb9bf7251b28bbcb063","a0f94a7a9cb5e7d99fadb5c9c3dae59687f1ef082fbbdd43528b06df87ce23d2","5c33a33081afe78b5dd06656e9a6373a83086b6617d5b1f831ccde5dfab1c421","fd5dc685f6aa8f985e4da1e1117e173413f6b0fcac28b0c260775d64802ea734","58589943dc30e24c17603a0f0747021e68e05c67dd3a8fbc1f13f55d0d05dcd7","fad3cad0ca5379c813e7ab7c23525ef21f4fa8be8821fc70423339fa21afc73a","80cf32a8d3eac34f94323bd9c73d83241db726ad6047445d3e71066fb6486199","3f4741aa2c958fe8546d16fc2f36d8510a6c8682d16f15766f47bea00140e40a","7854b83f6d377ff57a37df81a9ac1f179edcb857261d346dc751a1b2c5abcee2","a2d7357f1e05861f05301d01b8e337a8925541118cd1decafdca510944bd0c84","a496feaf7fb80ce021a418733ff18a9c58621355a617886abecf040231206818","fb78a7cd671b5d700e2b2564c6bddfbabe729a6d86a58457e5948816c44546a5","8e8c5f33bf28e9935169acd61aa2fa7fb4e4351991f5239092cec36f8474c766","a99223f047571450cde5b9a27b981bfd4a277b37df512f326295da2644cd546e","4e1762512aaffd891752a4d63fbc79a914b684a701617e747130943456a15a7a","b9f5c6e153de4393330a366dd5f321a5737e94bea6d8df99f8b8e704ed0ca726","3e314b8a37de1a4b0f88f90f0b85f157d953994b626a0cee7233f00c58dbe267","3656a92e0212c0587fcbaf8bdd8952f85b2729359128bde0172733513e3d09b7","66e45dae6f79727e9b0b4c0e5a7e3ac542dc675e1742139e951055c1d925e84f","36b6044066fba96b18894899fb179602e66992ff2ff96df594e56295576fff22","8b84c062472350ec2f40997e47d6965f0a8a9a40a040122c016d16fbef960552","a4386dd588a61fe943fd5285e9ea94f9a1d678b218c84c62a03adca24eb05518","42406a08ee36a8b76fa8a9d546193815130236ab26deff00c00cda62dfccee8f"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1920,1943],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p1920"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the RRCReconfiguration message was included in E-UTRA RRCConnectionResume message:","paragraph_zero_based":1944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete message via E-UTRA embedded in E-UTRA RRC message RRCConnectionResumeComplete as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.3.4a;","paragraph_zero_based":1945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete via E-UTRA embedded in E-UTRA RRC message RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.5.3/5.3.5.4/5.4.2.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the scg-State is not included in the E-UTRA message (RRCConnectionReconfiguration or RRCConnectionResume) containing the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":1948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform SCG activation as specified in 5.3.5.13a;","paragraph_zero_based":1949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":1950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate the Random Access procedure on the PSCell, as specified in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":1951},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else if the SCG was deactivated before the reception of the E-UTRA RRC message containing the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":1952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if bfd-and-RLM was not configured to true before the reception of the E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration or RRCConnectionResume message containing the RRCReconfiguration message or if lower layers indicate that a Random Access procedure is needed for SCG activation:","paragraph_zero_based":1953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>initiate the Random Access procedure on the SpCell, as specified in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":1954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":1955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":1956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform SCG deactivation as specified in 5.3.5.13b;","paragraph_zero_based":1958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":1959},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received within nr-SecondaryCellGroupConfig in RRCConnectionReconfiguration message received via SRB3 within DLInformationTransferMRDC:","paragraph_zero_based":1960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete via E-UTRA embedded in E-UTRA RRC message RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.5.3/5.3.5.4;","paragraph_zero_based":1961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the scg-State is not included in the RRCConnectionReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":1962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":1963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate the Random Access procedure on the SpCell, as specified in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":1964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":1965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform SCG deactivation as specified in 5.3.5.13b;","paragraph_zero_based":1967}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["442235efb4f95e73db2f029a17a44e07fc2284175015d52cc87e12f9f61faf78","2c51cc3977933bf7ab3a3b53234833190f595f560e544cc5372e6d52f014c6aa","36c145a111b0b9c18aae14dfd901ff59d1fb2c6fec782c89c7f5d519bf70544b","3e44e2a01daf81ddce6cb2c853c92c0483b3b2d38f4ba4c9e94e693a9c30b8a8","6c7af215cc5e14bbb2ecb6dc9e5a212e68a3e11c69b199968f3b18f186a9be7d","f217115fbdcf454ca1193b2d7e6fd408babfd7147eced89182a66fd1d1ad9b0d","553398ffd268f155c86346e16749e3362766d1a2a13ba186582c2a71162a159c","8277a86e490ce3333fd4d5aabffaaf65e52d5ac1651ca396af11d98e7277e0f5","a20a756f0e869cd56aff4ad203a2a24cca2bce4019f3501f3e51cf1e6a7b4268","94bc5128ee72ab6446796b8352ddd51e5115966d1e1799143f63a9e4e4ca2d12","b9fd26fc57973c6f31e89bbedde7407fd98600d10b156bc4b27d756eb5354dc5","3de6b67425e21fc2473b8c0c5029a0d73a79fdc042ca18638c38aa28188d026a","7bac5bec388cea3228352dcc889779bdc974d7c39d214d7c12a364b82054ae68","3c3c493a0d59546c11c82bf0ea2a23f32c06f99a5b7220665191f832718a4e91","b6498918ad5018fd738007fc913792fb458c10665e799c577599aec39485a50b","7701ca69e68dea0ce38ced99bfa8a30b75858e03e368cf29014161db1db92f10","66d1070e392bb903e00890af7f07fe694a2183b60732978a0487ebf1465ba745","93513da603b84eb1fae43a357d95d40addfe2af6f97b62ab9837dec7fa7d1d7e","80f61625b91bc357cdf54e37dd4a9f029720f2c4e92540c846c50e859768b64c","3d559ead5d0ae181fc3456728ddf085f69425577ace4a7916657a2005706b25f","9525fc9b89e252c32fb55c60326197bd5552b032f7e6f4d81412817c81cb2f38","59671c6f6564ef043bdd1c491cf25bb51df63d470126ef971e814b2bac845b48","340668e082586f6b3bce4d1f90c2ec4354998efe121879572a151916289468a0","d446f5a4dfb2c1dc6c8efededc953da37149d6978f469a81e0be9f096246fd56"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1944,1967],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p1944"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":1968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The order the UE sends the RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete message and performs the Random Access procedure towards the SCG is left to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":1969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (RRCReconfiguration was received via SRB3) but not within DLInformationTransferMRDC:","paragraph_zero_based":1970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete message via SRB3 to lower layers for transmission using the new configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":1971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:In (NG)EN-DC and NR-DC, in the case RRCReconfiguration is received via SRB1 or within DLInformationTransferMRDC via SRB3, the random access is triggered by RRC layer itself as there is not necessarily other UL transmission. In the case RRCReconfiguration is received via SRB3 but not within DLInformationTransferMRDC, the random access is triggered by the MAC layer due to arrival of RRCReconfigurationComplete.","paragraph_zero_based":1972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the RRCReconfiguration message was received via SRB1 within the nr-SCG within mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup (UE in NR-DC, mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup was received in RRCReconfiguration or RRCResume via SRB1):","paragraph_zero_based":1973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution for CPC which is configured via conditionalReconfiguration contained in nr-SCG within mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup; or","paragraph_zero_based":1974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration is applied due to an LTM cell switch execution:","paragraph_zero_based":1975},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete message via the NR MCG embedded in NR RRC message ULInformationTransferMRDC as specified in clause 5.7.2a.3.","paragraph_zero_based":1976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the scg-State is not included in the RRCReconfiguration or RRCResume message containing the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":1977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform SCG activation as specified in 5.3.5.13a;","paragraph_zero_based":1978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig in nr-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":1979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the RRCReconfiguration message is not applied due to an LTM cell switch execution for which lower layer indicate to skip the Random Access procedure:","paragraph_zero_based":1980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate the Random Access procedure on the PSCell, as specified in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":1981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE was configured with successPSCell-Config when connected to the source PSCell (for PSCell change) or to the PCell (for PSCell addition or change):","paragraph_zero_based":1982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>perform the actions for the successful PSCell change or addition report determination as specified in clause 5.7.10.7, upon successfully completing the Random Access procedure triggered for the reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig of the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":1983},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the SCG was deactivated before the reception of the NR RRC message containing the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":1984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if bfd-and-RLM was not configured to true before the reception of the RRCReconfiguration or RRCResume message containing the RRCReconfiguration message; or","paragraph_zero_based":1985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if lower layers indicate that a Random Access procedure is needed for SCG activation:","paragraph_zero_based":1986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate the Random Access procedure on the PSCell, as specified in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":1987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":1988},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":1989},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else","paragraph_zero_based":1990},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform SCG deactivation as specified in 5.3.5.13b;","paragraph_zero_based":1991}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fcd15f8a54d19b6660df19833e4b8a0ad5a41c308571c60e6154dd735e569f2f","7263c85ea4f9395f0c1413414a90f0cb44eae48606d71b5b2c77d80f2d30c710","5b1ca3a36b2b236186ff81d76438761962f11a55c001d66da087c44ec2b9027d","4607a1f3358a280e8e8c3332444332b52483962cecfb5f2f66dc04318a2dbde9","f1647dab3efde0cb4fa4fe068db043e5a194a4b2782de63904d92558fabf68c6","5c7a74a402a8edd899786feffaac935979943ad55ce611ad9d156c79d9ef8a40","e93810ee17540d0d5c0ba93df5595fe8cb278980f46f3a3efe5a3eeb5e419a9e","92b9ee80b8bd41f93c1e4ee5afed2fcf2ddd0e05cbf268dd0d3dec4c2c7935fa","52a42263c36b4c8f2a85ccd78c6d7ed3deff46992f70847863203afdde13ee75","77e3ce9a9d2853180708567350ad0fa5eba09285e7aed5dfd519636d9b0b005d","5a46dba371d67d994d33ad130e8137d08779c99ebdb2bd37a74f8e068695af54","74b18f985458136cd8389cfbb2d2a92197228751d0f6443da581de4ffeffd5a0","9cf06ea3b207c56fd97f5035801d49cabb9c863f378838a9e33e5e816ba0f8f9","bde22aadfaadb25fedf92fc15fba7b835d52edeaecd15e1c84beddfb1cb620eb","4f871874a59df2de8cb74b0b19cb374fe21fc3d34729a036141d9673b122f30a","e7c1e9ad522def1e6d7c46a848b2f0fd8a0e46ce95f2349903aee1a032bda9ce","e2e7d1bd63a36c40c976a4e998b32b8c5e874ece0969ef11387e2d1f8ebce4fd","2c778328fdf57e42de74aa55e5bb41d0a0b47e933cd802f929b8f20a1fade4fc","ac5d161a09c57bcedd6ed6d99101b64d8ca5b0c559a274163f5ab45377f95bc9","0cef5f8e26e9522d331db95fa70836b107bfdd4755ecc6ada73b00289a6acfd3","d2afc4a3aab477ed1ec88113c67abe1fd3951450b1c2f572873bdfdcaa07372f","193e1ec1f755416b4e0be87595d5682d83a15bac22f374c98ae95dfc15fc189e","e977cbc69420b2af91a3a8b324273f30880dbf63d46918f2f5d292a14f7d0b6f","8af7603fa7e2285c2d75075ad0e60ad803aefdf8e43895702f99e47dad5d0a1a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1968,1991],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p1968"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":1992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2a:The order in which the UE sends the RRCReconfigurationComplete message and performs the Random Access procedure towards the SCG is left to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":1993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the RRCReconfiguration message was received via SRB3 (UE in NR-DC):","paragraph_zero_based":1994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received within DLInformationTransferMRDC:","paragraph_zero_based":1995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received within the nr-SCG within mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup (NR SCG RRC Reconfiguration):","paragraph_zero_based":1996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the scg-State is not included in the RRCReconfiguration message containing the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":1997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig in nr-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":1998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>initiate the Random Access procedure on the PSCell, as specified in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":1999},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if the UE was configured with successPSCell-Config by the PCell or by the source PSCell:","paragraph_zero_based":2000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>perform the actions for the successful PSCell change report determination as specified in clause 5.7.10.7, upon successfully completing the Random Access procedure triggered for the reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig of the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":2001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":2003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>perform SCG deactivation as specified in 5.3.5.13b;","paragraph_zero_based":2005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":2006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2007},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the RRCReconfiguration does not include the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2008},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the scg-State:","paragraph_zero_based":2009},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>perform SCG deactivation as specified in 5.3.5.13b;","paragraph_zero_based":2010},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete message via SRB1 to lower layers for transmission using the new configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2011},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2012},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig for the SCG; and","paragraph_zero_based":2013},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE was configured with successPSCell-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":2014},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the actions for the successful PSCell change report determination as specified in clause 5.7.10.7, upon successfully completing the Random Access procedure triggered for the reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig of the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":2015}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["43cae5b3ed174b401e3e907477d757482dcc8905d1c639a00ccc1d5b561c04ae","8c767fe8ed62e079baf1ce550be54cf1702103c5e3170fb553c1e3a40fc8cca8","4159ab5e4a057b08485dee1b99ca5ed3b649b08c603b72cb71747f363eae2a22","57a3a6b35a9389db1587931100c3172104f4195400823fba47dfcdf854616102","0debcc6e787a3d0b34132e6a8ea940b872576cf453afbb9f6135fe3de5217c69","a89a50b38de7065c9f20729a6a4e8653b31670eb8093a1b1641a60980ce3bb25","af9c6d20d50653c17524e67edf4e901f2373e3ca9d8a64933d2fca6089fdac57","8ff5afc22383400ff0746c27ff8c93cd6ea90de6cd623363ca3e2183cba4d2dc","1242b7240237e0725802ddd213615510f06af4ef601a4bfe229ac52c051e9ee2","c487e820bb7a53f2c10a2924ea19575650a8773dd0773464b490c7ba228112f1","51dc06067d66f78033dd23f28e93ec4c1c409ef754c3f1e23b83eb5eba50f5ff","60cb87e1fca963c7585298cf85437feefceb19892b96daffae6d7133d0f0c299","e9cf1194a7baa9a4948b5425a3b384be98a82e80869b771a13972e97929a1c35","0e78fe6fbbd0f1d59cb049730d9b29c0c46432ada124e80c8b659aaaef98bfe1","4f9d5b9804b124e23e86ca5c44a9c9cc05c608ec99f1fca9f9a6e72987fd7c9c","fc20bc9526902308f96ade943b0a2110dbf7d7f1dd63fb428541cd4b7772a1a3","c3eb45352b3dc23ac26ea23755da649b427f63fe99c498ca13dc67af9bfc1a01","44c63aaacc4b01069f454965e87a2e8591a3d637f3d60beebd5651c0bd31b65a","7e023dca11dd07e65c95cee990cbf7a3edf12b7207230c1c33b8017a0655680e","f095f7615da01b8e1eb2940b19f5dfcdcaad01215c4cfa987670f75b757aed55","363e64cfbd2b32c902f3ca190e533fbbe0cf09846827fbb1962e5c31d9b14434","07e51d4d53938f976428e69eee673e512bfed9a92a2777b6c1ff150f9a9fbbae","aa35ddd65a4b043c1213fedbdfcf48af24194f7b2322cb970c60163f8e67a088","edfc2e357d0db2c839a09da9023c83371c8bebeedec26cdd8622a088c2fedb4c"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1992,2015],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p1992"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has successful PSCell change or addition information available in VarSuccessPSCell-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarSuccessPSCell-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":2016},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has successful PSCell change or addition information available in VarSuccessPSCell-Report and if the current registered SNPN is included in snpn-IdentityList stored in the VarSuccessPSCell-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":2017},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include successPSCell-InfoAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":2018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete message via SRB3 to lower layers for transmission using the new configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else (RRCReconfiguration was received via SRB1):","paragraph_zero_based":2020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is in NR-DC and;","paragraph_zero_based":2021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration does not include the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the scg-State:","paragraph_zero_based":2023},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform SCG deactivation as specified in 5.3.5.13b;","paragraph_zero_based":2024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform SCG activation without SN message as specified in 5.3.5.13b1;","paragraph_zero_based":2026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":2027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if ta-Report or ta-ReportATG is configured with value enabled and the UE supports TA reporting:","paragraph_zero_based":2028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate TA report initiation to lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":2029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete message via SRB1 to lower layers for transmission using the new configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if this is the first RRCReconfiguration message after successful completion of the RRC re-establishment procedure:","paragraph_zero_based":2031},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>resume SRB2, SRB4, DRBs, multicast MRB, and BH RLC channels for IAB-MT, and Uu Relay RLC channels for L2 U2N Relay UE, that are suspended;","paragraph_zero_based":2032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-IndirectPathAddChange was included in RRCReconfiguration message and if SRB1 is configured as split SRB and pdcp-Duplication is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>when successfully sending RRCReconfigurationComplete message via SL indirect path (i.e., PC5 RLC acknowledgement is received from target L2 U2N Relay UE):","paragraph_zero_based":2034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T421;","paragraph_zero_based":2035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an MCG or SCG and when MAC of an NR cell group successfully completes a Random Access procedure triggered above; or,","paragraph_zero_based":2036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-PathSwitchConfig was included in reconfigurationWithSync included in spCellConfig of an MCG, and when successfully sending RRCReconfigurationComplete message (i.e., PC5 RLC acknowledgement is received from target L2 U2N Relay UE); or,","paragraph_zero_based":2037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if rach-LessHO was included in reconfigurationWithSync included in spCellConfig of an MCG, and upon indication from lower layers that the RACH-less handover has been successfully completed; or,","paragraph_zero_based":2038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an MCG or SCG and the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to an LTM cell switch execution and upon an indication from lower layer that the LTM cell switch execution has been successfully completed:","paragraph_zero_based":2039}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["dc98956dfc6d345c59eafef76b56c5b79bdbb1c0a1425aa02f970f775b67a892","f86ab3fee08484e19c1e827ed02283055e18513ae29330013b16e5c8cf3455d3","24b19cbfd7c3ae1d11af35c9f9b02bce0f6ae2af29ed88d2fb7e8c54f240d53a","51aad122bbdf7d068cb42b6a1c1249f278fc50e87a63612d71ebc5f10a3e9728","f31524d6ad781acdfd45620496d9e0add1ced5c28027bafb7524019c42e10b0a","d5e7bad7eada84f9b58d26232f97aabbbce85a5b67740d728854ea5214889c42","2d229669beb954e4b63315e4ca191225f9791f84d9a2668acfcad63fe8065409","ccb2babbc571acba6ca97884f83b50443107eb0bf5248ad20331a71591d6a201","6ea5594373c5e86790184e0d213cdf2405d6a9c02b905c67ca84f074f7890ef1","8416bd0a88b296855e822e97135dc546c4c12c293a5825e12c62c1b108862614","7df588518d27bfb1fdfebbbdd2020fd8aa7bc78f39ad952b2175ba957adb20c6","c0e9350d09cc7f3c47a851c65fea986db4cf50efe58a2231700ef4f9b14cf39b","cd0e61b4f4f84acc27b7b714f1f4113ec44e27f3833bf2e90fbedff54e2cf1b5","b1b93e15f4d6e6c31f444241a25c4d6adbdd7f8deaa5c58f768b9c0189641542","c7b0abc9aaa384bb7b29e69859c3a632821457720399a4bfa1d7804e4a7b2b03","504b5e21e4a8b114d922d5a54c54b0755d2a0f78549de485be1817f326ca7bbc","7f1d59ef71d1526e069838bf05167e684fb4521daeb2000c3a4c23169d0056b3","0a2a96e1447bf482c98eccd86575fba391751d16cc4fc8299376a159efd005df","37c3dba9de4d14b8dad1f0d90dbc4768bf0ca29ae7586cbe0d27ae6a076f2330","10a6a41247ca0f2b46c1dee6b5529395d7a581eed73eef95fa2065e3ef4f39e9","13feeb82514fdc2374255d75b2ee10d262ed46df4dcaf96423615d96493520e8","e4f0aabe569194a30f4081e0435c3e7c43cc56698a486b29702eb713f970d3a3","037734fae8314750c5e4813cb700f731d381b562c857876ff67e87483babde94","6696b7db0516768ac7a60fa13c3d61a7e4cdacc8623d8e7ac4dda7babcbe8ba7"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2016,2039],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p2016"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T304 for that cell group if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if sl-PathSwitchConfig was included in reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":2041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T420;","paragraph_zero_based":2042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release all radio resources, including release of the RLC entities and the MAC configuration at the source side;","paragraph_zero_based":2043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reset MAC used in the source cell;","paragraph_zero_based":2044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if rach-LessHO was included in reconfigurationWithSync and cg-NTN-RACH-Less-Configuration was configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the uplink grant configured for RACH-less handover in cg-NTN-RACH-Less-Configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2b:PDCP and SDAP configured by the source prior to the path switch that are reconfigured and re-used by target when delta signalling is used, are not released as part of this procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":2047},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T310 for source SpCell if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the parts of the CSI reporting configuration, the scheduling request configuration and the sounding RS configuration that do not require the UE to know the SFN of the respective target SpCell, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":2049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the parts of the measurement and the radio resource configuration that require the UE to know the SFN of the respective target SpCell (e.g. measurement gaps, periodic CQI reporting, scheduling request configuration, sounding RS configuration), if any, upon acquiring the SFN of that target SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each DRB configured as DAPS bearer, request uplink data switching to the PDCP entity, as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":2051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":2052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if T390 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":2053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T390 for all access categories;","paragraph_zero_based":2054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4.","paragraph_zero_based":2055},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if T350 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":2056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T350;","paragraph_zero_based":2057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if RRCReconfiguration does not include dedicatedSIB1-Delivery and","paragraph_zero_based":2058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the active downlink BWP, which is indicated by the firstActiveDownlinkBWP-Id for the target SpCell of the MCG, has a common search space configured by searchSpaceSIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":2059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the SIB1, which is scheduled as specified in TS 38.213 [13], of the target SpCell of the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":2060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>upon acquiring SIB1, perform the actions specified in clause 5.2.2.4.2;","paragraph_zero_based":2061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution and the subsequentCondReconfig is included in the entry in VarConditionalReconfig containing the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":2062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each condReconfigId included in condExecutionCondToAddModList within subsequentCondReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2063}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["869891a04dd7e893a8d1d471d6b0e471e8021c9eb96a6d9148647b7ef20becbe","3be49e96d1878dad3ca5f006ba5cbce5fb4a8f2f3c82279bdadc567063a62897","741f8c24e593bca6c7a69b8a7ad6ff15235ff303840129c2e8199fda8d4e1653","c9b95ab98322609714abf735f21a0c78de704fb1c0c349f696280dcc32063d46","90c9aed00b8909f0f897e1a5b88d63c8ab65b0961f185c7925bcd341f602145c","e00fad889d6653311746b6d29529b055f6fd9c2f5420e52831d02f76ae051ef3","19630683dd443fe20753b541734b9b70d91ed60bfef693b08b0cdcbe72fc21e7","a62b1b182359087872d2ed253aa9256ac2df0f13f744cbb742531ef7dbc4572c","189fdbbd0ab78765ad40d88bdc2bb37e3ce4ba0c67d2a7627dffa7391e6772e4","4fb26824707832a929c8e102b48d738f3f25777519718af8b60a2d5c56c7ea80","f49f3f5c0be42cc161ce1ec63ce84ada95cf64ff31480467b894cf46db03ef8c","4fef441e9b7a1c809978f37c8e8caa307150e6b957a51f4188ac9f5a4fc419ea","8373bee9ae81d81bfb37c03edd715971616c37bee6a701e05f7adeda16fc7430","5469fcc6e0c0d5f1d3954d672b3acdb2f1d92c6ad9b6c70ae2bbbae17be0df35","9a0136e960cc7e3dd6ee07c68f54a10e489cdad8d47a78d5026df522a088336d","1cdfc1f8c71efd44aadef4ab83e95b2b7aa789b336d8a7709079a4a10f9461f3","45c37359bb7d0fc1edf6053f540beb28234ba8eadb82ceddf48d3d73086aa241","3f8b2f40c308d83ce3e1e249d8ea85ae56d87f2f83863ad6b11d373bbd6ea08c","e725b2ffc0b2546280e4819d311cb573fbb82e59138370d8943e5b8bb5fdfe2d","0d629b1989b3b97841c9e27f8cd395bab6cd168263c5cc9589e63951ec168e28","be1ad4a1a599b14df359c42bf3dc4e70f8b6a6a7776a8a09d6122897f4ac2747","2d92911da565b11406065eaaadca69f862f67d7bc31b0b061e167e867274f5e4","872c2c96dda1253568513a59acaf7ad6fe436f1a82a2c79e94b2d5a3bcdca5c4","db5fbdc1e77955cd1868f5e819202f47f6e433044c28a76ee3b51d6462d93628"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2040,2063],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p2040"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>replace within VarConditionalReconfig the entry in condExecutionCond or condExecutionCondSCG with the matching condReconfigId value;","paragraph_zero_based":2064},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an MCG; or","paragraph_zero_based":2065},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an SCG and the CPA, CPC, or subsequent CPAC was configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2066},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove all the entries in the condReconfigList within the MCG and the SCG VarConditionalReconfig except for the entries in which subsequentCondReconfig is present, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":2067},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove all the entries within VarConditionalReconfiguration as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.5.9.6, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":2068},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each measId of the MCG measConfig, if configured, and for each measId of the SCG measConfig, if configured, if the associated reportConfig has a reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2069},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the reportConfigId is not associated with any measId indicated by the condExecutionCond or the condExecutionCondSCG in an entry of condReconfigList in VarConditionalReconfig in which subsequentCondReconfig is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2070},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>remove the entry with the matching reportConfigId from the reportConfigList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":2071},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the associated measObjectId is only associated to a reportConfig with reportType set to condTriggerConfig; and","paragraph_zero_based":2072},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the measObjectId is not associated with any measId indicated by the condExecutionCond or the condExecutionCondSCG in an entry of condReconfigList in VarConditionalReconfig in which subsequentCondReconfig is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2073},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>remove the entry with the matching measObjectId from the measObjectList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":2074},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the entry with the matching measId from the measIdList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":2075},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in masterCellGroup or secondaryCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":2076},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE initiated transmission of a UEAssistanceInformation message for the corresponding cell group during the last 1 second, and the UE is still configured to provide the concerned UE assistance information for the corresponding cell group; or","paragraph_zero_based":2077},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution or an LTM cell switch procedure, and the UE is configured to provide UE assistance information for the corresponding cell group, and the UE has initiated transmission of a UEAssistanceInformation message for the corresponding cell group since it was configured to do so in accordance with 5.7.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":2078},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of a UEAssistanceInformation message for the corresponding cell group in accordance with clause 5.7.4.3 to provide the concerned UE assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":2079},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start or restart the prohibit timer (if exists) or the leave without response timer for the MUSIM associated with the concerned UE assistance information with the timer value set to the value in corresponding configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2080},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SIB12 is provided by the target PCell, and the UE initiated transmission of a SidelinkUEInformationNR message indicating a change of NR sidelink communication/discovery related parameters relevant in target PCell (i.e. change of sl-RxInterestedFreqList or sl-TxResourceReqList) during the last 1 second preceding reception of the RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig of an MCG; or","paragraph_zero_based":2081},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution and the UE is capable of NR sidelink communication/discovery and SIB12 is provided by the target PCell, and the UE has initiated transmission of a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since it was configured to do so in accordance with 5.8.3.2:","paragraph_zero_based":2082},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":2083},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in masterCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":2084},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if configured with application layer measurements and if application layer measurement report container has been received from upper layers for which the successful transmission of the message or at least one segment of the message has not been confirmed by lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":2085},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>re-submit the MeasurementReportAppLayer message or all segments of the MeasurementReportAppLayer message to lower layers for transmission via SRB4;","paragraph_zero_based":2086},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in masterCellGroup and the target cell provides SIB21:","paragraph_zero_based":2087}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a922b4794c53c19d6abde5ea1cc6d0ac3e413a6dfce8d0a68a464eda37b30d8f","c6fd39745f492955e8d993fffb2ba0fbb3d3e8fc3d2f304ae14984fce247a08c","7fe6c1d5c319f8e7526d30a0b8ca0afbdaaf9326f4388310e8eea88e82128459","441083ee2f1c45ca54f96721f3c412d7bd5b76541090a3123eac44930cac74c2","1b8f94b76877080c920f0d0b1a911c7d88dbf00812d56832c72c22ff360fdc2b","0f3d710ccd3105ca1e07500e0acceb9c77fe19aa64c7228f9d17799c0f6f1f42","a5bfb2351a510ce64a4759aa26a542745c776108d8565cc24ff568beafe21c77","ae3734d0af7bbeff3ef2babbbd4148fc60e8ff64116672396a5c843e0d1731fe","0db3cc4fdca48f92015b27ba296fef3e5d50d1fb0d1d14ff22960afb18bb0c04","7360f5b776ee200234a9184658ab65df309c23b88ee025fa99f88e1c17c8763d","3f331ce95f5bc0539f4d1402893a00b1ed66ca9cae42a16283ce5aef4527857d","b127da485b5327cf36a688d6b4270cf63519035ce1d9a23f4ccb859bf13a845b","f5bb651dea1d177034a9f62a281feb2ce574fb03749161ebc98ab8dbf823182a","ae03ee0607e0d4d101dabd150f5dcefa32c41985ab316d220e9337deeb814f79","3db018c170c2eba7726a8fb44e784201ad9e73e98044e52cb7adf7a73391c110","001f9c1f57de0dc7ad9cbe8fdee02ebb3e071757dc7c57d4b7d50501a8ffab51","628a564e1e4d254be05035bec48e6c8000c9f365045ed195d08958d0d3cfbcfa","bb65da32e23700240fc1bde37ea542133c983907658f9421bad314dca36c89ba","0027e4c511268d370c0601e1b82bf2cf2f0c8c9b50af4611fb0537978b1e2394","0cf6215aa8ce102bd5fe0e7f14088b9391457cb7a2c46a65c93e6deb74235577","8a0f6b8d1396a639a704c907f171efaf47b8622c65da1285747b5a36d11c6192","fb953aa4f521a80d7ebad6357c5c1546f2c12492502ea89224ed734f34ce9852","6e877349c86809811c66b8a588b8cd5d53451f4e51ce10810fec7982f2dac2dc","5788f55849bb7a097d8ae65bb60d3745e1a8d5cb7d01f80d107be83856c8b427"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2064,2087],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p2064"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE initiated transmission of an MBSInterestIndication message during the last 1 second preceding reception of this RRCReconfiguration message; or","paragraph_zero_based":2088},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution, and the UE has initiated transmission of an MBSInterestIndication message after having received this RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":2089},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of an MBSInterestIndication message in accordance with clause 5.9.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2090},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>the procedure ends.","paragraph_zero_based":2091},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:The UE is only required to acquire broadcasted SIB1 if the UE can acquire it without disrupting unicast or MBS multicast data reception, i.e. the broadcast and unicast/MBS multicast beams are quasi co-located.","paragraph_zero_based":2092},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4: The UE sets the content of UEAssistanceInformation according to latest configuration (i.e. the configuration after applying the RRCReconfiguration message) and latest UE preference. The UE may include more than the concerned UE assistance information within the UEAssistanceInformation according to 5.7.4.2. Therefore, the content of UEAssistanceInformation message might not be the same as the content of the previous UEAssistanceInformation message.","paragraph_zero_based":2093},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.4Secondary cell group release","paragraph_zero_based":2094},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2095},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>as a result of SCG release triggered by E-UTRA (i.e. (NG)EN-DC case) or NR (i.e. NR-DC case):","paragraph_zero_based":2096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset SCG MAC, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each RLC bearer that is part of the SCG configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":2098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform RLC bearer release procedure as specified in 5.3.5.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":2099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each BH RLC channel that is part of the SCG configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":2100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform BH RLC channel release procedure as specified in 5.3.5.5.10;","paragraph_zero_based":2101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the SCG configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for all application layer measurement configurations that are part of the SCG configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":2103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>inform upper layers about the release of the application layer measurement configurations;","paragraph_zero_based":2104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>discard any application layer measurement reports which were not yet submitted to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":2105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove all the entries within the SCG VarConditionalReconfig, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":2106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SCG release was triggered by NR (i.e. NR-DC case):","paragraph_zero_based":2107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove all the entries in the condReconfigList within the MCG VarConditionalReconfig for which the RRCReconfiguration within condRRCReconfig does not include the masterCellGroup with reconfigurationWithSync and for which subsequentCondReconfig is not present, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":2108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (i.e. EN-DC case):","paragraph_zero_based":2109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform VarConditionalReconfiguration CPC removal as specified in TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.5.9.7;","paragraph_zero_based":2110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T310 for the corresponding SpCell, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2111}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["afbc1e293d4100d47ada1bdc730c0d75b0ecdef4c34908aa1e097ccd89e2d4dc","3913068b38373f8d34c320e6e50f659b041d6cd5c418160f36a2877374dbc60b","817d66f8a3f0441e3478b84e45faaf49f4ad4c16fbc6420f602f277b1cfedb5e","c454c023b611b1144c568f970e38a4c06c244bf6741ddc391b0b3691f846d6cb","2ec9c81781a8e4ef745c8bb9125ff825efbf0118f2c96995ca7d907c1f24d250","4753418f9936a5e982a0e4b225e82038a8c5c916b1543e443f1791e43f3e8696","8f9e784ee8709992c5de4420e5e8f92948e5f61c2ec0305be84ac6281688d254","47c534e63839a3777a33765aa9e7e675c3b7e999a7a76ab427e1abaff1b2c35d","8f6b8761975cb3f8b6fad9435784266514108705ed57e3ebc6b79875064a40f3","a0bbd074ebb8c7d2932d177360b96e70ab09a5edd05917dc72522758b7eac2ec","7e024d42a9d310c6e7d244b09ceae7d8fc7d32b51fc93ea171ddcbe4783d91e6","0e396d0849f1664e4f370701142846b48b8c0f5325cfed7aa42700acbd8f6546","028d0021c3721fc5da1f3a870fcc7313eee443953f19516a933b9706839183ee","5d923fcb93e598f0f6679041c366ebdb0034c15433ed5c067f9b0ea0198aa08b","60f2583c0674d8fa6a0c08793b2af42ca3fda65dbeae0dc82216360730f73f78","952a6d3c5415d8af8635e08ec38416d1d28c8a56b59e523a7dad54ace776cbb7","0f0f7e8e74658a14fe7920ea2f91655bc4b8d4a2c17182b9f0f8eebaabcd9d46","b676f49f66a0b5ecd3e82728100c8dbe9cad3b7dfb7c10bd4963501f4ea6dc36","a57a130d0ce957ebed19a9031bbd97f83d327a9d3576b42a49a9fde5cf27a03b","ce4785dddc6358000f3368c2c6a25e2ffa76e9e1c1642a3dc25d6b697c486bee","2205cbb131d449271eef6f82c5075f28953fbd4f89ccc6ca1a80e5173d7eb067","ca9679609e5965644a3498b1f5be4ae0bc069940237f0e9f7b53547e924efb5e","a0b096e84255163bf4bd0a3509b407dc8a9936f5643c15ec466fcb747c58a960","9a819d0cf1edd5c9a254dcae7c16309dd4e8d1f1f57ec4b0f65f02957618517b"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2088,2111],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p2088"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T312 for the corresponding SpCell, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T304 for the corresponding SpCell, if running.","paragraph_zero_based":2113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:Release of cell group means only release of the lower layer configuration of the cell group but the RadioBearerConfig may not be released.","paragraph_zero_based":2114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5Cell Group configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.1General","paragraph_zero_based":2116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network configures the UE with Master Cell Group (MCG), and zero or one Secondary Cell Group (SCG). In (NG)EN-DC, the MCG is configured as specified in TS 36.331 [10], and for NE-DC, the SCG is configured as specified in TS 36.331 [10]. The network provides the configuration parameters for a cell group in the CellGroupConfig IE.","paragraph_zero_based":2117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE performs the following actions based on a received CellGroupConfig IE:","paragraph_zero_based":2118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the spCellConfig with reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":2119},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform Reconfiguration with sync according to 5.3.5.5.2;","paragraph_zero_based":2120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>resume all suspended radio bearers except the SRBs for the source cell group, and resume SCG transmission for all radio bearers, and resume BH RLC channels and resume SCG transmission for BH RLC channels for IAB-MT, if suspended;","paragraph_zero_based":2121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:If the SCG is deactivated, resuming SCG transmission for all radio bearers does not imply that PDCP PDUs can be transmitted or received on SCG RLC bearers.","paragraph_zero_based":2122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the rlc-BearerToReleaseList or rlc-BearerToReleaseListExt:","paragraph_zero_based":2123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform RLC bearer release as specified in 5.3.5.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":2124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the rlc-BearerToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the RLC bearer addition/modification as specified in 5.3.5.5.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the mac-CellGroupConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure the MAC entity of this cell group as specified in 5.3.5.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":2128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the sCellToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform SCell release as specified in 5.3.5.5.8;","paragraph_zero_based":2130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the spCellConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure the SpCell as specified in 5.3.5.5.7;","paragraph_zero_based":2132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the sCellToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform SCell addition/modification as specified in 5.3.5.5.9;","paragraph_zero_based":2134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the bh-RLC-ChannelToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2135}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a722d4c9aa6add9c75dc2cda31c892dc57f1ff270e4034c38576ab8ca9fd4d1b","e1208492bf46bee8567b3d095e46609dd3af18c286b18f0af1e15c9dc13d1149","d26260c40f7c0250ce897184434140b21f8bf41f5053ff79512189280d5fc1ef","55d647ac2aa02da15c48fef7f1a9a797a09b1302796885aea6d1e0631d3bebf3","34bc5e252b8eece1716f1bf9a28679a3f8bc0af820d18f8d8a2b5c8de2cedf8b","984d71d23061123db66ce2669f4388ebcb8e460815cb5ffa07147ae730cd4cd0","5889594ca164af5c873427cfe5c00b5aab3b166e7916e461dc8c052be1a5c1ca","1a1549c736e02a32466834b532014793e98c4795524562327aa6b6a1d34f703c","a9f0b8eb5401a7440e83c4cb1da323f4d9f48795daaf74bca43aea5432f7fc81","dc7720aab0b3d95c98f9672cc4dd4b93c7a7bfb406b7fec4e3143816b7f320df","4a582b0813b94f062d6cb7c3e7b343e52b96ccb990d5dc1dd912db1f73d24944","70720dfba07382b6ad9819210b2fc9f33e9b9013014aba15cf723ce7709260e9","87bfce0ed9466e8e72bcd1e5836ba5a1f984dfb1b0e918f400c25c6cc2c869b9","3c9223a6adb35ffb283d31a06a99cb93feecfaa35a3b588cc3e33e6efb7214c2","e9338d4f9742370ef5ed90510b46dd02435f28f6cbb755f83af97dec5c3ad0ea","7deaed5e82090d8e3f07b07c48af56c422122b9b5558ad37163cb8ae99673b56","c1dfb2599f92754d6092be8d1ab3cc3706bfa237e42d0c61e1a235241711748b","adbc88f04bec15d8e6ad55ec82ae0365b3f20dca4effcd8be1a3cc5c17ef24ce","684bfda093bad5b6ad7b1e86b920892d56eda99f4e60a9c30d59111335ec1a37","d733c3eb0e341017989e5eceb53d8d153adea3eccd7630c32c417171f3803e1a","dd5a5a07c06cd233d92f21290657f3a7f5ded0332b1d9ae1d1bbdd561d957dc2","c55667d054c64619fc0e62cf75d64e9cd3aa8bcdaff6da5f2b313f3549e34803","efc6ec3b075c6c38d734536dda5472895badc2465b646ff50768b31232fba82b","0bbc6fe20f88f3c7a9962176efcaecadb4120bca8323a3962346c4c6ea4889a0"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2112,2135],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p2112"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform BH RLC channel release as specified in 5.3.5.5.10;","paragraph_zero_based":2136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the bh-RLC-ChannelToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the BH RLC channel addition/modification as specified in 5.3.5.5.11;","paragraph_zero_based":2138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the uu-RelayRLC-ChannelToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform Uu Relay RLC channel release as specified in 5.3.5.5.12;","paragraph_zero_based":2140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the uu-RelayRLC-ChannelToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the Uu Relay RLC channel addition/modification as specified in 5.3.5.5.13;","paragraph_zero_based":2142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the ncr-FwdConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2143},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the NCR-Fwd configuration as specified in 5.3.5.5.14;","paragraph_zero_based":2144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the autonomousDenialParameters:","paragraph_zero_based":2145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider itself to be allowed to deny any transmission in a particular UL slot if during the number of slots indicated by autonomousDenialValidity, preceding and including this particular slot, it autonomously denied fewer UL slots than indicated by autonomousDenialSlots within the same cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:When counting the number of denied UL slots, the UE sums up the denied UL slots across all serving cells within the same cell group. When counting the number of slots indicated by autonomousDenialValidity, the UE sums up the UL slots across all serving cells within the same cell group.","paragraph_zero_based":2147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:When multiple denied UL slots across all serving cells partially or fully overlap in the time domain, the number of denied UL slots across all serving cells is counted as one denied UL slot, based on the longest slot.","paragraph_zero_based":2148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.2Reconfiguration with sync","paragraph_zero_based":2149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall perform the following actions to execute a reconfiguration with sync.","paragraph_zero_based":2150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the AS security is not activated, perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11 with the release cause 'other' upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":2151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T430 if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if no DAPS bearer is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T310 for the corresponding SpCell, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if this procedure is executed for the MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":2155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if timer T316 is running;","paragraph_zero_based":2156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T316;","paragraph_zero_based":2157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE supports RLF-Report for fast MCG recovery procedure:","paragraph_zero_based":2158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the elapsedTimeT316 in the VarRLF-Report to the value of the elapsed time of the timer T316;","paragraph_zero_based":2159}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["74b057354f3a8b00311dafe31d890c87cd25f1ae8795e8eb7926aa78a295762a","1f77b7f7049fe87b035a8eaf1a753405b2d4534319cf44dfd4af68cdace2887a","59ed8bea41c18d48af02b05b52bb4705a1a4d2d0c8fbaaa15947ea1effa9c5fb","bf02b85b8f7455224b61fa0e31c656a66e18c819f0d0279ca024659e3fcffb4a","283f8e5cad5bda3af6239b0f774fab4069426a1ad478687b6b53df07befaec41","ffc166cc13c7c1776bb587b30537eda52ced4627a4effeb643f9d6bf3fe6de98","fb3b8beaf269d869dd475cad078e3ed99ecfd8bec2f2f262377111d1d6d6e6c4","6b12e3869538490553678caf959779cefbd9773be26e43bad5e5b2527c21693b","35a8f3136cdd51270fe31dc8c874228ad427878c05a117f4b542f654e01faae2","636da266595b22c314587fd6997f45836eaba5354113696121642347e78a6e2a","706ebe01e1a9145e195a9bb3dc7f41250b33c6a7199dbedc3f14296ce07a32dd","82b4789f7019a825ce633ea1786e0a74326e5061eeacb2bb038dfe950e25f391","38c44af9ff1298ac091a8d44a7e32327c90f3ad79baf8fd209625f12d11d1442","5b8d72f5a175b84c59d1065baae9743234823f1afce6cabe45ea3c77e155954a","b82b779a5a0be19cc8e923810d4e632febd3ba9c87676d9811e476f0029e8828","9d61ebac257d0ebcccc0ed27339b5581801c3c912f4f4502f22ddec781da8fe6","79c84fca96aa2f87f467cf0595ccf457cfb61259ec443719ff3537d7125663f1","1f4c0d3c8627602ad6f24c3823b4b5fa6ff322dad9edd2ebea6142a838010b85","46378ca4a52704cd9111ec23c76e955aacad4e8a475c511cb479988b561379c2","84fb530ed1d213178d03bdce1e0105a27b5294f4c5308b479e14de34f4db9a4a","04fcf61d0d6d097f63f414ada77c363e7656e4f3d8612d55d919be6d288f7862","cbae3e1333074f4dd7788ccedb5adddfa526716dc6a7949f2ed3cbf8f465c4ec","91168f6b150f7ad69aa22d210f6a40069a1a9b473aa3e3450ab8b9066e186aeb","7e57402a76d15c9fb276e46de326c996eaf4826bbeae872c3b28ad480f52f882"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2136,2159],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p2136"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the pSCellId to the global cell identity of the PSCell, if available, otherwise to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>clear the information included in VarRLF-Report, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":2162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>resume MCG transmission, if suspended.","paragraph_zero_based":2163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T312 for the corresponding SpCell, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-PathSwitchConfig is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the target L2 U2N Relay UE to be the one indicated by the targetRelayUE-Identity in the sl-PathSwitchConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":2166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start timer T420 for the corresponding target L2 U2N Relay UE with the timer value set to t420, as included in the sl-PathSwitchConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":2167},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the value of the newUE-Identity as the C-RNTI;","paragraph_zero_based":2168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate to upper layer (to trigger the PC5 unicast link establishment) with the target L2 U2N Relay UE indicated by the targetRelayUE-Identity;","paragraph_zero_based":2169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the default configuration of SL-RLC1 as defined in 9.2.4 for SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else (sl-PathSwitchConfig is not included):","paragraph_zero_based":2171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if this procedure is executed for the MCG or if this procedure is executed for an SCG not indicated as deactivated in the E-UTRA or NR RRC message in which the RRCReconfiguration message is embedded:","paragraph_zero_based":2172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T304 for the corresponding SpCell with the timer value set to t304, as included in the reconfigurationWithSync;","paragraph_zero_based":2173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the frequencyInfoDL is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the target SpCell to be one on the SSB frequency indicated by the frequencyInfoDL with a physical cell identity indicated by the physCellId;","paragraph_zero_based":2175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the target SpCell to be one on the SSB frequency of the source SpCell with a physical cell identity indicated by the physCellId;","paragraph_zero_based":2177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start synchronising to the DL of the target SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the specified BCCH configuration defined in 9.1.1.1 for the target SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>acquire the MIB of the target SpCell, which is scheduled as specified in TS 38.213 [13];","paragraph_zero_based":2180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if NTN-Config is configured for the target cell:","paragraph_zero_based":2181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T430 with the timer value set to ntn-UlSyncValidityDuration from the subframe indicated by epochTime, according to the target cell NTN-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The UE should perform the reconfiguration with sync as soon as possible following the reception of the RRC message triggering the reconfiguration with sync, which could be before confirming successful reception (HARQ and ARQ) of this message.","paragraph_zero_based":2183}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b2d5cfab9897d2272365d133e81c6cfb5e81ec644e0ea74ddb8cb7bbd28683f0","979a9f957fb2b195f51cc1112569c63edff4183d0f6e1a73369dc03c2d23d959","3e32233a0cd34c2e96cb04eb8586857c0c9ec9177eb11c6e516e59a9b71337b5","daf996457c0088ec4e53b8d443d678f1af4b1f9593e08e0ec4911a356b16f0a0","9c78a804cbb321f7fbe3761dcb5c781cb3c24f27c8278e14b1f9ebbc6530f467","8dc4446589c26918563937b852d0f160b99c1f86389303f644fc0a68ccb86734","01cbd23e340873ce0a552922eb8e32e5036c28e32592409a0da7c98a53cf6736","238ac915bdecff1995521fe6e06689e6c356e193013cef8e9f2589555b6c0a3d","90dc90d3d2a49928d6eb3a76eccd04bb69bfc8b3d20d05615bb83967d15f1ffc","6c95982e56f68194a5469bdf386988cc04128c2e95340d61ae9c797715f775cc","efa9e44d178fbfa4d437395dc7f1faa65a972609b43185b573e7b91518c17ead","97fe638b98bfcc045282bbda63015723e7a160a8199f0e55ed3232d50aae4943","a92967f22d75a9330fa81038154c58acc4343080231569e375c42d3dde1a92d6","4877d3d861eea385f3f7e90d313aa47dfc21266af2c7e5c2e83ca4bd74bfaa12","6f5cf1f5a84533558915be642e57895231db53b23954d5d0f041e579f84f91d1","a3632473e6c22ee0865d0d71e56c8265e2208b49cca0d13c12be87aeb190ab8b","0fefaa7ce3ba2ad0d5f841a8f415bed8e5d772b311745e79a4a6e3545a443606","419d1c210f7d35d53a832be2751fc219115f8282990efeee9447154e7376ca18","b9d62a3cb57444977d0172d047154817ee172efbab15182840e325fb66bf3219","8688c0b3137d9dafbde0fea92dcf99022e2a189c2f025d9b1b2e609cce8fea61","80739e798c91b14c1b79b4b39abf1f8ecefdd840a2f79042b3734d8333f13830","e00ae67ba07fd049d5687fe09836a8a20feea18a8fb2068601bdc50fef90acab","cd61568562341e7a0fd80cfd1075c4bd6a5058e9a36145d16c8110a048fec795","85b30ccb86d12ae615a873b7addb6c4a804753eaf1f5eeec628d1283a29f31f7"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2160,2183],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p2160"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:The UE may omit reading the MIB if the UE already has the required timing information, or the timing information is not needed for random access.","paragraph_zero_based":2184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2a:A UE with DAPS bearer does not monitor for system information updates in the source PCell.","paragraph_zero_based":2185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>If any DAPS bearer is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>create a MAC entity for the target cell group with the same configuration as the MAC entity for the source cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each DAPS bearer:","paragraph_zero_based":2188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>establish an RLC entity or entities for the target cell group, with the same configurations as for the source cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>establish the logical channel for the target cell group, with the same configurations as for the source cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2b:In order to understand if a DAPS bearer is configured, the UE needs to check the presence of the field daps-Config within the RadioBearerConfig IE received in radioBearerConfig or radioBearerConfig2.","paragraph_zero_based":2191},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":2192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>establish an RLC entity for the target cell group, with the same configurations as for the source cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>establish the logical channel for the target cell group, with the same configurations as for the source cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>suspend SRBs for the source cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:Void","paragraph_zero_based":2196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the value of the newUE-Identity as the C-RNTI in the target cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers for the target SpCell in accordance with the received spCellConfigCommon;","paragraph_zero_based":2198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers for the target SpCell in accordance with any additional fields, not covered in the previous, if included in the received reconfigurationWithSync.","paragraph_zero_based":2199},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reset the MAC entity of this cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the SCell(s) of this cell group, if configured, that are not included in the SCellToAddModList in the RRCReconfiguration message, to be in deactivated state;","paragraph_zero_based":2202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the value of the newUE-Identity as the C-RNTI for this cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers in accordance with the received spCellConfigCommon;","paragraph_zero_based":2204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if rach-LessHO is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure lower layers in accordance with rach-LessHO for the target SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers in accordance with any additional fields, not covered in the previous, if included in the received reconfigurationWithSync.","paragraph_zero_based":2207}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["08e782a98dbfbadd470f35fd3393242abb799f16c845e89bd0de5c3a59270726","7d60587ca34f2944f1010227046521267e3e87b3e52f05ecc53f4ef3c6b9431d","e503da9129334a2e48122f40606b29eeee8a9aad53b113d260a36760b56a678b","8fbcda64346e988d093d0c84919270ef8a5810137bec336e694daf304be5a7ee","46e64ce484112f17ecae1ba1ecd24c83c5f656346594e3200d1b58bb7403a315","e3e4d0f25246fd0f7876c57903996936be0ff024b2fbd48cafd11d8439c8264a","1c9de320c28acc5e8295644487de37c12d68d6c99301e6c75e2dd347b1165fd6","9e5711f456e67c2480e1f9febf9407ba9d474a8ef876fe7dd924c1da80fbd42c","f0dca4544618274de49127be76a00d607f90cbb35a84e9ed16add374968eddf5","8f9c14bb3cb2e28d487a0b0b910bf7aca81c9ca17887cbd0d01755a75d1d98f8","329e8b26e399e2350f237e62e02bcc8ddf639e10e188331419fd9c413a1847b7","b95202f7f9ffb65a114c16f5020905f9d21ef1092f7d701caff2caca6093ce98","9c3ade8bd3a0ca824c8ba9807b28891f6d3a977b18e7e23539d81a4b6446214e","b3dc630be7dd9581e3be59183d0caf81ee0526081687a32b8e2d5f72a242c33e","cce1641532822262b7cf0cf1af0320ab1294d31894e610d6d21f2763f41d38fe","8eed17558dedde9818d993601dc4636008b291b31c639eecf5a418434c97bb1c","4e01451d39cf5e3118ded31843772e4f393569e619f3b53852141e053b7fa0e4","aaa76f8cb340d8e34369c31a13ef2fc32c2bc092d6c8b820a757146150e0683c","84ebe591e472f78220df56522c9aec8cf2997aabec755cea8c34c64e32fd8e3d","0e0a805fac1e73540e7393c594d1c8042de906c42df34bc42373289bafe8213a","7a240511528ae5b9bea6dbf95efb9d7f6ab123d25e9c528a990fe1fff633a36f","d1e88b7c7dad42c513c8f77f30cfc7197e096086cd75bb89bdbfc955d5230db4","67867973c0b38b8a3d242e744f1e061425ff3a207eb84e0a38b5d03c3aa70ddc","2ba648396cdec83ac7c6b48ba2239da7d8613e142a5a1649d2fab6018d34fb0c"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2184,2207],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p2184"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE at the source side:","paragraph_zero_based":2208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate upper layer to trigger PC5 unicast link release.","paragraph_zero_based":2209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon L2 U2N Relay UE receiving reconfigurationWithSync, it either indicates to upper layers (to trigger PC5 unicast link release) or sends NotificationMessageSidelink message to the connected L2 U2N Remote UE(s) in accordance with 5.8.9.10.","paragraph_zero_based":2210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.3RLC bearer release","paragraph_zero_based":2211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each logicalChannelIdentity/LogicalChannelIdentityExt value included in the rlc-BearerToReleaseList/rlc-BearerToReleaseListExt that is part of the current UE configuration within the same cell group (LCH release); or","paragraph_zero_based":2213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each logicalChannelIdentity value that is to be released as the result of an SCG release according to 5.3.5.4:","paragraph_zero_based":2214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the RLC entity or entities as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3;","paragraph_zero_based":2215},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the corresponding logical channel.","paragraph_zero_based":2216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.4RLC bearer addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":2217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For each RLC-BearerConfig received in the rlc-BearerToAddModList IE the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE's current configuration contains an RLC bearer with the received logicalChannelIdentity/LogicalChannelIdentityExt within the same cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":2219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RLC bearer is associated with an DAPS bearer, or","paragraph_zero_based":2220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if any DAPS bearer is configured and the RLC bearer is associated with an SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":2221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the RLC entity or entities for the target cell group in accordance with the received rlc-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the logical channel for the target cell group in accordance with the received mac-LogicalChannelConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":2223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if reestablishRLC is received:","paragraph_zero_based":2225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>re-establish the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4];","paragraph_zero_based":2226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the RLC entity or entities in accordance with the received rlc-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the logical channel in accordance with the received mac-LogicalChannelConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":2228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if servedMBS-RadioBearer is received:","paragraph_zero_based":2229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>associate this logical channel with the PDCP entity identified by servedMBS-RadioBearer;","paragraph_zero_based":2230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:For DRB and SRB, the network does not re-associate an already configured logical channel with another radio bearer. Hence, servedRadioBearer is not present in this case. For MRB, the network does not re-associate an already configured logical channel with DRB or SRB or another MRB (i.e. MRB with another PDCP entity). Hence multicastRLC-BearerConfig is not present in this case. If a radio bearer is released and another is added with the same radio bearer identity, it is considered as a new (different) radio bearer. Hence, the network also releases the RLC bearer(s) associated with the released radio bearer.","paragraph_zero_based":2231}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["cb8990c79fccc6167b37bf4dcb856e1d036a96834ca0922a2bd5880095de5d0d","a4da23e1864c3a5eaca82e1b04fa0735882ffec39630d73451e284918d589eb4","6d9cd5817a306da8da0fe2a833ec57a7dfad4149a6e4065704f8d35359643853","e78bd7e924e0b5dfdc8ccb30e397cf72625db743a5e43520923461731b68b37c","a47e4c7bdb3e09b3ce271a1642a894597b3c3e49926e8b4808736170eac28658","721b77c6d2bb896aeb1223b7d44966facc22c433189f729f41aa61120f04bb85","a152bcd5ca4df211c83fa715b1dc0162cd416d6f20d9dd45886f39e7795a040d","fb162ef4fb7513d0fae6fd6af628e6af334839ef0c80361899d8b29db8a56372","3a2c807d95f693aedb8d332faedc7bc55740825f595286d6a7a10c8e4341f56c","b7cab5169b27dfa9eeccdf049f8933d720883956f3ed4b89de049ef651f81cef","555ed52cc1bc88343127d162edf903965ea0ff53520b942708aa0ac43671273f","093968ed5f0512308488b22d65b11f1f1765bb7951a4d7ac9969b65292abee53","3a7bef341bfb187b9589c81be3714326f52767318dade9f83a736d07a88be6a7","bcd2bd2b6b68224e0c489f5fa223374046e5646085d6fd8fef1437992cf25f69","99b3097d09123da1a2b8711a9cf80f729fe73a22c8b13fb98ae0fc849e49f812","6a6c4d6df7b1a78df92925f029bc6f33831e2e3766ab3c9a76ee61eea8a44cf8","490afdf3ceb7026ae036a2d6fe2e29f011e1a8bd9b548cf5a2f17139b9bbd841","0e110888816ff7baa82895912832086b89cff3599654a03d80e3db29cb67e001","c3c16c5645f3db0fe0aff110130e21e55a16d5fe1c6e5ac7d26d0e392d771f13","39650500413c70d26069c68b56cd2391bc3bcc7e400f982615a5865208bf642a","f456e8c668faa74b98a553ca733b68d1d9091d53259eae10782d23f11f9ac34c","454eaecd811c524cf2f65616395b2fccc40b9fbbc793c21ac5b7f792e02ba331","cb8e86ccaf6465bc135037de1476b0ae24ba12bee8306e749b59a08a73359c49","659e024f02b95afdd224fc775235f58f0c71bc9fe70cc4737ba627d92132dace"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2208,2231],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p2208"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:In DAPS handover, the UE may perform RLC entity re-establishment (if reestablishRLC is set) for an RLC bearer associated with a non-DAPS bearer when indication of successful completion of random access towards target cell is received from lower layers as specified in TS 38.321 [3].","paragraph_zero_based":2232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else (a logical channel with the given logicalChannelIdentity/LogicalChannelIdentityExt is not configured within the same cell group, including the case when full configuration option is used):","paragraph_zero_based":2233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the servedRadioBearer associates the logical channel with an SRB and rlc-Config is not included:","paragraph_zero_based":2234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>establish an RLC entity in accordance with the default configuration defined in 9.2 for the corresponding SRB;","paragraph_zero_based":2235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>establish an RLC entity in accordance with the received rlc-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the servedRadioBearer associates the logical channel with an SRB and if mac-LogicalChannelConfig is not included:","paragraph_zero_based":2238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure this MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance to the default configuration defined in 9.2 for the corresponding SRB;","paragraph_zero_based":2239},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure this MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance to the received mac-LogicalChannelConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":2241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>associate this logical channel with the PDCP entity identified by servedRadioBearer or servedMBS-RadioBearer.","paragraph_zero_based":2242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.5MAC entity configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if SCG MAC is not part of the current UE configuration (i.e. SCG establishment):","paragraph_zero_based":2245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>create an SCG MAC entity;","paragraph_zero_based":2246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if any DAPS bearer is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the MAC main configuration for the target cell group in accordance with the received mac-CellGroupConfig excluding tag-ToReleaseList and tag-ToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":2248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the MAC main configuration of the cell group in accordance with the received mac-CellGroupConfig excluding tag-ToReleaseList and tag-ToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":2250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received mac-CellGroupConfig includes the tag-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each TAG-Id value included in the tag-ToReleaseList that is part of the current UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":2252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the TAG indicated by TAG-Id;","paragraph_zero_based":2253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received mac-CellGroupConfig includes the tag-ToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each tag-Id value included in tag-ToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration (TAG addition):","paragraph_zero_based":2255}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordin