{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>add the TAG, corresponding to the tag-Id, in accordance with the received timeAlignmentTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":2256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each tag-Id value included in tag-ToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration (TAG modification):","paragraph_zero_based":2257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the TAG, corresponding to the tag-Id, in accordance with the received timeAlignmentTimer.","paragraph_zero_based":2258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.6RLF Timers & Constants configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received rlf-TimersAndConstants is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":2261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if any DAPS bearer is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use values for timers T301, T310, T311 and constants N310, N311 for the target cell group, as included in ue-TimersAndConstants received in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2263},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use values for timers T301, T310, T311 and constants N310, N311, as included in ue-TimersAndConstants received in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if any DAPS bearer is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the value of timers and constants for the target cell group in accordance with received rlf-TimersAndConstants;","paragraph_zero_based":2268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>(re-)configure the value of timers and constants in accordance with received rlf-TimersAndConstants;","paragraph_zero_based":2270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T310 for this cell group, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T312 for this cell group, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reset the counters N310 and N311.","paragraph_zero_based":2273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.7SpCell Configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE and is not configured with MP:","paragraph_zero_based":2276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SpCellConfig contains the rlf-TimersAndConstants which is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use value for timers T311 as received in rlf-TimersAndConstants;","paragraph_zero_based":2278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if rlf-TimersAndConstants is not configured for this cell group or SpCellConfig contains the rlf-TimersAndConstants which is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":2279}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6765e07627507b6e8d0ed5f6c3a2db4e18192ccaf30edf5105afda2e805af7bb","e58153b0c62a7495a65323740d5cfeae6bcbfc0d030488fead1256bdfef60f46","e3e05c1ce0e461802103296eabd05a55618b220e33592ed66a17afef6502103f","fa6e7f05ffab08d0e05a61ef6c98b82c990be745f3d5c22d64bd7fd9b761cd2a","927f5f1f0dd551c287bc9fd9409b290576d556bf5f9e4959494f5f932476bc82","95cd11d310e7f8feadc98a1a75d25e28c87588bbd0539d4