{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use value for timers T311, as included in ue-TimersAndConstants received in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else","paragraph_zero_based":2281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SpCellConfig contains the rlf-TimersAndConstants:","paragraph_zero_based":2282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the RLF timers and constants for this cell group as specified in 5.3.5.5.6;","paragraph_zero_based":2283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if rlf-TimersAndConstants is not configured for this cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":2284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if any DAPS bearer is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>use values for timers T301, T310, T311 and constants N310, N311 for the target cell group, as included in ue-TimersAndConstants received in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else","paragraph_zero_based":2287},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>use values for timers T301, T310, T311 and constants N310, N311, as included in ue-TimersAndConstants received in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SpCellConfig contains spCellConfigDedicated:","paragraph_zero_based":2289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the SpCell in accordance with the spCellConfigDedicated;","paragraph_zero_based":2290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the bandwidth part indicated in firstActiveUplinkBWP-Id, if included in the spCellConfigDedicated, to be the active uplink bandwidth part;","paragraph_zero_based":2291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the firstActiveDownlinkBWP-Id is included in the spCellConfigDedicated:","paragraph_zero_based":2292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the SpCellConfig is included in an RRCReconfiguration message contained in an NR or E-UTRA RRC message indicating that the SCG is deactivated:","paragraph_zero_based":2293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider the bandwidth part indicated in firstActiveDownlinkBWP-Id to be the bandwidth part for Radio Link Monitoring, Beam Failure Detection and measurements;","paragraph_zero_based":2294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2295},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider the bandwith part indicated in firstActiveDownlinkBWP-Id to be the active downlink bandwidth part;","paragraph_zero_based":2296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if any of the reference signal(s) that are used for radio link monitoring are reconfigured by the received spCellConfigDedicated:","paragraph_zero_based":2297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T310 for the corresponding SpCell, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T312 for the corresponding SpCell, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>reset the counters N310 and N311.","paragraph_zero_based":2300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the SpCellConfig contains the lowMobilityEvaluationConnected:","paragraph_zero_based":2301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>the UE may perform the evaluation of the low mobility criterion for this cell group as specified in 5.7.13.1;","paragraph_zero_based":2302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the SpCellConfig contains the goodServingCellEvaluationRLM:","paragraph_zero_based":2303}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9f7be96e78a8c6815c5c2a3ae190918