{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>the UE may perform the evaluation of the good serving cell quality criterion for this SpCell as specified in 5.7.13.2;","paragraph_zero_based":2304},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the SpCellConfig contains the goodServingCellEvaluationBFD:","paragraph_zero_based":2305},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>the UE may perform the evaluation of the good serving cell quality criterion for this serving cell as specified in 5.7.13.2;","paragraph_zero_based":2306},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.8SCell Release","paragraph_zero_based":2307},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the release is triggered by reception of the sCellToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sCellIndex value included in the sCellToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the current UE configuration includes an SCell with value sCellIndex:","paragraph_zero_based":2311},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the SCell.","paragraph_zero_based":2312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.9SCell Addition/Modification","paragraph_zero_based":2313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sCellIndex value included in the sCellToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration (SCell addition):","paragraph_zero_based":2315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>add the SCell, corresponding to the sCellIndex, in accordance with the sCellConfigCommon and sCellConfigDedicated;","paragraph_zero_based":2316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sCellState is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2317},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers to consider the SCell to be in activated state;","paragraph_zero_based":2318},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2319},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers to consider the SCell to be in deactivated state;","paragraph_zero_based":2320},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each measId included in the measIdList within VarMeasConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2321},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SCells are not applicable for the associated measurement; and","paragraph_zero_based":2322},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the concerned SCell is included in cellsTriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":2323},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the concerned SCell from cellsTriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":2324},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SCellConfig contains the goodServingCellEvaluationBFD:","paragraph_zero_based":2325},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>the UE may perform the evaluation of the good serving cell quality criterion for this serving cell as specified in 5.7.13.2.","paragraph_zero_based":2326},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sCellIndex value included in the sCellToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration (SCell modification):","paragraph_zero_based":2327}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["94d0c6637ab19301428c00aa441810d30d742f9252b18f05e34a79a067c54c5f","d90a7eb48c9bc9801edc3a944b37b4249d7984df1fc4197c8fc9269a0c2a1a0d","8395db89fcdf15920f92abb25f74653bf1d4399baf902601e500dbf0f75a2e51","60c63311fa1163239635998