{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>modify the SCell configuration in accordance with the sCellConfigDedicated;","paragraph_zero_based":2328},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sCellToAddModList was received in an RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync, or received in an RRCResume message, or received in an RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync embedded in an RRCResume message or embedded in an RRCReconfiguration message or embedded in an E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration message or embedded in an E-UTRA RRCConnectionResume message, or received in an RRCReconfiguration message embedded in an RRCReconfiguration message or embedded in an E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration message activating deactivated SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":2329},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the sCellState is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2330},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure lower layers to consider the SCell to be in activated state;","paragraph_zero_based":2331},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2332},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure lower layers to consider the SCell to be in deactivated state.","paragraph_zero_based":2333},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SCellConfig contains the goodServingCellEvaluationBFD:","paragraph_zero_based":2334},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>the UE may perform the evaluation of the good serving cell quality criterion for this serving cell as specified in 5.7.13.2.","paragraph_zero_based":2335},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.10BH RLC channel release","paragraph_zero_based":2336},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IAB-node shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2337},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each BH-RLC-ChannelID value included in the bh-RLC-ChannelToReleaseList that is part of the current IAB-node configuration within the same cell group (LCH release); or","paragraph_zero_based":2338},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each BH-RLC-ChannelID value that is to be released as the result of an SCG release according to 5.3.5.4:","paragraph_zero_based":2339},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the RLC entity or entities as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3;","paragraph_zero_based":2340},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the corresponding logical channel.","paragraph_zero_based":2341},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.11BH RLC channel addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":2342},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For each BH-RLC-ChannelConfig received in the bh-RLC-ChannelToAddModList IE the IAB-node shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2343},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the current configuration contains a BH RLC Channel with the received bh-RLC-ChannelID within the same cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":2344},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reestablishRLC is received:","paragraph_zero_based":2345},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>re-establish the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4];","paragraph_zero_based":2346},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the RLC entity or entities in accordance with the received rlc-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2347},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the logical channel in accordance with the received mac-LogicalChannelConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":2348},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else (a backhaul logical channel with the given BH-RLC-ChannelID was not configured before within the same cell group):","paragraph_zero_based":2349},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish an RLC entity in accordance with the received rlc-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2350},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure this MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance to the received mac-LogicalChannelConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":2351}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["687eaebe2ed13234ad857e347c0ec968cea47251bb404fd797ee5ed19eec2ed4","c4c596ee3d993d7fedd3d16eadc5110850759c4df076f01ab5988b548a153402","899ebf5e5c5545e58f0cbe7eb7719f47c28dfc1ba1b33530d0892dafbeb8442a","2b16b6d4a60bd3756a25cfa1cb44970cee8c7da079bda92f8281db7fc87b273f","2942f18f24dc9f0bb9d1bcfb71f8d441cd18073f4477ec40fa3119d6fb9ee63d","bfbc06754309af6487929f233961740f0f349bac57c1aa0da9c869553a387f25","e60227ffbd4123e206a93c739c06272019a633e27989445c17ad4a4449c7654a","d3c54c315db47792190caae9e081a9669ad712ff887779d177f6671a6ba7f500","2bfc31dabd2f04ab0e1f385bc167ea1448e91b007ceb6b1b33f9e594f7ba868c","0913bbea9041b5fa3eb3c303b52597bb89c21f40ce6694722c83d6ab874c6687","67bf775f7f3fde41dad98f7a6a3d5d01d4caa6ce96ccb70ad4edb7964dd5fb21","784b6812fc727abfb0c9e466c6abbd5f2a8355c66d68d9a76b6abcb842fb7c71","2a81273c3b0186247f449c254b372be34593b0e0f8244d7960268ffc64f0dbec","ed3f12f5db3a2c555fedfa9054062abdebc5076baaf65f587a7c8e2f674cb1d2","7653c2459c325b9d40d2f0db1e26e4f13af9781bc36f382d4d0526a1ea4af34e","b9ec22e95c51c0f35d6c5c595e242aca2212a6736796838a860e5d0b50354eb5","f855e69ae4f75987afd41598c3528f3dc65d72e80ff04ffa5580113ef58296e1","2e44039e8f8d2066f07525edf9e236214d4d496a93e073503397db1706e55e2f","3f69d71378efbd4e167663c5a0a451e1c1525676d29d3aaa7f97eae9cff6b6d2","8d791e2e8f653f7ec0e8e2b31698037a217debe6628316b7f775c8697c04c0a9","1ff9982ef094e45b0cb351c2fd5ac540fb2ab37ca1ea44f04795395e8970b94c","387dab70a3f0b7dafa011403590e33d32a20d853fa846cb20d8cda2289d423f4","2634ab5e3f348341a68c1fb851656788852054058593af5d0af117d9c3a7994d","dc4565784a5c2c29215516eff7132e071ceee270b31b00019d4014cd47a55d7d"],"para