{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the SCG failure information procedure as specified in clause 5.7.3 to report SCG reconfiguration with sync failure, upon which the RRC reconfiguration procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":2688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is in NR-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":2690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the connection re-establishment procedure as specified in clause 5.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":2691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (the UE is in (NG) EN-DC):","paragraph_zero_based":2692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the connection re-establishment procedure as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":2693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if T304 expires when RRCReconfiguration is received via other RAT (HO to NR failure):","paragraph_zero_based":2694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset MAC;","paragraph_zero_based":2695},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions defined for this failure case as defined in the specifications applicable for the other RAT.","paragraph_zero_based":2696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:In this clause, the term 'handover failure' has been used to refer to 'reconfiguration with sync failure'.","paragraph_zero_based":2697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.9Other configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the delayBudgetReportingConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if delayBudgetReportingConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to send delay budget reports in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2703},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to send delay budget reports and stop timer T342, if running.","paragraph_zero_based":2704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the overheatingAssistanceConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if overheatingAssistanceConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide overheating assistance information in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide overheating assistance information and stop timer T345, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the idc-AssistanceConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if idc-AssistanceConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2711}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6250f4656517ffb8dcf498f81c678ae0a4ecfa5b79f5e933dc365c35c9decbff","22387c5debbd56e7c7d2af67da14d40b09f5363a943dcb34216ca807881ab859","cc6e90f07ca704c26ac6cd348c05abc6c9adf650773398d949792ba5ee488583","0b2fbab84427b305e895bc51454037e8fdbb77a1ef5dd1287ca2aa32a0403337","1ebf96572310eb91337d1ea6fbc8912158cadb8f8bb8e78c69ee40623167aba1","94ddb8d68681715f2403f8c8f56b2abb4c9d71a08bb3