{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:The UE is requested to attempt to have valid Bluetooth measurements, WLAN measurements and Sensor measurements whenever sending a measurement report for which it is configured to include these measurements. The UE may not succeed e.g. because the user manually disabled the WLAN or Bluetooth or Sensor hardware. Further details, e.g. regarding when to activate WLAN or Bluetooth or Sensor, are up to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":2760},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the sl-AssistanceConfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":2761},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider itself to be configured to provide configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2762},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the referenceTimePreferenceReporting:","paragraph_zero_based":2763},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider itself to be configured to provide UE reference time assistance information in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2764},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2765},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider itself not to be configured to provide UE reference time assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":2766},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the successHO-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":2767},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider itself to be configured to provide the successful handover information in accordance with 5.7.10.6;","paragraph_zero_based":2768},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2769},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider itself not to be configured to provide the successful handover information.","paragraph_zero_based":2770},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the successPSCell-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":2771},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if thresholdPercentageT304-SCG is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2772},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured by the target PSCell to provide the successful PSCell change or addition information in accordance with 5.7.10.7;","paragraph_zero_based":2773},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if sn-InitiatedPSCellChange is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2774},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured by the source PSCell to provide the successful PSCell change or addition information in accordance with 5.7.10.7;","paragraph_zero_based":2775},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2776},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured by the PCell to provide the successful PSCell change or addition information in accordance with 5.7.10.7;","paragraph_zero_based":2777},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2778},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider itself not to be configured to provide the successful PSCell change or addition information.","paragraph_zero_based":2779},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the ul-GapFR2-PreferenceConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2780},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider itself to be configured to provide its preference on FR2 UL gap in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2781},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2782},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider itself not to be configured to provide its preference on FR2 UL gap;","paragraph_zero_based":2783}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha2