{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to report the relaxation state of BFD measurements in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to report the relaxation state of BFD measurements and stop timer T346k associated with the cell group, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the scg-DeactivationPreferenceConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the scg-DeactivationPreferenceConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide its SCG deactivation preference in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2815},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2816},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide its SCG deactivation preference and stop timer T346i, if running.","paragraph_zero_based":2817},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the propDelayDiffReportConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2818},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the propDelayDiffReportConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2819},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and neighbour cell(s) in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and neighbour cell(s).","paragraph_zero_based":2822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the rrm-MeasRelaxationReportingConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2823},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the rrm-MeasRelaxationReportingConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2824},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to report the fulfilment of the criterion for relaxing RRM measurements in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2825},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2826},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to report the fulfilment of the criterion for relaxing RRM measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":2827},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the multiRx-PreferenceReportingConfigFR2:","paragraph_zero_based":2828},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the multiRx-PreferenceReportingConfigFR2 is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2829},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide its preference on multi-Rx operation for FR2 in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2830},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2831}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6a34b555cdc1b7f67dac921864456b51b215fdaf633189ea2deef890ac6d74df","940e82db1729da40a0f7e0a309be1db04e63847d77aab948db9b90aa0812900d","b4ae5b2fc9dbbe3ea2d7fdc6aecb37af4a22e8740a376f1726a8027c18de3c03","85c7202d76258258ec2b2696e95a06c0218784a505e6d3e294ff89683ca007bb","448f88d800b47fc0428cd3c185400c43bc9f3ab292eaf9f65dc0e108ef5c37d8","ee7480a9e4095fcabee36a4cfcc3fa57818ce8c78376f35d2711fb3ee97cd8a4","8cd88b86a06775c59566379101f8cf4ce023ba0972e350fe0b7c195117b5112c","88fc939f23510b0262e68e8572bd8959961593a8d2e69591cc3dc435f602679c","402cebbfabc7fd692271320730f70b8586c925b0422217d1fb048a72d285d1eb","f571efc3887dd444b91fdc60bac6a183b47151ff8b708ceb803732488c10cad9","9c8ae674508b415f63019a8dca302983109b65d231ced7c57d8435171cd9c304","213a2bf3270a57ad055ca6384d3091c518227c5b72d50a0e43f635c33fa597fd","887120b2c65387e41854964f7b255a96ee53436c57c676601d2b9a54ef03f966","b6a464c3e44cc37ed2aa1e471bb18f1bc3abd03748c7eb8eb041e0456c3c80d3","b5450b6bc9b348d020da303f6546bae31fb0d7b567420df9df4b92bce5f9e487","9581345f5e9564d413eca5b9692737527b8e6a481893ed9fcf5ba6aff1293dca","0f524970916f760aebcb60087840bbf7b16ab8535e350abb97f22414fc90cbd7","71013084c9a551a5b839f5828e39479057b6db9e9498a2b65914518c45135ce7","b0216520c5129e52b3f90a40b8854ece430f33517d4d3fd993ef5063d7853552","56fd4bb47d1b12f4248a114a773ecf205cf57d1100ac64679b62b8570cac4270","4e44b338c91d53a52a52f6ca9a56cffcf1e7edf2d1d9ddf3a7492b2d3b0f044e","96d9176c412be5a1330e05cedd38f68457c364eb071dc553893bb5e179cbe14f","814a68a97241ad9b9cdb856191c194ff156ee16eca51a4d5414997e65a33bf4b","6bb39cfc1e5226f6d1586071da1b580593c15a09adf63bf089a690325a989199"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2808,2831],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p2808"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide its preference on multi-Rx operation for FR2 and stop timer T346m, if running.","paragraph_zero_based":2832},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the uav-FlightPathAvailabilityConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2833},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider itself to be configured to indicate the availability of flight path information in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2834},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the ul-TrafficInfoReportingConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2835},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if ul-TrafficInfoReportingConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2836},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide UL traffic information in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2837},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2838},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide UL traffic information and stop all instances of timer T346l, if running.","paragraph_zero_based":2839},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.9aMUSIM gap configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2840},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2841},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if musim-GapConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2842},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each musim-GapId included in the received musim-GapToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2843},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the periodic MUSIM gap configuration associated with the musim-GapId;","paragraph_zero_based":2844},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each MUSIM-Gap included in the received musim-GapToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2845},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>setup periodic MUSIM gap configuration indicated by the MUSIM-Gap in accordance with the received musim-GapRepetitionAndOffset (providing musim-GapRepetition and Offset value for the following condition) i.e. the first subframe of each periodic MUSIM gap occurs at an SFN and subframe of the NR PCell meeting the following condition:","paragraph_zero_based":2846},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SFN mod T = FLOOR(Offset/10);","paragraph_zero_based":2847},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subframe = Offset mod 10;","paragraph_zero_based":2848},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"with T = musim-GapRepetition/10;","paragraph_zero_based":2849},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the MUSIM gap priority configuration indicated by musim-GapPriorityToAddModList, if configured, for each periodic MUSIM gap;","paragraph_zero_based":2850},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the musim-GapKeep, if all collided MUSIM gaps are configured to be kept;","paragraph_zero_based":2851},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:If network does not retain the relative priorities among MUSIM gaps, UE behaviour is not specified.","paragraph_zero_based":2852},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if musim-AperiodicGap is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2853},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>setup aperiodic MUSIM gap configuration indicated by the musim-AperiodicGap in accordance with the received musim-Starting-SFN-AndSubframe, i.e. the first subframe of aperiodic MUSIM gap occurs at an SFN and subframe of the NR PCell meeting the following condition:","paragraph_zero_based":2854},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SFN = starting-SFN;","paragraph_zero_based":2855}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad