{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subframe = startingSubframe;","paragraph_zero_based":2856},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if musim-GapConfig is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":2857},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the MUSIM gap configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":2858},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.10MR-DC release","paragraph_zero_based":2859},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2860},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>as a result of MR-DC release triggered by E-UTRA or NR:","paragraph_zero_based":2861},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release SRB3, if established, as specified in 5.3.5.6.2;","paragraph_zero_based":2862},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release SRB5, if established, as specified in 5.3.5.6.2;","paragraph_zero_based":2863},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release measConfig associated with SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":2864},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is configured with NR SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":2865},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the SCG configuration as specified in clause 5.3.5.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2866},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release otherConfig associated with the SCG, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2867},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release successPSCell-Config configured by the PCell in the otherConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2868},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timers T346a, T346b, T346c, T346d, T346e, T346j and T346k associated with the SCG, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2869},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release bap-Config associated with the SCG, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2870},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the BAP entity as specified in TS 38.340 [47], if there is no configured bap-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2871},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release iab-IP-AddressConfigurationList associated with the SCG, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2872},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the UE is configured with E-UTRA SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":2873},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the SCG configuration as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.10.19 to release the E-UTRA SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":2874},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.11Full configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2875},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2876},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release/ clear all current dedicated radio configurations except for the following:","paragraph_zero_based":2877},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the MCG C-RNTI;","paragraph_zero_based":2878},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the AS security configurations associated with the master key;","paragraph_zero_based":2879}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6ffd66631d6fa11b33ce4c9b3af4b9b8f3bf10307dcdb989c2aa8dd583109e91","587e61ab7a9a878a31473b67bedf7c85f56880e1d4ada05cf53cd26b71ac2e1a","6ec7c84310f2b8a0c240041948a4efa2c6f9d82fe376632c980ed0508bf206fe","4bd407b7c656c28873a53c88483a83f35f8c24a778f98fb452d49cdc534ab0ca","d8b5231cd5973fd704734f6bee9d82166d5879310c4010e5c7f589e34698ccfb","132a3bd01032c6f0ccc3875ff98a9cb76efabacf10bc8e9bf866357bd2b613f0","3621cc1f5d9254a64951ecfd25399a877841daf55f464d9af126c54795fbf06b","fad1d93b3899e95c621ff36bd2ed2435df48356a967afe886f100daf39086865","f818632de46481e79146c10d2093d4743b64b4ae4662265c0814f44101989005","325dac0fa5623cc4149721f691a1c06e2af02886dc60c3f1a28018e56df34f7f","0333047f1d38e452bdc1bc9d7ec7d80550785eb59d7e18cac892fab67278df49","f58e9e29218c9cd4967d9cf9b536127163d7fb861eab2f324b2764d249f538aa","4abfac05b76939088034b056a09510d4d8e7f50383c2aa70df9ce87ecacd6fe2","645e0366317137ad1038616f0eb694e3d5c213f21b6cddd96313f1613033d728","2a1f1b84a94a22e129278c00608e7444e2e519624074e2c3dbc2d4dd5feca41b","e1c0844c658abd65a2606d75a32913e9140cecce3ae2571c3b7182a66deefe48","1e4af59027a8ad27d87040b7fcfa1a076d1cf8ee1d1eb17f15f43c88b51d95e2","e95f59b608af806b8eda5eddca999bfdef3b065d108ae615a800973988f0bb43","fd01123ee350507bfddb499f7831ae3be3c45ced735df6ee3cb6e2174fc993f2","c300e58744ad91caaf997ee8e12a1cd02d121aaf25871332eea0c7c89b87bc74","3e0d342baf35ceb1d2056cd5393c8bf1baa5c2c9a1edf6cad0d75bd08c7ad5bc","9dc990f4f7530d18211118e16afa72b67fb3e559fc9308a48c1b75f71c3259a8","ee7dddee8d61b2748b414a17702ff74b22e4e30ed27dc65d344272cf53402a42","fc63a8c09cabc32d6c28e8fb10778df138b86336a7d622bbd6420deb943b8a44"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2856,2879],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p2856"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the SRB1/SRB2 configurations and DRB/multicast MRB configurations as configured by radioBearerConfig or radioBearerConfig2.","paragraph_zero_based":2880},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Radio configuration is not just the resource configuration but includes other configurations like MeasConfig. Radio configuration also includes the RLC bearer configurations as configured by RLC-BearerConfig, PC5 Relay RLC channel as configured by SL-RLC-ChannelConfig, and Uu Relay RLC channel as configured by Uu-RelayRLC-ChannelConfig. In case NR-DC or NE-DC is configured, this also includes the entire NR or E-UTRA SCG configuration which are released according to the MR-DC release procedure as specified in 5.3.5.10.","paragraph_zero_based":2881},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1a:For NR sidelink communication/discovery, the radio configuration includes the sidelink RRC configuration received from the network, but does not include the sidelink RRC reconfiguration and sidelink UE capability received from other UEs via PC5-RRC. In addition, the UE considers the new NR sidelink configurations as full configuration, in case of state transition and change of system information used for NR sidelink communication/discovery.","paragraph_zero_based":2882},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1b:To establish the RLC bearer of SRB(s) after release due to fullConfig, the network can include the srb-Identity within srb-ToAddModList (i.e. the UE applies RLC default configuration) and/or provide rlc-BearerToAddModList of concerned SRB(s) explicitly.","paragraph_zero_based":2883},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the logged measurement configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2884},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the spCellConfig in the masterCellGroup includes the reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":2885},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release/ clear all current common radio configurations;","paragraph_zero_based":2886},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if sl-PathSwitchConfig was included in reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":2887},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the default values specified in 9.2.3 for timer T311;","paragraph_zero_based":2888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the default values specified in 9.2.3 for timers T310, T311 and constants N310, N311;","paragraph_zero_based":2890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else (full configuration after re-establishment or during RRC resume):","paragraph_zero_based":2891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":2892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use value for timer T311, as included in ue-TimersAndConstants received in SIB1","paragraph_zero_based":2893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use values for timers T301, T310, T311 and constants N310, N311, as included in ue-TimersAndConstants received in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2895},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if no measConfigAppLayerId is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2896},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>inform upper layers about the release of all application layer measurement configurations;","paragraph_zero_based":2897},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard any received application layer measurement report from upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":2898},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider itself not to be configured to send application layer measurement report.","paragraph_zero_based":2899},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE at the target side during reconfiguration with sync, or after re-establishment, or during RRC resume:","paragraph_zero_based":2900},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the default configuration of SL-RLC1 as specified in clause 9.2.4 and associate it with the SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2901},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2902},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the default L1 parameter values as specified in corresponding physical layer specifications except for the following:","paragraph_zero_based":2903}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["10d1095d1a8fb6075ce5affebe3accdbe909c33d92a2fb91d6c42ca571a9e1e5","280e2f9685b772f1c97bd9b3aed4648235e0ad9dc1dfc506884ecf84691ef28b","1625fb6c60031e1d413f6c03782379b1936a2c5c23cd10c0873808f140f980c0","f619ce0a10afcb24f8bd8d63631cf19ef45e7aa37232788054bd912be4dfb5f2","7c9623ef88937c94ff93261c68f7d9f2982aa5d44ab0e1d322d984968fd9eeb7","a48f294343821095f477be8257aa44015dcf2c083254b3c72191e440c17ec9dd","8ca197efb3ba2e23c17316b0d9d0e1f42d5b8b87502072f73e886bcffc21f547","0640e50588f6d4e11ad6fa36101b6a53b7dc50bb2a2a94ef71d32ddf6749ada6","9d238c25d92d7ffd262fbabfbc81dabc87be3d391f576bb39a99fd2e15e57133","70bef1290e2e639c37674e101a88985f1c49d53739fd53c404d96841f4468e7b","a98d6404ab7304103cf63c00cdd3bfc06db7387f2eee04f84a1058a969007289","7e57f10adb148ba8ac5dc18832d6a1344d5eed493a3098c3c6b8d88525c68069","e595ceeca74087123bb207d59499737863f5d14fab852fb41872c78b6e66cc08","5af5463256bfecf98eb394d9168834cf1352565d59ace4f329c6c566599bdb54","f893bc1a2d1de5ce5ca84819140d01d6efafb3a3257cdb2eb295407bd2b20d5c","cb355f31b33f1eca824e8ca506e086b659bf28681837e553373cc707b9bc26d8","519b17f974a3c013dc194c8d18d94a20a79d70d67ea6f7bfd08d0b2ca706888f","a846386ba50d0e94c8d9ca770806bd15f4b6103737a791d990b3558f31a1db86","94c7aaa58ecd030ffc563d21744ef579573885ee479523f2e5de71cc498188a8","24a4bea5e06d33955a82f85975d6e038fa6d62f45b9ff8b428c2e1d0b75e1cf1","fad102645824b61df8ea27cba174fbecdb700520091ad527f084bb099926bc60","4bb6c305a1c54c03c0ac5b5a4f0bb70c84232e9455847ae5583da0daee733586","efb711c96d239fb802fa40b65593c55de0a269bfe6a42db4647734093c2082d2","3bb6beb92fc10c56b38e3b46fa3d6b3c7956ca12166c334ff376bb64c0661b47"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2880,2903],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p2880"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-parameters for which values are provided in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the default MAC Cell Group configuration as specified in 9.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":2905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each srb-Identity value included in the srb-ToAddModList (SRB reconfiguration):","paragraph_zero_based":2906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>establish an RLC entity for the corresponding SRB;","paragraph_zero_based":2907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the default SRB configuration defined in 9.2.1 for the corresponding SRB;","paragraph_zero_based":2908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:This is to get the SRBs (SRB1 and SRB2 for reconfiguration with sync and SRB2 for resume and reconfiguration after re-establishment) to a known state from which the reconfiguration message can do further configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":2909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each pdu-Session that is part of the current UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":2910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the SDAP entity (clause 5.1.2 in TS 37.324 [24]);","paragraph_zero_based":2911},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release each DRB associated to the pdu-Session as specified in 5.3.5.6.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:This will retain the pdu-Session but remove the DRBs including drb-identity of these bearers from the current UE configuration. Setup of the DRBs within the AS is described in clause 5.3.5.6.5 using the new configuration. The pdu-Session acts as the anchor for associating the released and re-setup DRB. In the AS the DRB re-setup is equivalent with a new DRB setup (including new PDCP and logical channel configurations).","paragraph_zero_based":2913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each mbs-SessionId that is part of the current UE configuration and associated to a multicast MRB:","paragraph_zero_based":2914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the SDAP entity (clause 5.1.2 in TS 37.324 [24]);","paragraph_zero_based":2915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release each multicast MRB associated to the mbs-SessionId as specified in 5.3.5.6.6;","paragraph_zero_based":2916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4:This will retain the mbs-SessionId but remove the multicast MRBs including mrb-identity of these bearers from the current UE configuration. Setup of the multicast MRBs within the AS is described in clause 5.3.5.6.7 using the new configuration. The mbs-SessionId acts as the anchor for associating the released and re-setup multicast MRB. In the AS the multicast MRB re-setup is equivalent with a new multicast MRB setup (including new PDCP and logical channel configurations).","paragraph_zero_based":2917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each pdu-Session that is part of the current UE configuration but not added with same pdu-Session in the drb-ToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the procedure was triggered due to reconfiguration with sync:","paragraph_zero_based":2919},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate the release of the user plane resources for the pdu-Session to upper layers after successful reconfiguration with sync;","paragraph_zero_based":2920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate the release of the user plane resources for the pdu-Session to upper layers immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":2922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each mbs-SessionId that is part of the current UE configuration but not added with the same mbs-SessionId in the mrb-ToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the procedure was triggered due to reconfiguration with sync:","paragraph_zero_based":2924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate the release of the user plane resources for the mbs-SessionId to upper layers after successful reconfiguration with sync;","paragraph_zero_based":2925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate the release of the user plane resources for the mbs-SessionId to upper layers immediately.","paragraph_zero_based":2927}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e386775a041d19fdce43644e9eac68e3ea2582b9d68541732c0d64d3416ef4f3","9d40e4e46cac34a0b5e83ef45ef7fd6c8714bcf049be2bf92291f357b6900817","e8889fc1586564ce574c7529411c055f7c1c369ba0d126644da8fdde60f9a69c","50a93c5fa957fa5237b5a6efc43661399f17717e9d5fbd7014dc0891fe946b52","8c6c26226fd3fc22bfa17f98aeb60be8fa7a886973cae7240edbb40c706c3d26","a5e540b4ab83bfe7edda88ae6f2a5a3f94c4f17434ab8a09d8ddf297c1900aab","e72b6e07f8bf7ae070801ddf48ad00942032b4146f27be20cc6c0c59590eaf5f","28c2487c2a6b96cf3130a165623ee43843d9ea9046ed468271da09c099116301","aa2e448c24cb4b78215d9f2cc6372e0e18b42797ef5c7ca95bdb62a39e96d597","d02105cb83f53fd9ae4c374fcf0f2bc91f7dad56b4c6f7f34e0055ab93545872","3fa5bb94e662839f1c35a7432c6227c4105c0d7bc30956e4acd2ba9832061e85","3fbdea764427205752608c31994267205ef4578febd301f33fd691eb95ca8753","fea1842a6d31fca63f4fe079ee45332b7eaa1842fcc96a9e5ae5d9b4f7c24751","b03e6cc62ddbc170be2d65d9ee437bbf572d640a38f74ab472af7b731d343e23","844b6dbdefde7c6f770f427ba186a33f5616e36bf2aedc192fe7d0746a1b656a","fe7ed9b5ca249cb0b57227d9f813dcb76c3d41dd2921ae5abccefd6c9c1cba97","5233c70d9f294dcaecd9c62466798c3ed7a75fa5e912cfeb2e99740673b3962a","8629a2fc2ab9f7e5bd06883883a1574153597f29b8a7251d53eac74bb960c8d9","137a4d80fe8a33125d42563ce1a91ccdb7ce570bcfa7694ad540f758c8629404","d57245211cbbb80b12f1f4f64bf3c6c445f04a85127a77e92ebf86918e19d9f9","30bb9b4d43698a9468474903152706f89e40d8b4d9b7f1c3c4d83d4ffd540b8a","70403387a9b10a07595cfb84cd782262ad4a72a4ed65a77e7276ec7d2b9750b3","5b11e3c543a6be91d24ac433e4d346f296707e9eab7feb67f32fd89517bbbf42","34554fbe43fca54d854ba11aee05829ffd3350fe6fb952d2654edbf3446fc6ba"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2904,2927],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p2904"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.12BAP configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IAB-MT shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the bap-Config is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if no BAP entity is established:","paragraph_zero_based":2931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>establish a BAP entity as specified in TS 38.340 [47];","paragraph_zero_based":2932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if bap-Address is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the BAP entity to use the bap-Address as this node's BAP address;","paragraph_zero_based":2934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if defaultUL-BAP-RoutingID is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2935},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the BAP entity to apply the default UL BAP routing ID according to the configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if defaultUL-BH-RLC-Channel is included","paragraph_zero_based":2937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the BAP entity to apply the default UL BH RLC channel according to the configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if flowControlFeedbackType is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the BAP entity to apply the flow control feedback according to the configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the bap-Config is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":2941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the concerned bap-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if there is no other configured bap-Config for the MCG or for the SCG","paragraph_zero_based":2943},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the BAP entity as specified in TS 38.340 [47].","paragraph_zero_based":2944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.12aIAB Other Configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.12a.1IP address management","paragraph_zero_based":2946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.12a.1.1IP Address Release","paragraph_zero_based":2947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IAB-MT shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the release is triggered by reception of the iab-IP-AddressToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each iab-IP-AddressIndex value included in iab-IP-AddressToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the corresponding IAB-IP-AddressConfiguration.","paragraph_zero_based":2951}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["67120b6ba619b69decd39f66a863115efe644303e0506eb6445da1e8b4e21daf","4b81a0c80710cb63be6d835aac66eb519ba7a4d508aacdd63bb6a607008db823","d4936f61210ad55701915f76392eae09695f9909d87ea5bb5fd520d240bbe839","870d5bea12c227c2de3c80ed92b77f9d55c827927a7039ae531d4e9120cb55f3","256604f9c241ad1a49ee98415352fc0b0e257284bdd9f5dbfba93229a7ca10c5","09c97281027a61f38e2b472708a46c6ea9462aaeb5ff4a2a2bb5bb1bf318e49e","c7bdc514cce9fb1b979c4dd8aac4aa539cb733041db007c8edc8ddfe41ed6e9e","1f1545084acef38fbfec1826688e07b7b9855cf2afdef6068a94c5a3497ca338","76fab1d1741b047a484a62a5e382fded3b00fcdef792454b0c4762ad7d9ab620","4299b3c4ef2d2a846ecb19bb20846982edcba812ef6a78c62769cbb133178792","4d14bba6dfadbf5338553e136d2b42e68cb6f6178b9839ffdc0458ddb04369f2","6646971c85b96aca34988eb8c9e64600f30e708f89e39cbca7b3a19c1de6a1f2","a28f2b39559e3b73c3388015cb7737ff8a23d49e9ec7c9c31430390ab0584aae","00b111fd7269b482d4b9c483e4586ca69823765ea0dad5b6c24261620bde30c3","3a58d0d7fd21bbc8a89f448b7d199e73a60f1c072b63b8a00218d59ee23c416c","5c9400d82c9765d9b6af5e306621d1e8bd490bed6224440fc121ee1235db51ef","8811350419b56bba0d3281ad2dae1a60ba62297b4156cd2c10debe75d01d6468","a3fc17e0031215b7cc08e697c3efce95532a0273d8e5f01cdea0e96877d578c1","ddf798f6bfeb24083dc782e61a2d622e4199b9ed31b15a4be15853a01a2b0567","3bf44987d315b6f6513c5ccf1e706531bc008874579a2ee26ebbec7d4515dc22","13ee774c89010ce23c960f744180f59e0bcb01d9b94f83d4dd05a2ddbae432f1","263b6d455c7597326fce729d8bcbbd675a281ff707d43a9945068dc11889a6a3","a6da61d693fa96a6ae4575efc6b81e500bb8c32bb74a879a6787dd3aa6346bea","e4aabec6df0c07b3f5983176b9f91e56d2020f1186e130cd87ce56522efc44d6"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2928,2951],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p2928"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.12a.1.2IP Address Addition/Modification","paragraph_zero_based":2952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IAB-MT shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each iab-IP-AddressIndex value included in the iab-IP-AddressToAddModList that is not part of the current IAB-MT configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":2954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>add the IP address indicated in iab-IP-Address, corresponding to the iab-IP-AddressIndex.","paragraph_zero_based":2955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if added IP address is iPv4-Address:","paragraph_zero_based":2956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if iab-IP-Usage is set to f1-C:","paragraph_zero_based":2957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received IPv4 address for F1-C traffic together with the IAB-donor-DU BAP address corresponding to the iab-IP-AddressIndex.","paragraph_zero_based":2958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if iab-IP-Usage is set to f1-U:","paragraph_zero_based":2959},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received IPv4 address for F1-U traffic together with the IAB-donor-DU BAP address corresponding to the iab-IP-AddressIndex.","paragraph_zero_based":2960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if iab-IP-Usage is set to non-F1:","paragraph_zero_based":2961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received IPv4 address for non-F1 traffic together with the IAB-donor-DU BAP address corresponding to the iab-IP-AddressIndex.","paragraph_zero_based":2962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received IPv4 address for all traffic together with the IAB-donor-DU BAP address corresponding to the iab-IP-AddressIndex.","paragraph_zero_based":2964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if iPv6-Address is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if iab-IP-Usage is set to f1-C:","paragraph_zero_based":2966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received IPv6 address for F1-C traffic together with the IAB-donor-DU BAP address corresponding to the iab-IP-AddressIndex.","paragraph_zero_based":2967},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if iab-IP-Usage is set to f1-U:","paragraph_zero_based":2968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received IPv6 address for F1-U traffic together with the IAB-donor-DU BAP address corresponding to the iab-IP-AddressIndex.","paragraph_zero_based":2969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if iab-IP-Usage is set to non-F1:","paragraph_zero_based":2970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received IPv6 address for non-F1 traffic together with the IAB-donor-DU BAP address corresponding to the iab-IP-AddressIndex.","paragraph_zero_based":2971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received IPv6 address for all traffic together with the IAB-donor-DU BAP address corresponding to the iab-IP-AddressIndex.","paragraph_zero_based":2973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if iPv6-Prefix is included in iab-IP-AddressToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if iab-IP-Usage is set to f1-C:","paragraph_zero_based":2975}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3cd992ac8c7a791db696f304c1107289f35e41ffdff15921aafc3bf9d6fc1d55","7203d73c0f2d2839a80d9b184c50e67d0b1b8bc954c0273dfbac2bb92764f510","aea523788752186f1514570e889ead95b93109ef658c77baf37859a52bdcf479","976bf6132fe9e37a526c083f4ec112ce09289d6ad5aa83627cc37c7f03951156","d02f6974fcf231a7001f6acc8f53f83239b9ff4f7a3bc6cd023a579bf752a85c","29364f780fa819392a7b5b452e5f1e57fc35c4523f3e74935c990b9d381ecfda","3ab05ca9fd6f8b8c7ff1670f83bb2f162a200afb1c829770bcd698917bacb105","5cd81016313e5fd84faf22eb3e74164289c05bbe6e2526c8201fda6f3d2f60f2","cb023f5fb9ed58c2d6d52474fb22806672c93a34f3431d63cc7779fc723fa32d","a803e625eafe20e0e958eda93a75fa021e412836c03f849de4d8d303efe69739","766938dcdcf6cd9dd702d8851f12d70d8ae7aa552ed4c115d0f7ff11a8672c3f","d0b56ece13cdb4042e60492cad8eb321813acfc647733502eca7f773478b6a1c","9e4f0673f4820b5257174c4b9662a7a8518865dd0eeeb858880abb16f687356b","856eaa9a88b86a3bcf45ceec713a54e5755bc4ce56af421ab2718bcac4ee5044","29517e481b74d967f28f3c6ffe5d37fd5878632b2f4364883619a0f8174ee5df","cc7aec7bfcc1f3dce36ec2799b37d349b201ad321b53db7341bf2fee01c05ec0","de2b5f01109fb05bf8db2a6faf5e5dccf76ff8bf28764f2000dbc440d31de54b","818865b506b6c2c281ad5c033e8015ba48acd88f324e437ab15f0f2c3b4f257f","ebf2487932296e393d1b42b58f93c698bb2d81d35c4a77f8d7252d8b1759b4c4","82abad2a74e2d12a993725e6fbf8ac44042f1222ba5f16c0066071f3efd2a2bb","2e6f80a62882f1fd102994cbe9cf241ebfcade9685b82e6f49b6a239c1201669","47119b3f632dc69317ca8c48d9a79429b3b9d991b494bcfbfa49bcecdc3c8743","28c7e88bc0981ed50f5eaea2c46b40d9ba0a984aacca5c2d9df55fecc408d931","ec57c39c679ade38f1472bfe0a41568f91e2caddf22730a381c70eb23a60a0db"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2952,2975],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p2952"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received IPv6 address prefix for F1-C traffic together with the IAB-donor-DU BAP address corresponding to the iab-IP-AddressIndex.","paragraph_zero_based":2976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if iab-IP-Usage is set to f1-U:","paragraph_zero_based":2977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received IPv6 address prefix for F1-U traffic together with the IAB-donor-DU BAP address corresponding to the iab-IP-AddressIndex.","paragraph_zero_based":2978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if iab-IP-Usage is set to non-F1:","paragraph_zero_based":2979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received IPv6 address prefix for non-F1 traffic together with the IAB-donor-DU BAP address corresponding to the iab-IP-AddressIndex.","paragraph_zero_based":2980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received IPv6 address prefix for all traffic together with the IAB-donor-DU BAP address corresponding to the iab-IP-AddressIndex.","paragraph_zero_based":2982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each iab-IP-AddressIndex value included in the iab-IP-AddressToAddModList that is part of the current IAB-MT configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":2983},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>modify the IP address configuration(s) in accordance with the IAB-IP-AddressConfiguration corresponding to the iab-IP-AddressIndex.","paragraph_zero_based":2984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.13Conditional Reconfiguration","paragraph_zero_based":2985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.13.1General","paragraph_zero_based":2986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network configures the UE with one or more candidate target SpCells in the conditional reconfiguration. The UE evaluates the condition of each configured candidate target SpCell. The UE applies the conditional reconfiguration associated with one of the target SpCells which fulfils associated execution condition.","paragraph_zero_based":2987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network can also configure the UE with one or more candidate target PCells associated with one or more candidate target PSCells. The UE evaluates the conditions for the candidate target PCells and the associated candidate target PSCells in parallel and applies a target configuration that include PCell and PSCell for which the associated execution conditions are fullfiled. If there are multiple candidate PSCells associated with one candidate target PCell, the network provides multiple conditional configurations for the same candidate target PCell, i.e., each configuration contains one MCG configuration (for the same candidate target PCell) and one SCG configuration (for one of the multiple associated candidate PSCells). For this case, the network may also provide a complementary CHO only configuration, i.e., there is execution condition only for candidate PCell.","paragraph_zero_based":2988},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network provides the configuration parameters for the target SpCell(s) in the condRRCReconfig.","paragraph_zero_based":2989},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In NR-DC, the UE may receive two independent conditionalReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":2990},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-a conditionalReconfiguration associated with MCG, that is included in the RRCReconfiguration message received via SRB1; and","paragraph_zero_based":2991},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-a conditionalReconfiguration, associated with SCG, that is included in the RRCReconfiguration message received via SRB3, or, alternatively, included within a RRCReconfiguration message embedded in a RRCReconfiguration message received via SRB1.","paragraph_zero_based":2992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In this case:","paragraph_zero_based":2993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE maintains two independent VarConditionalReconfig, one associated with each conditionalReconfiguration;","paragraph_zero_based":2994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE independently performs all the procedures in clause 5.3.5.13 for each conditionalReconfiguration and the associated VarConditionalReconfig, unless explicitly stated otherwise;","paragraph_zero_based":2995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE performs the procedures in clause 5.5 for the VarConditionalReconfig associated with the same cell group like the measConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":2996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In EN-DC, the VarConditionalReconfig is associated with the SCG.","paragraph_zero_based":2997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In NE-DC and when no SCG is configured, the VarConditionalReconfig is associated with the MCG.","paragraph_zero_based":2998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE performs the following actions based on a received ConditionalReconfiguration IE:","paragraph_zero_based":2999}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7cb7c72cc4bda737f75de512f0846c180c9971bfb43517d4a09ee5935a59464a","0cc3448d0019f632cd7ed8099bea8851b6a0cd5cfb710ebb4c8bdad66cfc659a","817fe401ade931aa724ed831cca33f3263e824fde0c2cbdc8c5257f0ef300b54","4757e01525a220e9c3c22aecb8279de177611f41c9a8f9204c88f867f3c5f2b0","b4201f581d622c1731b79a27ea6791dd1f44a2c05222084f078c8a2edc966c8f","580dcc586f2d168e8a8673ff6390503e4bd4973499258a893ab5bebf78b968ba","031a5395293e0ff4db80bb1285181de8c2d377a3ec47711012ca58a91140d844","2343f38b978541b347d096cad4f8352e2880aed04526e9296d7b0ddaddbf57d8","21574f7c2e364af5ba26fde550c31f31bf7e3e2a7c622f38a6bf95b029c6bf36","249421d5159985d4e3ff68a1039a7d45a347ba8006b285e85f4cabcbfb9842e3","87881c708ed8bff8dbc11258dd966fef426446661c33282c29e1110f92c9100c","948dd21d3ed2c4548fd4951b1c7035159a04f21d8ad028af94ee42012b63b760","fcbc9233a531653a1356ca9fb585b23ea43f5ee7dbb711ab1e2b2e2a805cfd00","9e50f0ae5f0a22aaee033d766504f7428ab15b1bdb051aa5e3ece33b54780153","5a1d9027e83193e46ecc4b49bfee4007744ed3636249bd6e8256636e329e068b","c2bcca698d820eef58502e9ea91ed001ae63c4d376060d27866f8df4154d1f71","d4229ee70827499b9a56e542d32e3e671ce67335b34faa65d841da75cfc95232","46099b4e57ef77445ce3c3c2ff6c25671c89710af75e89a445b76cd6fbab8d7a","848c086e129b60bdc1768e811ee7485d5f6cf9b8a4e49f452ca2853d4413da8d","a9896e998f1fa50df2802de9d8011cb97bbd98da63178b4abe6abe915951dd4d","db879e8f9b0955d8ce18e1516a8f5e78f154adb800263d7ed4567cba64d35b5b","495a7c04cd4deaeb25850c3be97495d9707fd778cece65345a1c20a10a917839","c52e5981e9b70e73970ac991d4f4dc53db2d2954598c4ac9bc20eaef5c5e1253","e1f1c67f8677687192173b9808d963083ad49a337d0dfc6233a4981a771da13a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2976,2999],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p2976"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the ConditionalReconfiguration contains the condReconfigToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":3000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform conditional reconfiguration removal procedure as specified in 5.3.5.13.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the ConditionalReconfiguration contains the condReconfigToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":3002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform conditional reconfiguration addition/modification as specified in 5.3.5.13.3;","paragraph_zero_based":3003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the ConditionalReconfiguration contains the scpac-ReferenceConfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":3004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform subsequent CPAC reference configuration addition/removal as specified in 5.3.5.13.6;","paragraph_zero_based":3005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the ConditionalReconfiguration contains the sk-CounterConfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":3006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform sk-CounterList addition/modification/removal as specified in 5.3.5.13.7;","paragraph_zero_based":3007},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the ConditionalReconfiguration contains the servingSecurityCellSetId:","paragraph_zero_based":3008},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current VarServingSecurityCellSetID includes servingSecurityCellSetId:","paragraph_zero_based":3009},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>replace the servingSecurityCellSetId value within VarServingSecurityCellSetID with the received servingSecurityCellSetID;","paragraph_zero_based":3010},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3011},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store the received servingSecurityCellSetId within VarServingSecurityCellSetID.","paragraph_zero_based":3012},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.13.2Conditional reconfiguration removal","paragraph_zero_based":3013},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3014},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each condReconfigId value included in the condReconfigToRemoveList that is part of the current UE conditional reconfiguration in VarConditionalReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3015},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove the entry with the matching condReconfigId from the VarConditionalReconfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3016},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The UE does not consider the message as erroneous if the condReconfigToRemoveList includes any condReconfigId value that is not part of the current UE configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":3017},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:The UE does not consider the message as erroneous if the condExecutionCondToReleaseList includes any condReconfigId value that is not part of the current UE configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":3018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.13.3Conditional reconfiguration addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":3019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For each condReconfigId received in the condReconfigToAddModList IE the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if an entry with the matching condReconfigId exists in the condReconfigToAddModList within the VarConditionalReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the entry in condReconfigToAddModList includes an condExecutionCond, condExecutionCondSCG, or condExecutionCondPSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":3022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>replace condExecutionCond, condExecutionCondSCG, or condExecutionCondPSCell within the VarConditionalReconfig with the value received for this condReconfigId;","paragraph_zero_based":3023}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ad0a82c281c85b6a72252abeb6af232378a3b81e8c908b67fc3500498709f461","e7dd96cc46b85cd4edba10145a583a77b5e5d9815f42e6ccd3692b7a35593ff6","4691c5cdae87dd467164e6c45ca25701690e141fca4ba59e36fdd5b8c79cfe08","b1b19c1710afb6d37aa4b77c8eca2f1315c951daa00058accbdb43f52b02455d","f07b1fc1f8e20b741e7592e6e88b87215aad5c2d9720df7fba578de559ae53eb","e601ecd490935df292ffe790d1de6099a1eda50aba9e7ed865e14d0eb5e252c4","e6b4629dd64d7788dad5d9b101ecc4b375e2a8e8eae0a7275c35e97fc0068596","667c627e76ecef0d40e2247a521309e315013fb711edd9e0d44f0e96953bf43f","64b6799aa748dca89b17a25df6d552b8ba4553dd33865dc2a0bdb0371b628a9e","0c8ad6764628cb0e08613deb7a70133e9dd47bdccf0aa3edde1181d195e4893e","7d0b7800f9b20c19560a5a6ee2a803165d1996f2ac18a0c9400a778fe0124425","f3071e1a01f8f3ca24855a7fbfb21d23b8c30ca183f9ec0b193c99e94d0779f9","f93be60e27d4fe5f14ff1c557365ad01b8851e6242162487fb693536b8d2da23","9e72681f7453976ff89c1abc0afdad7e1dae687b1f6bf30e877e2913d93d5f27","165215a486f3a1ff138e1caee7cf36721b172390086e0c6e08f3d9fb209110e4","f520e70a9e160e3561bc678111a331fdb45d2d67d0c72c4226ee54d59cc690d1","d48958bb528a3ca0300147b2289c10219e0cb6ebcc299335d8e3afe85755c06e","fabe03d078bc42524c1a7e2b37fc5349a6765e40bb204d9b3087b4252eca25fb","4b9c85ff0ae5408e1321315d9c113ba3910bcce3f0a3345ef86b0de3151d942e","9446f7772662ecb39bfbc8cc105ff9fae28d0491512b2d3f98f62ca78b47cd05","c33b1d94704c3f7d5a215016e6ba43b99da36d3448ff12d237762ede6d788485","4b1f93c283304905189382aea86799ef5e9923342da003a906e66e9f46cfbf2b","ffaae90b28e2950c69e338d03d004d52b6e424d4d12eda72f70de07b027ba0e2","7c8447fff53991b4ead0776bd53f0f7688fb7e10b9f838458b3eac74324df684"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3000,3023],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3000"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the entry in condReconfigToAddModList includes subsequentCondReconfig containing condExecutionCondToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":3024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each condReconfigId received in condExecutionCondToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":3025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if an entry with the matching condReconfigId exists in the condExecutionCondToAddModList within VarConditionalReconfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>replace the entry in condExecutionCondToAddModList within VarConditionalReconfig with the value received for this condReconfigId;","paragraph_zero_based":3027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>add a new entry in condExecutionCondToAddModList within VarConditionalReconfig with the value received for this condReconfigId;","paragraph_zero_based":3029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the entry in condReconfigToAddModList includes subsequentCondReconfig containing condExecutionCondToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each condReconfigId received in condExecutionCondToReleaseList that is part of current stored condExecutionCondToAddModList within VarConditionalReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3031},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the entry in condExecutionCondToAddModList within VarConditionalReconfig with the value received for this condReconfigId;","paragraph_zero_based":3032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the entry in condReconfigToAddModList includes an securityCellSetId;","paragraph_zero_based":3033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>replace securityCellSetId within the VarConditionalReconfig with the value received for this condReconfigId;","paragraph_zero_based":3034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The UE should release the entry within VarServingSecurityCellSetID in case all the subsequent CPAC configurations are released.","paragraph_zero_based":3035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the entry in condReconfigToAddModList includes an condRRCReconfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>replace condRRCReconfig within the VarConditionalReconfig with the value received for this condReconfigId;","paragraph_zero_based":3037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>add a new entry for this condReconfigId within the VarConditionalReconfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3039},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>perform conditional reconfiguration evaluation as specified in 5.3.5.13.4;","paragraph_zero_based":3040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.13.4Conditional reconfiguration evaluation","paragraph_zero_based":3041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each condReconfigId within the VarConditionalReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration within condRRCReconfig includes the masterCellGroup including the reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":3044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the associated condExecutionCondPSCell is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell which has a physical cell identity matching the value indicated in the ServingCellConfigCommon included in the reconfigurationWithSync within the masterCellGroup in the received condRRCReconfig to be applicable cell; and","paragraph_zero_based":3046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> consider the cell which has a physical cell identity matching the value indicated in the ServingCellConfigCommon included in the reconfigurationWithSync within the secondaryCellGroup within the nr-SCG within the received condRRCReconfig to be applicable cell;","paragraph_zero_based":3047}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1a58afe5958f2069a624f03e214b43cdcc245b61ebd5528fb02446f6807d655a","099de7e79504c356fb95dc78b73bc8e1d387378b6df4e0b4402f2c4b5fa1f0cf","1d9ad412b8ae13a38574b74d33a3271ecb20c1736bb3deb5a54d100796e0bdf3","0e2eef3012a385b2e786a2000051962f6856774548eef90ca110af3c8fd92000","c1a97e812b0b4d0fd3b0e3adff95bd59b0fac2492d9752ce5e4084d9cf25a675","7946dc6277c89e0007e1012973eb24f41d30ca835034b98baa9e605b0a015106","e8561c3ef5dc38964cebdaf0530349630ddffe74d031c7de170fddc470cc48d3","ab7d42321acba0e1b3894cbe9de7ad1df101cc9bee997181dfe91392d79397f7","ab7e7ec51b75f8850627e3f21579fe67b4f9b717ffebe14fb7b2b48fd4785973","260dfd695641827387516e9ce53c78d2bff08e2a31bcc6d962babe2426ae11f5","374381f0064ad327b1b1f8afe1d16c4761ec6901942a63e9a725de1641495f7f","abd5bd54a11f0143e07adf48f556914b3c0476c31d20aba5cd709f08aafefc41","a74a31d0867a033fb586c75f936cb15151235e6434912a7d44191c57a36ce457","0faf61b73d612e79ecc473d7b8e9d103c7c70615fbf813bab7ece476a5ca55ba","15f7b207f4360d4fe763ce096b5f09d9824193c462485d845a233eb4b17e46f1","d691bcb060afe714126e8719cc3ebe2d058e69ad467ae60cfcdf2d79880f866b","f6e9fa8e54da0c4a8ba72c8d10e1f2fc49d43ec1ea2ef2ca5513aec43c9f9c59","aa5f37ccbdfe58dc88938450c6282d53e93cc65d1bf1d820b9dbc030f7282fe8","2ae178d202981d4a2f4d2a770617e9cf54e795e2d56e9654f91f204e76ca76bb","8268c3520857deb250ced7f9c2a76081a1b1a771d27660cef74279f2c1f9ea23","6cea0bd80c2c5e37d10e4eb3ad0d08c4e76698f4f2aaa303b9a502acab779e53","79a71b7b95a1263ae5852b86c6d48b7ecfd04b07acc395a1f29cf82c0269706d","5fd6548f25b8506cae3512acd78896a43304f3123edd2ca4e10138b57c38937e","2695204ae9071dabca7e558e013b06f965d8ee681720f60132f626f2e983ba83"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3024,3047],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3024"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell which has a physical cell identity matching the value indicated in the ServingCellConfigCommon included in the reconfigurationWithSync within the masterCellGroup in the received condRRCReconfig to be applicable cell;","paragraph_zero_based":3049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the RRCReconfiguration within condRRCReconfig includes the secondaryCellGroup including the reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":3050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the cell which has a physical cell identity matching the value indicated in the ServingCellConfigCommon included in the reconfigurationWithSync within the secondaryCellGroup within the received condRRCReconfig is not the PSCell:","paragraph_zero_based":3051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell to be applicable cell;","paragraph_zero_based":3052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if condExecutionCondSCG is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>in the remainder of the procedure, consider each measId indicated in the condExecutionCondSCG as a measId in the VarMeasConfig associated with the SCG measConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the condExecutionCondPSCell is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3055},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>in the remainder of the procedure, consider each measId indicated in the condExecutionCondPSCell as a measId in the VarMeasConfig associated with the MCG measConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if condExecutionCond is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if it is configured via SRB3 or configured within nr-SCG or within nr-SecondaryCellGroupConfig (specified in TS 36.331[10]) via SRB1:","paragraph_zero_based":3058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>in the remainder of the procedure, consider each measId indicated in the condExecutionCond as a measId in the VarMeasConfig associated with the SCG measConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>in the remainder of the procedure, consider each measId indicated in the condExecutionCond as a measId in the VarMeasConfig associated with the MCG measConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each measId included in the measIdList within VarMeasConfig indicated in the condExecutionCond, condExecutionCondSCG, or condExecutionCondPSCell associated to condReconfigId:","paragraph_zero_based":3062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the condTriggerConfig is not configured with nesEvent:","paragraph_zero_based":3063},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the condEventId is associated with condEventT1, and if the entry condition applicable for this event associated with the condReconfigId, i.e. the event corresponding with the condEventId(s) of the corresponding condTriggerConfig within VarConditionalReconfig, is fulfilled for the applicable cell; or","paragraph_zero_based":3064},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> if the condEventId is associated with condEventD1, and if the entry conditions applicable for this event associated with the condReconfigId, i.e. the event corresponding with the condEventId(s) of the corresponding condTriggerConfig within VarConditionalReconfig, is fulfilled for the applicable cell during the corresponding timeToTrigger defined for this event within the VarConditionalReconfig; or","paragraph_zero_based":3065},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the condEventId is associated with condEventD2, and if the entry conditions applicable for this event associated with the condReconfigId, i.e., the event corresponding with the condEventId(s) of the corresponding condTriggerConfig within VarConditionalReconfig, is fulfilled for the applicable cell during the corresponding timeToTrigger defined for this event within the VarConditionalReconfig; or","paragraph_zero_based":3066},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the condEventId is associated with condEventA3, condEventA4 or condEventA5, and if the entry condition(s) applicable for this event associated with the condReconfigId, i.e. the event corresponding with the condEventId(s) of the corresponding condTriggerConfig within VarConditionalReconfig, is fulfilled for the applicable cells for all measurements after layer 3 filtering taken during the corresponding timeToTrigger defined for this event within the VarConditionalReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3067},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider the event associated to that measId to be fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":3068},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the measId for this event associated with the condReconfigId has been modified; or","paragraph_zero_based":3069},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the condEventId is associated with condEventT1, and if the leaving condition applicable for this event associated with the condReconfigId, i.e. the event corresponding with the condEventId(s) of the corresponding condTriggerConfig within VarConditionalReconfig, is fulfilled for the applicable cell; or","paragraph_zero_based":3070},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the condEventId is associated with condEventD1, and if the leaving condition(s) applicable for this event associated with the condReconfigId, i.e. the event corresponding with the condEventId(s) of the corresponding condTriggerConfig within VarConditionalReconfig, is fulfilled for the applicable cell during the corresponding timeToTrigger defined for this event within the VarConditionalReconfig; or","paragraph_zero_based":3071}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5ab8cf1593bf3a6cacb6486006b7add185e374159dfc4dd8e32f1ab40dafd14f","e464e27dd98c8a9f02fb78d1bb718a2986b6ffc9a6cc657b61632ed3689dffa2","3ccf93b29f5a2e0f6e1f627be5f7f425509bd061226641df5695c149b219c00d","22a22b2ff3101c2e54a7f8059b8b32a9d1925e5cfef6977ef6d15494a193c22f","2be38318f41e4115e51d56c7f91dfc5c23262dd36d50479a917f8bd2ae425ef0","7e810dca37ef8064e1ada9cf5f86e8fb61ccd62ec39912b60b0d18c2c4db3620","4c4a904279c12538eaa44ecac768af95655796c8b4e78e3bf873e7bbe044e822","0170e1e2c03d6f2f7c46702c2632f0780aef4356a0ce90259760eb30d77644ac","25ab1e88c86f36147acc158f3564999a4d7d73422db181624d8b995a7beb0b40","c742c65fe30abf7d3f9bc1a228f1c5fe79e69d656dcbc7f55eee0b120ed84458","ab877d992e0afc58670c56855f4407b1ee6e118a8ecbb7fa122dbce9652adfce","e77bc7b9f97f7bb741682d568d6aeee40121407f9dc7c813a1780ef1a42c30aa","45d317c700480dc45c0f0f20e8377c334e3e0701714a181e5cb0582f99c40aba","3c82a211fc74e80f624a734f9b5460e4a7da3666f6a3f7e69f81c3269586bccc","05514a20e35d2a715cb2a3f5a1d6829be8c09a404b347cbc439c32697a8b9fc0","10060402149af4022b001455dfca82c64d673e8dcd0094ef084263c5a2d2e6d7","5bc4b1d538e4ef404633f9ec329401189d1ffa44fcd914ca8b89f9e20b16c2a2","8cd3965cc79d1e92c11a8730f727dc95aafec2d585336eaa20bc2d65a9137363","a2b86bd60fc380b4d23fcea5e1adb746e3eea439ebf7ad42985dcf674eec0e72","1a2675b22479ecaaa98ad3ae7a6b4be6a7c63236563a07b633258791635edb84","0d1080e7410e973617f7b3b9f6a0b097d333eee40438fdb8da28dc67672a9423","1081cf7301e04d03533b469b419d7f26acd7825c812fa3c35034c7fc4b3d3c2a","b359fb96d403eb7fd30f154c4baff1eefaa2770a33c717fec01af5824b3fe330","67369154bd35531bad9792df6bf71630152faa555b334993f0f1c50fdd6acd0a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3048,3071],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3048"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the condEventId is associated with condEventD2, and if the leaving condition(s) applicable for this event associated with the condReconfigId, i.e., the event corresponding with the condEventId(s) of the corresponding condTriggerConfig within VarConditionalReconfig, is fulfilled for the applicable cell during the corresponding timeToTrigger defined for this event within the VarConditionalReconfig; or","paragraph_zero_based":3072},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the condEventId is associated with condEventA3, condEventA4 or condEventA5, and if the leaving condition(s) applicable for this event associated with the condReconfigId, i.e. the event corresponding with the condEventId(s) of the corresponding condTriggerConfig within VarConditionalReconfig, is fulfilled for the applicable cells for all measurements after layer 3 filtering taken during the corresponding timeToTrigger defined for this event within the VarConditionalReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3073},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider the event associated to that measId to be not fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":3074},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3075},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if NES mode indication is received from lower layers, indicating that the NES-specific CHO execution condition is enabled; and","paragraph_zero_based":3076},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the entry condition(s) applicable for this event associated with the condReconfigId, i.e. the event corresponding with the condEventId(s) of the corresponding condTriggerConfig within VarConditionalReconfig, is fulfilled for the applicable cells for all measurements after layer 3 filtering taken during the corresponding timeToTrigger defined for this event within the VarConditionalReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3077},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider the event associated to that measId to be fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":3078},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the measId for this event associated with the condReconfigId has been modified; or","paragraph_zero_based":3079},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if NES mode indication is received from lower layers, indicating that the NES-specific CHO execution condition is disabled; or","paragraph_zero_based":3080},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the leaving condition(s) applicable for this event associated with the condReconfigId, i.e. the event corresponding with the condEventId(s) of the corresponding condTriggerConfig within VarConditionalReconfig, is fulfilled for the applicable cells for all measurements after layer 3 filtering taken during the corresponding timeToTrigger defined for this event within the VarConditionalReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3081},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider the event associated to that measId to be not fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":3082},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if condExecutionCondPSCell is not configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3083},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if event(s) associated to all measId(s) within condTriggerConfig for the applicable cell are fulfilled:","paragraph_zero_based":3084},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the applicable cell, associated to that condReconfigId, as a triggered cell;","paragraph_zero_based":3085},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the conditional reconfiguration execution, as specified in 5.3.5.13.5;","paragraph_zero_based":3086},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3087},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if event(s) associated to all measId(s), as indicated in the condExecutionCond and condExecutionCondPSCell, within condTriggerConfig for a target candidate cell within the stored condRRCReconfig are fulfilled:","paragraph_zero_based":3088},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the target candidate PCell within the stored condRRCReconfig, associated to that condReconfigId, as a triggered PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":3089},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the target candidate PSCell within the stored condRRCReconfig, associated to that condReconfigId, as a triggered PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":3090},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the conditional reconfiguration execution, as specified in 5.3.5.13.5.","paragraph_zero_based":3091},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if one of the events associated to the measIds within condTriggerConfig for the applicable cell within the stored condRRCReconfig is not configured with nesEvent, and the other event associated to the measIds within condTriggerConfig for the applicable cell within the stored condRRCReconfig is configured with nesEvent, and at least one of them is fulfilled:","paragraph_zero_based":3092},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the applicable cell within the stored condRRCReconfig, associated to that condReconfigId, as a triggered cell;","paragraph_zero_based":3093},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the conditional reconfiguration execution, as specified in 5.3.5.13.5;","paragraph_zero_based":3094},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Up to 2 MeasId can be configured for each condReconfigId, if condExecutionCondPSCell is not configured. The conditional reconfiguration event of the 2 MeasId may have the same or different event conditions, triggering quantity, time to trigger, and triggering threshold.","paragraph_zero_based":3095}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7d261ab02417014f4a41a930a68d0eccc64e712c3281abc95b00193a4841f4f4","8df34b1e6c0bb9a80734bba6f427b1842765805a70d356fa7e5c73cc61149f06","2a0bba5cbbfc8e816a1ce177beac745824228d798d19eae905f4fae1eff7d4a7","8ceae268185cc106f225a8be7c72f7aad89a97d3eea1723cb93e681281db114d","6bdb98e5f1d03b86c8223a146d1607a119ed5bef8bc0de48ebef5c018776707a","b71bbcb204899d65af022990176c708b1829d9f6528d631884b5a6d1d3380040","3b851d4f5f348386114444758b0df6de39c1d9b5290af3f500dce97bf6acd693","9aed9353a17f2f8651a237767db0a5d94b2a07f4388c3b6f91eb1faeffad4d69","154ea469d6b73fc9e2e1d58729d52a5faf8ce185d64613f3a156f14b37ebb61a","cc976cfd498777f2a05a8ea3452e8f3ba00c94e220dc6812713d58d73f126960","da26ccc86b055a8ea8ebea08d17c29b57fec0abc62e7adcb9e9eaddf2c6b67ae","3935c5ddb2ac921c4636c5bc18a9414bfc813255698dd9c2aecab28cb9207976","cf282860219e9608d58e3a5256e7ce1c0cd4dfc9c57390042dcaa8a997660928","60b5825acaedb9014098397dca6f4611926f792f410581624685475f3736aa77","004a5e8dfa543931ebfaaec4870ed99de3195585682b63c7cc33e7d52c9cf026","8a75c6440bd52b9ee63fbe7c406416c2e7f077e1fc2430d06ad9c012973f7ca9","61e18ca3dea16e33f9f1720578fb62c90878445092250c46a0c08741054ffe2c","f540d7e9f13170ebb5accb53e8be1d4a81318310a20b72408dc514b404cbbb3f","b6b674c6b45221502d688fef1f48e252214dd816597e4a71bbd104db981b6908","e78c570e235db324f0b1fe81a321038e64f87611aa3b88513a56f859c694ccbd","f3803f150cd90639a0fd4f001fa1f1ec1635b04180fa75ded586259c2fa71d94","23cbf9f5a59680c6ed214619f50430ce0f04184356d7ef5a64fcad7ec17b761c","ace751287895e665fa5097f0d104979c7ded34622c4dbc2f066ac97ba6f875eb","c78d751775f3bd448d0a46e24d57c6979aa99a3ca77a0eb048fe8cb9b6964e56"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3072,3095],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3072"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:Void.","paragraph_zero_based":3096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:For CHO with candidate SCGs, up to 2 MeasId can be configured for condExecutionCond and up to 2 MeasId can be configured for condExecutionCondPSCell for each condReconfigId.","paragraph_zero_based":3097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.13.4aConditional reconfiguration evaluation of SN initiated inter-SN CPC for EN-DC","paragraph_zero_based":3098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each condReconfigurationId within the VarConditionalReconfiguration specified in TS 36.331[10]:","paragraph_zero_based":3100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each measId included in the measIdList within VarMeasConfig indicated in the CondReconfigExecCondSCG contained in the triggerConditionSN associated to the condReconfigurationId as specified in TS 36.331[10]:","paragraph_zero_based":3101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the entry condition(s) applicable for the event associated with that measId, is fulfilled for the applicable cells for all measurements after layer 3 filtering taken during the corresponding timeToTrigger defined for this event associated with that measId:","paragraph_zero_based":3102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider this event to be fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":3103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measId for this event has been modified; or","paragraph_zero_based":3104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the leaving condition(s) applicable for this event associated with that measId, is fulfilled for the applicable cells for all measurements after layer 3 filtering taken during the corresponding timeToTrigger defined for this event associated with that measId:","paragraph_zero_based":3105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider this event associated to that measId to be not fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":3106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if trigger conditions for all events associated with the measId(s) indicated in the CondReconfigExecCondSCG contained in the triggerConditionSN as specified in TS 36.331[10]), are fulfilled:","paragraph_zero_based":3107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the target cell candidate within the RRCReconfiguration message contained in nr-SecondaryCellGroupConfig in the RRCConnectionReconfiguration message, as specified in TS 36.331[10], contained in the stored condReconfigurationToApply, associated to that condReconfigurationId as specified in TS 36.331[10]), clause 5.3.5.9.4, as a triggered cell;","paragraph_zero_based":3108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the conditional reconfiguration execution, as specified in TS 36.331[10]), clause 5.3.5.9.5;","paragraph_zero_based":3109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:Void.","paragraph_zero_based":3110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.13.5Conditional reconfiguration execution","paragraph_zero_based":3111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if more than one pair of triggered PCell and associated triggered PSCell exist:","paragraph_zero_based":3113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>select one of the triggered PCell(s) and the associated triggered PSCell(s) as the selected cells for conditional reconfiguration execution;","paragraph_zero_based":3114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if only one pair of triggered PCell and associated triggered PSCell exists:","paragraph_zero_based":3115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the triggered PCell and the associated triggered PSCell as the selected cells for conditional reconfiguration execution;","paragraph_zero_based":3116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if more than one triggered cell exists:","paragraph_zero_based":3117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>select one of the triggered cells as the selected cell for conditional reconfiguration execution;","paragraph_zero_based":3118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c85acc6b8dfd7aa9a27c720e69aecb84daccb0bebbdc55158cc2562116e77df9","1ab227ef27305d24613f7a82ecdc2876e50cf8afae05a48e9edda8a53a39cb1f","a051471b3eeddbe694171ed0af39be0ad902a5da661755f01d819ecd647e9cb4","daaaeb82f5d3c0f220920c606be685670e51008cc65fc058e74afaa28ccf1e63","69028a34fc811f3d4312094ced31ed4d7ac33c3e66a29b5173691d03dd60e091","5e17b2c22654a0638c7c112b399f333c7f4c7ff1a8cfd5f0ea6e156aae20669d","b8961064036a2e24e8e4d8584f74061d61ff9480651181dc24b89667d8be5367","5af0e5034058c0b7a96f2869161f00f0b35c95cc30f6da2fc10b721692100c1e","2628835fecc532339d3ea4ecbc45b35d097e60889ec59185ff1a826e038fecdc","c6403a6bae9bb7daca67fe6d2f5eaf9cd98a00d1485b5122a8a44fb217970c2e","68bd9ed556666a83c3541a26080ed62486d7d1b767f1cd3d37a87957d07e9757","2fc489a1dc35edb37d371f5c848c40a3849a8f7e5a9656ae5cbb1312855c7e85","02c6c032465554d8bccddde2b4c8bc0ca93255de88bb2cb48f24b8cbc87c783c","2f6ad453be261a4f331f7d92c6e3c553a662f36bc8a46717d1b77aabe2021acd","cd0c08e095c13d24f11fc111d327f5c669ef3806843f0b886fd12889d2f0ea97","8e836239787b226dd955e015ef57c8c445bc55e126f8ad3ba312bdd2ced80144","3ebd797491044324f0ebef2279ace846a84b65915f4cdc1e631c83ff81a5209f","4bacc703e92ff8e34e3959d29527c0df822176d213c4bb705e71afdc8a98c74d","561ccfb865c82729d0d91c7e185f620edd270b274f73522a3e33b8af7040c3ac","76d05b73b4d662366f05bbe04aab7511226e4d960021e80cf029e5cfe2a8abfa","b8c85579d7a26c96a03e87eb342229e1f06b5f52bf88fbb10500bc84dbe30969","112ebf5096ce2e4f22dead0fde337af2f50302a3bb8ff355f7bc47e774933b0e","178abdb22c789022dbcd3932dab403daa8ca859ce4307d74b27fba431793f73f","dcea3dd6f91a8e5d13ef083a704d84fb94402e86df1ffbf88003f963137f45d8"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3096,3119],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3096"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the triggered cell as the selected cell for conditional reconfiguration execution;","paragraph_zero_based":3120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for the selected cell(s) of conditional reconfiguration execution:","paragraph_zero_based":3121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the subsequentCondReconfig is included in the entry in VarConditionalReconfig containing the RRCReconfiguration message for the selected cell:","paragraph_zero_based":3122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.5.13.8;","paragraph_zero_based":3123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the stored condRRCReconfig of the selected cell and perform the actions as specified in 5.3.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":3125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:If multiple NR cells are triggered in conditional reconfiguration execution, it is up to UE implementation which one to select, e.g. the UE considers beams and beam quality to select one of the triggered cells for execution.","paragraph_zero_based":3126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.13.6Subsequent CPAC reference configuration addition/removal","paragraph_zero_based":3127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the scpac-ReferenceConfiguration is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":3129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if scpac-ReferenceConfiguration exists within the VarConditionalReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>replace the scpac-ReferenceConfiguration within the VarConditionalReconfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store the scpac-ReferenceConfiguration within the VarConditionalReconfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else (if scpac-ReferenceConfiguration is set to release):","paragraph_zero_based":3134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove the scpac-ReferenceConfiguration within the VarConditionalReconfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.13.7sk-Counter configuration addition/modification/removal","paragraph_zero_based":3136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each securityCellSetId received in the sk-CounterConfigToAddModList IE:","paragraph_zero_based":3138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if an entry with the matching securityCellSetId exists in the sk-CounterConfigToAddModList within the VarConditionalReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>replace the sk-CounterList within the VarConditionalReconfig with the sk-CounterList according to the received securityCellSetId;","paragraph_zero_based":3140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>add a new entry for this securityCellSetId within the VarConditionalReconfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each securityCellSetId value included in the sk-CounterConfigToRemoveList that is part of the current sk-CounterConfigToAddModList in VarConditionalReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6d361d9b9debaed3faa96cd39db2c38590fa2170b0b6a12e1d020f8d39af7f83","59a69c966f5f194efcec8bc9141653487d51081e232ae822b7dff6b87d64fea9","bf1e2ad6234091192b622d7c7f94cbb806687dd43d8efdf8612d3e3c10753f33","d028a0f11d90be10c3ce46fcf64d16483c5dbd05f8d099c3aa8480be51d91788","ca80b5489acd61e9d6cdad22ed9dba33ff3ae73673e0c5b908d319d442346ce6","46c2704e9bc91665ba68d8565fb1125e2ad78876dbf265f6fc9d8bdda2d2cd0f","9fdb97c517d39f1fb1c2d0e0232dabf18415ed1fe127165be83be6c45112b976","4eee6350547487f18d3d37b5da9a91ec630967c14b47d3c985aa716a4300d9ed","4c5852128865f88b47ffb36247a397e20ced96e9f4fa37e5d2a350ddf158001f","6c55383a6ceb30fa0efc5f241e7ed4f94f0af74ef5e5cedbadf1cc0762d3b6e6","ad7fc099460a64dbd807717e45d4f0582dd16d8a153e5e52b8f85fa18a9c34f0","abc41e9ee5c8dd2c61e68019895f9164e96a809e3bbf220b9df5f13ee940aea6","d9983a7222d61e5be325c4b909ef1d788881eb360f4bc4e8ac1902d9ba193307","416a3f23d618ba3bad1d932daf13df16794824c436d3f0dfb4eefe4392a874a0","008044a95b066ed7949e46ae2851428d3a91f284e6f5131e862c879615ecff3e","34d9fa0985d905ad8b3781066fe70a41630582866a26d3e8aa514e4b31389198","08f4f7882797e39986dfdddb58e0634251f4af1f437f5d99fb0fbfd1ea0697e2","cd57c2f8849323c6357459a92141b9c030a55b525ef59fbb476d482a7aa7f809","d929e0e1b7339fa4c0267e499685b33588541c77d4f9ab2d404065165a882225","442765bf7ba11aa790d9d12e400cdb7e32a26f62426146003c7e95d86c927141","19c7674bbafd8d0620a7e99253cd0f7fc98794e7127a5476989d975f7a6828af","52baef0593c2e967487c266b57f75c1db68cfee174efe12e0e85972932f38c82","f49774f95ad6d894234ce467b81a0289ade6a6046899bd2a77a4b33e5ee790e4","3d6a20c9fe88c5649ea03227d7923fe39251239e17903ada875c7aecc5656e70"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3120,3143],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3120"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove the entry with the matching securityCellSetId from the sk-CounterConfigToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":3144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.13.8Subsequent CPAC execution","paragraph_zero_based":3145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon the conditional reconfiguration execution for subsequent CPAC, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the selected subsequent CPAC candidate configuration is stored in MCG VarConditionalReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release/clear all current dedicated radio configuration except for the following:","paragraph_zero_based":3148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the MCG C-RNTI;","paragraph_zero_based":3149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the AS security configurations associated with the master key and the secondary key;","paragraph_zero_based":3150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-for each SRB/DRB in current UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":3151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-keep the associated RLC, PDCP and SDAP entities, their state variables, buffers and timers;","paragraph_zero_based":3152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-release all fields related to the SRB/DRB configuration except for srb-Identity and drb-Identity;","paragraph_zero_based":3153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE variables VarConditionalReconfig and VarServingSecurityCellSetID.","paragraph_zero_based":3154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release/clear all current common radio configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":3155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release/clear all current dedicated radio configuration associated with the SCG except for the following:","paragraph_zero_based":3157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the AS security configurations associated with the secondary key;","paragraph_zero_based":3158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-for each SRB/DRB in current UE configuration which is using the secondary key:","paragraph_zero_based":3159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-keep the associated RLC, PDCP and SDAP entities, their state variables, buffers and timers;","paragraph_zero_based":3160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-release all fields related to the SRB/DRB configuration except for srb-Identity and drb-Identity;","paragraph_zero_based":3161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE variables VarConditionalReconfig.","paragraph_zero_based":3162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release/clear all current common radio configuration associated with the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":3163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>use the default values specified in 9.2.3 for timers T310, T311 and constants N310, N311 for the cell group for which the subsequent CPAC cell switch procedure is triggered;","paragraph_zero_based":3164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the securityCellSetId is included in the entry in VarConditionalReconfig containing the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":3165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if servingSecurityCellSetId is not included within VarServingSecurityCellSetID; or","paragraph_zero_based":3166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the value of the securityCellSetId is not equal to the value of servingSecurityCellSetId within VarServingSecurityCellSetID:","paragraph_zero_based":3167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["88e25695185f85d1b8274d73df821be5cc66eae69ebbad203bbf51aee74e699e","ff2281fdc6d70b61762580630b5a662b34845a0eff08ec5ad217ef38b8acfe5f","a7c886e0886a43aea98c8c3b71cbb0e539c4380de71b11cf930827f9f3e70bab","d242bb6740027987a3cb00a43adae2403b2b9bedbcade712d03fe6d3ac1d5a5e","91a21f7077556f09705302528e32bf37f405a9f941ea7d4df730e0557c809a9e","2c0dbc83657fef4c2b9c25cc2da27df54c63f77e7f5c61115c459ea568a69c1f","ddc6ebe574eb3d868810fa503df3821f223bbf837e2186046a170fb3ab5d6a7e","2fa8e4ccc1258fefbcd4d3647784032215908c518bbcb307d2367660f18dff4d","299dcf77fca903d1aa11b4b021fd5114acd52a8af5e5d33556f2e417df645298","6572290d73dd5d329dfc7d7eec11313855ac6adbee8b7ebe12df4ec71a50e14c","bd7ce73cb56f181a59e448609804edf8198b6a32ea70d18887c85a567d0ac819","d3ead0b6374b7e401d72d708ead589c285c7c117dbc4716a087d170b4d5655be","9a6fc2c28dd6b35acbf00321efa22a2a668ec44b12641217318afe1caa3a462d","9dba030e27ed6a690e42fb1568d2ca2dfe10f7056469c84ecafcb614c8ece922","b7eae9f1f1b4ca5b25e389afcbd6937c2c7ee2f8f9bc57739d3c5ac3a398ba22","cdaee9eb7ae05b9bd2eb09385eb9c1d1670ddba6a97333aa0a5a3e936580c9f2","a14d6cc368988a77e0f3c6cf51c1b182f9c35a66136e137cc69391e2f5c7878b","cffc42c27ef53f9356c4a061f4623ce8a9c0a9a97702b151f5bc76e253f120ce","bc7c7141855afbd3dd7e99bf8e0e0986096428058dda91f4ac1b17e61072d63c","99dd6229874c5b200158b1234e4479b306f187b0ae2dd7fbc1635183331aa038","4974d1d47d1d20172e3e8ebdf66f0cb64cc3d4035e25000a64a605a5eaa9370f","c2296f0b2c5ff688e4beea03076cd2a1fa05f174cf7136f2e1151cdd41931c01","5a7ece0a6d0cc5e15415f2c351336a8cb5974dcdfefd262121c8e6a8776c1611","7f321657e3fcf988f0f2d9352a49f12dc4d7d251ae421eb914b98566fcf864ed"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3144,3167],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3144"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the first sk-Counter value in the sk-CounterList associated with the securityCellSetId within the VarConditionalReconfig as the selected sk-Counter value, and perform security key update procedure as specified in 5.3.5.7;","paragraph_zero_based":3168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the selected sk-Counter value from the sk-CounterList associated with the securityCellSetId within the VarConditionalReconfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the current VarServingSecurityCellSetID includes servingSecurityCellSetId:","paragraph_zero_based":3170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>replace the value of servingSecurityCellSetId within VarServingSecurityCellSetID with the value of securityCellSetId associated with the selected cell;","paragraph_zero_based":3171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the servingSecurityCellSetId within VarServingSecurityCellSetID with the value of securityCellSetId associated with the selected cell;","paragraph_zero_based":3173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the selected subsequent CPAC candidate configuration is stored in the SCG VarConditionalReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each drb-Identity value included in RadioBearerConfig associated with the secondary key (S-KgNB) as indicated by keyToUse that is part of the current UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":3175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>trigger the PDCP entity of the AM DRB to perform PDCP data recovery as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":3176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>re-establish the corresponding RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4];","paragraph_zero_based":3177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor's Note: FFS how the L2 reset (PDCP re-establishment, PDCP recovery, and RLC re-establishment) is indicated by the network in case of subsequent CPAC.","paragraph_zero_based":3178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each drb-Identity value included in RadioBearerConfig that is part of the current UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":3180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if a different keyToUse value is configured; or","paragraph_zero_based":3181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if a new sk-Counter value has been selected due to the conditional reconfiguration execution for subsequent CPAC:","paragraph_zero_based":3182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>trigger the PDCP entity of the bearer to perform PDCP reestablishment as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":3183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>trigger the PDCP entity of the AM DRB to perform PDCP data recovery as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":3185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>re-establish the corresponding RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4];","paragraph_zero_based":3186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if scpac-ConfigComplete is not included within the VarConditionalReconfig for the selected cell:","paragraph_zero_based":3187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the subsequent CPAC candidate cell configuration is stored in MCG VarConditionalReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider scpac-ReferenceConfiguration in MCG VarConditionalReconfig to be the current UE configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":3189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider scpac-ReferenceConfiguration in SCG VarConditionalReconfig to be the current SCG configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":3191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b1be6d6316a02a174076fa99bbd46ff2ea736940d2044696fa22334bc8f26f04","a4146c909137cde12024c85f43128f22a38c3b79836c94e256cfa8f3b9f7bbc0","fdb4aa1636fda57576c5c276effb727c1c85fb6f8d791927ab783e42ee6d4b9a","f6efd7351d707ff4402fdeabc2a40f0fb1fdc3a25427eb3066fabc6540adc72f","609e063abb585fdcc2ca975112479736ae6c22223ade200b0416b198a2333d35","7dd11bad8a124a4231224438300eee0e3a14ed040b4fad5c408fd119df5b954d","9f9f24cb677dc01335cd886cbd3228f26bde219971298c65f7bdf9b835afdaa9","d67f96eec35f681b270209578f4a95fa07848d94be11824207d8d9aab3662c62","fedf4c65138a5b0e51ca63554accebd7c90e4c3acf8dccbce589c708a2decc9a","e1aae4ebb3ad1343b6e2f76156e7998669234a490a106ee7d8e43790bc47c1ba","cb354821d86d97f5eeca3a0239c06b0c435b76935785dd97b5819c831e1433a8","50640687dfc7a3ebf31c7f9407a7f7976df42f58b11067ee896b29e902d35ada","bc77ee1891b78db680af9887b9165635acfa641d5e7f7e4e3398041a620c22cd","9268e76062f7965c463e8f4899af1ca3d9eb180288ba477682b93e65e18b8361","724c716581829aeb483c428758bb724569ca66f9f7268d94da18806f120ff116","d2e91134753113e3fefcc41dce80344912004b640330f61f5ff9708136cdc06c","eb8609b79fb1f37ebd6ca4f744f592b9f192641a5dab5c14cf21553827b3b0f1","82e5e0e6a08353c279595b73c1cae226d3fd579f1ca1097d00cc224dd5af472b","aa029d0f08787f5f9e24c0ede79e448bdc70d6de1e9994cb51c2ade963b27e24","33f19ec6c5fa7e0d63c0f27b84767f5c35e61125bf6975311a10f207a4a07158","f10ddb06d50a96cb9d944dae850092be4c4976ecc39564b6496bdf158e1a1db9","04cfadf62a03935076f29332dca6f29825f0a6911f3ef6838b32a7f96ef67f84","e6540d41141c8100ed9747841c8c71c74e3b6872d5536d790fad1c0dd97975c4","661b9a0f309f9ce065bb48a402ed91dc395ebdb7e71726dd16d4a646b1bfd8ae"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3168,3191],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3168"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:When the UE considers the reference configuration to be the current UE configuration, the UE should store fields and configurations that are part of the reference configuration but should not execute any actions or procedures triggered by the reception of an RRCReconfiguration message which are described in clause 5.3.5.3.","paragraph_zero_based":3192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>apply the stored condRRCReconfig of the selected cell(s) and perform the actions as specified in 5.3.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":3193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release the radio bearer(s) and the associated logical channel(s) that are part of the current UE configuration but not part of the subsequent CPAC candidate configuration for the selected cell, or the subsequent CPAC reference configuration (in case the subsequent CPAC candidate configuration does not include scpac-ConfigComplete).","paragraph_zero_based":3194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:When scpac-ConfigComplete is not included for the selected cell, before a subsequent CPAC execution, a UE implementation may generate and store an RRC reconfiguration message by applying the received subsequent CPAC candidate configuration on top of the subsequent CPAC reference configuration, and the stored RRC reconfiguration message is applied for subsequent CPAC execution.","paragraph_zero_based":3195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.13aSCG activation","paragraph_zero_based":3196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiating the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is configured with an SCG after receiving the message for which this procedure is initiated:","paragraph_zero_based":3198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE was configured with a deactivated SCG before receiving the message for which this procedure is initiated:","paragraph_zero_based":3199},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the SCG to be activated;","paragraph_zero_based":3200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>resume performing radio link monitoring on the SCG, if previously stopped;","paragraph_zero_based":3201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate to lower layers to resume beam failure detection on the PSCell, if previously stopped;","paragraph_zero_based":3202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate to lower layers that the SCG is activated.","paragraph_zero_based":3203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.13bSCG deactivation","paragraph_zero_based":3204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiating the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the SCG to be deactivated;","paragraph_zero_based":3206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>indicate to lower layers that the SCG is deactivated;","paragraph_zero_based":3207},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if bfd-and-RLM is configured to true:","paragraph_zero_based":3208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform radio link monitoring on the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":3209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate to lower layers to perform beam failure detection on the PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":3210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop radio link monitoring on the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":3212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate to lower layers to stop beam failure detection on the PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":3213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T310 for this cell group, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T312 for this cell group, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3215}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1071c8397d9643309804a3b7c3ab07b5bb0d944ac765b0c1698639869952f85d","9f0879658e743334a80eefbe945beeb3ab1d2c894bcddd1ba79e69f9076c9f07","fcba73f5e176411defae867a813d01b4c4683baa50d893970a502e3fa04529d7","fc26fc43941c42677eeb7ea05dfd6bc8bdc9c7d60b86e0a22186bb436a9921c8","07b8db355e3b4ed8994b5ef3f034bdfe0a532a53826df3bbeb8395ec5fe8fa15","c79ee70a5254f6b233c2e6ba8299b887402c8994904d49643ae304bbdb291fc7","46ecd7caa853ebed35c5fcba859b9fca2526b719dd40ebc762fc929613ba9c4d","08e1d80b53e2b64cb5ac23a4966a9b3a9ed7508904e0818deba83b0eed32edbf","fd3ff23bb08a23478d10c4ed797cb1a975236e0f418357e5edb6914db286b139","038dd8c89545d055d782c8ae0b1959054a53d4e907b26fedb83c3cdf785b7dc9","387e557997a614c775c4c207b1527b6cf9587efac295da20800b58c33ffaa5c9","f4d932868a2ab6c895d71a80976eda52dbc185776b09e69f0c6d9013632504d8","c05357c2dc4faf4074a6ccc810867c68d4baf983aa2b1d4136611e2ff60f1ec1","697533c83fb33ab5e05cf181140d7c1fbd5b08845e721ecd3251df4be7765779","e4e7e6baba333b2b6c3fbc033e2e53f784741c147c92bc0d9c8be68cab3502a4","823f654495609d2086e39bf30f9ec6a06f86e9a97cc06537ef75f4a1a8c35da8","c101d99e42f6430b03144eaa2064e83ce7c471222885f90c9ad316a521fffa8b","533f8adaf3768c2f979acf10a4e30794dc0f2065c6b843681986955f9378a7f5","d8331ee2366adbdc3b8406e5eeb510c0752a9a225369986300481829e3778dd1","41e35761e9bd2049633775d6c8c62fd3d209e2de402754769ce29a1bb92cb4f4","7a6bf93404aa827129593edfdabc8c31b6e874a1cbcbb38c89ff74864fd3c1f9","39ab328126a4ebc69cb8f6cfde411a95ae265f0ec3b3bf301b825c033f00ce70","2ce69d1d7daa23f9b81223e9f321333a623a68e3a8c9510b70c3a7a90f184b21","02de66c33643b5e673c7ab2dcc694d75deeb0ec5ea3563276d9699a954adb979"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3192,3215],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3192"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset the counters N310 and N311;","paragraph_zero_based":3216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE was in RRC_CONNECTED and the SCG was activated before receiving the message for which this procedure is initiated:","paragraph_zero_based":3217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SRB3 was configured before the reception of the RRCReconfiguration or of the RRCConnectionReconfiguration and SRB3 is not to be released according to any RadioBearerConfig included in the RRCReconfiguration or in the RRCConnectionReconfiguration as specified in TS 36.331[10]:","paragraph_zero_based":3218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>trigger the PDCP entity of SRB3 to perform SDU discard as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":3219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>re-establish the RLC entity of SRB3 as specified in TS 38.322 [4].","paragraph_zero_based":3220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.13b1SCG activation without SN message","paragraph_zero_based":3221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiating the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the SCG was deactivated before the reception of the RRCReconfiguration message or the E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration message for which the procedure invoking this clause is executed:","paragraph_zero_based":3223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the SCG to be activated;","paragraph_zero_based":3224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate to lower layers that the SCG is activated;","paragraph_zero_based":3225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>resume performing radio link monitoring on the SCG, if previously stopped;","paragraph_zero_based":3226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate to lower layers to resume beam failure detection on the PSCell, if previously stopped;","paragraph_zero_based":3227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if bfd-and-RLM was not configured to true before the reception of the RRCReconfiguration message or the E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration message for which the procedure invoking this clause is executed; or","paragraph_zero_based":3228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if lower layers indicate that a Random Access procedure is needed for SCG activation:","paragraph_zero_based":3229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the Random Access procedure on the PSCell, as specified in TS 38.321 [3].","paragraph_zero_based":3230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.13cFR2 UL gap configuration","paragraph_zero_based":3231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if ul-GapFR2-Config is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":3233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if an FR2 UL gap configuration is already setup, release the FR2 UL gap configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":3234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>setup the FR2 UL gap configuration indicated by the ul-GapFR2-Config in accordance with the received gapOffset, i.e., the first subframe of each gap occurs at an SFN and subframe meeting the following condition:","paragraph_zero_based":3235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SFN mod T = FLOOR (gapOffset/10);","paragraph_zero_based":3236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"if the UGRP is larger than 5ms:","paragraph_zero_based":3237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subframe = gapOffset mod 10;","paragraph_zero_based":3238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"else:","paragraph_zero_based":3239}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5c8fc8edd8854aeb0d9e791942933167f6d1a9b112ec71b324d996ce5dc94472","4a04222cb58d72a3c59cdb81afc288e4e73a6e4e91800925995502241a4f3fd5","23c956d6597061486e1a6b1235b40fce86f83f405856600bd71c71f7ce0e612b","30dc5d1cc6b86208febeb42733dc22738f10fe32f9bd324dfb2457b25986a885","d7759f84e71d68bc934bf8e03f90e13da6659722e393155a3c53290189b2b7ec","ad3e898b638273d44bb1c8f0f059659ac524cb464173b669a286d768308b43e2","4cb51990589fe281a143bf69b0b2e3ae75ed5e393da03523bc45484eb9c63fa3","66d582e5f47a70731f81fd7c578a292de83849b22489768ae3a32d96a85effe5","fe499fdbab520e28604471c6b5888ad91d3a1da10839c8c11ed9f432056ffed9","50b5e6b38ce524fb79d3010428ff7b672f4b479c07488830c6c758433b575cae","0ec52fca714e9a76367d77ff4026adeb37f3ad1882eabfada923579afd98fe6f","22a199aea48d9b5147e985ae0d4b301ba702a0e14aaa1eb6ef0226c5edf86386","3ad3dc4ced1b56e4583defff813161f8c5ce6d46d04c2f83be12ef00e0d93b70","283757ec2fe620ff12a06d650de753c181d30441d0f46bf200977a909737df0f","0d7da89bc79238d562414cfb307c0d24a5e39bea9709c74e16581c1420e27ba9","f74cddcccd91065aa24651d8b40bf7b1c8ca8b4f2d5b2e12f07e7791bd468039","e623e58662709748006e1171174795727d974c9d029435c2695885d80d7b33c8","080348a53b639054b45ed3f26f0fc3327e218073aa40b3a97c07948584338eee","86e5fd649fd73fde30630aaccddbe1e7b97ae8f94e525ed9573ca67ec428e57b","18efe09b858620ca2ad586ddb83207ab30d129186492142cdf3d5d4124f33e39","2be7eefd07f941ac805fa324d92f66808411588d735355640c9b635a05837667","efa7732db4421c8807f19b8ac59d0e05b228e237abe56e5fd46d79e589cabac6","a60b69f83a14b8b96eb79c113bb8b2c9226c85ce316dd6ddd43be7a49aaf0526","f754c8bb54f8e70a6f1c22e8f6654e540f5368af9bdad9439df5cd739294276a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3216,3239],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3216"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subframe = gapOffset or (gapOffset +5);","paragraph_zero_based":3240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"with T = CEIL(UGRP/10).","paragraph_zero_based":3241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if ul-GapFR2-Config is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":3242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the FR2 UL gap configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":3243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:For ul-GapFR2-Config configuration with synchronous CA, the SFN and subframe of a serving cell on FR2 frequency is used in the gap calculation. For ul-GapFR2-Config configuration with asynchronous CA, the SFN and subframe of a serving cell on FR2 frequency indicated by the refFR2-ServCellAsyncCA in ul-GapFR2-Config is used in the gap calculation.","paragraph_zero_based":3244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.13dApplication layer measurement configuration","paragraph_zero_based":3245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if measConfigAppLayerToReleaseList is included in appLayerMeasConfig within RRCReconfiguration or RRCResume:","paragraph_zero_based":3247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each measConfigAppLayerId value included in the measConfigAppLayerToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>forward the measConfigAppLayerId and inform upper layers about the release of the application layer measurement configuration including any RAN visible application layer measurement configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":3249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>discard any application layer measurement report received from upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":3250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if stored, release the application layer measurement configuration in UE variables VarAppLayerIdleConfig and VarAppLayerPLMN-ListConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to send application layer measurement report for the measConfigAppLayerId.","paragraph_zero_based":3252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if measConfigAppLayerToAddModList is included in appLayerMeasConfig within RRCReconfiguration or RRCResume:","paragraph_zero_based":3253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each measConfigAppLayerId value included in the measConfigAppLayerToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":3254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if measConfigAppLayerContainer is included for the corresponding MeasConfigAppLayer configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":3255},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the measConfigAppLayerContainer, the measConfigAppLayerId and the serviceType to upper layers considering the serviceType;","paragraph_zero_based":3256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to send application layer measurement report for the measConfigAppLayerId in accordance with 5.7.16;","paragraph_zero_based":3257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>forward the transmissionOfSessionStartStop, if configured, and measConfigAppLayerId to upper layers considering the serviceType;","paragraph_zero_based":3258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if ran-VisibleParameters is set to setup and the parameters have been received:","paragraph_zero_based":3259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the measConfigAppLayerId, the ran-VisiblePeriodicity, if configured, the numberOfBufferLevelEntries, if configured, and the reportPlayoutDelayForMediaStartup, if configured, to upper layers considering the serviceType;","paragraph_zero_based":3260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if ran-VisibleParameters is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":3261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the measConfigAppLayerId and inform upper layers about the release of the RAN visible application layer measurement configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":3262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if pauseReporting is set to true:","paragraph_zero_based":3263}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1a2d5549259b593c601f5e3cce08a9465390563c08c26f3bd34f0eb5460f8fe1","c8a04e2afef13e4b7065cdf59bbc29e013ad2bdc581e99b6a37b382512c12aa5","bd7e124a3e83515f9d74b4b4dab0cf1df6871cd3345de4670da960d096cc152f","1632e0fc46f6f78b3bf48f0e2e7d2630d08b660c76c7fef2ee31c12a752e21af","f4a3dc83d1ecbe008b3156f67bcbdff5cdd86daf23c62a2c3a5355ddb4a4f4b4","5ae6059c33ec5526ba3bf19f3c1b1db32263e42f5067cd43766e108df48bed1b","5f0764e96f8edeef542a8423fc3c4758fc082b67ea65718b36f51b1389bdd106","e770020bc6c75fda22ca3b30a1fecdc5263865fe6c4a28a1d6fc1be710b91d89","342a3322e5e664724861a8fbf21dfda12b7ea9e4687b5b3e5609e2b05d79a985","111e800c53ad4f68fafea1b8ce43d2101c06d34ac60a4e458b18ef2bda97512e","1cb1d57340e839a91dbf80ab85c7290e1ab0a7484061b170962ab24766c86e51","80feba90eabb35ab9bdcca3df964718fe98280388271fb7a89abfa80c99f3c05","4f73bf4136c5b917f81abaa5e3379de96e05911146e73606ea1dc1cc07dd175b","fe814a44692eda7b514344a5463707a8e5f64a13e8b240edd8ea07db6fac62d3","c8b5afa6b2497f256f6b46242dd788371b06d8f95ae17d0790b81a0e74095e67","f20e37d1153952a1542e9705d2c4d697691c2002227b125b252b9d3efeef4e87","3ffe88105979b7e13b44a862d149cc624103f8d2e7be6c36256d562ad3cf5e32","edb304df98b20953081c4dc053798cde99bca7d965788652fd2677dc527f6780","b638625c3bfeefc1e47871f5e306974d52be800943a96eb68882f3bc7674d375","aaaa8ca88817554640476249e5c71fb7401dfcc712825504445d5b006e2af2eb","25dc66e98ac085aba3a7efc38d877df83387135f9fd70319247578bb611d1300","839c1b248750ee106ff48cd37c85322a35279a06d66205a9830fe2302b935964","59948e0925bde2687c15bfdfb5acfa0b18c2fc869b3aa88bf91b8c95304e6194","158b1c81f02c5c71e11e63e216c8fcc075359c25dcb1fc0276b441c63bcea8c9"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3240,3263],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3240"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if at least one segment, but not all segments, of a segmented MeasurementReportAppLayer message containing an application layer measurement report associated with the measConfigAppLayerId has been submitted to lower layers for transmission:","paragraph_zero_based":3264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>submit the remaining segments of the MeasurementReportAppLayer message to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":3265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>suspend submitting application layer measurement report containers to lower layers for the application layer measurement configuration associated with the measConfigAppLayerId;","paragraph_zero_based":3266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store any previously or subsequently received application layer measurement report containers associated with the measConfigAppLayerId for which no segment, or full message, has been submitted to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":3267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the memory reserved for storing application layer measurement report containers becomes full while the reporting is paused and if the UE is configured with appLayerMeasPriority:","paragraph_zero_based":3268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>discard reports in priority order where reports with the lowest priority are discarded first;","paragraph_zero_based":3269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if pauseReporting is set to false and if transmission of application layer measurement report containers has previously been suspended for the application layer measurement configuration associated with the measConfigAppLayerId:","paragraph_zero_based":3270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>submit stored application layer measurement report containers to lower layers, if any, for the application layer measurements configuration associated with the measConfigAppLayerId;","paragraph_zero_based":3271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>resume submitting application layer measurement report containers to lower layers for the application layer measurement configuration associated with the measConfigAppLayerId;","paragraph_zero_based":3272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if configForRRC-IdleInactive is set to true:","paragraph_zero_based":3273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received qoe-Reference, measConfigAppLayerId, serviceType, qoe-MeasurementType, qoe-AeaScope, mce-Id, configForRRC-IdleInactive, appLayerMeasPriority, if included, in VarAppLayerIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the qoe-AreaScope includes plmn-IdentityList:","paragraph_zero_based":3275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set plmn-IdentityList in VarAppLayerPLMN-ListConfig to include the RPLMN as well as the PLMNs included in plmn-IdentityList;","paragraph_zero_based":3276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set plmn-IdentityList in VarAppLayerPLMN-ListConfig to include the RPLMN;","paragraph_zero_based":3278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The UE may discard reports when the memory reserved for storing application layer measurement report containers becomes full. If no appLayerMeasPriority is configured, older reports may be discarded first.","paragraph_zero_based":3279},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:The transmission of RAN visible application layer measurement reports and appLayerSessionStatus is not paused when pauseReporting is set to true.","paragraph_zero_based":3280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:The UE may discard an application layer measurement configuration and associated unsent reports after 48 hours.","paragraph_zero_based":3281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor's Note: FFS on when the 48 hours start for when the UE may discard application layer measurement configuration and reports.","paragraph_zero_based":3282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.14Sidelink dedicated configuration","paragraph_zero_based":3283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiating the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-FreqInfoToReleaseList is included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":3285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each entry included in the received sl-FreqInfoToReleaseList that is part of the current UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":3286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the related configurations from the stored NR sidelink communication/discovery configurations;","paragraph_zero_based":3287}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["41b44fd8cc841ee39668891d6be6a374a9a5ad98ab2231c314a384851ff6d710","053220211a1660f455e32db1340cd0afbedd816a19999929913dba828b57b5be","380ced87953f4ccf3964870c418189d3b00d8bc2e1b3303117e07567d82234b0","3af28cd4517f812758c055b84285dc8089d3717a7fa27264a31ee7cf2dbdabe1","17845dcc140f202b87c4bc4beecdfbc99128bceb132cb7e5bad6a0b296052360","5af109eb4eb401565a67e3a1f5a28b55627d9dd69cec45290d71c1ade94c5ab7","7f57b52e6704ba6918cc8e5e620db7c37b02c042859b7c96ec4abb6e3ae7608a","828d142cae9d3b6fea06db03450182ab97139b8c4350414041991e72b15a8228","77da1ef2e5af00522f690a5c3e4420f38ab49a0065ab5f2a8f716e6210a640d6","fb3cac5e1b7288514da5fd82927896783830546f3a4e16d4c6126b04516db09f","3178c74df6af8f742b646af9f8b442f5a8ee2d621643b86e2ecd627a544c63ad","41b81f1b9261ef0653bfe6f87906a186588f2ea4da0edb9ffc547d5a198c3cbc","4f9e4fb66f4118a18c4baee3990790daccc11e9b231443bf73b45cdc5caf6f5d","650ca42b6dcf84bc57cc3efd47000f4b766d071bee0fe1e9186c566a94d77d90","c6a147a3935c7a4dddab13ce94623b8f6625a29da36a08c6db5f53c6793ae6ef","49d324260e1d60637f1a21373bc0a333e7a5f79f29493ee54a743942e6b34d60","17f9cab4f3070023cd979bd0244f1cba30f8626775056117d3d2adbb8850408b","0916bf4466f6ec3dd92f7093990c1274507931887479405d5b0cebdefa039a50","bbd67e9328ed8364f84f2669056135fdd679eeeacaf75f7f04aa27ac076f4b0f","1333e9a6293705101e46e4541308301f26a65a8cd4c43ede7c5265c028381796","8c59c422a8d48e7a4ba83ebd703fafcfbf68d54e560d59b6429e43b2e8bdc2c5","2230ae1f8409fe9b2b9b3f60dcf590e04b808f9c3d027678ae0cc901b551bbb4","3e654ec98f98e2659669615d37f1939a68d980298fce1acef0f074a5af55450e","7fdfd5164e73d028fa732c911857705691b24cf42dc4101433d798d917925f2d"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3264,3287],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3264"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-FreqInfoToAddModList/sl-FreqInfoToAddModListExt is included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":3288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured to receive NR sidelink communication:","paragraph_zero_based":3289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the resource pool(s) indicated by sl-RxPool for NR sidelink communication reception, as specified in 5.8.7;","paragraph_zero_based":3290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured to transmit NR sidelink communication:","paragraph_zero_based":3291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the resource pool(s) indicated by sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal, sl-TxPoolScheduling or sl-TxPoolExceptional for NR sidelink communication transmission, as specified in 5.8.8;","paragraph_zero_based":3292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured to receive NR sidelink discovery:","paragraph_zero_based":3293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the resource pool(s) indicated by sl-DiscRxPool or sl-RxPool for NR sidelink discovery reception, as specified in 5.8.13.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured to transmit NR sidelink discovery:","paragraph_zero_based":3295},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the resource pool(s) indicated by sl-DiscTxPoolSelected, sl-DiscTxPoolScheduling, sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal, sl-TxPoolScheduling or sl-TxPoolExceptional for NR sidelink discovery transmission, as specified in 5.8.13.3;","paragraph_zero_based":3296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured to receive sidelink control information for SL-PRS measurement:","paragraph_zero_based":3297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the resource pool(s) indicated by sl-RxPool and/or sl-PRS-RxPool for SL-PRS reception, as specified in 5.8.18.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured to transmit SL-PRS:","paragraph_zero_based":3299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the resource pool(s) indicated by sl-PRS-TxPoolSelectedNormal, sl-PRS-TxPoolScheduling, sl-BWP-PRS-PoolConfig or sl-PRS-TxPoolExceptional for SL-PRS transmission, as specified in 5.8.18.3;","paragraph_zero_based":3300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform CBR measurement on the transmission resource pool(s) indicated by sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal, sl-TxPoolScheduling, sl-PRS-TxPoolSelectedNormal, sl-PRS-TxPoolScheduling, sl-DiscTxPoolSelected, sl-DiscTxPoolScheduling, sl-TxPoolExceptional or sl-PRS-TxPoolExceptional for NR sidelink communication/discovery/positioning transmission, as specified in 5.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":3301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>use the synchronization configuration parameters for NR sidelink communication/discovery/positioning on frequencies included in sl-FreqInfoToAddModList/sl-FreqInfoToAddModListExt, as specified in 5.8.5;","paragraph_zero_based":3302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-RadioBearerToReleaseList or sl-RLC-BearerToReleaseList is included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":3303},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform sidelink DRB release as specified in 5.8.9.1a.1;","paragraph_zero_based":3304},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-RLC-BearerToReleaseListSizeExt is included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":3305},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform additional sidelink RLC bearer release as specified in 5.8.9.1a.5;","paragraph_zero_based":3306},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-RadioBearerToAddModList or sl-RLC-BearerToAddModList is included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":3307},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform sidelink DRB addition/modification as specified in 5.8.9.1a.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-RLC-BearerToAddModListSizeExt is included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":3309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform additional sidelink RLC bearer addition/modification as specified in 5.8.9.1a.6;","paragraph_zero_based":3310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-ScheduledConfig is included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":3311}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["344a423c9e18929e6730e9cbaa385fc2bcf1b63639b5c26f3aa753f0f5d4f3c7","710745591be358528434e7d9bf6654ae73d256c829cd9aed94b23022199fbca9","ee8d9b87482e32a1e2a1c1801af0960d9e5f17ed37b719e5b4d66ece04f71f59","f6341844b783702f45cece8c673b1f933ea9ab09cd4cc2e732bd9e286c683e7a","50eb3b6dbe3b788584d1d0c32fc09496fe6cc562693e833e639b4ea8473c632d","9ac92b73ae367dca53ce683b798fae5678dfd5a508de9b89f539fe4763b7dc7b","a84ebf67d874117e4b13698a6d291e5334c73ddd6073cee325e12636fb7ad18b","3b84bd745949ee46b879bf12e8ec58258aa3c96ba53aaa268851fee1dc421c22","26a6a83d7dc24df1386928e586912b81e8d5716ff2bff2ee954f0817a27a9a38","b0f8f9e61f2a54a9d7d41f97aff87dc0d7ec420d91b63790b7d55f2fc7548967","699d498e58c6f51f82e88501fdd60a3d8bcea8c3085ef90c5ea5fc7e47baf1ee","c82b073ed4eebc2a04e7bb9fbe35b02b457617392c6a33a97aa662e86ca6b474","3e841f417922bbf10eeda5c4c18193c5b417e8c6284987a98b10cb7fccb342c0","dd65361e66722dd23b5dd96cce7fa9c86e6b891ba8a59aeb97711a91bd931ed6","8567cf7b25f3a6adcbcfee8e40d6e4d93efc3dee5829266133d1b02b8ce6ef82","ee6882f627e3000002fc8650512214916c3a3947e6bd1042a2553f32bd192026","79d4b920f8583a1892751503b74ce986a15102734814998082a37a7bafe9019d","2c42c62f53c6786f1efb6867fbefaaea60cdc18b63b09f80541a2ae8bbcc8fce","fb633354f4767a5a8448c446e36c1f8cbee206d8afdac6caad9d25efd017d267","9fe6aaea13456e46d65afdb461c015f4c7b294b3af993fe6676a1cb3cfb0b413","29a9f9670b8f6ada5bc49007c9de4104b1888e1e4bce8c0737420893160d9c61","b2ee21449a3343f4a912ff79b88217fe4c3004e2b50dc64575de4df71c51875e","d6f3007184b2401588fbcc95489164cc5a20fd13420e2efb38e855c4d101b260","a061e01733fe40566b656c0ca347d420d77cf42c52ab1fb9ec7e527298cf48a4"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3288,3311],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3288"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure the MAC entity parameters, which are to be used for NR sidelink communication/discovery, in accordance with the received sl-ScheduledConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-UE-SelectedConfig is included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":3313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure the parameters, which are to be used for NR sidelink communication/discovery, in accordance with the received sl-UE-SelectedConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-MeasConfigInfoToReleaseList is included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":3315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SL-DestinationIndex included in the received sl-MeasConfigInfoToReleaseList that is part of the current UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":3316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the entry with the matching SL-DestinationIndex from the stored NR sidelink measurement configuration information;","paragraph_zero_based":3317},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-MeasConfigInfoToAddModList is included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":3318},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sl-DestinationIndex included in the received sl-MeasConfigInfoToAddModList that is part of the current stored NR sidelink measurement configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":3319},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the entry according to the value received for this sl-DestinationIndex from the stored NR sidelink measurement configuration information;","paragraph_zero_based":3320},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sl-DestinationIndex included in the received sl-MeasConfigInfoToAddModList that is not part of the current stored NR sidelink measurement configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":3321},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>add a new entry for this sl-DestinationIndex to the stored NR sidelink measurement configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":3322},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The UE is expected to update the mapping between the Destination Layer-2 ID and the destination index for the stored NR sidelink measurement configuration after the UE updates the destination list and reports to the gNB.","paragraph_zero_based":3323},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-DRX-ConfigUC-ToReleaseList is included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":3324},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SL-DestinationIndex included in the received sl-DRX-ConfigUC-ToReleaseList that is part of the current UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":3325},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the entry with the matching SL-DestinationIndex from the stored NR sidelink DRX configuration information;","paragraph_zero_based":3326},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-DRX-ConfigUC-ToAddModList is included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":3327},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sl-DestinationIndex included in the received sl-DRX-ConfigUC-ToAddModList that is part of the current stored NR sidelink DRX configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":3328},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the entry according to the value received for this sl-DestinationIndex from the stored NR sidelink DRX configuration information;","paragraph_zero_based":3329},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sl-DestinationIndex included in the received sl-DRX-ConfigUC-ToAddModList that is not part of the current stored NR sidelink DRX configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":3330},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>add a new entry for this sl-DestinationIndex to the stored NR sidelink DRX configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":3331},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:The UE is expected to update the mapping between the Destination Layer-2 ID and the destination index for the stored NR sidelink DRX configuration after the UE updates the destination list and reports to the gNB.","paragraph_zero_based":3332},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-RLC-ChannelToReleaseList is included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":3333},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform PC5 Relay RLC channel release as specified in 5.8.9.7.1;","paragraph_zero_based":3334},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-RLC-ChannelToAddModList is included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration or RRCSetup:","paragraph_zero_based":3335}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d7402ac51bf8ee3689a1108971af4da30d95a9da8f525464e3af1b5f17e1a850","ce62fcfea3fbca84012271ece0d3cdbe62eceb75e8c6b230e55ff93bf07d9916","341bb4f0875b4380492a8de695475937cec002ea9cf1f7f0c8213898002d81ef","39ac888cbc00df979fc410c5b4cd00ac4a539a6e40c50df6e1670f4fa832701f","c090be66601f91ecef8fda62934804030c3dcbac7b3d1ae4bcc16199790b9b84","a229f8ead4a2ad9730253115c876a66918252c65f3c9dd138ecc34ab14aa5bdf","336b84c3cb7cc7722667f520b6dd9932622e93e0c0fc4c85d7f0c18ac8b4686c","5b7a1a0ddfbf49a2ba319cea6b3bbd87251e154614aba744756dd3b2b19eb79f","edb550060997fd5785996db86758d5d7f29b891cf8afe59a59dbb938a7a2d76e","99d2a7318f8d6334e4f018ba8cde6c15337f83739497a6fc5361359caf762b69","67669eb2a086fb1adce9c5d56fbbd6cd7a2ffe6c7e18e2c6b9f1b13a827bcd71","50f5606061574061b98a713b7923c1b369c2aeab5220224012a5a86a538559e2","8daa63a15ce45990b3ca176190b76b1d3e1f069785aca24283a52639623b16b3","2eafc20ec3ffae5749a81a31a9a284a7e11f344b0c7d2d8e8f5b0da16284e52d","dc13ee96f41d9d9ddb1041ce9781aaa9d675dcf86e81cb60b70e739dbc49965c","cff00974e97ad7c156eb9dfe27398b73bedb80c37f0c10d34218886cc2602541","b05549760dfe304a49ede1f711e80701f40f00bc38a9c00c0eeacad0ec1f508b","026b715ec044d550b4f5815dc15ad9906b2a396c4f04b9b57b10404d8178eed6","39ad08693ea6e94adfec6bc4c5233341fe26db7cba08eddf6a3f3f30cbde7118","f4a1faa35518c2503f70765a73a87f422bcfd4342439f09103c9ce6facccaf16","67fdf5602371cfc0f416ed177bd71cb275082e08604ed6d4fda39958bf364bec","c65a1f0a31d349750c26814507a1776fd370b498fddccc9603e8e45a1a105c64","c8897d72dc8e285654ab387ecb7ac08ee073b02fbbce6aebfcd2df995583ce88","30a48b7571c7cdf054df758207e778cd00c0fa7cc98acb086818171e95ece201"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3312,3335],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3312"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification as specified in 5.8.9.7.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3336},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.15L2 U2N or U2U Relay UE configuration","paragraph_zero_based":3337},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.15.1General","paragraph_zero_based":3338},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network configures the L2 U2N or U2U Relay UE with relay operation related configurations. For each connected L2 U2N or U2U Remote UE indicated in sl-L2IdentityRemote, the network provides the configuration parameters used for relaying.","paragraph_zero_based":3339},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3340},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-L2RelayUE-Config is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":3341},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-L2RelayUE-Config contains the sl-RemoteUE-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3342},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the L2 U2N Remote UE release as specified in 5.3.5.15.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3343},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-L2RelayUE-Config contains the sl-RemoteUE-ToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":3344},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the L2 U2N Remote UE addition/modification as specified in 5.3.5.15.3;","paragraph_zero_based":3345},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if sl-L2RelayUE-Config is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":3346},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the relay operation related configurations.","paragraph_zero_based":3347},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2U Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3348},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-L2RelayUE-Config is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":3349},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-L2RelayUE-Config contains the sl-U2U-RemoteUE-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3350},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the L2 U2U Remote UE release as specified in 5.3.5.15.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3351},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-L2RelayUE-Config contains the sl-U2U-RemoteUE-ToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":3352},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the L2 U2U Remote UE addition/modification as specified in 5.3.5.15.3;","paragraph_zero_based":3353},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if sl-L2RelayUE-Config is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":3354},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the related configurations.","paragraph_zero_based":3355},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.15.2L2 U2N or U2U Remote UE Release","paragraph_zero_based":3356},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3357},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the release is triggered by reception of the sl-RemoteUE-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3358},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SL-DestinationIdentity value included in the sl-RemoteUE-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3359}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a29d9673541a21b4fde55d25046c39a5ca2d1abc84628c06480093a13fa8cc3a","4aa57d651882cce58cffec33c78d2a8a485ccb2379cb540d614052d1bd53e196","421baa8acc5919831aedb94fe554503c88e292bf2f3fcfa81963f4d98c07c045","d53b1e4b2bf869d811897ef28456da464f5a189c4993c9fca54322a49ce0c8e6","8af18cfb911156f36752ff955e8065cbe869b7c19d31188e7a809d8996b20dea","793b6ccdf709c24f58b9042300f0cac13e88b1e1f995f6445a1f419a807ccb65","3936140d453b807f418262d0dd428bc32cd08e12a4