{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the current UE has a PC5 RRC connection to a L2 U2N Remote UE with SL-DestinationIdentity:","paragraph_zero_based":3360},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release.","paragraph_zero_based":3361},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2U Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3362},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the release is triggered by reception of the sl-U2U-RemoteUE-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3363},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SL-DestinationIdentity value included in the sl-U2U-RemoteUE-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3364},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the configuration associated with the L2 U2U Remote UE.","paragraph_zero_based":3365},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.15.3L2 U2N or U2U Remote UE Addition/Modification","paragraph_zero_based":3366},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3367},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if no SRAP entity has been established:","paragraph_zero_based":3368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish a SRAP entity as specified in TS 38.351 [66];","paragraph_zero_based":3369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sl-L2IdentityRemote value included in the sl-RemoteUE-ToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration (L2 U2N Remote UE Addition):","paragraph_zero_based":3370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure the parameters to SRAP entity in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigRelay;","paragraph_zero_based":3371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SRB1 is included in sl-MappingToAddModList, and sl-EgressRLC-ChannelPC5 is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release SL-RLC1, if established;","paragraph_zero_based":3373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>associate the PC5 Relay RLC channel as indicated by sl-EgressRLC-ChannelPC5 with SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":3374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else: (i.e. SRB1 is not included in sl-MappingToAddModList, or SRB1 is included in sl-MappingToAddModList, but sl-EgressRLC-ChannelPC5 is not configured)","paragraph_zero_based":3375},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SL-RLC1 is not established:","paragraph_zero_based":3376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the default configuration of SL-RLC1 as specified in clause 9.2.4 and associate it with the SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":3377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sl-L2IdentityRemote value included in the sl-RemoteUE-ToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration (L2 U2N Remote UE modification):","paragraph_zero_based":3378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>modify the configuration in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigRelay;","paragraph_zero_based":3379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2U Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if no SRAP entity has been established:","paragraph_zero_based":3381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish a SRAP entity as specified in TS 38.351 [66];","paragraph_zero_based":3382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each target L2 U2U Remote UE indicated in sl-L2IdentityRemote value included in the sl-U2U-RemoteUE-ToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration (target L2 U2U Remote UE Addition):","paragraph_zero_based":3383}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["98c35364e6c705b766a46da1ce283112735723144277052372e8