{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each source L2 U2U Remote UE indicated in sl-SourceUE-Identity in accordance with one entry of the sl-SourceRemoteUE-ToAddModList, configure the parameters to SRAP entity in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigU2U;","paragraph_zero_based":3384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each target L2 U2U Remote UE indicated in sl-L2IdentityRemote value included in the sl-U2U-RemoteUE-ToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration (target L2 U2U Remote UE modification):","paragraph_zero_based":3385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each source L2 U2U Remote UE indicated in sl-SourceUE-Identity included in the sl-SourceRemoteUE-ToReleaseList (source L2 U2U Remote UE Release):","paragraph_zero_based":3386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the configuration associated with the source L2 U2U Remote UE;","paragraph_zero_based":3387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the source L2 U2U Remote UE indicated in sl-SourceUE-Identity included in the sl-SourceRemoteUE-ToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration (source L2 U2U Remote UE Addition):","paragraph_zero_based":3388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the parameters to SRAP entity in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigU2U;","paragraph_zero_based":3389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the source L2 U2U Remote UE indicated in sl-SourceUE-Identity included in the sl-SourceRemoteUE-ToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration (source L2 U2U Remote UE modification):","paragraph_zero_based":3390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>modify the configuration in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigU2U;","paragraph_zero_based":3391},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.16L2 U2N or U2U Remote UE configuration","paragraph_zero_based":3392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network configures the L2 U2N or U2U Remote UE with relay operation related configurations, e.g. SRAP configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":3393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-L2RemoteUE-Config is set to setup or received from RRCSetup message:","paragraph_zero_based":3395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-L2RemoteUE-Config contains the sl-SRAP-ConfigRemote:","paragraph_zero_based":3396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if no SRAP entity has been established:","paragraph_zero_based":3397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>establish a SRAP entity as specified in TS 38.351 [66];","paragraph_zero_based":3398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the parameters to SRAP entity in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigRemote;","paragraph_zero_based":3399},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SRB1 is included in sl-MappingToAddModList, and sl-EgressRLC-ChannelPC5 is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release SL-RLC1, if established;","paragraph_zero_based":3401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> associate the PC5 Relay RLC channel as indicated by sl-EgressRLC-ChannelPC5 with SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":3402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else: (i.e. SRB1 is not included in sl-MappingToAddModList, or SRB1 is included in sl-MappingToAddModList, but sl-EgressRLC-ChannelPC5 is not configured)","paragraph_zero_based":3403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if SL-RLC1 is not established:","paragraph_zero_based":3404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the default configuration of SL-RLC1 as specified in clause 9.2.4 and associate it with the SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":3405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-L2RemoteUE-Config contains the sl-UEIdentityRemote:","paragraph_zero_based":3406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the value of the sl-UEIdentityRemote as the C-RNTI in the PCell.","paragraph_zero_based":3407}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["594a6f9ce61ce2329f14c6777882ce06d600525730e7830c14178f5f6d5c6598","d17239ba94353583fb55d7ae18515be4b6fe22bee4d53731bb5d6868b1c68835","64fe6794cc383592e4a53d3105bd73e8217946c1cc12bb01169acf04a9c93579","e6ff237684b1d81483ac4fc7f05d0a46f73b8e29578d289f9cf44f2955626cc9","8cab60215501ba1bfbb5e2c4852c955a3b0aaa022adc1f9b99338e224c9a3b03","9c2c01fc3df8608424bff174a0e7d5f2551a62740b5559a6f77f96fc9aa77e64","186d1a479cb4a896959cde451f520953f7b0125744813cf7c12d2de969355a4a","6887d706f046ae3c68db18f8189d70b678162070b5e8ff0df6ede84c542515ee","9f40fb6c427c033ceda4821e1f484161a9dfcb6394df008068ca5de85886372a","6eb919de1cbc1d16643fff4d088466d37970b8e5510ef5ffd141a98ce5e70dcc","09141f0d264c6a3073c5c3a4eea0da0c28800a4ed438e8d753c369bc2f87aa55","06d2dc285280a5a7e23a62d57bc916fcc8bc04b49b78f68b6abf8913b22dd112","66f0b0f19b517f2fb3f6345ab9b37c747c206d25d2908265a19de2679612b5ea","e29f86e284cd2fb3d1fa8f97d31a33e7ecb42518dedaeea0ada1b22af7b902b0","bb8e4d4cbad9e6f5864ba96d9c3d05ccdd0d5ccff506d27c636e3521bcb7172d","e31434e4d109bf488b3fb6b34f93b14494e946b7c823d5c2db60881381624510","04b08e00102a646e207c38da35ea006d86ee632d1617b46008c4bb5407ee79ad","a3779f7b6642005eb6b2421e78556f2d8987227e921ea12c50ae8788b91c09dc","ce72105dd388c684820cd057d791f81d49540ac7c672e7bd50f1cf0322e228c4","ff14aea3d4409fffe2bae4968a752cb20910c71b9f3c943d0113efe827ad8829","eb9ffda099fdaa5c67c4209803dc9438e78e3df6e58e1bcbbe2837e51a04e9c6","666faa088b4462f68654340d36cc1b58eeab5ff86339a6292c3925730cfeef9f","ce1815ce8bb97634746121bf412e68baf938a21d5eca03220687a1b595f6ead0","df85bba065830ec9277dee5c77186acf263efd0f4b17fe7c16a