{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if sl-L2RemoteUE-Config is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":3408},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the relay operation related configurations.","paragraph_zero_based":3409},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2U Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3410},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-L2RemoteUE-Config is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":3411},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-L2RemoteUE-Config contains the sl-U2U-RelayUE-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3412},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the L2 U2U Relay UE release as specified in 5.3.5.16.1;","paragraph_zero_based":3413},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-L2RemoteUE-Config contains the sl-U2U-RelayUE-ToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":3414},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the L2 U2U Relay UE addition/modification as specified in 5.3.5.16.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3415},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if sl-L2RemoteUE-Config is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":3416},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the related configurations.","paragraph_zero_based":3417},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.16.1L2 U2U Relay UE Release","paragraph_zero_based":3418},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2U Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3419},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the release is triggered by reception of the sl-U2U-RelayUE-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3420},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SL-DestinationIdentity value included in the sl-U2U-RelayUE-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3421},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the configuration associated with the L2 U2U Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":3422},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.16.2L2 U2U Relay UE Addition/Modification","paragraph_zero_based":3423},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2U Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3424},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if no SRAP entity has been established:","paragraph_zero_based":3425},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish a SRAP entity as specified in TS 38.351 [66];","paragraph_zero_based":3426},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each L2 U2U Relay UE indicated in sl-L2IdentityRelay value included in the sl-U2U-RelayUE-ToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration (L2 U2U Relay UE Addition):","paragraph_zero_based":3427},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for peer target L2 U2U Remote UE indicated in sl-TargetUE-Identity in accordance with one entry of the SL-PeerRemoteUE-ToAddModList, configure the parameters to SRAP entity in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigU2U;","paragraph_zero_based":3428},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each L2 U2U Relay UE indicated in sl-L2IdentityRelay value included in the sl-U2U-RelayUE-ToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration (L2 U2U Relay UE modification):","paragraph_zero_based":3429},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each peer target L2 U2U Remote UE included in the sl-PeerRemoteUE-ToReleaseList (peer target L2 U2U Remote UE Release):","paragraph_zero_based":3430},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the configuration associated with the peer target L2 U2U Remote UE;","paragraph_zero_based":3431}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3b33473de5a0d07d3aad9ee9abb158ad8ca2d538a2334bd150635e0bb714aafa","f2fa8d0ce48fa93b30bd6ba85fdcf980c23edd165f88beba28a7b91925bf3c8b","ec2c3bc66deb2c1726715c1817366727b41ffbe3190e6365d1af454edbee838d","ca94e7adc61d9bfda1873ef7b5f3744e38e8343b3247f06e48c6dc02463f3f71","2aeb7104408dda584f3778c2029a09f5d280f28539b1aa8f374c7f8f5f015016","a6c27b2866914755c01433d76f7379042af5319f992e927294ea0cf4753942da","20d9c4e4f1c07c7586f8d7504d2baaffeb11a3f68539d248dd4a7a3ded47060d","e2efae23b365fc93a579614b4a8a97d93acf99d296af82cf89c1b731e3cc27ef","dbda705724581443e715d6c5802342dcb655e5ae9a101e2df58acc275fbe0bc8","730d6a3aa863de6c10cfa2b53217eb6474f47140b1dbe6da8714cad89a74dcbc","1ebebceb83eeda339425f14c79e56db5881230a3d795b3443ebe111636747f1b","46462a0e2d61f4ccf574ced73041777569e0f17a12bc64152bf81ecc88b5c9fd","feb179b861e9d1286e73ab06f71d7e5d6d96313450b2ab690e8e96ada13c7577","5c4198740acb9197bcc38d5f72ebb93564b35f9a1198a5c83dd423cc9a296f98","bf8a071a51e30f9dde6848c8bce19694e9d4a3f840495fe0175f78f28313f9ea","a07866328d3fdedcd158469da2ed1eda0ef35fe36cf94d2486c2f2d0418cce8a","e1b1ed2b8cbc3ce113c95578bcaf9f59dee6a8880bf975b265d8281b23d319a9","777aba943f4a38f67f05620b6f494eef6b192a87199306b9244ebf22362a631e","c6612702a24075ae5ab74a24eaef2a3c63efa998857435a987fe25a1304f2f93","08965597180b043d9873d71f06bcd2de60f00baba337c60b6c475634312e36db","93824798cbb379bd58da27c3479d6b731165dc691ee2b722861884109eaa15aa","1d71f2a4be1156cd445b6a6348d59f0d1fcfbc7b8b4de7ac34148147520c015f","c246e647e02f54dc57fa453db577472ae4fe8e24b1b473d38dd7d0d5f6c3be01","2baa1d914f9a5742e37a79e4860e8af83f8e7986252386aa6b56ee425c04a328"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3408,3431],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3408"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the peer target L2 U2U Remote UE indicated in sl-TargetUE-Identity included in the sl-PeerTargetRemoteUE-ToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration (peer target L2 U2U Remote UE Addition):","paragraph_zero_based":3432},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the parameters to SRAP entity in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigU2U;","paragraph_zero_based":3433},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the peer target L2 U2U Remote UE indicated in sl-TargetUE-Identity included in the sl-PeerTargetRemoteUE-ToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration (peer target L2 U2U Remote UE modification):","paragraph_zero_based":3434},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>modify the configuration in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigU2U;","paragraph_zero_based":3435},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17MP configuration","paragraph_zero_based":3436},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.1Introduction","paragraph_zero_based":3437},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In case of MP, a MP remote UE is configured with one direct path (i.e. MCG) and one indirect path. The MP remote UE connects to network on the direct path using NR Uu, and connects to network on the indirect path via a MP relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":3438},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"On indirect path, for the hop between the MP remote UE and the MP relay UE, when the MP remote UE connects to a L2 U2N Relay UE, i.e. the MP remote UE is acting as a L2 U2N Remote UE, the network provides the configuration of SL indirect path to the MP remote UE and the L2 U2N Relay UE as specified in 5.3.5.17.2; when the MP remote UE connects to a N3C relay UE using non-3GPP connection, the network provides the configuration of N3C indirect path to the MP remote UE and the N3C relay UE as specified in 5.3.5.17.3.","paragraph_zero_based":3439},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.2Configuration of SL indirect path","paragraph_zero_based":3440},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.2.1General","paragraph_zero_based":3441},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For SL indirect path:","paragraph_zero_based":3442},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the L2 U2N Remote UE is provided with sidelink dedicated configuration as specified in 5.3.5.14, L2 U2N Remote UE configuration as specified in 5.3.5.16, and SL indirect path specific configuration as specified in 5.3.5.17.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3443},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the L2 U2N Relay UE is provided with sidelink dedicated configuration as specified in 5.3.5.14, L2 U2N Relay UE configuration as specified in 5.3.5.15, as well as Uu Relay RLC channel configuration as specified in 5.3.5.5.12 and 5.3.5.5.13.","paragraph_zero_based":3444},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.2.2SL indirect path specific configuration","paragraph_zero_based":3445},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3446},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-IndirectPathAddChange is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":3447},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the UE indicated by the sl-IndirectPathRelayUE-Identity to be the (target) L2 U2N Relay UE and indicate to upper layer to trigger the PC5 unicast link establishment with the L2 U2N Relay UE;","paragraph_zero_based":3448},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start timer T421 for the corresponding L2 U2N Relay UE with the timer value set to T421;","paragraph_zero_based":3449},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate to upper layer (to trigger the PC5 unicast link release) with the source L2 U2N Relay UE in case of SL indirect path change (i.e. a new L2 U2N Relay UE is indicated via sl-IndirectPathRelayUE-Identity);","paragraph_zero_based":3450},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if sl-IndirectPathAddChange is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":3451},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the SL indirect path is released and release the corresponding configurations;","paragraph_zero_based":3452},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate to upper layer (to trigger the PC5 unicast link release) with the L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":3453},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.2.3T421 expiry (Indirect path addition/change failure)","paragraph_zero_based":3454},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3455}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ec8a9ae018eaa1b08fe07717e75fc0c0275de6ccad0a87774c2f99e89f586824","eb33c18ffcb261b75d454fa9189a3260d31e63da5591f7c8f136f977175a037f","d24e6922c1cd38f231f2cba8c0c7135c3508b76f6eb3969e8fab9648b4ec44cf","5be1954fe44f5367436ab23f6c8a719a871dd26d29ce89fdd638ec07e13e04ef","5814f9abca18d1b97680ebef1327d0c4dc3ceacf91594e4c7108592b7ff883ea","73734e7972a40a209a50fb16238536d9ee381238c9b2e0983eefab7cb42f9e36","029a4ec381bb1589a30d482d3defca075d49592e3fc863b72e90ac43df0af9fd","58f140487801610e83c7d5a1e0675fabeda8bf5e9cfbac7bb02602cdea9372ff","5f74ff03b000ccd6fdc540d83a2f75407011e61c2d8874fc8d89453b7b832c3b","53d847178b770cca4b9c4e9e5fe04e7de7053e6d76231e9a424fd7493fb0125b","827d614ad925c2bddc9d00e8649928b72207c0dbca30faea2b0b9a2c26b8dba2","14bfa65d7d7cc78a811f74a03bc7e876c554c2f5722d915a328cae7dd3c4b781","0532bcb5d15ced497dd0d4fdf2e52f7835a5036ef906a8833a31960449d28657","0befae9b706e690a6058a6fdbc2797a5113727298af707f282af0459de80825b","18e28b5ac11a7a77778b5ff0b5243ff59686f378d9f448cb032a245ed97b39b4","09080203102d25b3a998d389dd098675773004ee3e1d64b2abd352ede046480b","11a85fb93116e773f98db82e05b130b9c508ebeda3fc4ab1021a96d1ad4335d1","b74ec96e98d23dfd6ef240aa99fb28bb479f4d2fff1daec6951b1f0337f4af6e","8fffd668c5c15525e1af887d489c5aac3d566ecdb26c68091b0503ba6c78b54a","7a24da0499d0474d1aeabeae0e05a3bce258afe03d9e7653849ece25c45df725","34ea87d92ca418cc654618f6defe3a2e580943a7ce0e93d6826baf8ec4ad6597","c462f58843097caf2ada3fbae8dd8be219904dcb393f5423779148755af67c63","5c2f1b9e854ec1da32241086ccdcbdae2d3ced286db7de0a14924826751016ba","9cff08fef66698911faf049a370993cf097efa146c7be1730deadb690d471e02"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3432,3455],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3432"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> if T421 expires; or","paragraph_zero_based":3456},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> if the (target) L2 U2N Relay UE (i.e., the UE indicated by sl-IndirectPathRelayUE-Identity in the received sl-IndirectPathAddChange) changes its serving PCell to a different cell from the target cell (i.e. the cell indicated by sl-IndirectPathCellIdentity in the received sl-IndirectPathAddChange) before path addition or change:","paragraph_zero_based":3457},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if MCG transmission is not suspended:","paragraph_zero_based":3458},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the indirect path failure information procedure as specified in clause 5.7.3c to report indirect path addition/change failure;","paragraph_zero_based":3459},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3460},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the connection re-establishment procedure as specified in clause 5.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":3461},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.3Configuration of N3C indirect path","paragraph_zero_based":3462},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.3.1General","paragraph_zero_based":3463},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For N3C indirect path,","paragraph_zero_based":3464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the N3C remote UE is provided with N3C indirect path configuration including relay UE identification as specified in 5.3.5.17.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the N3C relay UE is provided with N3C indirect path configuration including bearer mapping configurations as specified in 5.3.5.17.3.4, as well as Uu Relay RLC channel configuration as specified in 5.3.5.5.12 and 5.3.5.5.13.","paragraph_zero_based":3466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE: The data transmission/reception between the N3C remote UE and the N3C relay UE via the non-3GPP connection is outside the scope of 3GPP.","paragraph_zero_based":3467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.3.2N3C remote UE configuration","paragraph_zero_based":3468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The N3C remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if n3c-IndirectPathAddChange is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":3470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the non-3GPP connection with the relay UE indicated by the n3c-RelayIdentification to be used for the N3C indirect path;","paragraph_zero_based":3471},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the source non-3GPP connection is not to be used in case of N3C indirect path change (i.e. a new relay UE is indicated by the n3c-RelayIdentification);","paragraph_zero_based":3472},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if n3c-IndirectPathAddChange is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":3473},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the indirect path is not to be used and release the corresponding configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":3474},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor's Note: whether T421 is applicable to scenario 2.","paragraph_zero_based":3475},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.3.3N3C relay UE configuration","paragraph_zero_based":3476},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The N3C relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3477},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if n3c-IndirectPathConfigRelay is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":3478},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if n3c-MappingToReleaseList is included:","paragraph_zero_based":3479}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["be582c11f6a16b9e686f1eb12f085c03921fe709b72719e002497a31d829f47e","70cb4895bacd38b289d34790346d0e2b4dcc324d0d03fd4ae14047021ed426fe","fa7cae4b7e3b43bf49c264cf2da3db8400e040005ffb51a3c68e202a5c83080b","77a42c47527377f35d36241c6b21f5b9746e17ceaf3936b125da1112100523ad","f7df3f5bb44dbfe86158f7077930bf99a923a94762d25c262f97451a5885809f","03dea981552d5c72ced2ec20592570ec1718d3db9d41043f02d0f288fe39a6c4","69cc129038563c7b6ddcddbf1fedb903dc54e4a1f24d2c5175184c740e819637","e3bf443905513207716305995b88482eda3b34b529dccef21d200a1cfd5ef5ee","a307fdc503b41f29c77a75524d9bc6927c8e385219038d4cc88ea649e6cabf32","a2d775cff94ba08bccee730574e15b25936b4e09a9f1557e7f3e68be055ab4af","bacdf9027a50df3ac37389fae6ca64c1aafc2475f94627ba104aed69ddd5c579","47dcccd12241bd076a8159b26b28c4160e46f125c4babb81636470298e527daa","5bb71006834bd36559aad732f01947464ba91c0f391314931e4e4af2d1c4cabc","6358c155187d3608d020f032b2d8744dd9c4026bace2a4677a1673b70ed322e9","8241ddc822f8462400638e851752dde2ebdf63bea40d33df70df1d8cd7e85c6d","70e66b367df6a0a49949693de29fbfe22aea40713d8a650968d4dbdb4e543227","23b947885a10e02d10e013e7c9fdfe4dacbea791f18c0b8d5ced4802d44547ee","782369125ac26ecbc421b6472be779f23cc72f9a3ae839d5ac0daa5710c309c3","ae6f23f4069e2911c0d2bfd7415c12ff9f43e4523b4f27024585b993314a72c1","eb7523e9c795e9688c1ed3661237666ee3a76728b31b9c4af4bad10fd41ad75e","f53b7e98ace6b93b733a022f5eef7179de57d85134690abe4f63ca18024cd53e","d9c37ddedd0aab2c50cac12c77c697e858ac9bd72da4280a0ba12d275662d45c","173b71e66ca10dca0da4b05f32a7e1c0d10688730fb2f62cf26eefe4f59e6754","5a4882d2faebe425b82ef5dda8e3e1d95c364239b780c5582f2b5155571d5dc2"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3456,3479],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3456"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform N3C bearer mapping release as specified in 5.3.5.17.3.4.1;","paragraph_zero_based":3480},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if n3c-MappingToAddModList is included:","paragraph_zero_based":3481},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform N3C bearer mapping addition/modification as specified in 5.3.5.17.3.4.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3482},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if n3c-IndirectPathConfigRelay is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":3483},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the indirect path with the remote UE is released and release the corresponding configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":3484},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.3.4Bearer mapping management on N3C indirect path","paragraph_zero_based":3485},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.3.4.1Bearer mapping release","paragraph_zero_based":3486},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3487},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the release is triggered by reception of n3c-IndirectPathConfigRelay set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":3488},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for all configured SL-RemoteUE-RB-Identity value:","paragraph_zero_based":3489},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release n3c-RLC-ChannelUu and n3c-RemoteUE-RB-Identity;","paragraph_zero_based":3490},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the release is triggered by reception of the n3c-MappingToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3491},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SL-RemoteUE-RB-Identity value included in n3c-MappingToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3492},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the corresponding n3c-RLC-ChannelUu and n3c-RemoteUE-RB-Identity;","paragraph_zero_based":3493},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.3.4.2Bearer mapping addition and modification","paragraph_zero_based":3494},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3495},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each n3c-RemoteUE-RB-Identity value included in the n3c-MappingToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":3496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>associate the remote UE's RB indicated in n3c-RemoteUE-RB-Identity to the Uu RLC channel indicated in n3c-RLC-ChannelUu;","paragraph_zero_based":3497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for the n3c-RemoteUE-RB-Identity value included in the n3c-MappingToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":3498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>update the associated Uu RLC channel to the one indicated in n3c-RLC-ChannelUu.","paragraph_zero_based":3499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.18LTM configuration and execution","paragraph_zero_based":3500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.18.1LTM configuration","paragraph_zero_based":3501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network configures the UE with one or more LTM candidate configurations within the LTM-Config IE.","paragraph_zero_based":3502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In NR-DC, the UE may receive two independent ltm-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":3503}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ac9a746b2b5d625090e0ea1c78ed21422c09e49ff228f91e0382773e530ff956","521bd6bb0c6668526b2a9aa5ce4ea62820bbf75e9a47383e4373e572a0d802c9","69cf981996fc04df76221e2133b9a2a1f730d0914c5885af7aad46900d860fc9","4c5786977b229652ed2332627b04eafd20d24477ebd7668b58bef3f95d9a49bc","fe61f244b2d45f834a4cc72f606f0b6d9b43c1224a23f2f60e2c0339dd658728","d25d418ab744297968fff626031ef72a6d9653843d962b444bcbcef71ee3dc55","fae93597567bbf75a366ff8ce1bc3cbfe9cdf0840c42756fe958401e7581a4fd","2085137e63419288dff15ad213f66df1e17c71c0e6f653ad33a4262093cfe6d6","e987ee559f8c7bf02c76bca24192d117f7d9a58675e50394705de742e33769a3","4f010d9c4c6858a476e00f2c627214648a608975c6e74652e3799a0c435588c0","fbb8a381d02024b6e90bfe582a4e45c7280524edd4619530b101c162ae9821ee","d4eb1f8e5ac2fd0ff65af988d60b00f1570e0a126f9512101470e11f307cc863","2990c124adb164e60e6af20ed4a23fc5615452238ab26354cdfeddc9edaa2757","37be748b8b823bfb82efc0b9487ac94686869ea36c7c1407bb90ef72201406f5","ab18823c31d40a2479d392f181d3d568b29954136a2007fc36954548433960de","272047a34ca7bd14e379168623148df513297ba99c71769c178f1476a43b6412","30fcfb7af372bd8cb0333a8266b3002b7367308ed89d9b55fe4dc48937632bd5","982fb5522c7759d308f188537d796192207fb293779980286c34536b7af71009","a3dd52f56ddbfbcaeee2cc0879e879f7eb8e1e36809621e95ac10964b4570d36","a540cf817373752a5c1d7fa56d17c036f305dbf46d1b5e678b73bf33dfb83cce","4516096ac33ccae2f1d3cfa5995e218234c61a2c0b331e06a8a6ff7ce3e7a097","b6797aac04338c4d2f439b51be5b5480de225f5ae2abc26e08a5d956cb9dda10","d341a1bb7ea7e46c7c4454dc3d90f6dc51aa410bfc9107e46ce6ee8f26890bdd","15dbfb67bafa0d3cf359e7bc2f92ca62a4bb16b3ca74ecee3bd36f9ce7c11e8a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3480,3503],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3480"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-an ltm-Config associated with the MCG that is included within an RRCReconfiguration message received via SRB1; and","paragraph_zero_based":3504},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-an ltm-Config associated with the SCG that is included within an RRCReconfiguration message either received via SRB3, or, alternatively, embedded in an RRCReconfiguration message received via SRB1.","paragraph_zero_based":3505},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In case the UE receives two independent ltm-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":3506},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE maintains two independent VarLTM-Config, one associated with each ltm-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":3507},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE maintains two independent VarLTM-ServingCellNoResetID, one associated with each ltm-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":3508},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE maintains two independent VarLTM-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID, one associated with each ltm-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":3509},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE independently performs all the procedures in clause 5.3.5.18 for each ltm-Config and the associated VarLTM-Config, VarLTM-ServingCellNoResetID, and VarLTM-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID unless explicitly stated otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":3510},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall perform the following actions based on the received LTM-Config IE:","paragraph_zero_based":3511},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received LTM-Config includes ltm-ReferenceConfiguration set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":3512},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current VarLTM-Config includes an ltm-ReferenceConfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":3513},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>replace the ltm-ReferenceConfiguration value within VarLTM-Config with the received ltm-ReferenceConfiguration;","paragraph_zero_based":3514},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3515},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store the received ltm-ReferenceConfiguration in VarLTM-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":3516},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else (the received LTM-Config includes ltm-ReferenceConfiguration set to release):","paragraph_zero_based":3517},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove ltm-ReferenceConfiguration in VarLTM-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":3518},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received LTM-Config includes ltm-ServingCellNoResetID:","paragraph_zero_based":3519},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current VarLTM-ServingCellNoResetID includes an ltm-ServingCellNoResetID:","paragraph_zero_based":3520},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>replace the ltm-ServingCellNoResetID value within VarLTM-ServingCellNoResetID with the received ltm-ServingCellNoResetID;","paragraph_zero_based":3521},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3522},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store the received ltm-ServingCellNoResetID in VarLTM-ServingCellNoResetID;","paragraph_zero_based":3523},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received LTM-Config includes ltm-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID:","paragraph_zero_based":3524},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current VarLTM-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID includes an ltm-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID:","paragraph_zero_based":3525},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>replace the ltm-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID value within VarLTM-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID with the received ltm-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID;","paragraph_zero_based":3526},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3527}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["66d56f9982a8a300d6895cbc2a18bfe7c4795de3c54fb19640badec0b5a377b9","74050c66f2855137b6cda92abcd83bbbbd0f67badc67fb93151056b5845229d5","27ef36453e8091f7bef5d63c498532da6a0160c52b54fa9085a5e314520ddc30","45e776c6854858e6eee3c9f9420b7492d706fbc5f6852ac58ce0f1b66c2f33ce","752f71d7648973e6f0c75eb7a78085655dfab06a3138d52318e49dd606deb601","bd41ea35359f136734f662e41fb4a1f376262d290f73d413b5c8d7bc8393ab9c","2e4e699be70f43e94bbec66bf1ca14483af82f728ec8182c86374535ff1de3dc","8d7a30cfe386aed78cd10a197ac53eddbe02d89c3f2c98b51b9ee16da7b05cf9","c9461cea38e7538013bd1f813f151a8b539bafa2c7dacb9e7e362101b80a1000","d203029de346ac7eebb2411e0e7e6aaf8b4c1e063a580d786a62a0c3ba1e52ec","af00e1789cb48edd50681d931d1b3d0cad364a2808618ef61bc85c29789126ae","aae0749df89b6f53fb03a5f277a5985cea79bdfb7af7ab1d71d73571807c8a7f","a69bfcfebe919517fad053517ad07a505879a28a5778b032584c3b8002a281fa","870c019dac4d37dd77cab759b81819f34b968d8eee26cb6e4430199be52c7295","8ea4be7ac4c0380eaa70dea801547888bfad797b3cd8bfd2c8978ccab88dc5fd","8d096206f0de6537900baee3033668e211a6541af23df64a52fa174e855041de","6d1687e29d241a6c17492557bb3fa32b50448e284f87c1e673d8de8341915f5c","ee63fb4674aeb579a521fc451351f1e1ab14e630b6396e45ffbb6d89850e79eb","f56a90c39abadbb00403e47b9c95e43763b76ceeae9135620fa9b668ef97b1b6","dc5970bdc4f2dea053d0b82e20de3a68b3888a0b7138aa441caf692545601fd4","5b5f4117e27389be85c96ca7a666561e1c53e9e28633b3832041a14dc6e0f7e9","793fdb52a03fe4d84452f0a0e7775a29686d7a060146db944ce69fbe25c395b6","86d41d01aff98c2d28d24fcbe258f44eb29c09891bf3bb0d84b4edfceb68575f","6a0776a3cdd725e59b706a114772766447c1f38e3631f068cdf1d8267b6cc0cb"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3504,3527],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections f