{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store the received ltm-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID in VarLTM-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID;","paragraph_zero_based":3528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received LTM-Config includes ltm-CSI-ResourceConfigToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the LTM CSI resource configuration release as specified in 5.3.5.18.4;","paragraph_zero_based":3530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received LTM-Config includes ltm-CSI-ResourceConfigToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":3531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the LTM CSI resource configuration addition or modification as specified in 5.3.5.18.5;","paragraph_zero_based":3532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received LTM-Config includes the ltm-CandidateToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the LTM candidate configuration release as specified in 5.3.5.18.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received LTM-Config includes the ltm-CandidateToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":3535},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the LTM candidate configuration addition or modification as specified in 5.3.5.18.3.","paragraph_zero_based":3536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.18.2LTM candidate configuration release","paragraph_zero_based":3537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each ltm-CandidateId value included in the ltm-CandidateToReleaseList for which there is an entry in ltm-CandidateList in VarLTM-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":3539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove the entry related to LTM-Candidate from VarLTM-Config.","paragraph_zero_based":3540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.18.3LTM candidate configuration addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":3541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each ltm-CandidateId value in the ltm-CandidateToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":3543},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current VarLTM-Config includes an LTM-Candidate with the ltm-CandidateId value:","paragraph_zero_based":3544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>replace the LTM-Candidate within VarLTM-Config in accordance with the received LTM-Candidate;","paragraph_zero_based":3545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>add the received LTM-Candidate to VarLTM-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":3547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the received LTM-Candidate includes ltm-DL-OrJointTCI-StateToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each tci-StateId in the ltm-DL-OrJointTCI-StateToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the current VarLTM-Config includes a CandidateTCI-State within an LTM-Candidate with the ltm-CandidateId value that is associated with the tci-StateId value:","paragraph_zero_based":3550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>remove the entry related to CandidateTCI-State within the LTM-Candidate from VarLTM-Config.","paragraph_zero_based":3551}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0d6c532d80578633c42f6b6e1e02517abd6f68f1199b9516aac8dba401c51a90","dbf7cf2a2022155ce849deb1b7ba07d10bcca07994215d71ce86a0d25240a9f6","e42e1fecb24bbba61cf600d8eda9668032ba639749