{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>inform lower layers that UE is configured with UE-based TA measurements if an LTM cell switch is executed for this LTM candidate configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":3600},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.18.4LTM CSI resource configuration release","paragraph_zero_based":3601},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3602},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each ltm-CSI-ResourceConfigId value included in the ltm-CSI-ResourceConfigToReleaseList for which there is an entry in ltm-CSI-ResourceConfigList in VarLTM-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":3603},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove the entry related to the LTM-CSI-ResourceConfig from VarLTM-Config.","paragraph_zero_based":3604},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.18.5LTM CSI resource configuration addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":3605},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3606},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each ltm-CSI-ResourceConfigId value in the ltm-CSI-ResourceConfigToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":3607},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current VarLTM-Config includes an LTM-CSI-ResourceConfig with the ltm-CSI-ResourceConfigId value:","paragraph_zero_based":3608},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>replace the LTM-CSI-ResourceConfig within VarLTM-Config in accordance with the received LTM-CSI-ResourceConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3609},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3610},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>add the received LTM-CSI-ResourceConfig to VarLTM-Config.","paragraph_zero_based":3611},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.18.6LTM cell switch execution","paragraph_zero_based":3612},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon the indication by lower layers that an LTM cell switch procedure is triggered, or upon performing LTM cell switch following cell selection performed while timer T311 was running, as specified in 5.3.7.3, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3613},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release/clear all current dedicated radio configuration associated with the cell group for which the LTM cell switch procedure is triggered except for the following:","paragraph_zero_based":3614},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the logicalChannelIdentity and logicalChannelIdentityExt of RLC bearers configured in RLC-BearerConfig and the associated RLC entities, their state variables, buffers, and timers;","paragraph_zero_based":3615},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE variables VarLTM-Config, VarLTM-ServingCellNoResetID, and VarLTM-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID.","paragraph_zero_based":3616},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the LTM cell switch is triggered on the MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":3617},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the MCG C-RNTI;","paragraph_zero_based":3618},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the AS security configurations associated with the master key;","paragraph_zero_based":3619},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-for each SRB/DRB in current UE configuration which is using the master key:","paragraph_zero_based":3620},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-keep the associated PDCP and SDAP entities, their state variables, buffers and timers;","paragraph_zero_based":3621},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-release all fields related to the SRB/DRB configuration except for srb-Identity and drb-Identity;","paragraph_zero_based":3622},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else, if the LTM cell switch is triggered on the SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":3623}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["090d4cb0e88af64c770ce44955a7dd5c19f18176c65891e02554924649df3f66","88e1ec62597e944519c246310a9c7859118b29388ed61c21e2e0d58685de6298","233656086e79bda922160df6da56eab10e1fd772571cfe803d401a5ded2c6689","be6a37986f52531296c3d19082f07f9eff226691d38a553d87fc1999e68cb1bb","f783778e95690a03f5825ccd0e22cd0560b6c6cdb70c01087ae12d7a8046cc3f","ec60b55ceb248faed07b3d503c1f4eca0a868d4dceed6ac0854d78c578ec6403","d2122c0676cafdd2a4097ac8067a29f126b1bc923ae12e5c4285e8459eb1d273","6bff9b455b53cdcd708e6713663e385aee446020d808ac22b9bd64cb95739f41","07a8053afeafcbe1ebfe053d87a54729d0c3a615426683c4e93b3e2dc3d0b4e1","0902878ada48176561cc2a1b70c0b907f746f65aec194ba0b8e747dee5d38a68","84d41205d081f7358d61c33d50c8415797af09db612c757401584082a7f3bf76","30dcc1371c8e4aea0e51a18c4b8621cd4a63ae456d6977dcb9fa3f84415cb4b3","00b28e34a467a241a2c5ac88a5cc0c59b334cada8325fbf6d73a895666114297","53a76d58a203b836c0a1ad020dade05f31d24a29b83694e73df2108b445d9966","a9992fe48b3fc331d7f765e861a370c6b823b101443710fe3c54933d344e685f","35058f421b74a7ae5be399f2f1135d7004590026fb4e8674e5f6974fe1acb77e","826fce41d1dd0522fbee621871dcf586f704247c854b4d90484c1e6be42384be","4f903d74d74828865f8f2db7060b67e9d846a7e8ebe132bbb0cd8654b527b5f5","f24d86dbbc6ac1d4636b12615bbb86b97858f2ee64523b02549ff0e303d3f6d8","9cee269ff469e907f166057bc13c3e09e64a8396cccea844bb96fd0470fc9368","4f84f7359d82d6a2b4b3e86f1206f44a6e5da3cf93bab201bd8e5ef186a503d6","24b900fcb402380a972722ef01f5129dc458800518a424d1c22dac8b835c24f7","b7b57d08d733cc48efb345181eea206356a1b43c1a9324abe66c1fb5e19177d5","a37f31f8dc5697af685675f9cc7912f50ca2d65e5991c220a9d51c1bfdf9fad0"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3600,3623],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3600"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the AS security configurations associated with the secondary key;","paragraph_zero_based":3624},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-for each SRB/DRB in current UE configuration which is using the secondary key:","paragraph_zero_based":3625},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-keep the associated PDCP and SDAP entities, their state variables, buffers and timers;","paragraph_zero_based":3626},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-release all fields related to the SRB/DRB configuration except for srb-Identity and drb-Identity;","paragraph_zero_based":3627},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release/clear all current common radio configuration associated with the cell group for which the LTM cell switch procedure is triggered;","paragraph_zero_based":3628},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>use the default values specified in 9.2.3 for timers T310, T311 and constants N310, N311 associate to cell group for which the LTM cell switch procedure is triggered;","paragraph_zero_based":3629},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the value of field ltm-NoResetID contained within the LTM-Candidate IE in VarLTM-Config indicated by lower layers or for the selected cell in accordance with 5.3.7.3 is not equal to the value of ltm-ServingCellNoResetID within VarLTM-ServingCellNoResetID:","paragraph_zero_based":3630},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each logicalChannelId and logicalChannelIdExt that is part of the current UE configuration for the cell group for which the LTM cell switch procedure is triggered:","paragraph_zero_based":3631},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>after the end of this procedure, re-establish the corresponding RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4], after applying the LTM configuration in ltm-CandidateConfig within LTM-Candidate IE in VarLTM-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":3632},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each drb-Identity value that is part of the current UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":3633},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if this DRB is an AM DRB:","paragraph_zero_based":3634},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>after the end of this procedure, trigger the PDCP entity of this DRB to perform data recovery as specified in TS 38.323 [5], after applying the LTM configuration in ltm-CandidateConfig within LTM-Candidate IE in VarLTM-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":3635},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>replace the value of ltm-ServingCellNoResetID in VarLTM-ServingCellNoResetID with the value of ltm-NoResetID in the LTM-Candidate in VarLTM-Config indicated by lower layers or for the selected cell in accordance with 5.3.7.3;1> if the LTM-Candidate IE in VarLTM-Config indicated by lower layers or for the selected cell in accordance with 5.3.7.3 contains the field ltm-UE-MeasuredTA-ID:","paragraph_zero_based":3636},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>replace the value of ltm-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID in VarLTM-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID with the value received within ltm-UE-MeasuredTA-ID;","paragraph_zero_based":3637},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if ltm-ConfigComplete is not included within the LTM-Candidate IE in VarLTM-Config indicated by lower layers or for the selected cell in accordance with 5.3.7.3:","paragraph_zero_based":3638},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider ltm-ReferenceConfiguration in VarLTM-Config, associated with the cell group for which the LTM cell switch procedure is triggered, to be the current UE configuration for the fields and configurations which have been released and to be released by the actions above in this procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":3639},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:When the UE considers the reference configuration to be the current UE configuration, the UE should store fields and configurations that are part of the reference configuration but should not execute any actions or procedures triggered by the reception of an RRCReconfiguration message which are described in clause 5.3.5.3.","paragraph_zero_based":3640},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the LTM cell switch is triggered by an indication from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":3641},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the RRCReconfiguration message in ltm-CandidateConfig within LTM-Candidate IE in VarLTM-Config identified by the LTM candidate configuration identity received from lower layers according to clause 5.3.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":3642},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else (LTM cell switch triggered upon cell selection performed while timer T311 was running):","paragraph_zero_based":3643},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the RRCReconfiguration message in ltm-CandidateConfig within LTM-Candidate IE in VarLTM-Config related to the LTM candidate configuration identity for the selected cell (i.e., in accordance with 5.3.7.3) according to clause 5.3.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":3644},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release the radio bearer(s) and the logical channel(s) that are part of the current UE configuration but not part of the LTM candidate configuration either indicated by lower layers or for the selected cell in accordance with 5.3.7.3, or the LTM reference configuration (in case the LTM candidate configuration does not include ltm-ConfigComplete).","paragraph_zero_based":3645},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:When ltm-ConfigComplete is not included for an LTM candidate configuration, before an LTM cell switch is triggered a UE implementation may generate and store an RRC reconfiguration message by applying the received LTM candidate configuration on top of the LTM reference configuration, and the stored RRC reconfiguration message is applied when the LTM cell switch is triggered.","paragraph_zero_based":3646},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.18.7LTM configuration release","paragraph_zero_based":3647}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5a08e5ec726a772473b19f28d3a166bd5cc6f3b793b76574006acd0794127331","3270ce96149a6e40829f9b29e654c52937b53398d57a73935d7903c1e5d4e4d6","386c42ba5b039d8840958693b1d0e86883183fb6ab809a90ce4714f475bd2b6f","6825919dce038fc0feac7e71ab936702002da532fb1d75d2ce8fe257e27b5ba7","eedb59e12d02ac47a07de80de95fe1db71cb7c2f614a5a010b2bdbf6bfa67308","01ab8cd916761415ed30c287bb12038ee035ab2a4f12b678856638387257d956","461deb8631547c0e333d1772c812d5d3b651416709116fdd3547a0f94640073f","3113325d7fcf2ee008695b8da66d8c52eed8ff0478df8c9cc9b0207238a74fba","e453ac2c9116259eb367138faacc38af4c7c1aa8015fddb450eb20c825e5aa9c","0671baee676a8da8de4ff44f282564659c383f6390ef734642087d12d828cc74","7c247527c64a338e82cfbd8e35dd7902b33d7da7c18f4f36b24f48192fa0f783","0bae49f0d128f2a27ae042dd2db24ad6da9bc76e470a05f1659db90701d78a68","be9eb04d7054b12954b21fa973662830d82dcdfa3b553add6531af13a1ec546f","da5509c7067525e768f5ed8ef7468e6078df8ecda48a79f37f3e0ddb47d7503c","0e83aea91d354235c7a8a96dce8be60601ed40e10519135783b4ea79ec246ff0","e46618ab1631fd0861001c612e774ee09ca43ac364531e520d89335b39a54557","3c72fe43fbe6e7e2d481452d13d96952866a48d81007ebef1710461c3db16a9a","9108aa370116b02cc94a83bcf17faa390078361ac406e8c50b7f5b6d3108527b","fca12d290369b69b7b4c544562ab5902cc494516d1c80184190a2a32a5b1a7d2","fe6e32c22b276fb313352736f75e6a4721ac44303e7dd6a7342b63d33d34c6f3","96c29a4fee426fbf5db6434ffaaadd685b7cb544d979f493b3552627dd6af7d1","b91fc236102c740f9081014a429a67fd06dea80170919526d49761d088458338","f2bfc1627b486871e5483256a3737266ddf3a1ac56ab8d4f7e54d32d052eaca4","634c90aa01ae9a10d500f64ee95b65e57102a9d772c0ab233b5dcf1ad17b1836"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3624,3647],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3624"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For the cell group for which the LTM configuration release procedure is triggered, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3648},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>remove all entries within VarLTM-ServingCellNoResetID;","paragraph_zero_based":3649},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>remove the entry within VarLTM-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID;","paragraph_zero_based":3650},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release from current UE configuration all entries of ltm-CSI-ReportConfigToAddModList.","paragraph_zero_based":3651},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release ltm-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":3652},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.19T348 expiry","paragraph_zero_based":3653},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE can apply the temporary UE capability restriction in accordance with the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including musim-CapRestriction, as specified in 5.7.4.3.","paragraph_zero_based":3654},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.6Counter check","paragraph_zero_based":3655},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.6.1General","paragraph_zero_based":3656},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":3657},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.3.6.1-1: Counter check procedure","paragraph_zero_based":3658},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The counter check procedure is used by the network to request the UE to verify the amount of data sent/ received on each DRB. More specifically, the UE is requested to check if, for each DRB, the most significant bits of the COUNT match with the values indicated by the network.","paragraph_zero_based":3659},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The procedure enables the network to detect packet insertion by an intruder (a 'man in the middle').","paragraph_zero_based":3660},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.6.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":3661},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network initiates the procedure by sending a CounterCheck message.","paragraph_zero_based":3662},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The network may initiate the procedure when any of the COUNT values reaches a specific value.","paragraph_zero_based":3663},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.6.3Reception of the CounterCheck message by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":3664},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving the CounterCheck message, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3665},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each DRB that is established:","paragraph_zero_based":3666},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if no COUNT exists for a given direction (uplink or downlink) because it is a uni-directional bearer configured only for the other direction:","paragraph_zero_based":3667},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>assume the COUNT value to be 0 for the unused direction;","paragraph_zero_based":3668},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the drb-Identity is not included in the drb-CountMSB-InfoList:","paragraph_zero_based":3669},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the DRB in the drb-CountInfoList in the CounterCheckResponse message by including the drb-Identity, the count-Uplink and the count-Downlink set to the value of TX_NEXT – 1 and RX_NEXT – 1 (specified in TS 38.323 [5]), respectively;","paragraph_zero_based":3670},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if, for at least one direction, the most significant bits of the COUNT are different from the value indicated in the drb-CountMSB-InfoList:","paragraph_zero_based":3671}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f94af86d8684b0c07f93edc38090d181128a21a2d285cc9ac7ba9d7f9da88525","752bd69f12665d2db3b55b01a85a85f8e2c289cf7d1964950deb03e08432e9fe","4e8e98d094d8cc531a9219d2a6c2d41a496c202a87cb5fa52890359887b8fe98","61460de75e92575f7f7de9f1bce55f7b43b8b32b0878714702700fad95ebfd26","9663103422d1d47afc0aba28fe0f2773f1e906595355abd839db8029bb444769","822e50c806d2b4f37f6be4618230a45788789a444fa92067f26a080a843c661d","1472d43f6cf0d0889343681ec59b72a593d25ac2910a489ae6cb2d8101793e6a","dbf27fcfaa6a781bb8e1467626240dab5cccf400f4c648b9c801afa8c8ad992c","9275a29d6768d10758b00af438ab9fc347890e5cf85968a07b091cf19fddaba9","8d921211acfa32832ec2b532fd9ca58185275eb0f0464ebc73902f6a9e1f78bd","0032656ddf70d325a3d7887a0ea045a8ab9b16cf373708e0010e282b67e928d9","c364623340c408f060f6de1b5e88428fa81a475528bf080c45e334b28d293a80","0066012b8fdc7dd234a5e6468386ff6b543ad01189d3858aa88e06eca8da8315","5b0de2042098cedfa5b6e902e0ebfd04d90426888d33ae35b3a537596eb7a5fc","bdd2578ff0a0b1a966e77097d83f176356bf842e841a5bf512b753c22a608ddd","3081f0d166cb8bfb00b3bfa2b509a45c62f78ce412d97a397bae9dd09d1c5c5d","6ca54d553138df3f744dbe3c4cbaf4c47e54755f081aab96fea4362b3db0fedf","3eb35c1f8b11207c2da9ea4763d64f697093ef5bb2c5ed045ddea6a087a2a2d2","8a935331e63a87d2ecd7c47e3438c391fc022a038b2b7699579b6a39062d4e5a","fc1f161b357f22b7300afe5eb5047016dd65f53c102b0eba38e90c555a9eadb7","06f6f174b55aab9ada00e8eead8d27391dab7e2a573ecc17a4f62095db7748c1","fb3c5796b3191d1eb015cdb7d8f3817236e832b143dbd73d8ad8dc4f4737a054","77bf61ad406053000b72945e65d14ce3666b430b63380feb98d61c6d8fb103af","51b3390e880e36d1655389b29b918e9150193c1cb7c9fcaf2674c6d7c3327c1b"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3648,3671],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3648"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the DRB in the drb-CountInfoList in the CounterCheckResponse message by including the drb-Identity, the count-Uplink and the count-Downlink set to the value of TX_NEXT – 1 and RX_NEXT – 1 (specified in TS 38.323 [5]), respectively;","paragraph_zero_based":3672},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each DRB that is included in the drb-CountMSB-InfoList in the CounterCheck message that is not established:","paragraph_zero_based":3673},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the DRB in the drb-CountInfoList in the CounterCheckResponse message by including the drb-Identity, the count-Uplink and the count-Downlink with the most significant bits set identical to the corresponding values in the drb-CountMSB-InfoList and the least significant bits set to zero;","paragraph_zero_based":3674},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the CounterCheckResponse message to lower layers for transmission upon which the procedure ends.","paragraph_zero_based":3675},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.7RRC connection re-establishment","paragraph_zero_based":3676},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.7.1General","paragraph_zero_based":3677},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":3678},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.3.7.1-1: RRC connection re-establishment, successful","paragraph_zero_based":3679},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":3680},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":3681},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.3.7.1-2: RRC re-establishment, fallback to RRC establishment, successful","paragraph_zero_based":3682},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to re-establish the RRC connection. A UE in RRC_CONNECTED, for which AS security has been activated with SRB2 and at least one DRB/multicast MRB setup or, for IAB and NCR, SRB2, may initiate the procedure in order to continue the RRC connection. The connection re-establishment succeeds if the network is able to find and verify a valid UE context or, if the UE context cannot be retrieved, and the network responds with an RRCSetup according to clause 5.3.3.4.","paragraph_zero_based":3683},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network applies the procedure e.g as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":3684},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-When AS security has been activated and the network retrieves or verifies the UE context:","paragraph_zero_based":3685},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-to re-activate AS security without changing algorithms;","paragraph_zero_based":3686},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-to re-establish and resume the SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":3687},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-When UE is re-establishing an RRC connection, and the network is not able to retrieve or verify the UE context:","paragraph_zero_based":3688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-to discard the stored AS Context and release all RBs and BH RLC channels and Uu Relay RLC channels;","paragraph_zero_based":3689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-to fallback to establish a new RRC connection.","paragraph_zero_based":3690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If AS security has not been activated, the UE shall not initiate the procedure but instead moves to RRC_IDLE directly, with release cause 'other'. If AS security has been activated, but SRB2 and at least one DRB or multicast MRB or, for IAB and NCR, SRB2, are not setup, the UE does not initiate the procedure but instead moves to RRC_IDLE directly, with release cause 'RRC connection failure'.","paragraph_zero_based":3691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.7.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":3692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE initiates the procedure when one of the following conditions is met:","paragraph_zero_based":3693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG and t316 is not configured, in accordance with 5.3.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":3694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG while SCG transmission is suspended, in accordance with 5.3.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":3695}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6a4e300911ec954e514b62a5a2e883ecc7ead3c2ff5f5a87490569c2538e7291","45d35973e0ef11d185b2476461384da87f042761230e9f527377a895810ba0ef","23a6951dd7d5017513a856cee91a8e203feaa2d2a92e7da4ff59f976983e8d40","6598a8e8a4f72d336a94dc728af0f4da24eb48b881644b804d643f7f004db725","e569e084383102986a8f7140d54e47b7c79c1f714fb001cb50d0327a55ce548c","1ab36b5e68ad96deb1babf25bbdb05ef0c0a4b9302d33141ff7806cb0ef0dbc8","df612a33cb890b35f750aeb623edf66f7b92d5197986142a65398353dc7fa2c0","00c401fe8736a3d367f5a15b1c6394d0639eccfdef7344aec92ac559a276bd14","96135ef5f01fd0da098116158f024654df3a9c7ac83bad8d4d9207136b833904","dd0e1c70d212429eb9b8b7e71232bdab1ebd8359d1cfb1699c4a876a039da807","ed3f9d1b909f2f90f0661fcc247e25da7f459efe1d62a52db390c198948be825","4c9a70656e1a705e7f8a443a98450fed2aa369a0dfb00860c17452256bfbbf1b","0bd963f7d07d20ce5dfe7faf3536fba03cdf7547158f285734c3abf8b90e2f13","f36d559bc98f13d307fcd220f80e6a29b56802af2c46dac60436561ad89b8fe6","86ffc00b2ce17b5b0d21579ed5064b2e3d9ecaa2a3b8a304266fa38b1bb73389","855065b40d87eb334400f0534298bca7555f7fc4dc53f20dcad3e98cadbb8449","3b0bafbec58ced2f3d80201fb2a7afbd6001b7a70d37ff30785359be7c2e3544","a97fd3ff44b112dcf68dbaf4b46682a653e0b9ba790cb6177056a26316052d29","7275f9bcce9549e00ab4d28295fef2a40f37051e0e61aa876192ad911514c3c5","f457dfe3186da75d59b175b96b533a5b70cab5af6b10ea333667dafe4f003d2f","5d7cf6d206815140ae5127245ccff0f99509e42df8cd2cb849dbf30d623ed010","72d7bce31791eb166f806a02a3fd9e76b94e39a88faf7957e25f1ee61f8478e6","b19367bebc4c2dac8a3b36268fdf453a98c8c8df114351da2c23fc55783ef7ff","a012c07e808a0bc3ce8bf9699765d095e23fd71a7a5c3a152786c3d279c17647"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3672,3695],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p3672"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG while PSCell change or PSCell addition is ongoing, in accordance with 5.3.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":3696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG while the SCG is deactivated, in accordance with 5.3.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":3697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon re-configuration with sync failure of the MCG, in accordance with clause 5.3.5.8.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":3698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon mobility from NR failure, in accordance with clause 5.4.3.5; or","paragraph_zero_based":3699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon integrity check failure indication from lower layers concerning SRB1 or SRB2, except if the integrity check failure is detected on the RRCReestablishment message; or","paragraph_zero_based":3700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon an RRC connection reconfiguration failure, in accordance with clause 5.3.5.8.2; or","paragraph_zero_based":3701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure for the SCG while MCG transmission is suspended, in accordance with clause 5.3.10.3 in NR-DC or in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.11.3 in NE-DC; or","paragraph_zero_based":3702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon reconfiguration with sync failure of the SCG while MCG transmission is suspended in accordance with clause 5.3.5.8.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":3703},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon SCG change failure while MCG transmission is suspended in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.5.7a; or","paragraph_zero_based":3704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon SCG configuration failure while MCG transmission is suspended in accordance with clause 5.3.5.8.2 in NR-DC or in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.5.5 in NE-DC; or","paragraph_zero_based":3705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon integrity check failure indication from SCG lower layers concerning SRB3 while MCG is suspended; or","paragraph_zero_based":3706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon T316 expiry, in accordance with clause 5.7.3b.5; or","paragraph_zero_based":3707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting sidelink radio link failure by L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED which is not configured with MP, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":3708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon reception of NotificationMessageSidelink including indicationType by L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED which is not configured with MP, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":3709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon PC5 unicast link release for the serving L2 U2N Relay UE indicated by upper layer at L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED which is not configured with MP while T301 is not running; or","paragraph_zero_based":3710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if MP is configured, upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG (i.e. direct path) in accordance with clause 5.3.10 while the transmission of indirect path is suspended as specified in 5.3.5.17; or","paragraph_zero_based":3711},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if MP is configured, upon detecting sidelink radio link failure of SL indirect path by L2 U2N Remote UE, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.3, while MCG transmission (i.e. direct path) is suspended as specified in clause 5.7.3b; or","paragraph_zero_based":3712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if MP is configured, upon reception of NotificationMessageSidelink including indicationType in accordance with clause 5.8.9.10, while MCG transmission (i.e. direct path) is suspended as specified in clause 5.7.3b; or","paragraph_zero_based":3713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if MP is configured, upon PC5 unicast link release indicated by upper layer at L2 U2N Remote UE, while MCG transmission (i.e. direct path) is suspended as specified in clause 5.7.3b; or","paragraph_zero_based":3714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if MP is configured, upon detecting the failure of N3C indirect path by N3C remote UE in accordance with clause 5.7.3c, while MCG transmission (i.e. direct path) is suspended.","paragraph_zero_based":3715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0:It is up to UE implementation whether to initiate the procedure while T346g is running.","paragraph_zero_based":3716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiation of the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T310, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T312, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3719}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f88011d8cee53adac21b15454adcb260edd3059b6c317b67d5c2abb17d86c138","3d84dc0b91ea2ba615c6418a4d98f994306154394a64d4f16efc416ce225ea37","12379bb8b4bc19bca84f69e292492d995d92d9394499a24e4d84ed22d401c508","96c0e1b6f45e6899da6de53d9adcf680910e984ec0cce08a891377889b5a38d4","f75adef12f3f394564c0c9525e8963e41c03f14a13a27e4eebde56695f0a6f88","9c623cc946b2ad0a5424c7a49900a1a35c88fce387300ed4d343c6421e650fbf","bce080fac434609df3f0dc891effeb49f6ea268678f5bf7e49a9f1d60947497f","38f4e4840b94eb8d31a9e2ffb6cc1c089f0ed1ae6c21ba1bccf879c5e4515720","7e968298e4be4e2558f7bd25ef16e749b269230c7a443f1a8b0911e9e07813e2","c8be17530dd6e5e59a1714878bffee1acae193410bec9216f8aba3afd346188a","3042ebf46a3d82e192df96d8fd7e7d825cbd88866c5e6158528ade0b6d5f86a5","c24cbeb7c10a3ad7b75bc4ed253b5abd28