{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset the source MAC and release the source MAC configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":3768},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each DAPS bearer:","paragraph_zero_based":3769},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity or entities as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":3770},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the PDCP entity to release DAPS as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":3771},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":3772},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the PDCP entity for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":3773},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":3774},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the physical channel configuration for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":3775},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the keys used in the source SpCell (the KgNB key, the KRRCenc key, the KRRCint key, the KUPint key and the KUPenc key), if any;","paragraph_zero_based":3776},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release sl-L2RelayUE-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3777},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release sl-L2RemoteUE-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3778},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release the SRAP entity, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3779},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release NCR-FwdConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3780},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is NCR-MT:","paragraph_zero_based":3781},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate to NCR-Fwd to cease forwarding;","paragraph_zero_based":3782},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if SL indirect path is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3783},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release cell identity and relay UE ID configured in sl-IndirectPathAddChange;","paragraph_zero_based":3784},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release of the SL indirect path;","paragraph_zero_based":3785},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if N3C indirect path is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3786},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release n3c-IndirectPathAddChange;","paragraph_zero_based":3787},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> consider the non-3GPP connection is not used;","paragraph_zero_based":3788},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as a N3C relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":3789},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release n3c-IndirectPathConfigRelay;","paragraph_zero_based":3790},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> consider the non-3GPP connection is not used;","paragraph_zero_based":3791}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["585265059df1e536b0fdc00b59a7e6a51f27b1b28e84ab6f69246660f4082c14","cd3c9068152102f247d057992a2049f8258e3015dacda9edcffcb4cae4feccd8","24f8ab4cc07ea43e9f3eb7ecb9f3eb5853e3db9a4464ab2344bd0a06a55bd49f","fc8c75e323a5f33e2ae990bbf1e35acc215173a3224e30213e4e0a3998df7cc5","dcc6548477224fdabf0c6a2c3165fe09fbbd3f2d9fb66ebb5ab1a2b0d264be24","9837d3b4debab9b4ff96797134bc8dc7a89efb9c97845ccc35b2b7a69effcee5","75996ab903aba81d1511bbfe10bb62a0ebcc8d115d3abfd390078dcb5e2f9dd8","b7a6bacb01a816e31c1bc56b4a4eae5abb0bc0d1377eaf8b52d63f199113d543","36e06d58d5553936ed8e2b16bb0