{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE and MP via L2 U2N Relay UE is not configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3792},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the PC5-RRC connection with the U2N Relay UE is determined to be released:","paragraph_zero_based":3793},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release;","paragraph_zero_based":3794},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform either cell selection in accordance with the cell selection process as specified in TS 38.304 [20], or relay selection as specified in clause 5.8.15.3, or both;","paragraph_zero_based":3795},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (i.e., maintain the PC5 RRC connection):","paragraph_zero_based":3796},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the connected L2 U2N Relay UE as suitable and perform actions as specified in clause 5.3.7.3a;","paragraph_zero_based":3797},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:It is up to Remote UE implementation whether to release or keep the current PC5 unicast link.","paragraph_zero_based":3798},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> else:","paragraph_zero_based":3799},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is capable of L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":3800},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform either cell selection as specified in TS 38.304 [20], or relay selection as specified in clause 5.8.15.3, or both;","paragraph_zero_based":3801},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3802},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform cell selection in accordance with the cell selection process as specified in TS 38.304 [20].","paragraph_zero_based":3803},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:For L2 U2N Remote UE, if both a suitable cell and a suitable relay are available, the UE can select either one based on its implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":3804},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.7.3Actions following cell selection while T311 is running","paragraph_zero_based":3805},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon selecting a suitable NR cell, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3806},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>ensure having valid and up to date essential system information as specified in clause 5.2.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3807},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T311;","paragraph_zero_based":3808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if T390 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":3809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T390 for all access categories;","paragraph_zero_based":3810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4;","paragraph_zero_based":3811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop the relay (re)selection procedure, if ongoing;","paragraph_zero_based":3812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the cell selection is triggered by detecting radio link failure of the MCG or re-configuration with sync failure of the MCG or mobility from NR failure, and","paragraph_zero_based":3813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if attemptCondReconfig is configured; and","paragraph_zero_based":3814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the selected cell is not configured with CondEventT1, or the selected cell is configured with CondEventT1 and leaving condition has not been fulfilled; and","paragraph_zero_based":3815}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ba87f1b0f9fe267c2eba05d2631abedb4b6afb7182a02aaa3ce76ba6a75d2c00","7c76f90dcb2fa84030fec1cad1007d916d85a7ac76