{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the selected cell is one of the candidate cells for which the reconfigurationWithSync is included in the masterCellGroup in the MCG VarConditionalReconfig and the condExecutionCondPSCell is not configured for the corresponding condReconfigId in the MCG VarConditionalReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3816},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports RLF-Report for conditional handover, set the choCellId in the VarRLF-Report to the global cell identity, if available, otherwise to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the selected cell;","paragraph_zero_based":3817},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the stored condRRCReconfig associated to the selected cell and perform actions as specified in 5.3.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":3818},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:It is left to network implementation to how to avoid keystream reuse in case of CHO based recovery after a failed handover without key change.","paragraph_zero_based":3819},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the cell selection is triggered by detecting radio link failure of the MCG or re-configuration with sync failure of the MCG or mobility from NR failure; and","paragraph_zero_based":3820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if attemptLTM-Switch is configured; and","paragraph_zero_based":3821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the selected cell is one of the LTM candidate cells in the LTM-Candidate IE within VarLTM-Config associated with the MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":3822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the LTM cell switch procedure for the selected LTM candidate cell according to the actions specified in 5.3.5.18.6;","paragraph_zero_based":3823},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3824},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if UE is configured with attemptCondReconfig; or","paragraph_zero_based":3825},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if UE is configured with attemptLTM-Switch:","paragraph_zero_based":3826},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reset MAC;","paragraph_zero_based":3827},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release spCellConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3828},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the MCG SCell(s), if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3829},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release delayBudgetReportingConfig, if configured and stop timer T342, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3830},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release overheatingAssistanceConfig , if configured and stop timer T345, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3831},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if MR-DC is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3832},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform MR-DC release, as specified in clause 5.3.5.10;","paragraph_zero_based":3833},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release idc-AssistanceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3834},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release btNameList, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3835},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release wlanNameList, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3836},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release sensorNameList, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3837},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release drx-PreferenceConfig for the MCG, if configured and stop timer T346a associated with the MCG, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3838},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release maxBW-PreferenceConfig for the MCG, if configured and stop timer T346b associated with the MCG, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3839}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sh