{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T331 with the value set to measIdleDuration;","paragraph_zero_based":4056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measIdleConfig contains measIdleCarrierListNR:","paragraph_zero_based":4057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received measIdleCarrierListNR in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":4058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measIdleConfig contains measIdleCarrierListEUTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":4059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received measIdleCarrierListEUTRA in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":4060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measIdleConfig contains validityAreaList:","paragraph_zero_based":4061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received validityAreaList in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":4062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCRelease includes suspendConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":4063},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset MAC and release the default MAC Cell Group configuration, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":4064},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the received suspendConfig except the received nextHopChainingCount;","paragraph_zero_based":4065},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sdt-Config is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4066},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each of the DRB in the sdt-DRB-List:","paragraph_zero_based":4067},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the DRB to be configured for SDT;","paragraph_zero_based":4068},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sdt-SRB2-Indication is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4069},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the SRB2 to be configured for SDT;","paragraph_zero_based":4070},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each RLC bearer (except those associated with broadcast MRBs) that is not suspended:","paragraph_zero_based":4071},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>re-establish the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4];","paragraph_zero_based":4072},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for SRB2 (if it is resumed) and for SRB1:","paragraph_zero_based":4073},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>trigger the PDCP entity to perform SDU discard as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":4074},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sdt-MAC-PHY-CG-Config is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4075},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure the PCell with the configured grant resources for SDT and instruct the MAC entity to start the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":4076},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if srs-PosRRC-Inactive is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4077},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the configuration and instruct MAC to start the inactivePosSRS-TimeAlignmentTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":4078},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if srs-PosRRC-InactiveValidityAreaConfig is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4079}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["93b3b7dbbf00b2d3eae791b9247133c86f571abf92d1caeb776d162aaf867fba","e8534d2e7163ba12e8beebfe93e5ac11161c7f94bebcadea31b660fec8f1f13f","0dd4a295b5d6b251f294c30c80ce9b58ec1c4875024df9afd4eb0f08c8d63253","ace6e7a9a416c033a0b643ca20832dd8e5199d203ce9885f7958309f52a5e6f9","9c057a7d82fc753d5fa8c44860293e594825f315b8c31b43488a7c9b83bcd8b6","8bd7a829062cc2bb21eafc3e425d9642772659fe887a6c2b1b1a6f10e2402c36","b2b87acc8742d652697c67fb81b0b8227e73e13503383253ffef4d03c1340250","c3d6badaf8b71056423d192abe459d345b43d9cafc8c9c2e8db3193e8f6bb300","d7c225d94ea1ea9c1573b594e5eca4d703dd7e41cbb8a80adf942bd13ff2f62e","1596075fc3cf7c6310abdbc0e311c51465271a8c1d1ca0ffe88c167f18732991","855ff77967e94869fdc5615fe9ea5d6e990ef5d5175704104a0ef7093e4466d9","ce57d7bdfb1ba77b087317cc62424dcbd34a22134cd2cd0a02eb57702d774911","5e56ce06e3c401bcb2ce761a1b4bd08b176209f5170515049b7bd11f48939eae","d8dc951d7eb0abe5e8522ebb2d45607885bae89fecc436f7df266e232a06b755","4bec0a23d8510b5502c373dbad31aa6e334a0a49faa989c4cfb2123f96d5967f","244cdfc1250e57625dac27192d32765d83adcfd4ce42ce572c9c8c6f8ee8a662","c7348fa7a69ab400def24c9288ec0c489a3b735d7f8a24949599c8b036d4a31a","2171b6cadc78041894a034a54541771fc2e1d0c6b12cbd2efebf872b7bc8a0af","36e4c8b5708b5a104a1df6aa9e8d4c9e0b37fa3defa01fb25c83f451b3aa053e","b4ba0057589437d10540de0a533ce4720b67e58bda4abb7cb2d203dd67df5bb5","68360e15499bd3a109940dd29de3340de02fd5cdf821f259a688faeaf18b30c7","810e3dc51ae996ba3b1242bee9e553ce1cedfaf67f003a282661e555ea488ed4","2a786198a104e798c2e2be40f855e76ac9f02ad7275f7f1082d12a683296002d","35c11e92a7d63aadb7e27823c29375c3271a97e933ba4e53ab950926b18477aa"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[4056,4079],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx:p4056"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the configuration and instruct MAC to start the inactivePosSRS-ValidityAreaTAT;","paragraph_zero_based":4080},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1b:The Network should provide full configuration to UE for SRS for Positioning in RRC_INACTIVE.","paragraph_zero_based":4081},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the LTM configuration release procedure for the MCG and the SCG as specified in clause 5.3.5.18.7;","paragraph_zero_based":4082},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove all the entries within the MCG and the SCG VarConditionalReconfig, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":4083},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove the servingSecurityCellSetId within the VarServingSecurityCellSetID, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":4084},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each measId of the MCG measConfig and for each measId of the SCG measConfig, if configured, if the associated reportConfig has a reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":4085},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for the associated reportConfigId:","paragraph_zero_based":4086},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the entry with the matching reportConfigId from the reportConfigList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":4087},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the associated measObjectId is only associated to a reportConfig with reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":4088},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the entry with the matching measObjectId from the measObjectList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":4089},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the entry with the matching measId from the measIdList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":4090},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for NCR-MT, if NCR-FwdConfig is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4091},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the NCR-FwdConfig includes periodic forwarding resource configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":4092},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate to NCR-Fwd to continue forwarding only in accordance with the configured periodic forwarding resource set(s);","paragraph_zero_based":4093},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4094},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate to NCR-Fwd to cease forwarding;","paragraph_zero_based":4095},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE and is not configured with MP:","paragraph_zero_based":4096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the PC5-RRC connection with the U2N Relay UE is determined to be released:","paragraph_zero_based":4097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release;","paragraph_zero_based":4098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (i.e., maintain the PC5 RRC connection):","paragraph_zero_based":4099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>establish or re-establish (e.g. via release and add) SL RLC entity for SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":4100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>re-establish RLC entities for SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":4102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCRelease message with suspendConfig was received in response to an RRCResumeRequest or an RRCResumeRequest1:","paragraph_zero_based":4103}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b3775a5d14ac021fc4f5f3e8002b92527fa1c052d9b7c535f196b5410b17f720","original_member_sha256":"0b2b1acef7c2981dcae001f9ad768411cade15b8ef16fbb988748fdb44fd8de1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["89595f643fe5305cab2561888edbb0969e02956706a6275f7e2d445b641fc9f2","3316597c50a92