{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2401569.zip::R2-2401569 RRC corrections for XR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the cell identity of current cell is not equal to the cell identity stored in measResultFailedCell in VarConnEstFailReport and if the maxCEFReport-r17 has not been reached:","paragraph_zero_based":4848},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>append the VarConnEstFailReport as a new entry in the VarConnEstFailReportList;","paragraph_zero_based":4849},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has connection establishment failure information or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport and if the RPLMN is not equal to plmn-identity stored in VarConnEstFailReport; or","paragraph_zero_based":4850},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the cell identity of current cell is not equal to the cell identity stored in measResultFailedCell in VarConnEstFailReport:","paragraph_zero_based":4851},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reset the numberOfConnFail to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":4852},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has connection establishment failure information or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReportList and if the RPLMN is not equal to plmn-identity stored in any entry of VarConnEstFailReportList:","paragraph_zero_based":4853},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>clear the content included in VarConnEstFailReportList;","paragraph_zero_based":4854},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> clear the content included in VarConnEstFailReport except for the numberOfConnFail, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":4855},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>store the following connection resume failure information in the VarConnEstFailReport by setting its fields as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":4856},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the plmn-Identity to the PLMN selected by upper layers (see TS 24.501 [23]) from the PLMN(s) included in the plmn-IdentityInfoList in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":4857},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the measResultFailedCell to include the global cell identity, tracking area code, the cell level and SS/PBCH block level RSRP, and RSRQ, and SS/PBCH block indexes, of the failed cell based on the available SSB measurements collected up to the moment the UE detected connection resume failure;","paragraph_zero_based":4858},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if available, set the measResultNeighCells, in order of decreasing ranking-criterion as used for cell re-selection, to include neighbouring cell measurements for at most the following number of neighbouring cells: 6 intra-frequency and 3 inter-frequency neighbours per frequency as well as 3 inter-RAT neighbours, per frequency/ set of frequencies per RAT and according to the following:","paragraph_zero_based":4859},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each neighbour cell included, include the optional fields that are available;","paragraph_zero_based":4860},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The UE includes the latest results of the available measurements as used for cell reselection evaluation, which are performed in accordance with the performance requirements as specified in TS 38.133 [14].","paragraph_zero_based":4861},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if available, set the locationInfo as in 5.3.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":4862},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set perRAInfoList to indicate the performed random access procedure related information as specified in 5.7.10.5;","paragraph_zero_based":4863},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if numberOfConnFail is smaller than 8:","paragraph_zero_based":4864},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>increment the numberOfConnFail by 1;","paragraph_zero_based":4865},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11 with release cause 'RRC 